#: ../NEWS:161
msgid ""
":gh:`121284`: Fix bug in the folding of rfc2047 encoded-words when "
"flattening an email message using a modern email policy. Previously when an "
"encoded-word was too long for a line, it would be decoded, split across "
"lines, and re-encoded. But commas and other special characters in the "
"original text could be left unencoded and unquoted. This could theoretically"
" be used to spoof header lines using a carefully constructed encoded-word if"
" the resulting rendered email was transmitted or re-parsed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121284`: 修复了在使用现代电子邮件策略扁平化电子邮件消息时，rfc2047 "
"编码词的折叠错误。以前，当一个编码词对于一行来说太长时，它会被解码、跨行分割并重新编码。但是原始文本中的逗号和其他特殊字符可能会被保留未编码和未引用。如果生成的渲染电子邮件被传输或重新解析，理论上可以利用精心构造的编码词来欺骗标题行。"

#: ../NEWS:172
msgid ":gh:`116608`: undeprecate functional API for ``importlib.resources``"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:174
msgid ""
":gh:`132075`: Fix possible use of :mod:`socket` address structures with "
"uninitialized members. Now all structure members are initialized with zeroes"
" by default."
msgstr ":gh:`132075`: 修复可能使用带未初始化成员的 :mod:`socket` 地址结构体。 现在所有结构体成员默认都将初始化为零。"

#: ../NEWS:178
msgid ""
":gh:`132002`: Fix crash when deallocating :class:`contextvars.ContextVar` "
"with weird unahashable string names."
msgstr ""
":gh:`132002`: 修复了在释放具有奇怪不可哈希字符串名称的 :class:`contextvars.ContextVar` 时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:181
msgid ""
":gh:`131668`: :mod:`socket`: Fix code parsing AF_BLUETOOTH socket addresses."
msgstr ":gh:`131668`: :mod:`socket`: 修复了解析AF_BLUETOOTH套接字地址的代码。"

#: ../NEWS:183
msgid ""
":gh:`131492`: Fix a resource leak when constructing a :class:`gzip.GzipFile`"
" with a filename fails, for example when passing an invalid "
"``compresslevel``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131492`: 修复当构造 :class:`gzip.GzipFile` 发生文件名错误，例如传入无效的 ``compresslevel``"
" 时的资源泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:187
msgid ""
":gh:`131325`: Fix sendfile fallback implementation to drain data after "
"writing to transport in :mod:`asyncio`."
msgstr ":gh:`131325`: 修复 :mod:`asyncio` 中 sendfile 回退实现在写入传输后的耗尽数据问题。"

#: ../NEWS:190
msgid ""
":gh:`129843`: Fix incorrect argument passing in "
":func:`warnings.warn_explicit`."
msgstr ":gh:`129843`: 修复 :func:`warnings.warn_explicit` 中不正确的参数传递问题。"

#: ../NEWS:193
msgid ""
":gh:`131204`: Use monospace font from System Font Stack for cross-platform "
"support in :class:`difflib.HtmlDiff`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`131204`: 在 :class:`difflib.HtmlDiff` 中将使用来自 System Font Stack "
"的等宽字体以提供跨平台支持。for cross-platform support ."

#: ../NEWS:196
msgid ""
":gh:`131045`: Fix issue with ``__contains__``, values, and pseudo-members "
"for :class:`enum.Flag`."
msgstr ":gh:`131045`: 修复 :class:`enum.Flag` 的 ``__contains__``、值以及伪成员问题。"

#: ../NEWS:199
msgid ""
":gh:`130959`: Fix pure-Python implementation of "
":func:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` to reject times with spaces in "
"fractional part (for example, ``12:34:56.400 +02:00``), matching the C "
"implementation. Patch by Michał Gorny."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130959`: 修复了 :func:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` 的纯 Python "
"实现以拒绝小数部分带有空格的时间值 (例如 ``12:34:56.400 +02:00``)，以与 C 实现相匹配。 由 Michał Gorny "
"编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:204
msgid ""
":gh:`130637`: Add validation for numeric response data in poplib.POP3.stat()"
" method"
msgstr ":gh:`130637`: 在 poplib.POP3.stat() 方法中添加对数值响应数据的验证。"

#: ../NEWS:207
msgid ""
":gh:`130461`: Remove ``.. index::`` directives from the :mod:`uuid` module "
"documentation. These directives previously created entries in the general "
"index for :func:`~uuid.getnode` as well as the :func:`~uuid.uuid1`, "
":func:`~uuid.uuid3`, :func:`~uuid.uuid4`, and :func:`~uuid.uuid5` "
"constructor functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:213
msgid ""
":gh:`130285`: Fix corner case for :func:`random.sample` allowing the "
"*counts* parameter to specify an empty population. So now, ``sample([], 0, "
"counts=[])`` and ``sample('abc', k=0, counts=[0, 0, 0])`` both give the same"
" result as ``sample([], 0)``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130285`: 修复了 :func:`random.sample` 的一个边缘情况，允许 *counts* "
"参数指定一个空的总数。现在，``sample([], 0, counts=[])`` 和 ``sample('abc', k=0, counts=[0,"
" 0, 0])`` 都会给出与 ``sample([], 0)`` 相同的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:218
msgid ":gh:`130250`: Fix regression in ``traceback.print_last()``."
msgstr ":gh:`130250`: 修复 ``traceback.print_last()`` 中的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:220
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Reverts a change in the previous release attempting to make "
"some stdlib imports used within the :mod:`subprocess` module lazy as this "
"was causing errors during ``__del__`` finalizers calling methods such as "
"``terminate``, or ``kill``, or ``send_signal``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 撤销上一个版本中的更改，该更改尝试使 :mod:`subprocess` 模块内使用的一些 stdlib "
"导入变为懒加载，因为这会导致在 ``__del__`` 终结器中调用诸如 ``terminate``、``kill`` 或 "
"``send_signal`` 等方法时出现错误。"

#: ../NEWS:225
msgid ""
":gh:`130164`: Fixed failure to raise :exc:`TypeError` in "
":meth:`inspect.Signature.bind` for positional-only arguments provided by "
"keyword when a variadic keyword argument (e.g. ``**kwargs``) is present."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130164`: 修复了当存在可变关键字参数 (即 ``**kwargs``) 时在 "
":meth:`inspect.Signature.bind` 中以关键字形式提供仅限位置参数不会引发 :exc:`TypeError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:229
msgid ""
":gh:`130151`: Fix reference leaks in :func:`!_hashlib.hmac_new` and "
":func:`!_hashlib.hmac_digest`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130151`: 修复 :func:`!_hashlib.hmac_new` 和 :func:`!_hashlib.hmac_digest` "
"中的引用泄漏。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:232
msgid ""
":gh:`129726`: Fix :class:`gzip.GzipFile` raising an unraisable exception "
"during garbage collection when referring to a temporary object by breaking "
"the reference loop with :mod:`weakref`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129726`: 通过使用 :mod:`weakref` 打破引用循环，修复 :class:`gzip.GzipFile` "
"在垃圾收集时引用临时对象抛出无法处理的异常的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:236
