":gh:`131865`: 当在Linux上使用SystemTap时，DTrace构建现在正确地将 ``CC`` 和 ``CFLAGS`` 变量传递给 "
"``dtrace`` 命令。"

#: ../NEWS:359
msgid ""
":gh:`130740`: Ensure that ``Python.h`` is included before ``stdbool.h`` "
"unless ``pyconfig.h`` is included before or in some platform-specific "
"contexts."
msgstr ""
":gh:`130740`: 确保 ``Python.h``在 ``stdbool.h`` 之前被包含，除非 ``pyconfig.h`` "
"在此之前被包含或在某些特定平台上下文中。"

#: ../NEWS:363
msgid ""
":gh:`129838`: Don't redefine ``_Py_NO_SANITIZE_UNDEFINED`` when compiling "
"with a recent GCC version and undefined sanitizer enabled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129838`: 当使用最近的GCC版本和启用未定义消毒器编译时，不重新定义``_Py_NO_SANITIZE_UNDEFINED``。"

#: ../NEWS:366
msgid ""
":gh:`129660`: Drop ``test_embed`` from PGO training, whose contribution in "
"recent versions is considered to be ignorable."
msgstr ":gh:`129660`: 从 PGO 训练中丢弃 ``test_embed``，它在近期版本中的贡献被认为是可忽略的。"

#: ../NEWS:371
msgid "Python 3.12.9 final"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:373
msgid "*Release date: 2025-02-04*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2025-02-04*"

#: ../NEWS:378
msgid ""
":gh:`127906`: Test the limited C API in test_cppext. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ":gh:`127906`: 在 test_cppext 中测试受限 C API。 由 Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:380
msgid ""
":gh:`127906`: Backport test_cext from the main branch. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:383
msgid ""
":gh:`127637`: Add tests for the :mod:`dis` command-line interface. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ":gh:`127637`: 增加针对 :mod:`dis` 命令行界面的测试。 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:389
msgid ""
":gh:`105704`: When using :func:`urllib.parse.urlsplit` and "
":func:`urllib.parse.urlparse` host parsing would not reject domain names "
"containing square brackets (``[`` and ``]``). Square brackets are only valid"
" for IPv6 and IPvFuture hosts according to `RFC 3986 Section 3.2.2 "
"<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3986#section-3.2.2>`__."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105704`: 当使用 :func:`urllib.parse.urlsplit` 和 "
":func:`urllib.parse.urlparse` 时主机解析将不会拒绝包含方括号 (``[`` 和 ``]``) 的主机名。 根据 `RFC "
"3986 第 3.2.2 节 <https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc3986#section-3.2.2>`__方括号仅适用于 IPv6 和 IPvFuture 主机。"

#: ../NEWS:395
msgid ""
":gh:`127655`: Fixed the "
":class:`!asyncio.selector_events._SelectorSocketTransport` transport not "
"pausing writes for the protocol when the buffer reaches the high water mark "
"when using :meth:`asyncio.WriteTransport.writelines`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127655`: 修正了 :class:`!asyncio.selector_events._SelectorSocketTransport`"
" 传输当使用 :meth:`asyncio.WriteTransport.writelines` 时不在缓冲区到达高水位时暂停为协议写入的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:400
msgid ""
":gh:`126108`: Fix a possible ``NULL`` pointer dereference in "
":c:func:`!PySys_AddWarnOptionUnicode`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126108`: 修正了 :c:func:`!PySys_AddWarnOptionUnicode` 中的一个可能的 ``NULL`` "
"指针解引用。"

#: ../NEWS:403
msgid ""
":gh:`80222`: Fix bug in the folding of quoted strings when flattening an "
"email message using a modern email policy. Previously when a quoted string "
"was folded so that it spanned more than one line, the surrounding quotes and"
" internal escapes would be omitted. This could theoretically be used to "
"spoof header lines using a carefully constructed quoted string if the "
"resulting rendered email was transmitted or re-parsed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`80222`: "
"修复在使用现代电子邮件策略扁平化电子邮件消息时引用字符串折叠的错误。之前，当一个引用字符串被折叠以至于跨越多行时，周围的引号和内部转义将被省略。理论上，如果生成的渲染电子邮件被传输或重新解析，这可能会被用来使用精心构造的引用字符串欺骗标题行。"

#: ../NEWS:410
msgid ""
":gh:`119511`: Fix a potential denial of service in the :mod:`imaplib` "
"module. When connecting to a malicious server, it could cause an arbitrary "
"amount of memory to be allocated. On many systems this is harmless as unused"
" virtual memory is only a mapping, but if this hit a virtual address size "
"limit it could lead to a :exc:`MemoryError` or other process crash. On "
"unusual systems or builds where all allocated memory is touched and backed "
"by actual ram or storage it could've consumed resources doing so until "
"similarly crashing."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119511`: 修复 :mod:`imaplib` "
"模块中潜在的拒绝服务问题。当连接到恶意服务器时，可能导致分配任意数量的内存。在许多系统上，这是无害的，因为未使用的虚拟内存只是一个映射，但如果这达到了虚拟地址大小限制，可能会导致"
" :exc:`MemoryError` 或其他进程崩溃。在不寻常的系统或构建中，所有分配的内存都被触及并由实际 RAM "
"或存储支持，这可能会消耗资源，直到类似崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:422
msgid ""
":gh:`129502`: Unlikely errors in preparing arguments for :mod:`ctypes` "
"callback are now handled in the same way as errors raised in the callback of"
" in converting the result of the callback -- using "
":func:`sys.unraisablehook` instead of :func:`sys.excepthook` and not setting"
" :data:`sys.last_exc` and other variables."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129502`: 在准备 :mod:`ctypes` "
"回调参数时不太可能发生的错误现在以与回调中引发的错误或在转换回调结果时的错误相同的方式处理——使用 :func:`sys.unraisablehook`"
" 而不是 :func:`sys.excepthook`，并且不设置 :data:`sys.last_exc` 和其他变量。"

#: ../NEWS:428
msgid ""
":gh:`129403`: Corrected :exc:`ValueError` message for "
":class:`asyncio.Barrier` and :class:`threading.Barrier`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129403`: 修正了用于 :class:`asyncio.Barrier` 和 :class:`threading.Barrier` 的 "
":exc:`ValueError` 消息。"

#: ../NEWS:431
msgid ""
":gh:`129409`: Fix an integer overflow in the :mod:`csv` module when writing "
"a data field larger than 2GB."
msgstr ":gh:`129409`: 修复了 :mod:`csv` 模块中当写入大于 2GB 的数据字段时的整数溢出。"

#: ../NEWS:434
msgid ""
":gh:`118761`: Improve import time of :mod:`subprocess` by lazy importing "
"``locale`` and ``signal``. Patch by Taneli Hukkinen."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118761`: 通过惰性导入 ``locale`` 和 ``signal`` 提升了 :mod:`subprocess` 的导入速度。 由 "
"Taneli Hukkinen 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:437
msgid ""
":gh:`129346`: In :mod:`sqlite3`, handle out-of-memory when creating user-"
"defined SQL functions."
msgstr ":gh:`129346`: 在 :mod:`sqlite3` 中，处理当创建用户自定义 SQL 函数时的内存不足问题。"

#: ../NEWS:440
msgid ""
":gh:`128550`: Removed an incorrect optimization relating to eager tasks in "
":class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` that resulted in cancellations being missed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128550`: 移除了 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` 中关于急切任务的不正确优化，该优化导致取消操作被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:443
msgid ""
":gh:`128991`: Release the enter frame reference within :mod:`bdb` callback"
msgstr ":gh:`128991`: 在 :mod:`bdb` 回调中释放进入帧的引用。"

#: ../NEWS:445
msgid ""
":gh:`128961`: Fix a crash when setting state on an exhausted "
":class:`array.array` iterator."
msgstr ":gh:`128961`: 修复在设置耗尽的 :class:`array.array` 迭代器状态时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:448
msgid ""
":gh:`128916`: Do not attempt to set ``SO_REUSEPORT`` on sockets of address "
"families other than ``AF_INET`` and ``AF_INET6``, as it is meaningless with "
"these address families, and the call with fail with Linux kernel 6.12.9 and "
"newer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128916`: 不尝试在 ``AF_INET`` 和 ``AF_INET6`` 之外的地址族套接字上设置 "
"``SO_REUSEPORT``，因为这对这些地址族来说毫无意义，并且在Linux内核6.12.9及更新版本中调用会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:453
msgid ""
":gh:`128679`: Fix :func:`tracemalloc.stop` race condition. Fix "
":mod:`tracemalloc` to support calling :func:`tracemalloc.stop` in one "
"thread, while another thread is tracing memory allocations. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:458
msgid ""
":gh:`128562`: Fix possible conflicts in generated :mod:`tkinter` widget "
"names if the widget class name ends with a digit."
msgstr ":gh:`128562`: 修正了当控件类名称是以数字结尾时在生成的 :mod:`tkinter` 控件名称中可能出现的冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:461
msgid ""
":gh:`128552`: Fix cyclic garbage introduced by "
":meth:`asyncio.loop.create_task` and :meth:`asyncio.TaskGroup.create_task` "
"holding a reference to the created task if it is eager."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128552`: 修正了由于 :meth:`asyncio.loop.create_task` 和 "
":meth:`asyncio.TaskGroup.create_task` 在其为主动型时持有对所创建任务的引用而导致的循环垃圾。"

#: ../NEWS:465
msgid ""
":gh:`128479`: Fix :func:`!asyncio.staggered.staggered_race` leaking tasks "
"and issuing an unhandled exception."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128479`: 修复 :func:`!asyncio.staggered.staggered_race` 泄露任务和发出未处理异常的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:468
msgid ""
":gh:`88834`: Unify the instance check for :class:`typing.Union` and "
":class:`types.UnionType`: :class:`!Union` now uses the instance checks "
"against its parameters instead of the subclass checks."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88834`: 统一了 :class:`typing.Union` 和 :class:`types.UnionType` 的实例检查方式：现在"
" :class:`!Union` 将针对其形参使用实例检查而不是子类检查。"

#: ../NEWS:472
msgid ""
":gh:`128302`: Fix "
":meth:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMEntityResolver.resolveEntity`, which was "
"broken by the Python 3.0 transition."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128302`: 修正了 "
":meth:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMEntityResolver.resolveEntity`，它是在 Python 3.0 "
"过渡期中被破坏的。"

#: ../NEWS:476
msgid ""
":gh:`128302`: Allow :meth:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMParser.parse` to correctly"
" handle :class:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMInputSource` instances that only have"
" a :attr:`!systemId` attribute set."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128302`: 允许 :meth:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMParser.parse` 正确地处理仅设置了 "
":attr:`!systemId` 属性的 :class:`!xml.dom.xmlbuilder.DOMInputSource` 实例。"

#: ../NEWS:480
msgid ""
":gh:`112064`: Fix incorrect handling of negative read sizes in "
":meth:`HTTPResponse.read <http.client.HTTPResponse.read>`. Patch by Yury "
"Manushkin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112064`: 修复 :meth:`HTTPResponse.read <http.client.HTTPResponse.read>` "
"中负读取大小的错误处理。由 Yury Manushkin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:484
msgid ":gh:`58956`: Fixed a frame reference leak in :mod:`bdb`."
msgstr ":gh:`58956`: 修复了 :mod:`bdb` 中的一个帧引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:486
msgid ""
":gh:`128131`: Completely support random access of uncompressed unencrypted "
"read-only zip files obtained by :meth:`ZipFile.open <zipfile.ZipFile.open>`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128131`: 完全支持通过 :meth:`ZipFile.open <zipfile.ZipFile.open>` 获取的未压缩未加密只读"
" zip 文件的随机访问。"

#: ../NEWS:490
msgid ""
":gh:`127975`: Avoid reusing quote types in :func:`ast.unparse` if not "
"needed."
msgstr ":gh:`127975`: 在 :func:`ast.unparse` 中避免不必要地重复使用引号类型。"

#: ../NEWS:492
msgid ""
":gh:`128014`: Fix resetting the default window icon by passing "
"``default=''`` to the :mod:`tkinter` method :meth:`!wm_iconbitmap`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128014`: 通过将 ``default=''`` 传给 :mod:`tkinter` 方法 :meth:`!wm_iconbitmap`"
" 修复了重设默认窗口图标问题。"

#: ../NEWS:495
msgid ""
":gh:`115514`: Fix exceptions and incomplete writes after "
":class:`!asyncio._SelectorTransport` is closed before writes are completed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115514`: 修复了在 :class:`!asyncio._SelectorTransport` "
"关闭前未完成写入时的异常和不完整写入问题。"

#: ../NEWS:499
msgid ""
":gh:`41872`: Fix quick extraction of module docstrings from a file in "
":mod:`pydoc`. It now supports docstrings with single quotes, escape "
"sequences, raw string literals, and other Python syntax."
msgstr ""
":gh:`41872`: 修正了在 :mod:`pydoc` 中自文件中快速提取模块文档字符串的功能。 "
"现在它支持具有单引用、转义序列、原始字符串字面值以及其他 Python 语法的文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:503
msgid ""
":gh:`126742`: Fix support of localized error messages reported by "
":manpage:`dlerror(3)` and :manpage:`gdbm_strerror <gdbm(3)>` in "
":mod:`ctypes` and :mod:`dbm.gnu` functions respectively. Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126742`: 在 :mod:`ctypes` 和 :mod:`dbm.gnu` 函数中分别修正了对 "
":manpage:`dlerror(3)` 和 :manpage:`gdbm_strerror <gdbm(3)>` 所报告的本地化错误消息的支持。 由"
" Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:508
msgid ""
":gh:`127870`: Detect recursive calls in ctypes ``_as_parameter_`` handling. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127870`: 检测在 ctypes ``_as_parameter_`` 处理中的递归调用。 由 Victor Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:511
msgid ""
":gh:`127847`: Fix the position when doing interleaved seeks and reads in "
"uncompressed, unencrypted zip files returned by "
":meth:`zipfile.ZipFile.open`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127847`: 修复了在由 :meth:`zipfile.ZipFile.open` 返回的未压缩、未加密的 zip "
"文件上执行交错定位和读取时的位置问题。"

#: ../NEWS:515
msgid ""
":gh:`127732`: The :mod:`platform` module now correctly detects Windows "
"Server 2025."
msgstr ":gh:`127732`: 现在 :mod:`platform` 模块能正确地检测 Windows Server 2025。"

#: ../NEWS:518
msgid ""
":gh:`93312`: Include ``<sys/pidfd.h>`` to get ``os.PIDFD_NONBLOCK`` "
"constant. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93312`: 包括 ``<sys/pidfd.h>`` 以获取 ``os.PIDFD_NONBLOCK`` 常量。 由 Victor "
"Stinner 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:521
msgid ""
":gh:`83662`: Add missing ``__class_getitem__`` method to the Python "
"implementation of :func:`functools.partial`, to make it compatible with the "
"C version. This is mainly relevant for alternative Python implementations "
"like PyPy and GraalPy, because CPython will usually use the C-implementation"
" of that function."
msgstr ""
":gh:`83662`: 为 :func:`functools.partial` 的 Python 实现增加了缺失的 "
"``__class_getitem__`` 方法，以使其与 C 版本相兼容。 这主要影响其他 Python 实现如 PyPy 和 GraalPy，因为 "
"CPython 通常会使用相应函数的 C 实现。"

#: ../NEWS:527
msgid ""
":gh:`127586`: :class:`multiprocessing.pool.Pool` now properly restores "
"blocked signal handlers of the parent thread when creating processes via "
"either *spawn* or *forkserver*."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127586`: 现在当通过 *spawn* 或 *forkserver* 创建进程时 "
":class:`multiprocessing.pool.Pool` 会正确地恢复父线程被阻塞的信号处理器。"

#: ../NEWS:531
msgid ""
":gh:`98188`: Fix an issue in :meth:`email.message.Message.get_payload` where"
" data cannot be decoded if the Content Transfer Encoding mechanism contains "
"trailing whitespaces or additional junk text. Patch by Hui Liu."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98188`: 修复了在 :meth:`email.message.Message.get_payload` 中当 Content "
"Transfer Encoding 机制包含末尾空格或额外冗余文本时数据无法被解码的问题。 由 Hui Liu 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:535
msgid ""
":gh:`127257`: In :mod:`ssl`, system call failures that OpenSSL reports using"
" ``ERR_LIB_SYS`` are now raised as :exc:`OSError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127257`: 在 :mod:`ssl` 中，OpenSSL 报告使用 ``ERR_LIB_SYS`` 的系统调用失败现在将作为 "
":exc:`OSError` 被引发。"

#: ../NEWS:538
msgid ""
":gh:`126775`: Make :func:`linecache.checkcache` thread safe and GC re-"
"entrancy safe."
msgstr ":gh:`126775`: 使得 :func:`linecache.checkcache` 保证线程安全和 GC 重进入安全。"

#: ../NEWS:541
msgid ""
":gh:`58956`: Fixed a bug in :mod:`pdb` where sometimes the breakpoint won't "
"trigger if it was set on a function which is already in the call stack."
msgstr ":gh:`58956`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 中的一个 bug，其中如果断点设置在已经在调用堆栈中的函数上，有时不会触发。"

#: ../NEWS:544
msgid ""
":gh:`123401`: The :mod:`http.cookies` module now supports parsing obsolete "
":rfc:`850` date formats, in accordance with :rfc:`9110` requirements. Patch "
"by Nano Zheng."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123401`: 现在 :mod:`http.cookies` 模块支持解释过时的 :rfc:`850` 日期格式，以符合 "
":rfc:`9110` 的要求。 由 Nano Zheng 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:548
msgid ""
":gh:`123085`: In a bare call to :func:`importlib.resources.files`, ensure "
"the caller's frame is properly detected when ``importlib.resources`` is "
"itself available as a compiled module only (no source)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123085`: 在裸调用 :func:`importlib.resources.files` 时，确保当 "
"``importlib.resources`` 本身仅作为编译模块可用时（无源代码），能正确检测到调用者的帧。"

#: ../NEWS:552
msgid ""
":gh:`122431`: :func:`readline.append_history_file` now raises a "
":exc:`ValueError` when given a negative value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122431`: 现在当为 :func:`readline.append_history_file` 给出负值时将会引发 "
":exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:558
msgid ""
":gh:`125722`: Require Sphinx 8.1.3 or later to build the Python "
"documentation. Patch by Adam Turner."
msgstr ":gh:`125722`: 要求Sphinx 8.1.3或更高版本来构建Python文档。由Adam Turner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:561
msgid ""
":gh:`67206`: Document that :const:`string.printable` is not printable in the"
" POSIX sense. In particular, :meth:`string.printable.isprintable() "
"<str.isprintable>` returns :const:`False`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`67206`: 记录了 :const:`string.printable` 在 POSIX 下的不可打印字符。 特别地， "
":meth:`string.printable.isprintable() <str.isprintable>` 将返回 :const:`False`。"
" 由 Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:568
msgid ""
":gh:`129345`: Fix null pointer dereference in :func:`syslog.openlog` when an"
" audit hook raises an exception."
msgstr ":gh:`129345`: 修复当审计钩子引发异常时 :func:`syslog.openlog` 中的空指针解引用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:571
msgid ""
":gh:`129093`: Fix f-strings such as ``f'{expr=}'`` sometimes not displaying "
"the full expression when the expression contains ``!=``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`129093`: 修复像 ``f'{expr=}'`` 这样的 f-字符串在表达式包含 ``!=`` 时有时不显示完整表达式的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:574
msgid ""
":gh:`124363`: Treat debug expressions in f-string as raw strings. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`124363`: 将 f-string 中的调试表达式视为原始字符串。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:577
msgid ""
":gh:`128799`: Add frame of ``except*`` to traceback when it wraps a naked "
"exception."
msgstr ":gh:`128799`: 当 ``except*`` 包装裸异常时，将其框架添加到回溯中。"

#: ../NEWS:580
msgid ""
":gh:`128078`: Fix a :exc:`SystemError` when using :func:`anext` with a "
"default tuple value. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128078`: 修正了当附带默认的元组值使用 :func:`anext` 时导致的 :exc:`SystemError`。 由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 编写补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:583
msgid ""
":gh:`128079`: Fix a bug where :keyword:`except* <except_star>` does not "
"properly check the return value of an :exc:`ExceptionGroup`'s "
":meth:`~BaseExceptionGroup.split` function, leading to a crash in some "
"cases. Now when :meth:`~BaseExceptionGroup.split` returns an invalid object,"
" :keyword:`except* <except_star>` raises a :exc:`TypeError` with the "
"original raised :exc:`ExceptionGroup` object chained to it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128079`: 修复了一个由于 :keyword:`except* <except_star>` 不能正确地检查 "
":exc:`ExceptionGroup` 的 :meth:`~BaseExceptionGroup.split` "
"函数的返回值，导致在某些情况下发生崩溃的程序错误。 现在当 :meth:`~BaseExceptionGroup.split` "
"返回无效对象时，:keyword:`except* <except_star>` 将引发一个 :exc:`TypeError` 并原来所引发的 "
":exc:`ExceptionGroup` 对象与其进行串连。"

#: ../NEWS:590
msgid ""
":gh:`127903`: ``Objects/unicodeobject.c``: fix a crash on DEBUG builds in "
"``_copy_characters`` when there is nothing to copy."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127903`: ``Objects/unicodeobject.c``: 修复了在DEBUG构建中当没有内容可复制时 "
"``_copy_characters`` 的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:593
msgid ""
":gh:`127599`: Fix statistics for increments of object reference counts (in "
"particular, when a reference count was increased by more than 1 in a single "
"operation)."
msgstr ":gh:`127599`: 修复对象引用计数增加的统计（特别是当引用计数在单个操作中增加了超过1时）。"

#: ../NEWS:597
msgid ":gh:`111609`: Respect *end_offset* in :exc:`SyntaxError` subclasses."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:599
msgid ""
":gh:`126862`: Fix a possible overflow when a class inherits from an absurd "
"number of super-classes. Reported by Valery Fedorenko. Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126862`: 修复了一个类继承自极其多的超类时可能出现的溢出问题。由Valery Fedorenko报告。由Bénédikt "
"Tran提交补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:603
msgid ""
":gh:`117195`: Avoid assertion failure for debug builds when calling "
"``object.__sizeof__(1)``"
msgstr ":gh:`117195`: 在调试构建中调用 ``object.__sizeof__(1)`` 时避免断言失败。"

#: ../NEWS:609
msgid ""
":gh:`126554`: Fix error handling in :class:`ctypes.CDLL` objects which could"
" result in a crash in rare situations."
msgstr ":gh:`126554`: 修复 :class:`ctypes.CDLL` 对象中的错误处理，在极少数情况下可能导致崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:612
msgid ""
":gh:`107249`: Implement the :c:macro:`Py_UNUSED` macro for Windows MSVC "
"compiler. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107249`: 为 Windows MSVC 编译器实现 :c:macro:`Py_UNUSED` 宏。补丁由 Victor Stinner"
" 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:618
msgid ""
":gh:`129539`: Don't redefine ``EX_OK`` when the system has the "
"``sysexits.h`` header."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:621
msgid ""
":gh:`128472`: Skip BOLT optimization of functions using computed gotos, "
"fixing errors on build with LLVM 19."
msgstr ":gh:`128472`: 跳过使用计算跳转的函数的 BOLT 优化，修复了使用 LLVM 19 构建时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:624
msgid ""
":gh:`123925`: Fix building the :mod:`curses` module on platforms with "
"libncurses but without libncursesw."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123925`: 修复在没有 libncursesw 但有 libncurses 的平台上构建 :mod:`curses` 模块的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:627
msgid ""
":gh:`128321`: Set ``LIBS`` instead of ``LDFLAGS`` when checking if "
":mod:`sqlite3` library functions are available. This fixes the ordering of "
"linked libraries during checks, which was incorrect when using a statically "
"linked ``libsqlite3``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`128321`: 在检查 :mod:`sqlite3` 库函数是否可用时设置 ``LIBS`` 而不是 "
"``LDFLAGS``。这修复了链接库的顺序问题，该问题在使用静态链接的 ``libsqlite3`` 时是不正确的。"

#: ../NEWS:634
msgid "Python 3.12.8 final"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:636
msgid "*Release date: 2024-12-03*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2024-12-03*"

#: ../NEWS:641
msgid ":gh:`124448`: Update bundled Tcl/Tk in macOS installer to 8.6.15."
msgstr ":gh:`124448`: 更新 macOS 安装程序中的捆绑 Tcl/Tk 至 8.6.15。"

#: ../NEWS:646
msgid ":gh:`126911`: Update credits command output."
msgstr ":gh:`126911`: 更新了 credits 命令输出。"

#: ../NEWS:648
msgid ""
":gh:`125315`: Avoid crashing in :mod:`platform` due to slow WMI calls on "
"some Windows machines."
msgstr ":gh:`125315`: 避免在某些 Windows 机器上由于 WMI 调用缓慢而在 :mod:`platform` 中崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:651
msgid ""
":gh:`125550`: Enable the :ref:`launcher` to detect Python 3.14 installs from"
" the Windows Store."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125550`: 开启 :ref:`launcher` 对来自 Windows Store 的 Python 3.14 安装版的检测。"

#: ../NEWS:654
msgid ":gh:`124448`: Updated bundled Tcl/Tk to 8.6.15."
msgstr ":gh:`124448`: 将捆绑的 Tcl/Tk 更新至 8.6.15。"

#: ../NEWS:659
msgid ""
":gh:`126807`: Fix extraction warnings in :program:`pygettext.py` caused by "
"mistaking function definitions for function calls."
msgstr ":gh:`126807`: 修复 :program:`pygettext.py` 中因将函数定义误认为函数调用而导致的提取警告。"

#: ../NEWS:665
msgid ""
":gh:`126909`: Fix test_os extended attribute tests to work on filesystems "
"with 1 KiB xattr size limit."
msgstr ":gh:`126909`: 修复 test_os 扩展属性测试，使其能在 xattr 大小限制为 1 KiB 的文件系统上工作。"

#: ../NEWS:668
msgid ""
":gh:`125041`: Re-enable skipped tests for :mod:`zlib` on the s390x "
"architecture: only skip checks of the compressed bytes, which can be "
"different between zlib's software implementation and the hardware-"
"accelerated implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125041`: 在s390x架构上重新启用对 :mod:`zlib` "
"的跳过测试：仅跳过压缩字节的检查，这些在zlib的软件实现和硬件加速实现之间可能不同。"

#: ../NEWS:673
msgid ":gh:`124295`: Add translation tests to the :mod:`argparse` module."
msgstr ":gh:`124295`: 向 :mod:`argparse` 模块添加翻译测试。"

#: ../NEWS:678
msgid ":gh:`126623`: Upgrade libexpat to 2.6.4"
msgstr ":gh:`126623`: 将 libexpat 升级到 2.6.4 版本"

#: ../NEWS:683
msgid ""
":gh:`127303`: Publicly expose :data:`~token.EXACT_TOKEN_TYPES` in "
":attr:`!token.__all__`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127303`: 公开暴露 :data:`~token.EXACT_TOKEN_TYPES` 在 :attr:`!token.__all__`"
" 中。"

#: ../NEWS:686
msgid ""
":gh:`123967`: Fix faulthandler for trampoline frames. If the top-most frame "
"is a trampoline frame, skip it. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123967`: 修复了 faulthandler 对于 trampoline 框架的处理。如果最顶层的框架是 trampoline "
"框架，则跳过它。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:689
msgid ""
":gh:`127182`: Fix :meth:`!io.StringIO.__setstate__` crash, when "
":const:`None` was passed as the first value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127182`: 修复了 :meth:`!io.StringIO.__setstate__` 当 :const:`None` "
"作为第一个值传递时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:692
msgid ""
":gh:`127217`: Fix :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` for paths starting "
"with multiple slashes on Posix."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127217`: 修复了 :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` 对于 Posix "
"上以多个斜杠开头的路径的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:695
msgid ""
":gh:`127035`: Fix :mod:`shutil.which` on Windows. Now it looks at direct "
"match if and only if the command ends with a PATHEXT extension or X_OK is "
"not in mode. Support extensionless files if \".\" is in PATHEXT. Support "
"PATHEXT extensions that end with a dot."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127035`: 修复了 Windows 上的 :mod:`shutil.which`。现在它仅在命令以 PATHEXT 扩展名结束或 "
"X_OK 不在模式中时查看直接匹配。如果 \".\" 在 PATHEXT 中，则支持无扩展名的文件。支持以点结束的 PATHEXT 扩展名。"

#: ../NEWS:700
msgid ""
":gh:`127078`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` failed to "
"discard an extra slash before a UNC drive in the URL path on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`127078`: 修复了 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 在 Windows 上无法丢弃 URL "
"路径中 UNC 驱动器前的额外斜杠的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:703
msgid ""
":gh:`126766`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` failed to "
"discard any 'localhost' authority present in the URL."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126766`: 修复 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 在 URL 中存在 'localhost' "
"授权时未能丢弃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:706
msgid ""
":gh:`126997`: Fix support of STRING and GLOBAL opcodes with non-ASCII "
"arguments in :mod:`pickletools`. :func:`pickletools.dis` now outputs non-"
"ASCII bytes in STRING, BINSTRING and SHORT_BINSTRING arguments as escaped "
"(``\\xXX``)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126997`: 修复 :mod:`pickletools` 中 STRING 和 GLOBAL 操作码对非 ASCII "
"参数的支持。:func:`pickletools.dis` 现在将 STRING、BINSTRING 和 SHORT_BINSTRING 参数中的非 "
"ASCII 字节输出为转义形式（``\\xXX``）。"

#: ../NEWS:711
msgid ""
":gh:`126618`: Fix the representation of :class:`itertools.count` objects "
"when the count value is :data:`sys.maxsize`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126618`: 修复当计数值为 :data:`sys.maxsize` 时 :class:`itertools.count` 对象的表示。"

#: ../NEWS:714
msgid ""
":gh:`85168`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` and "
":func:`~urllib.request.pathname2url` always used UTF-8 when quoting and "
"unquoting file URIs. They now use the :term:`filesystem encoding and error "
"handler`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85168`: 修复了 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 和 "
":func:`~urllib.request.pathname2url` 在引用和取消引用文件 URI 时总是使用 UTF-8 的问题。它们现在使用 "
":term:`文件系统编码和错误处理程序`。"

#: ../NEWS:719
msgid ""
":gh:`67877`: Fix memory leaks when :mod:`regular expression <re>` matching "
"terminates abruptly, either because of a signal or because memory allocation"
" fails."
msgstr ":gh:`67877`: 修复了当 :mod:`正则表达式 <re>` 匹配因信号或内存分配失败而突然终止时的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:723
msgid ""
":gh:`126789`: Fixed the values of :py:func:`sysconfig.get_config_vars`, "
":py:func:`sysconfig.get_paths`, and their siblings when the :py:mod:`site` "
"initialization happens after :py:mod:`sysconfig` has built a cache for "
":py:func:`sysconfig.get_config_vars`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126789`: 当 :py:mod:`site` 初始化发生在 :py:mod:`sysconfig` 为 "
":py:func:`sysconfig.get_config_vars` 构建缓存之后时，修复了 "
":py:func:`sysconfig.get_config_vars`、:py:func:`sysconfig.get_paths` "
"及其相关函数的返回值。"

#: ../NEWS:728
msgid ":gh:`126188`: Update bundled pip to 24.3.1"
msgstr ":gh:`126188`: 将捆绑的 pip 更新到 24.3.1 版本"

#: ../NEWS:730
msgid ""
":gh:`126766`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` failed to "
"discard two leading slashes introducing an empty authority section."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126766`: 修复 :func:`urllib.request.url2pathname` 在丢弃两个前导斜杠时引入空授权部分的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:733
msgid ""
":gh:`126727`: ``locale.nl_langinfo(locale.ERA)`` now returns multiple era "
"description segments separated by semicolons. Previously it only returned "
"the first segment on platforms with Glibc."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126727`: ``locale.nl_langinfo(locale.ERA)`` 现在返回由分号分隔的多个时代描述段。以前在带有 "
"Glibc 的平台上它只返回第一段。"

#: ../NEWS:737
msgid ""
":gh:`126699`: Allow :class:`collections.abc.AsyncIterator` to be a base for "
"Protocols."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126699`: 允许 :class:`collections.abc.AsyncIterator` 作为 Protocols 的基类。"

#: ../NEWS:740
msgid ""
":gh:`104745`: Limit starting a patcher (from :func:`unittest.mock.patch` or "
":func:`unittest.mock.patch.object`) more than once without stopping it"
msgstr ""
":gh:`104745`: 限制在不停止的情况下多次启动修补程序（来自 :func:`unittest.mock.patch` 或 "
":func:`unittest.mock.patch.object`）。"

#: ../NEWS:743
msgid ""
":gh:`126595`: Fix a crash when instantiating :class:`itertools.count` with "
"an initial count of :data:`sys.maxsize` on debug builds. Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126595`: 修复在调试构建中，当 :class:`itertools.count` 以 :data:`sys.maxsize` "
"为初始计数实例化时崩溃的问题。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:747
msgid ""
":gh:`120423`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` mishandled"
" Windows paths with embedded forward slashes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120423`: 修复 :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` 处理嵌入正斜杠的 Windows "
"路径时的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:750
msgid ""
":gh:`126565`: Improve performances of :meth:`zipfile.Path.open` for non-"
"reading modes."
msgstr ":gh:`126565`: 提高 :meth:`zipfile.Path.open` 在非读取模式下的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:753
msgid ""
":gh:`126505`: Fix bugs in compiling case-insensitive :mod:`regular "
"expressions <re>` with character classes containing non-BMP characters: "
"upper-case non-BMP character did was ignored and the ASCII flag was ignored "
"when matching a character range whose upper bound is beyond the BMP region."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126505`: 修复在编译包含非 BMP 字符的字符类的大小写不敏感 :mod:`正则表达式 <re>` 时的错误：大写的非 BMP "
"字符被忽略，并且在匹配超出 BMP 区域上限的字符范围时，ASCII 标志被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:759
msgid ""
":gh:`117378`: Fixed the :mod:`multiprocessing` ``\"forkserver\"`` start "
"method forkserver process to correctly inherit the parent's :data:`sys.path`"
" during the importing of :func:`multiprocessing.set_forkserver_preload` "
"modules in the same manner as :data:`sys.path` is configured in workers "
"before executing work items."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117378`: 修复 :mod:`multiprocessing` ``\"forkserver\"`` 启动方法 forkserver "
"进程在导入 :func:`multiprocessing.set_forkserver_preload` 模块时正确继承父进程的 "
":data:`sys.path`，与在执行工作项之前在工作者中配置 :data:`sys.path` 的方式相同。"

#: ../NEWS:765
msgid ""
"This bug caused some forkserver module preloading to silently fail to "
"preload. This manifested as a performance degration in child processes when "
"the ``sys.path`` was required due to additional repeated work in every "
"worker."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:770
msgid ""
"It could also have a side effect of ``\"\"`` remaining in :data:`sys.path` "
"during forkserver preload imports instead of the absolute path from "
":func:`os.getcwd` at multiprocessing import time used in the worker "
"``sys.path``."
msgstr ""
"它还可能在 forkserver 预加载导入期间，将 ``\"\"`` 保留在 :data:`sys.path` 中，而不是使用工作者 "
"``sys.path`` 中在 multiprocessing 导入时来自 :func:`os.getcwd` 的绝对路径。"

#: ../NEWS:775
msgid ""
"The ``sys.path`` differences between phases in the child process could "
"potentially have caused preload to import incorrect things from the wrong "
"location.  We are unaware of that actually having happened in practice."
msgstr "子进程中各阶段之间的 ``sys.path`` 差异可能导致预加载从错误的位置导入不正确的内容。我们尚未在实际中遇到这种情况。"

#: ../NEWS:779
msgid ""
":gh:`125679`: The :class:`multiprocessing.Lock` and "
":class:`multiprocessing.RLock` ``repr`` values no longer say \"unknown\" on "
"macOS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125679`: 在macOS上，:class:`multiprocessing.Lock` 和 "
":class:`multiprocessing.RLock` 的``repr``值不再显示为\"unknown\"。"

#: ../NEWS:783
msgid ""
":gh:`126476`: Raise :class:`calendar.IllegalMonthError` (now a subclass of "
":class:`IndexError`) for :func:`calendar.month` when the input month is not "
"correct."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126476`: 当输入的月份不正确时，:func:`calendar.month` 会抛出 "
":class:`calendar.IllegalMonthError` (现在是 :class:`IndexError` 的子类) 。"

#: ../NEWS:787
msgid ""
":gh:`126489`: The Python implementation of :mod:`pickle` no longer calls "
":meth:`pickle.Pickler.persistent_id` for the result of "
":meth:`!persistent_id`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126489`: Python实现的 :mod:`pickle` 不再为 :meth:`!persistent_id` 的结果调用 "
":meth:`pickle.Pickler.persistent_id`。"

#: ../NEWS:791
msgid ""
":gh:`126303`: Fix pickling and copying of :class:`os.sched_param` objects."
msgstr ":gh:`126303`: 修复 :class:`os.sched_param` 对象的序列化和复制问题。"

#: ../NEWS:793
msgid ""
":gh:`126138`: Fix a use-after-free crash on :class:`asyncio.Task` objects "
"whose underlying coroutine yields an object that implements an evil "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__`. Patch by Nico Posada."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126138`: 修复 :class:`asyncio.Task` 对象中的一个使用后释放崩溃问题，该问题发生在底层协程生成一个实现邪恶 "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__` 的对象时。由 Nico Posada 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:797
msgid ""
":gh:`126220`: Fix crash in :class:`!cProfile.Profile` and "
":class:`!_lsprof.Profiler` when their callbacks were directly called with 0 "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126220`: 修复 :class:`!cProfile.Profile` 和 :class:`!_lsprof.Profiler` "
"中当它们的回调被直接以0个参数调用时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:801
msgid ""
":gh:`126212`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` and "
":func:`~urllib.request.url2pathname` removed slashes from Windows DOS drive "
"paths and URLs."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126212`: 修复 :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` 和 "
":func:`~urllib.request.url2pathname` 从 Windows DOS 驱动路径和 URL 中移除斜杠的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:805
msgid ""
":gh:`126205`: Fix issue where :func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` generated "
"URLs beginning with four slashes (rather than two) when given a Windows UNC "
"path."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126205`: 修复当给定 Windows UNC 路径时，:func:`urllib.request.pathname2url` "
"生成以四个斜杠（而不是两个）开头的 URL 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:809
msgid ""
":gh:`126105`: Fix a crash in :mod:`ast` when the :attr:`ast.AST._fields` "
"attribute is deleted."
msgstr ":gh:`126105`: 修复 :mod:`ast` 中当 :attr:`ast.AST._fields` 属性被删除时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:812
msgid ""
":gh:`126106`: Fixes a possible ``NULL`` pointer dereference in :mod:`ssl`."
msgstr ":gh:`126106`: 修复 :mod:`ssl` 中可能出现的 ``NULL`` 指针解引用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:814
msgid ""
":gh:`126080`: Fix a use-after-free crash on :class:`asyncio.Task` objects "
"for which the underlying event loop implements an evil "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__`. Reported by Nico-Posada. Patch by Bénédikt"
" Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126080`: 修复 :class:`asyncio.Task` 对象中的一个使用后释放崩溃问题，该问题发生在底层事件循环实现了一个邪恶的 "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__` 时。由 Nico-Posada 报告。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:819
msgid ""
":gh:`126083`: Fixed a reference leak in :class:`asyncio.Task` objects when "
"reinitializing the same object with a non-``None`` context. Patch by Nico "
"Posada."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126083`: 修复 :class:`asyncio.Task` 对象中当用非 ``None`` "
"上下文重新初始化同一对象时的引用泄漏问题。由 Nico Posada 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:823
msgid ""
":gh:`125984`: Fix use-after-free crashes on :class:`asyncio.Future` objects "
"for which the underlying event loop implements an evil "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__`. Reported by Nico-Posada. Patch by Bénédikt"
" Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125984`: 修复了 :class:`asyncio.Future` 对象上因底层事件循环实现了恶意的 "
":meth:`~object.__getattribute__` 而导致的释放后使用崩溃。由 Nico-Posada 报告，Bénédikt Tran "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:828
msgid ""
":gh:`125969`: Fix an out-of-bounds crash when an evil "
":meth:`asyncio.loop.call_soon` mutates the length of the internal callbacks "
"list. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125969`: 修复了当恶意的 :meth:`asyncio.loop.call_soon` 改变内部回调列表长度时导致的越界崩溃。由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:832
msgid ""
":gh:`125966`: Fix a use-after-free crash in "
":meth:`asyncio.Future.remove_done_callback`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125966`: 修复了 :meth:`asyncio.Future.remove_done_callback` 中的释放后使用崩溃。由 "
"Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:835
msgid ""
":gh:`125789`: Fix possible crash when mutating list of callbacks returned by"
" :attr:`!asyncio.Future._callbacks`. It now always returns a new copy in C "
"implementation :mod:`!_asyncio`. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125789`: 修复了当改变由 :attr:`!asyncio.Future._callbacks` 返回的回调列表时可能导致的崩溃。现在在"
" C 实现 :mod:`!_asyncio` 中总是返回一个新的副本。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:839
msgid ""
":gh:`124452`: Fix an issue in "
":meth:`email.policy.EmailPolicy.header_source_parse` and "
":meth:`email.policy.Compat32.header_source_parse` that introduced spurious "
"leading whitespaces into header values when the header includes a newline "
"character after the header name delimiter (``:``) and before the value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124452`: 修复了 :meth:`email.policy.EmailPolicy.header_source_parse` 和 "
":meth:`email.policy.Compat32.header_source_parse` "
"中的一个问题，该问题在头名称分隔符（``:``）之后和值之前包含换行符时，会在头值中引入虚假的前导空格。"

#: ../NEWS:845
msgid ""
":gh:`125884`: Fixed the bug for :mod:`pdb` where it can't set breakpoints on"
" functions with certain annotations."
msgstr ":gh:`125884`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 中无法为带有特定注解的函数设置断点的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:848
msgid ""
":gh:`125355`: Fix several bugs in "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_intermixed_args`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125355`: 修复了 :meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_intermixed_args` "
"中的几个错误。"

#: ../NEWS:851
msgid "The parser no longer changes temporarily during parsing."
msgstr "解析器在解析过程中不再临时改变。"

#: ../NEWS:852
msgid "Default values are not processed twice."
msgstr "默认值不会被处理两次。"

#: ../NEWS:853
msgid ""
"Required mutually exclusive groups containing positional arguments are now "
"supported."
msgstr "现在支持包含位置参数的必需互斥组。"

#: ../NEWS:854
msgid ""
"The missing arguments report now includes the names of all required optional"
" and positional arguments."
msgstr "缺少的参数报告现在包括所有必需的可选和位置参数的名称。"

#: ../NEWS:855
msgid ""
"Unknown options can be intermixed with positional arguments in "
"parse_known_intermixed_args()."
msgstr "未知选项可以与位置参数在 parse_known_intermixed_args() 中混合使用。"

#: ../NEWS:857
msgid ""
":gh:`125682`: Reject non-ASCII digits in the Python implementation of "
":func:`json.loads` conforming to the JSON specification."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125682`: 在 Python 实现的 :func:`json.loads` 中拒绝非 ASCII 数字，以符合 JSON 规范。"

#: ../NEWS:860
msgid ""
":gh:`125660`: Reject invalid unicode escapes for Python implementation of "
":func:`json.loads`."
msgstr ":gh:`125660`: 在 Python 实现的 :func:`json.loads` 中拒绝无效的 unicode 转义。"

#: ../NEWS:863
msgid ""
":gh:`125259`: Fix the notes removal logic for errors thrown in enum "
"initialization."
msgstr ":gh:`125259`: 修复了在枚举初始化中抛出错误的注释移除逻辑。"

#: ../NEWS:866
msgid ""
":gh:`125519`: Improve traceback if :func:`importlib.reload` is called with "
"an object that is not a module. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125519`: 如果 :func:`importlib.reload` 被调用时传入的对象不是模块，改进回溯信息。由 Alex "
"Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:869
msgid ""
":gh:`125451`: Fix deadlock when "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` shuts down concurrently with"
" an error when feeding a job to a worker process."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125451`: 修复 :class:`concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` "
"在向工作进程提供作业时因错误而并发关闭时的死锁问题。"

#: ../NEWS:873
msgid ""
":gh:`125422`: Fixed the bug where :mod:`pdb` and :mod:`bdb` can step into "
"the bottom caller frame."
msgstr ":gh:`125422`: 修复了 :mod:`pdb` 和 :mod:`bdb` 可以步入底部调用者帧的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:876
msgid ""
":gh:`100141`: Fixed the bug where :mod:`pdb` will be stuck in an infinite "
"loop when debugging an empty file."
msgstr ":gh:`100141`: 修复了调试空文件时 :mod:`pdb` 会陷入无限循环的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:879
msgid ""
":gh:`53203`: Fix :func:`time.strptime` for ``%c``, ``%x`` and ``%X`` formats"
" in many locales that use non-ASCII digits, like Persian, Burmese, Odia and "
"Shan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`53203`: 修复 :func:`time.strptime` 对于使用非 ASCII 数字的许多地区（如波斯语、缅甸语、奥里亚语和掸语）的"
" ``%c``、``%x`` 和 ``%X`` 格式的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:883
msgid ""
":gh:`125254`: Fix a bug where ArgumentError includes the incorrect ambiguous"
" option in :mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":gh:`125254`: 修复 ArgumentError 在 :mod:`argparse` 中包含错误模糊选项的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:886
msgid ""
":gh:`61011`: Fix inheritance of nested mutually exclusive groups from parent"
" parser in :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser`. Previously, all nested mutually"
" exclusive groups lost their connection to the group containing them and "
"were displayed as belonging directly to the parser."
msgstr ""
":gh:`61011`: 修复了 :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` "
"中父解析器中嵌套互斥组的继承问题。之前，所有嵌套的互斥组都会失去与包含它们的组的连接，并显示为直接属于解析器。"

#: ../NEWS:891
msgid ""
":gh:`52551`: Fix encoding issues in :func:`time.strftime`, the "
":meth:`~datetime.datetime.strftime` method of the :mod:`datetime` classes "
":class:`~datetime.datetime`, :class:`~datetime.date` and "
":class:`~datetime.time` and formatting of these classes. Characters not "
"encodable in the current locale are now acceptable in the format string. "
"Surrogate pairs and sequence of surrogatescape-encoded bytes are no longer "
"recombinated. Embedded null character no longer terminates the format "
"string."
msgstr ""
":gh:`52551`: 修复了 :func:`time.strftime`、:mod:`datetime` 类 "
":class:`~datetime.datetime`、:class:`~datetime.date` 和 "
":class:`~datetime.time` 的 :meth:`~datetime.datetime.strftime` "
"方法以及这些类的格式化中的编码问题。现在，格式字符串中可以包含当前区域设置无法编码的字符。代理对和代理转义编码字节序列不再重新组合。嵌入的空字符不再终止格式字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:900
msgid ""
":gh:`125118`: Don't copy arbitrary values to :c:expr:`_Bool` in the "
":mod:`struct` module."
msgstr ":gh:`125118`: 在 :mod:`struct` 模块中，不要将任意值复制到 :c:expr:`_Bool`。"

#: ../NEWS:903
msgid ""
":gh:`125069`: Fix an issue where providing a :class:`pathlib.PurePath` "
"object as an initializer argument to a second :class:`~pathlib.PurePath` "
"object with a different flavour resulted in arguments to the former object's"
" initializer being joined by the latter object's flavour."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:908
msgid ""
":gh:`124969`: Fix ``locale.nl_langinfo(locale.ALT_DIGITS)`` on platforms "
"with glibc. Now it returns a string consisting of up to 100 semicolon-"
"separated symbols (an empty string in most locales) on all Posix platforms. "
"Previously it only returned the first symbol or an empty string."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:913
msgid ""
":gh:`124958`: Fix refcycles in exceptions raised from "
":class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` and the python implementation of "
":class:`asyncio.Future`"
msgstr ""
":gh:`124958`: 修复了从 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` 和 :class:`asyncio.Future` 的 "
"Python 实现中引发的异常中的引用循环。"

#: ../NEWS:917
msgid ""
":gh:`53203`: Fix :func:`time.strptime` for ``%c`` and ``%x`` formats in many"
" locales: Arabic, Bislama, Breton, Bodo, Kashubian, Chuvash, Estonian, "
"French, Irish, Ge'ez, Gurajati, Manx Gaelic, Hebrew, Hindi, Chhattisgarhi, "
"Haitian Kreyol, Japanese, Kannada, Korean, Marathi, Malay, Norwegian, "
"Nynorsk, Punjabi, Rajasthani, Tok Pisin, Yoruba, Yue Chinese, Yau/Nungon and"
" Chinese."
msgstr ""
":gh:`53203`: 修复 :func:`time.strptime` 在许多语言环境中对 ``%c`` 和 ``%x`` "
"格式的支持，包括阿拉伯语、比斯拉马语、布列塔尼语、博多语、卡舒比语、楚瓦什语、爱沙尼亚语、法语、爱尔兰语、吉兹语、古吉拉特语、曼克斯盖尔语、希伯来语、印地语、恰蒂斯加尔语、海地克里奥尔语、日语、卡纳达语、韩语、马拉地语、马来语、挪威语、新挪威语、旁遮普语、拉贾斯坦语、托克皮辛语、约鲁巴语、粤语、尧语/农贡语和中文。"

#: ../NEWS:924
msgid ""
":gh:`124917`: Allow calling :func:`os.path.exists` and "
":func:`os.path.lexists` with keyword arguments on Windows. Fixes a "
"regression in 3.12.4."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:928
msgid ""
":gh:`124653`: Fix detection of the minimal Queue API needed by the "
":mod:`logging` module. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ":gh:`124653`: 修复检测 :mod:`logging` 模块所需的最小队列 API。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:931
msgid ""
":gh:`124858`: Fix reference cycles left in tracebacks in "
":func:`asyncio.open_connection` when used with ``happy_eyeballs_delay``"
msgstr ""
":gh:`124858`: 修复在 :func:`asyncio.open_connection` 与 ``happy_eyeballs_delay``"
" 一起使用时留下的引用循环在 tracebacks 中的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:934
msgid ""
":gh:`124390`: Fixed :exc:`AssertionError` when using "
":func:`!asyncio.staggered.staggered_race` with "
":attr:`asyncio.eager_task_factory`."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:938
msgid ""
":gh:`124651`: Properly quote template strings in :mod:`venv` activation "
"scripts."
msgstr ":gh:`124651`: 在 :mod:`venv` 激活脚本中正确引用模板字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:941
msgid ""
":gh:`124594`: All :mod:`asyncio` REPL prompts run in the same "
":class:`context <contextvars.Context>`. Contributed by Bartosz Sławecki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124594`: 所有 :mod:`asyncio` REPL提示符都在同一个 :class:`context "
"<contextvars.Context>` 中运行。由Bartosz Sławecki贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:944
msgid ""
":gh:`120378`: Fix a crash related to an integer overflow in "
":func:`curses.resizeterm` and :func:`curses.resize_term`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120378`: 修复了与 :func:`curses.resizeterm` 和 :func:`curses.resize_term` "
"中整数溢出相关的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:947
msgid ""
":gh:`123884`: Fixed bug in itertools.tee() handling of other tee inputs (a "
"tee in a tee). The output now has the promised *n* independent new "
"iterators.  Formerly, the first iterator was identical (not independent) to "
"the input iterator. This would sometimes give surprising results."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123884`: 修复了 itertools.tee() 处理其他 tee 输入（tee 中的 tee）时的 bug。现在输出具有承诺的 "
"*n* 个独立新迭代器。以前，第一个迭代器与输入迭代器相同（不独立）。这有时会给出令人惊讶的结果。"

#: ../NEWS:952
msgid ""
":gh:`123978`: Remove broken :func:`time.thread_time` and "
":func:`time.thread_time_ns` on NetBSD."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123978`: 在 NetBSD 上移除损坏的 :func:`time.thread_time` 和 "
":func:`time.thread_time_ns`。"

#: ../NEWS:955
msgid ""
":gh:`124008`: Fix possible crash (in debug build), incorrect output or "
"returning incorrect value from raw binary ``write()`` when writing to "
"console on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124008`: 修复了在 Windows 上写入控制台时，原始二进制 ``write()`` "
"可能崩溃（在调试构建中）、输出不正确或返回不正确值的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:959
msgid ""
":gh:`123370`: Fix the canvas not clearing after running turtledemo clock."
msgstr ":gh:`123370`: 修复运行 turtledemo 时钟后画布不清除的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:961
msgid ""
":gh:`120754`: Update unbounded ``read`` calls in :mod:`zipfile` to specify "
"an explicit ``size`` putting a limit on how much data they may read. This "
"also updates handling around ZIP max comment size to match the standard "
"instead of reading comments that are one byte too long."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120754`: 更新 :mod:`zipfile` 中的无界 ``read`` 调用，以指定显式的 "
"``size``，限制它们可以读取的数据量。这也更新了 ZIP 最大注释大小的处理，以匹配标准，而不是读取多出一个字节的注释。"

#: ../NEWS:966
msgid ""
":gh:`70764`: Fixed an issue where :func:`inspect.getclosurevars` would "
"incorrectly classify an attribute name as a global variable when the name "
"exists both as an attribute name and a global variable."
msgstr ""
":gh:`70764`: 修复了 :func:`inspect.getclosurevars` "
"在属性名同时作为属性名和全局变量存在时，错误地将属性名分类为全局变量的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:970
msgid ""
":gh:`119826`: Always return an absolute path for :func:`os.path.abspath` on "
"Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`119826`: 在 Windows 上，:func:`os.path.abspath` 现在总是返回绝对路径。"

#: ../NEWS:973
msgid ""
":gh:`117766`: Always use :func:`str` to print ``choices`` in "
":mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":gh:`117766`: 总是使用 :func:`str` 在 :mod:`argparse` 中打印 ``choices``。"

#: ../NEWS:975
msgid ""
":gh:`101955`: Fix SystemError when match regular expression pattern "
"containing some combination of possessive quantifier, alternative and "
"capture group."
msgstr ":gh:`101955`: 修复当匹配包含某些占有量词、选择项和捕获组组合的正则表达式模式时出现的 SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:979
msgid ""
":gh:`88110`: Fixed :class:`multiprocessing.Process` reporting a "
"``.exitcode`` of 1 even on success when using the ``\"fork\"`` start method "
"while using a :class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88110`: 修复了在使用 ``\"fork\"`` 启动方法时，即使成功，:class:`multiprocessing.Process`"
" 也报告 ``.exitcode`` 为 1 的问题，同时使用了 "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor`。"

#: ../NEWS:983
msgid ""
":gh:`71936`: Fix a race condition in :class:`multiprocessing.pool.Pool`."
msgstr ":gh:`71936`: 修复 :class:`multiprocessing.pool.Pool` 中的一个竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:985
msgid ""
":issue:`46128`: Strip :class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` stack frames"
" from reported stacktraces."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46128`: 从报告的堆栈跟踪中剥离 :class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 堆栈帧。"

#: ../NEWS:988
msgid ""
":issue:`14074`: Fix :mod:`argparse` metavar processing to allow positional "
"arguments to have a tuple metavar."
msgstr ":issue:`14074`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 的 metavar 处理，允许位置参数有一个元组 metavar。"

#: ../NEWS:994
msgid ""
":gh:`122392`: Increase currently inadequate vertical spacing for the IDLE "
"browsers (path, module, and stack) on high-resolution monitors."
msgstr ":gh:`122392`: 在高分辨率显示器上增加了 IDLE 浏览器（路径、模块和堆栈）当前不足的垂直间距。"

#: ../NEWS:1000
msgid ""
":gh:`125277`: Require Sphinx 7.2.6 or later to build the Python "
"documentation. Patch by Adam Turner."
msgstr ":gh:`125277`: 构建 Python 文档需要 Sphinx 7.2.6 或更高版本。由 Adam Turner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1003
msgid ""
":gh:`125018`: The :mod:`importlib.metadata` documentation now includes "
"semantic cross-reference targets for the significant documented APIs. This "
"means intersphinx references like :func:`importlib.metadata.version` will "
"now work as expected."
msgstr ""
":gh:`125018`: :mod:`importlib.metadata` 文档现在包括重要文档API的语义交叉引用目标。这意味着像 "
":func:`importlib.metadata.version` 这样的intersphinx引用现在将按预期工作。"

#: ../NEWS:1008
msgid ""
":gh:`121277`: Writers of CPython's documentation can now use ``next`` as the"
" version for the ``versionchanged``, ``versionadded``, ``deprecated`` "
"directives."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121277`: CPython文档的作者现在可以使用 ``next`` 作为 "
"``versionchanged``、``versionadded``、``deprecated``指令的版本。"

#: ../NEWS:1012
msgid ""
":gh:`60712`: Include the :class:`object` type in the lists of documented "
"types. Change by Furkan Onder and Martin Panter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`60712`: 在记录的类型列表中包括 :class:`object` 类型。由 Furkan Onder 和 Martin Panter "
"更改。"

#: ../NEWS:1018
msgid ""
":gh:`113841`: Fix possible undefined behavior division by zero in "
":class:`complex`'s :c:func:`_Py_c_pow`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113841`: 修复 :class:`complex` 的 :c:func:`_Py_c_pow` 中可能未定义行为的除以零错误。"

#: ../NEWS:1021
msgid ""
":gh:`126341`: Now :exc:`ValueError` is raised instead of :exc:`SystemError` "
"when trying to iterate over a released :class:`memoryview` object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126341`: 现在当尝试迭代已释放的 :class:`memoryview` 对象时，会引发 :exc:`ValueError` 而不是 "
":exc:`SystemError`。"

#: ../NEWS:1024
msgid ""
":gh:`126066`: Fix :mod:`importlib` to not write an incomplete .pyc files "
"when a ulimit or some other operating system mechanism is preventing the "
"write to go through fully."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126066`: 修复 :mod:`importlib` 不会在 ulimit 或其他操作系统机制阻止写入完全通过时写入不完整的 .pyc "
"文件。"

#: ../NEWS:1028
msgid ""
":gh:`126139`: Provide better error location when attempting to use a "
":term:`future statement <__future__>` with an unknown future feature."
msgstr ""
":gh:`126139`: 当尝试使用带有未知未来特性的 :term:`future 语句 <__future__>` 时，提供更好的错误位置。"

#: ../NEWS:1031
msgid ""
":gh:`125008`: Fix :func:`tokenize.untokenize` producing invalid syntax for "
"double braces preceded by certain escape characters."
msgstr ":gh:`125008`: 修复 :func:`tokenize.untokenize` 在特定转义字符前的双大括号产生无效语法的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1034
msgid ""
":gh:`123378`: Fix a crash in the :meth:`~object.__str__` method of "
":exc:`UnicodeError` objects when the :attr:`UnicodeError.start` and "
":attr:`UnicodeError.end` values are invalid or out-of-range. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123378`: 修复了当 :attr:`UnicodeError.start` 和 :attr:`UnicodeError.end` "
"值无效或超出范围时，:exc:`UnicodeError` 对象的 :meth:`~object.__str__` "
"方法崩溃的问题。补丁由Bénédikt Tran提供。"

#: ../NEWS:1039
msgid ""
":gh:`116510`: Fix a crash caused by immortal interned strings being shared "
"between sub-interpreters that use basic single-phase init.  In that case, "
"the string can be used by an interpreter that outlives the interpreter that "
"created and interned it.  For interpreters that share obmalloc state, also "
"share the interned dict with the main interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116510`: "
"修复了由于不朽的内部字符串在使用基本单阶段初始化的子解释器之间共享而导致的崩溃。在这种情况下，字符串可以被创建和内部化它的解释器之外的另一个解释器使用。对于共享obmalloc状态的解释器，也与主解释器共享内部字典。"

#: ../NEWS:1045
msgid ""
":gh:`118950`: Fix bug where SSLProtocol.connection_lost wasn't getting "
"called when OSError was thrown on writing to socket."
msgstr ""
":gh:`118950`: 修复 SSLProtocol.connection_lost 在向套接字写入时抛出 OSError 时未被调用的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:1048
msgid ""
":gh:`113570`: Fixed a bug in ``reprlib.repr`` where it incorrectly called "
"the repr method on shadowed Python built-in types."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113570`: 修复 ``reprlib.repr`` 中的一个错误，其中它错误地调用了被遮蔽的 Python 内置类型的 repr 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:1051
msgid ""
":gh:`109746`: If :func:`!_thread.start_new_thread` fails to start a new "
"thread, it deletes its state from interpreter and thus avoids its repeated "
"cleanup on finalization."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109746`: 如果 :func:`!_thread.start_new_thread` "
"未能启动新线程，它会从解释器中删除其状态，从而避免在最终化时重复清理。"

#: ../NEWS:1058
msgid ""
":gh:`113601`: Removed debug build assertions related to interning strings, "
"which were falsely triggered by stable ABI extensions."
msgstr ":gh:`113601`: 移除了与字符串驻留相关的调试构建断言，这些断言被稳定 ABI 扩展错误地触发。"

#: ../NEWS:1064
msgid ":gh:`89640`: Hard-code float word ordering as little endian on WASM."
msgstr ":gh:`89640`: 在 WASM 上将浮点数字序硬编码为小端序。"

#: ../NEWS:1066
msgid ""
":gh:`89640`: Improve detection of float word ordering on Linux when link-"
"time optimizations are enabled."
msgstr ":gh:`89640`: 当启用链接时优化时，改进 Linux 上浮点数字序的检测。"

#: ../NEWS:1071
msgid "Python 3.12.7 final"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1073
msgid "*Release date: 2024-10-01*"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1078
msgid ""
":gh:`123915`: Ensure that ``Tools\\msi\\buildrelease.bat`` uses different "
"directories for AMD64 and ARM64 builds."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123915`: 确保 ``Tools\\msi\\buildrelease.bat`` 对 AMD64 和 ARM64 构建使用不同的目录。"

#: ../NEWS:1081
msgid ""
":gh:`117505`: Fixes an issue with the Windows installer not running "
"ensurepip in a fully isolated environment. This could cause unexpected "
"interactions with the user site-packages."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117505`: 修复 Windows 安装程序未在完全隔离的环境中运行 ensurepip 的问题。这可能导致与用户 site-"
"packages 的意外交互。"

#: ../NEWS:1088
msgid ":gh:`124378`: Updated ``test_ttk`` to pass with Tcl/Tk 8.6.15."
msgstr ":gh:`124378`: 更新 ``test_ttk`` 以通过Tcl/Tk 8.6.15的测试。"

#: ../NEWS:1093
msgid ""
":gh:`122792`: Changed IPv4-mapped ``ipaddress.IPv6Address`` to consistently "
"use the mapped IPv4 address value for deciding properties. Properties which "
"have their behavior fixed are ``is_multicast``, ``is_reserved``, "
"``is_link_local``, ``is_global``, and ``is_unspecified``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122792`: 修改了IPv4映射的 "
"``ipaddress.IPv6Address``，使其一致使用映射的IPv4地址值来决定属性。行为被修复的属性包括 "
"``is_multicast``、``is_reserved``、``is_link_local``、``is_global`` 和 "
"``is_unspecified``。"

#: ../NEWS:1101
msgid ""
":gh:`116850`: Fix :mod:`argparse` for namespaces with not directly writable "
"dict (e.g. classes)."
msgstr ":gh:`116850`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 对于具有不可直接写入字典的命名空间（例如类）的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1104
msgid ""
":gh:`58573`: Fix conflicts between abbreviated long options in the parent "
"parser and subparsers in :mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":gh:`58573`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 中父解析器和子解析器之间缩写长选项的冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:1107
msgid ""
":gh:`61181`: Fix support of :ref:`choices` with string value in "
":mod:`argparse`. Substrings of the specified string no longer considered "
"valid values."
msgstr ""
":gh:`61181`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 中对带有字符串值的 :ref:`choices` "
"的支持。不再认为指定字符串的子字符串为有效值。"

#: ../NEWS:1111
msgid ""
":gh:`80259`: Fix :mod:`argparse` support of positional arguments with "
"``nargs='?'``, ``default=argparse.SUPPRESS`` and specified ``type``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`80259`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 对带有 "
"``nargs='?'``、``default=argparse.SUPPRESS`` 和指定 ``type`` 的位置参数的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:1114
msgid ""
":gh:`124498`: Fix :class:`typing.TypeAliasType` not to be generic, when "
"``type_params`` is an empty tuple."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124498`: 修复 :class:`typing.TypeAliasType` 当 ``type_params`` "
"为空元组时不泛型的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1117
msgid ""
":gh:`124345`: :mod:`argparse` vim supports abbreviated single-dash long "
"options separated by ``=`` from its value."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1120
msgid ""
":gh:`104860`: Fix disallowing abbreviation of single-dash long options in "
":mod:`argparse` with ``allow_abbrev=False``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104860`: 修复在 :mod:`argparse` 中不允许单破折号长选项缩写的问题，当``allow_abbrev=False``时。"

#: ../NEWS:1123
msgid ""
":gh:`63143`: Fix parsing mutually exclusive arguments in :mod:`argparse`. "
"Arguments with the value identical to the default value (e.g. booleans, "
"small integers, empty or 1-character strings) are no longer considered \"not"
" present\"."
msgstr ""
":gh:`63143`: 修复在 :mod:`argparse` "
"中解析互斥参数的问题。与默认值相同值的参数（例如布尔值、小整数、空或1字符字符串）不再被视为“不存在”。"

#: ../NEWS:1128
msgid ""
":gh:`72795`: Positional arguments with :ref:`nargs` equal to ``'*'`` or "
":data:`!argparse.REMAINDER` are no longer required. This allows to use "
"positional argument with ``nargs='*'`` and without ``default`` in mutually "
"exclusive group and improves error message about required arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`72795`: 具有 :ref:`nargs` 等于 ``'*'`` 或 :data:`!argparse.REMAINDER` "
"的位置参数不再必需。这允许在互斥组中使用 ``nargs='*'`` 且没有 ``default`` 的位置参数，并改进了关于必需参数的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:1133
msgid ""
":gh:`59317`: Fix parsing positional argument with :ref:`nargs` equal to "
"``'?'`` or ``'*'`` if it is preceded by an option and another positional "
"argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`59317`: 修复如果前面有一个选项和另一个位置参数时，解析 :ref:`nargs` 等于 ``'?'`` "
"或``'*'``的位置参数的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1137
msgid ""
":gh:`53780`: :mod:`argparse` now ignores the first ``\"--\"`` (double dash) "
"between an option and command."
msgstr ":gh:`53780`: :mod:`argparse` 现在忽略选项和命令之间的第一个 ``\"--\"`` (双破折号) 。"

#: ../NEWS:1140
msgid ""
":gh:`124217`: Add RFC 9637 reserved IPv6 block ``3fff::/20`` in "
":mod:`ipaddress` module."
msgstr ":gh:`124217`: 在 :mod:`ipaddress` 模块中添加RFC 9637保留的IPv6块 ``3fff::/20``。"

#: ../NEWS:1143
msgid ""
":gh:`124248`: Fixed potential crash when using :mod:`struct` to process "
"zero-width 'Pascal string' fields (``0p``)."
msgstr ":gh:`124248`: 修复了使用 :mod:`struct` 处理零宽度'Pascal字符串'字段（``0p``）时可能导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:1146
msgid ""
":gh:`81691`: Fix handling of multiple ``\"--\"`` (double dashes) in "
":mod:`argparse`. Only the first one has now been removed, all subsequent "
"ones are now taken literally."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81691`: 修复在 :mod:`argparse` 中处理多个 ``\"--\"`` (双破折号) "
"的问题。现在只移除第一个，所有后续的都按字面意思处理。"

#: ../NEWS:1150
msgid ""
":gh:`87041`: Fix a bug in :mod:`argparse` where lengthy subparser argument "
"help is incorrectly indented."
msgstr ":gh:`87041`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中的一个错误，该错误导致冗长的子解析器参数帮助信息缩进不正确。"

#: ../NEWS:1153
msgid ""
":gh:`124171`: Add workaround for broken :c:func:`!fmod()` implementations on"
" Windows, that loose zero sign (e.g. ``fmod(-10, 1)`` returns ``0.0``). "
"Patch by Sergey B Kirpichev."
msgstr ""
":gh:`124171`: 为 Windows 上损坏的 :c:func:`!fmod()` "
"实现添加了变通方案，该实现会丢失零的符号（例如，``fmod(-10, 1)`` 返回 ``0.0``）。由 Sergey B Kirpichev "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1157
msgid ""
":gh:`123934`: Fix :class:`unittest.mock.MagicMock` reseting magic methods "
"return values after ``.reset_mock(return_value=True)`` was called."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1160
msgid ""
":gh:`123935`: Fix parent slots detection for dataclasses that inherit from "
"classes with ``__dictoffset__``."
msgstr ":gh:`123935`: 修复数据类继承自具有 ``__dictoffset__`` 的类时的父槽检测问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1163
msgid ""
":gh:`123892`: Add ``\"_wmi\"`` to :data:`sys.stdlib_module_names`. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123892`: 将 ``\"_wmi\"`` 添加到 :data:`sys.stdlib_module_names`。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1166
msgid ""
":gh:`116810`: Resolve a memory leak introduced in CPython 3.10's :mod:`ssl` "
"when the :attr:`ssl.SSLSocket.session` property was accessed.  Speeds up "
"read and write access to said property by no longer unnecessarily cloning "
"session objects via serialization."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116810`: 解决了 CPython 3.10 的 :mod:`ssl` 中访问 "
":attr:`ssl.SSLSocket.session` 属性时引入的内存泄漏。不再通过序列化不必要地克隆会话对象，从而加快了对所述属性的读写访问。"

#: ../NEWS:1171
msgid ""
":gh:`121735`: When working with zip archives, importlib.resources now "
"properly honors module-adjacent references (e.g. ``files(pkg.mod)`` and not "
"just ``files(pkg)``)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121735`: 在处理 zip 存档时，importlib.resources 现在能正确遵守模块相邻引用（例如 "
"``files(pkg.mod)`` 而不仅仅是 ``files(pkg)``）。"

#: ../NEWS:1175
msgid ""
":gh:`119004`: Fix a crash in :ref:`OrderedDict.__eq__ "
"<collections_OrderedDict__eq__>` when operands are mutated during the check."
" Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119004`: 修复 :ref:`OrderedDict.__eq__ <collections_OrderedDict__eq__>` "
"在检查操作数被修改时的崩溃。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1179
msgid ""
":issue:`44864`: Do not translate user-provided strings in "
":class:`argparse.ArgumentParser`."
msgstr ":issue:`44864`: 不在 :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` 中翻译用户提供的字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:1185
msgid ""
":gh:`112938`: Fix uninteruptable hang when Shell gets rapid continuous "
"output."
msgstr ":gh:`112938`: 修复了 Shell 在快速连续输出时不可中断的挂起问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1191
msgid ""
":gh:`116510`: Fix a bug that can cause a crash when sub-interpreters use "
"\"basic\" single-phase extension modules.  Shared objects could refer to "
"PyGC_Head nodes that had been freed as part of interpreter cleanup."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116510`: "
"修复了一个当子解释器使用“基本”单阶段扩展模块时可能导致崩溃的bug。共享对象可能引用已被作为解释器清理一部分释放的PyGC_Head节点。"

#: ../NEWS:1195
msgid ""
":gh:`124188`: Fix reading and decoding a line from the source file witn non-"
"UTF-8 encoding for syntax errors raised in the compiler."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1198
msgid ""
":gh:`77894`: Fix possible crash in the garbage collector when it tries to "
"break a reference loop containing a :class:`memoryview` object. Now a "
":class:`!memoryview` object can only be cleared if there are no buffers that"
" refer it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`77894`: 修复了垃圾回收器在尝试断开包含 :class:`memoryview` "
"对象的引用循环时可能发生的崩溃。现在，只有在没有缓冲区引用 :class:`!memoryview` 对象时才能清除它。"

#: ../NEWS:1203
msgid ""
":gh:`98442`: Fix too wide source locations of the cleanup instructions of a "
"with statement."
msgstr ":gh:`98442`: 修复了 with 语句的清理指令的源代码位置过宽的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1206
msgid ""
":gh:`113993`: Strings interned with :func:`sys.intern` are again garbage-"
"collected when no longer used, as per the documentation. Strings interned "
"with the C function :c:func:`PyUnicode_InternInPlace` are still immortal. "
"Internals of the string interning mechanism have been changed. This may "
"affect performance and identities of :class:`str` objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113993`: 根据文档，使用 :func:`sys.intern` 内联的字符串在不再使用时再次被垃圾回收。使用 C 函数 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_InternInPlace` 内联的字符串仍然是不朽的。字符串内联机制的内部已经改变。这可能会影响 "
":class:`str` 对象的性能和身份。"

#: ../NEWS:1215
msgid ""
":gh:`113993`: :c:func:`PyUnicode_InternInPlace` no longer prevents its "
"argument from being garbage collected."
msgstr ":gh:`113993`: :c:func:`PyUnicode_InternInPlace` 不再阻止其参数被垃圾回收。"

#: ../NEWS:1218
msgid ""
"Several functions that take ``char *`` are now documented as possibly "
"preventing string objects from being garbage collected; refer to their "
"documentation for details: :c:func:`PyUnicode_InternFromString`, "
":c:func:`PyDict_SetItemString`, :c:func:`PyObject_SetAttrString`, "
":c:func:`PyObject_DelAttrString`, :c:func:`PyUnicode_InternFromString`, and "
"``PyModule_Add*`` convenience functions."
msgstr ""
"几个接受 ``char *`` "
"的函数现在被记录为可能阻止字符串对象被垃圾回收；详情请参阅它们的文档：:c:func:`PyUnicode_InternFromString`, "
":c:func:`PyDict_SetItemString`, :c:func:`PyObject_SetAttrString`, "
":c:func:`PyObject_DelAttrString`, :c:func:`PyUnicode_InternFromString`, 和 "
"``PyModule_Add*`` 便利函数。"

#: ../NEWS:1228
msgid ""
":gh:`124487`: Windows builds now use Windows 8.1 as their API baseline "
"(installation already required Windows 8.1)."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1231
msgid ""
":gh:`123917`: Fix the check for the ``crypt()`` function in the configure "
"script. Patch by Paul Smith and Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1236
msgid "Python 3.12.6 final"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1238
msgid "*Release date: 2024-09-06*"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1243
msgid ":gh:`123418`: Updated macOS installer build to use OpenSSL 3.0.15."
msgstr ":gh:`123418`: 更新 macOS 安装程序构建以使用 OpenSSL 3.0.15。"

#: ../NEWS:1248
msgid ":gh:`123418`: Updated Windows build to use OpenSSL 3.0.15."
msgstr ":gh:`123418`: 更新 Windows 构建以使用 OpenSSL 3.0.15。"

#: ../NEWS:1250
msgid ""
":gh:`100256`: :mod:`mimetypes` no longer fails when it encounters an "
"inaccessible registry key."
msgstr ":gh:`100256`: :mod:`mimetypes` 在遇到不可访问的注册表键时不再失败。"

#: ../NEWS:1253
msgid ""
":gh:`79846`: Makes :code:`ssl.create_default_context()` ignore invalid "
"certificates in the Windows certificate store"
msgstr ""
":gh:`79846`: 使 :code:`ssl.create_default_context()` 忽略 Windows 证书存储中的无效证书"

#: ../NEWS:1259
msgid ""
":gh:`123418`: Update GitHub CI workflows to use OpenSSL 3.0.15 and "
"multissltests to use 3.0.15, 3.1.7, and 3.2.3."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123418`: 更新 GitHub CI 工作流以使用 OpenSSL 3.0.15 和 multissltests 以使用 "
"3.0.15、3.1.7 和 3.2.3。"

#: ../NEWS:1265
msgid ""
":gh:`101525`: Skip ``test_gdb`` if the binary is relocated by BOLT. Patch by"
" Donghee Na."
msgstr ":gh:`101525`: 如果二进制文件被BOLT重定位，则跳过 ``test_gdb``。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1271
msgid ":gh:`123678`: Upgrade libexpat to 2.6.3"
msgstr ":gh:`123678`: 将libexpat升级到2.6.3版本"

#: ../NEWS:1273
msgid ""
":gh:`121285`: Remove backtracking from tarfile header parsing for "
"``hdrcharset``, PAX, and GNU sparse headers."
msgstr ":gh:`121285`: 在 tarfile 头解析中移除对 ``hdrcharset``、PAX 和 GNU 稀疏头的回溯。"

#: ../NEWS:1279
msgid ""
":gh:`123270`: Applied a more surgical fix for malformed payloads in "
":class:`zipfile.Path` causing infinite loops (:gh:`122905`) without breaking"
" contents using legitimate characters."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123270`: 对 :class:`zipfile.Path` "
"中导致无限循环的畸形负载应用了更为精确的修复（:gh:`122905`），而不会破坏使用合法字符的内容。"

#: ../NEWS:1283
msgid ""
":gh:`123213`: :meth:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element.extend` and "
":class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` assignment no longer hide the "
"internal exception if an erronous generator is passed. Patch by Bar Harel."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1287
msgid ""
":gh:`85110`: Preserve relative path in URL without netloc in "
":func:`urllib.parse.urlunsplit` and :func:`urllib.parse.urlunparse`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85110`: 在 :func:`urllib.parse.urlunsplit` 和 "
":func:`urllib.parse.urlunparse` 中保留没有 netloc 的 URL 的相对路径。"

#: ../NEWS:1290
msgid ""
":gh:`123067`: Fix quadratic complexity in parsing ``\"``-quoted cookie "
"values with backslashes by :mod:`http.cookies`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123067`: 通过 :mod:`http.cookies` 修复解析带有反斜杠的 ``\"`` 引号包围的 cookie "
"值时的二次复杂度问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1293
msgid ""
":gh:`122903`: ``zipfile.Path.glob`` now correctly matches directories "
"instead of silently omitting them."
msgstr ":gh:`122903`: ``zipfile.Path.glob`` 现在能正确匹配目录，而不是默默地忽略它们。"

#: ../NEWS:1296
msgid ""
":gh:`122905`: :class:`zipfile.Path` objects now sanitize names from the "
"zipfile."
msgstr ":gh:`122905`: :class:`zipfile.Path` 对象现在会对来自 zipfile 的名称进行清理。"

#: ../NEWS:1299
msgid ""
":gh:`122695`: Fixed double-free when using :func:`gc.get_referents` with a "
"freed :class:`asyncio.Future` iterator."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1302
msgid ""
":gh:`116263`: :class:`logging.handlers.RotatingFileHandler` no longer rolls "
"over empty log files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116263`: :class:`logging.handlers.RotatingFileHandler` 不再滚动空日志文件。"

#: ../NEWS:1305
msgid ""
":gh:`118814`: Fix the :class:`typing.TypeVar` constructor when name is "
"passed by keyword."
msgstr ":gh:`118814`: 修复 :class:`typing.TypeVar` 构造函数在名称通过关键字传递时的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1308
msgid ""
":gh:`122478`: Remove internal frames from tracebacks shown in "
":class:`code.InteractiveInterpreter` with non-default "
":func:`sys.excepthook`. Save correct tracebacks in "
":attr:`sys.last_traceback` and update ``__traceback__`` attribute of "
":attr:`sys.last_value` and :attr:`sys.last_exc`."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1314
msgid ""
":gh:`113785`: :mod:`csv` now correctly parses numeric fields (when used with"
" :const:`csv.QUOTE_NONNUMERIC`) which start with an escape character."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1317
msgid ""
":gh:`112182`: :meth:`!asyncio.futures.Future.set_exception` now transforms "
":exc:`StopIteration` into :exc:`RuntimeError` instead of hanging or other "
"misbehavior. Patch contributed by Jamie Phan."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1321
msgid ""
":gh:`108172`: ``webbrowser`` honors OS preferred browser on Linux when its "
"desktop entry name contains the text of a known browser name."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108172`: ``webbrowser`` 在 Linux 上尊重操作系统首选的浏览器，当其桌面条目名称包含已知浏览器名称的文本时。"

#: ../NEWS:1324
msgid ""
":gh:`102988`: :func:`email.utils.getaddresses` and "
":func:`email.utils.parseaddr` now return ``('', '')`` 2-tuples in more "
"situations where invalid email addresses are encountered instead of "
"potentially inaccurate values. Add optional *strict* parameter to these two "
"functions: use ``strict=False`` to get the old behavior, accept malformed "
"inputs. ``getattr(email.utils, 'supports_strict_parsing', False)`` can be "
"use to check if the *strict* paramater is available. Patch by Thomas Dwyer "
"and Victor Stinner to improve the CVE-2023-27043 fix."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1333
msgid ""
":gh:`99437`: :func:`runpy.run_path` now decodes path-like objects, making "
"sure __file__ and sys.argv[0] of the module being run are always strings."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99437`: :func:`runpy.run_path` 现在解码路径类对象，确保被运行模块的 __file__ 和 "
"sys.argv[0] 始终是字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:1339
msgid ""
":gh:`120083`: Add explicit black IDLE Hovertip foreground color needed for "
"recent macOS. Fixes Sonoma showing unreadable white on pale yellow.  Patch "
"by John Riggles."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120083`: 为最近的 macOS 添加了明确的黑色 IDLE Hovertip 前景色。修复了 Sonoma "
"显示不可读的白色在淡黄色上的问题。由 John Riggles 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1346
msgid ""
":gh:`123321`: Prevent Parser/myreadline race condition from segfaulting on "
"multi-threaded use. Patch by Bar Harel and Amit Wienner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`123321`: 防止在多线程使用时Parser/myreadline竞争条件导致段错误。由Bar Harel和Amit "
"Wienner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1349
msgid ""
":gh:`122982`: Extend the deprecation period for bool inversion (``~``) by "
"two years."
msgstr ":gh:`122982`: 将布尔反演(``~``)的弃用期延长两年。"

#: ../NEWS:1352
msgid ""
":gh:`123229`: Fix valgrind warning by initializing the f-string buffers to 0"
" in the tokenizer. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`123229`: 通过在分词器中初始化f-string缓冲区为0来修复valgrind警告。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1355
msgid ""
":gh:`123142`: Fix too-wide source location in exception tracebacks coming "
"from broken iterables in comprehensions."
msgstr ":gh:`123142`: 修复来自理解中损坏的可迭代对象的异常跟踪中过宽的源位置。"

#: ../NEWS:1358
msgid ""
":gh:`123048`: Fix a bug where pattern matching code could emit a "
":opcode:`JUMP_FORWARD` with no source location."
msgstr ":gh:`123048`: 修复一个bug，其中模式匹配代码可能发出没有源位置的 :opcode:`JUMP_FORWARD`。"

#: ../NEWS:1361
msgid ""
":gh:`123083`: Fix a potential use-after-free in ``STORE_ATTR_WITH_HINT``."
msgstr ":gh:`123083`: 修复 ``STORE_ATTR_WITH_HINT`` 中潜在的释放后使用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1363
msgid ""
":gh:`122527`: Fix a crash that occurred when a ``PyStructSequence`` was "
"deallocated after its type's dictionary was cleared by the GC.  The type's "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_basicsize` now accounts for non-sequence fields "
"that aren't included in the :c:macro:`Py_SIZE` of the sequence."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122527`: 修复当 ``PyStructSequence`` 在其类型的字典被 GC 清除后被释放时发生的崩溃。该类型的 "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_basicsize` 现在计算了不包括在序列的 :c:macro:`Py_SIZE` "
"中的非序列字段。"

#: ../NEWS:1368
msgid ""
":gh:`93691`: Fix source locations of instructions generated for with "
"statements."
msgstr ":gh:`93691`: 修复为with语句生成的指令的源代码位置。"

#: ../NEWS:1374
msgid ""
":gh:`123297`: Propagate the value of ``LDFLAGS`` to ``LDCXXSHARED`` in "
":mod:`sysconfig`. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`123297`: 在 :mod:`sysconfig` 中将 ``LDFLAGS`` 的值传播到 ``LDCXXSHARED``。由 "
"Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1379
msgid "Python 3.12.5 final"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1381
msgid "*Release date: 2024-08-06*"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1386
msgid ":gh:`122573`: The Windows build of CPython now requires 3.10 or newer."
msgstr ":gh:`122573`: CPython 的 Windows 构建现在需要 3.10 或更新版本。"

#: ../NEWS:1391
msgid ""
":gh:`59022`: Add tests for :func:`pkgutil.extend_path`. Patch by Andreas "
"Stocker."
msgstr ":gh:`59022`: 为 :func:`pkgutil.extend_path` 添加测试。由Andreas Stocker提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1394
msgid ""
":gh:`99242`: :func:`os.getloadavg` may throw :exc:`OSError` when running "
"regression tests under certain conditions (e.g. chroot). This error is now "
"caught and ignored, since reporting load average is optional."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99242`: 在某些条件下（如chroot）运行回归测试时，:func:`os.getloadavg` 可能会抛出 "
":exc:`OSError`。现在捕获并忽略此错误，因为报告负载平均值是可选的。"

#: ../NEWS:1398
msgid ""
":gh:`121084`: Fix test_typing random leaks. Clear typing ABC caches when "
"running tests for refleaks (``-R`` option): call ``_abc_caches_clear()`` on "
"typing abstract classes and their subclasses. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121084`: 修复test_typing随机泄漏。在运行反射泄漏测试（``-R``选项）时清除键入ABC缓存：在键入抽象类及其子类上调用 "
"``_abc_caches_clear()``。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1402
msgid ""
":gh:`121160`: Add a test for :func:`readline.set_history_length`. Note that "
"this test may fail on readline libraries."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121160`: 为 :func:`readline.set_history_length` "
"添加测试。请注意，此测试可能在readline库上失败。"

#: ../NEWS:1405
msgid ""
":gh:`121200`: Fix ``test_expanduser_pwd2()`` of ``test_posixpath``.  Call "
"``getpwnam()`` to get ``pw_dir``, since it can be different than "
"``getpwall()`` ``pw_dir``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121200`: 修复 ``test_posixpath`` 的 ``test_expanduser_pwd2()``。调用 "
"``getpwnam()`` 获取``pw_dir``，因为它可能与 ``getpwall()`` 的 ``pw_dir`` 不同。由Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1409
msgid ""
":gh:`121188`: When creating the JUnit XML file, regrtest now escapes "
"characters which are invalid in XML, such as the chr(27) control character "
"used in ANSI escape sequences. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121188`: 当创建JUnit "
"XML文件时，regrtest现在转义XML中无效的字符，如用于ANSI转义序列的chr(27)控制字符。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1416
msgid ""
":gh:`121957`: Fixed missing audit events around interactive use of Python, "
"now also properly firing for ``python -i``, as well as for ``python -m "
"asyncio``. The event in question is ``cpython.run_stdin``."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1420
msgid ""
":gh:`122133`: Authenticate the socket connection for the "
"``socket.socketpair()`` fallback on platforms where ``AF_UNIX`` is not "
"available like Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122133`: 在 ``AF_UNIX`` 不可用的平台（如Windows）上，为 ``socket.socketpair()`` "
"后备方案验证套接字连接。"

#: ../NEWS:1424
msgid ""
"Patch by Gregory P. Smith <greg@krypto.org> and Seth Larson "
"<seth@python.org>. Reported by Ellie <el@horse64.org>"
msgstr ""
"由Gregory P. Smith <greg@krypto.org> 和 Seth Larson "
"<seth@python.org>提供补丁。由Ellie <el@horse64.org>报告。"

#: ../NEWS:1430
msgid ""
":gh:`122744`: Bump the version of pip bundled in ensurepip to version 24.2."
msgstr ":gh:`122744`: 将 ensurepip 中捆绑的 pip 版本提升至 24.2。"

#: ../NEWS:1432
msgid ""
":gh:`122334`: Fix crash when importing :mod:`ssl` after the main interpreter"
" restarts."
msgstr ":gh:`122334`: 修复在主解释器重启后导入 :mod:`ssl` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1435
msgid ""
":gh:`87320`: In :class:`code.InteractiveInterpreter`, handle exceptions "
"caused by calling a non-default :func:`sys.excepthook`. Before, the "
"exception bubbled up to the caller, ending the REPL."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1439
msgid ""
":gh:`122400`: Handle :exc:`ValueError`\\s raised by :func:`os.stat` in "
":class:`filecmp.dircmp` and :func:`filecmp.cmpfiles`. Patch by Bénédikt "
"Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122400`: 在 :class:`filecmp.dircmp` 和 :func:`filecmp.cmpfiles` 中处理由 "
":func:`os.stat` 引发的 :exc:`ValueError`\\。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1443
msgid ":gh:`122311`: Fix some error messages in :mod:`pickle`."
msgstr ":gh:`122311`: 修复 :mod:`pickle` 中的一些错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:1445
msgid ""
":gh:`121650`: :mod:`email` headers with embedded newlines are now quoted on "
"output. The :mod:`~email.generator` will now refuse to serialize (write) "
"headers that are unsafely folded or delimited; see "
":attr:`~email.policy.Policy.verify_generated_headers`. (Contributed by Bas "
"Bloemsaat and Petr Viktorin in :gh:`121650`.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`121650`: 现在，带有嵌入换行符的 :mod:`email` 标题在输出时会被引用。:mod:`~email.generator` "
"现在会拒绝序列化（写入）不安全折叠或分隔的标题；参见 "
":attr:`~email.policy.Policy.verify_generated_headers`。（由Bas Bloemsaat和Petr "
"Viktorin在 :gh:`121650` 中贡献。）"

#: ../NEWS:1451
msgid ""
":gh:`122332`: Fixed segfault with :meth:`asyncio.Task.get_coro` when using "
"an eager task factory."
msgstr ":gh:`122332`: 修复了在使用急切任务工厂时 :meth:`asyncio.Task.get_coro` 的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:1454
msgid ""
":gh:`122170`: Handle :exc:`ValueError`\\s raised by :func:`os.stat` in "
":mod:`linecache`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122170`: 在 :mod:`linecache` 中处理由 :func:`os.stat` 抛出的 "
":exc:`ValueError`。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1457
msgid ""
":gh:`121723`: Make :func:`logging.config.dictConfig` accept any object "
"implementing the Queue public API. See the :ref:`queue configuration "
"<configure-queue>` section for details. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121723`: 使 :func:`logging.config.dictConfig` 接受任何实现Queue公共API的对象。详情参见 "
":ref:`queue configuration <configure-queue>` 部分。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1461
msgid ""
":gh:`82951`: Serializing objects with complex ``__qualname__`` (such as "
"unbound methods and nested classes) by name no longer involves serializing "
"parent objects by value in pickle protocols < 4."
msgstr ""
":gh:`82951`: 在pickle协议<4中，通过名称序列化具有复杂 ``__qualname__`` "
"的对象（如未绑定方法和嵌套类）不再涉及通过值序列化父对象。"

#: ../NEWS:1465
msgid ""
":gh:`120930`: Fixed a bug introduced by :gh:`92081` that added an incorrect "
"extra blank to encoded words occurring in wrapped headers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120930`: 修复了由 :gh:`92081` 引入的一个错误，该错误在包裹的标头中出现的编码单词上添加了一个不正确额外的空白。"

#: ../NEWS:1468
msgid ""
":gh:`121474`: Fix missing sanity check for ``parties`` arg in "
":class:`threading.Barrier` constructor. Patch by Clinton Christian (pygeek)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121474`: 修复 :class:`threading.Barrier` 构造函数中 ``parties`` 参数缺少的健全性检查。由 "
"Clinton Christian (pygeek) 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1472
msgid ""
":gh:`121025`: Improve the :meth:`~object.__repr__` of "
":class:`functools.partialmethod`. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121025`: 改进 :class:`functools.partialmethod` 的 "
":meth:`~object.__repr__`。由 Bénédikt Tran 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1475
msgid ""
":gh:`121018`: Fixed issues where :meth:`!argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_args`"
" did not honor ``exit_on_error=False``. Based on patch by Ben Hsing."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121018`: 修复 :meth:`!argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_args` 未遵守 "
"``exit_on_error=False`` 的问题。基于 Ben Hsing 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1478
msgid ""
":gh:`119614`: Fix truncation of strings with embedded null characters in "
"some internal operations in :mod:`tkinter`."
msgstr ":gh:`119614`: 修复 :mod:`tkinter` 中某些内部操作对嵌入空字符的字符串的截断问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1481
msgid ""
":gh:`120910`: When reading installed files from an egg, use "
"``relative_to(walk_up=True)`` to honor files installed outside of the "
"installation root."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120910`: 从 egg 读取安装文件时，使用 ``relative_to(walk_up=True)`` "
"以尊重安装根目录之外安装的文件。"

#: ../NEWS:1485
msgid ""
":gh:`101830`: Accessing the :mod:`tkinter` object's string representation no"
" longer converts the underlying Tcl object to a string on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101830`: 在 Windows 上访问 :mod:`tkinter` 对象的字符串表示不再将底层的 Tcl 对象转换为字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:1488
msgid ""
":gh:`120811`: Fix possible memory leak in :meth:`contextvars.Context.run`."
msgstr ":gh:`120811`: 修复 :meth:`contextvars.Context.run` 中可能的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:1490
msgid ""
":gh:`120769`: Make empty line in :mod:`pdb` repeats the last command even "
"when the command is from ``cmdqueue``."
msgstr ":gh:`120769`: 使 :mod:`pdb` 中的空行即使命令来自 ``cmdqueue`` 也重复最后一个命令。"

#: ../NEWS:1493
msgid ""
":gh:`120732`: Fix ``name`` passing to :class:`unittest.mock.Mock` object "
"when using :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120732`: 在使用 :func:`unittest.mock.create_autospec` 时修复传递给 "
":class:`unittest.mock.Mock` 对象的 ``name``。"

#: ../NEWS:1496
msgid ""
":gh:`120495`: Fix incorrect exception handling in Tab Nanny. Patch by "
"Wulian233."
msgstr ":gh:`120495`: 修复 Tab Nanny 中错误的异常处理。由 Wulian233 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1499
msgid ""
":gh:`120343`: Fix column offset reporting for tokens that come after "
"multiline f-strings in the :mod:`tokenize` module."
msgstr ":gh:`120343`: 修复 :mod:`tokenize` 模块中多行 f-strings 之后出现的标记的列偏移报告。"

#: ../NEWS:1502
msgid ""
":gh:`119600`: Fix :func:`unittest.mock.patch` to not read attributes of the "
"target when ``new_callable`` is set. Patch by Robert Collins."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119600`: 修复 :func:`unittest.mock.patch` 在 ``new_callable`` "
"设置时不读取目标属性的问题。由 Robert Collins 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1505
msgid ""
":gh:`120289`: Fixed the use-after-free issue in :mod:`cProfile` by "
"disallowing ``disable()`` and ``clear()`` in external timers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120289`: 通过禁止外部计时器中的 ``disable()`` 和 ``clear()`` 来修复 :mod:`cProfile` 中的"
" use-after-free 问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1508
msgid ""
":gh:`114053`: Fix edge-case bug where :func:`typing.get_type_hints` would "
"produce incorrect results if type parameters in a class scope were "
"overridden by assignments in a class scope and ``from __future__ import "
"annotations`` semantics were enabled. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114053`: 修复了一个边缘情况下的 bug，即在类作用域中的类型参数被类作用域中的赋值覆盖并且启用了 ``from __future__"
" import annotations`` 语义时，:func:`typing.get_type_hints` 会产生不正确的结果。由 Alex "
"Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1513
msgid ""
":gh:`114053`: Fix erroneous :exc:`NameError` when calling "
":func:`inspect.get_annotations` with ``eval_str=True``` on a class that made"
" use of :pep:`695` type parameters in a module that had ``from __future__ "
"import annotations`` at the top of the file. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114053`: 修复了当在文件顶部有 ``from __future__ import annotations`` 的模块中，对使用了 "
":pep:`695` 类型参数的类调用 :func:`inspect.get_annotations` 并设置 ``eval_str=True`` "
"时出现的错误 :exc:`NameError`。由Alex Waygood提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1519
msgid ""
":gh:`120268`: Prohibit passing ``None`` to pure-Python "
":meth:`datetime.date.fromtimestamp` to achieve consistency with C-extension "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120268`: 禁止向纯Python的 :meth:`datetime.date.fromtimestamp` 传递 "
"``None``，以实现与C扩展实现的一致性。"

#: ../NEWS:1523
msgid ""
":gh:`120244`: Fix memory leak in :func:`re.sub` when the replacement string "
"contains backreferences."
msgstr ":gh:`120244`: 修复了当替换字符串包含反向引用时 :func:`re.sub` 中的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1526
msgid ":gh:`120211`: Fix :mod:`tkinter.ttk` with Tcl/Tk 9.0."
msgstr ":gh:`120211`: 修复了 :mod:`tkinter.ttk` 与Tcl/Tk 9.0的兼容性问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1528
msgid ""
":gh:`71587`: Fix crash in C version of :meth:`datetime.datetime.strptime` "
"when called again on the restarted interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`71587`: 修复了在重启的解释器上再次调用C版本的 :meth:`datetime.datetime.strptime` 时崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1531
msgid ""
":gh:`117983`: Defer the ``threading`` import in ``importlib.util`` until "
"lazy loading is used."
msgstr ":gh:`117983`: 在 ``importlib.util`` 中推迟 ``threading`` 的导入，直到使用懒加载。"

#: ../NEWS:1534
msgid ""
":gh:`119698`: Fix :meth:`symtable.Class.get_methods` and document its "
"behaviour. Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119698`: 修复了 :meth:`symtable.Class.get_methods` 并记录了其行为。由Bénédikt "
"Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1537
msgid ""
":gh:`120121`: Add :exc:`concurrent.futures.InvalidStateError` to module's "
"``__all__``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120121`: 向模块的 ``__all__`` 中添加了 "
":exc:`concurrent.futures.InvalidStateError`。"

#: ../NEWS:1540
msgid ":gh:`112672`: Support building :mod:`tkinter` with Tcl 9.0."
msgstr ":gh:`112672`: 支持使用 Tcl 9.0 构建 :mod:`tkinter`。"

#: ../NEWS:1542
msgid ""
":gh:`65454`: :func:`unittest.mock.Mock.attach_mock` no longer triggers a "
"call to a ``PropertyMock`` being attached."
msgstr ""
":gh:`65454`: :func:`unittest.mock.Mock.attach_mock` 不再触发对正在附加的 "
"``PropertyMock`` 的调用。"

#: ../NEWS:1545
msgid ""
":gh:`81936`: :meth:`!help` and :meth:`!showtopic` methods now respect a "
"configured *output* argument to :class:`!pydoc.Helper` and not use the pager"
" in such cases. Patch by Enrico Tröger."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81936`: :meth:`!help` 和 :meth:`!showtopic` 方法现在尊重为 "
":class:`!pydoc.Helper` 配置的 *output* 参数，在这种情况下不使用分页器。由 Enrico Tröger 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1549
msgid ""
":gh:`119577`: The :exc:`DeprecationWarning` emitted when testing the truth "
"value of an :class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` now describes "
"unconditionally returning ``True`` in a future version rather than raising "
"an exception in Python 3.14."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119577`: 当测试 :class:`xml.etree.ElementTree.Element` 的真值时，发出的 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning` 现在描述了在未来的版本中无条件返回 ``True``，而不是在 Python 3.14 中引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:1554
msgid ""
":gh:`119506`: Fix :meth:`!io.TextIOWrapper.write` method breaks internal "
"buffer when the method is called again during flushing internal buffer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119506`: 修复了在刷新内部缓冲区期间再次调用 :meth:`!io.TextIOWrapper.write` "
"方法时会破坏内部缓冲区的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1557
msgid ""
":gh:`119189`: When using the ``**`` operator or :func:`pow` with "
":class:`~fractions.Fraction` as the base and an exponent that is not "
"rational, a float, or a complex, the fraction is no longer converted to a "
"float."
msgstr ""
":gh:`119189`: 当使用 ``**`` 操作符或 :func:`pow` 时，如果基数是 "
":class:`~fractions.Fraction` 且指数不是有理数、浮点数或复数，分数不再转换为浮点数。"

#: ../NEWS:1562
msgid ""
":gh:`105623`: Fix performance degradation in "
":class:`logging.handlers.RotatingFileHandler`. Patch by Craig Robson."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105623`: 修复 :class:`logging.handlers.RotatingFileHandler` 中的性能下降问题。由 "
"Craig Robson 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1565
msgid ":issue:`39324`: Add mime type mapping for .md <-> text/markdown"
msgstr ":issue:`39324`: 添加 .md 文件扩展名与 text/markdown MIME 类型的映射关系。"

#: ../NEWS:1570
msgid ""
":gh:`122482`: Change About IDLE to direct users to discuss.python.org "
"instead of the now unused idle-dev email and mailing list."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122482`: 更改 About IDLE，将用户引导至 discuss.python.org，而不是现在未使用的 idle-dev "
"电子邮件和邮件列表。"

#: ../NEWS:1573
msgid ""
":gh:`78889`: Stop Shell freezes by blocking user access to non-method "
"sys.stdout.shell attributes, which are all private."
msgstr ":gh:`78889`: 通过阻止用户访问非方法 sys.stdout.shell 属性（这些属性都是私有的）来停止 Shell 冻结。"

#: ../NEWS:1576
msgid ":gh:`120104`: Fix padding in config and search dialog windows in IDLE."
msgstr ":gh:`120104`: 修复IDLE中配置和搜索对话框窗口的填充问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1581
msgid ":gh:`121749`: Fix documentation for :c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef`."
msgstr ":gh:`121749`: 修复 :c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef` 的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:1583
msgid ""
":gh:`120012`: Clarify the behaviours of :meth:`multiprocessing.Queue.empty` "
"and :meth:`multiprocessing.SimpleQueue.empty` on closed queues. Patch by "
"Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120012`: 澄清了 :meth:`multiprocessing.Queue.empty` 和 "
":meth:`multiprocessing.SimpleQueue.empty` 在关闭队列上的行为。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1590
msgid ""
":gh:`122208`: Dictionary watchers now only deliver the PyDict_EVENT_ADDED "
"event when the insertion is in a known good state to succeed."
msgstr ":gh:`122208`: 字典观察器现在仅在插入处于已知良好状态以成功时传递PyDict_EVENT_ADDED事件。"

#: ../NEWS:1593
msgid ""
":gh:`122300`: Preserve AST nodes for f-string with single-element format "
"specifiers. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`122300`: 保留f-string中单元素格式说明符的AST节点。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1596
msgid ""
":gh:`122029`: Emit ``c_call`` events in :func:`sys.setprofile` when a "
"``PyMethodObject`` pointing to a ``PyCFunction`` is called."
msgstr ""
":gh:`122029`: 在 :func:`sys.setprofile` 中，当调用指向 ``PyCFunction`` 的 "
"``PyMethodObject``时，发出 ``c_call`` 事件。"

#: ../NEWS:1599
msgid ""
":gh:`122026`: Fix a bug that caused the tokenizer to not correctly identify "
"mismatched parentheses inside f-strings in some situations. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`122026`: 修复了一个导致分词器在某些情况下不能正确识别f-string中不匹配括号的错误。补丁由Pablo Galindo提供。"

#: ../NEWS:1603
msgid ""
":gh:`121657`: Improve the :exc:`SyntaxError` message if the user tries to "
"use :keyword:`yield from <yield>` outside a function."
msgstr ""
":gh:`121657`: 如果用户试图在函数外部使用 :keyword:`yield from <yield>`，改进了 "
":exc:`SyntaxError` 的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:1606
msgid ""
":gh:`117482`: Unexpected slot wrappers are no longer created for builtin "
"static types in subinterpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`117482`: 在子解释器中不再为内置静态类型创建意外的槽包装器。"

#: ../NEWS:1609
msgid ":gh:`121439`: Allow tuples of length 20 in the freelist to be reused."
msgstr ":gh:`121439`: 允许 freelist 中长度为 20 的元组被重用。"

#: ../NEWS:1611
msgid ""
":gh:`121130`: Fix f-strings with debug expressions in format specifiers. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`121130`: 修复了格式说明符中使用调试表达式的 f-strings。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1614
msgid ""
":gh:`120722`: Correctly set the bytecode position on return instructions "
"within lambdas. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ":gh:`120722`: 正确设置 lambda 中返回指令的字节码位置。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1617
msgid ""
":gh:`120384`: Fix an array out of bounds crash in ``list_ass_subscript``, "
"which could be invoked via some specificly tailored input: including "
"concurrent modification of a list object, where one thread assigns a slice "
"and another clears it."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1622
msgid ""
":gh:`120380`: Fix Python implementation of :class:`pickle.Pickler` for "
":class:`bytes` and :class:`bytearray` objects when using protocol version 5."
" Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
msgstr ""
":gh:`120380`: 修复使用协议版本5时，:class:`pickle.Pickler` 对 :class:`bytes` 和 "
":class:`bytearray` 对象的Python实现。由Bénédikt Tran提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:1626
msgid ""
":gh:`93691`: Fix source locations of instructions generated for the iterator"
" of a for statement."
msgstr ":gh:`93691`: 修复为for语句的迭代器生成的指令的源代码位置。"

#: ../NEWS:1629
msgid ""
":gh:`120198`: Fix a crash when multiple threads read and write to the same "
"``__class__`` of an object concurrently."
msgstr ":gh:`120198`: 修复多个线程同时读写同一对象的 ``__class__`` 时发生的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1632
msgid ""
":gh:`120298`: Fix use-after free in ``list_richcompare_impl`` which can be "
"invoked via some specificly tailored evil input."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1635
msgid ""
":gh:`119666`: Fix a compiler crash in the case where two comprehensions in "
"class scope both reference ``__class__``."
msgstr ":gh:`119666`: 修复在类作用域中两个推导式都引用 ``__class__`` 的情况下编译器崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:1638
msgid ""
":issue:`24766`: Fix handling of ``doc`` argument to subclasses of "
"``property``."
msgstr ":issue:`24766`: 修复对 ``property`` 子类的 ``doc`` 参数的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:1643
msgid ""
":gh:`120671`: Fix failing configure tests due to a missing space when "
"appending to CFLAGS."
msgstr ":gh:`120671`: 修复由于在附加到CFLAGS时缺少空格而导致的配置测试失败。"

#: ../NEWS:1646
msgid ""
":gh:`115983`: Skip building test modules that must be built as shared under "
"WASI."
msgstr ":gh:`115983`: 跳过必须作为共享库在WASI下构建的测试模块。"

#: ../NEWS:1651
msgid "Python 3.12.4 final"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1653
msgid "*Release date: 2024-06-06*"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:1658
msgid ""
":gh:`118486`: :func:`os.mkdir` on Windows now accepts *mode* of ``0o700`` to"
