"argument in :class:`property` methods :meth:`~property.getter`, "
":meth:`~property.setter` and :meth:`~property.deleter`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115618`: 修复 :class:`property` 方法 "
":meth:`~property.getter`、:meth:`~property.setter` 和 "
":meth:`~property.deleter` 中对 ``None`` 参数引用计数不当减少的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2160
msgid ""
":gh:`115570`: A :exc:`DeprecationWarning` is no longer omitted on access to "
"the ``__doc__`` attributes of the deprecated ``typing.io`` and ``typing.re``"
" pseudo-modules."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:2164
msgid ""
":gh:`112006`: Fix :func:`inspect.unwrap` for types with the ``__wrapper__`` "
"data descriptor."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:2167
msgid ""
":gh:`101293`: Support callables with the ``__call__()`` method and types "
"with ``__new__()`` and ``__init__()`` methods set to class methods, static "
"methods, bound methods, partial functions, and other types of methods and "
"descriptors in :meth:`inspect.Signature.from_callable`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101293`: 在 :meth:`inspect.Signature.from_callable` 中支持带有 ``__call__()``"
" 方法的可调用对象，以及将 ``__new__()`` 和 ``__init__()`` "
"方法设置为类方法、静态方法、绑定方法、部分函数以及其他类型的方法和描述符的类型。"

#: ../NEWS:2172
msgid ""
":gh:`115392`: Fix a bug in :mod:`doctest` where incorrect line numbers would"
" be reported for decorated functions."
msgstr ":gh:`115392`: 修复 :mod:`doctest` 中的一个错误，该错误会导致装饰函数的行号报告不正确。"

#: ../NEWS:2175
msgid ""
":gh:`114563`: Fix several :func:`format` bugs when using the C "
"implementation of :class:`~decimal.Decimal`: * memory leak in some rare "
"cases when using the ``z`` format option (coerce negative 0) * incorrect "
"output when applying the ``z`` format option to type ``F`` (fixed-point with"
" capital ``NAN`` / ``INF``) * incorrect output when applying the ``#`` "
"format option (alternate form)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`114563`: 修复使用 :class:`~decimal.Decimal` 的C实现时的几个 :func:`format` 错误：* "
"在某些罕见情况下使用`z`格式选项（强制负0）时的内存泄漏 * 将`z`格式选项应用于`F`类型（固定点与大写`NAN` / `INF`）时的错误输出 "
"* 应用`#` 格式选项（交替形式）时的错误输出。"

#: ../NEWS:2182
msgid ""
":gh:`115197`: ``urllib.request`` no longer resolves the hostname before "
"checking it against the system's proxy bypass list on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115197`: ``urllib.request`` 在 macOS 和 Windows 上不再在检查系统代理绕过列表之前解析主机名。"

#: ../NEWS:2185
msgid ""
":gh:`115165`: Most exceptions are now ignored when attempting to set the "
"``__orig_class__`` attribute on objects returned when calling :mod:`typing` "
"generic aliases (including generic aliases created using "
":data:`typing.Annotated`). Previously only :exc:`AttributeError` was "
"ignored. Patch by Dave Shawley."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115165`: 现在在尝试为调用 :mod:`typing` 泛型别名（包括使用 :data:`typing.Annotated` "
"创建的泛型别名）返回的对象设置`__orig_class__` 属性时，大多数异常会被忽略。之前只有 :exc:`AttributeError` "
"被忽略。由Dave Shawley提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2191
msgid ""
":gh:`115133`: Fix tests for :class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLPullParser` "
"with Expat 2.6.0."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115133`: 修复与Expat 2.6.0兼容的 "
":class:`~xml.etree.ElementTree.XMLPullParser` 测试。"

#: ../NEWS:2194
msgid ""
":gh:`115059`: :meth:`io.BufferedRandom.read1` now flushes the underlying "
"write buffer."
msgstr ":gh:`115059`: :meth:`io.BufferedRandom.read1` 现在会刷新底层写入缓冲区。"

#: ../NEWS:2197
msgid ""
":gh:`79382`: Trailing ``**`` no longer allows to match files and non-"
"existing paths in recursive :func:`~glob.glob`."
msgstr ":gh:`79382`: 在递归 :func:`~glob.glob` 中，尾随的 ``**`` 不再允许匹配文件和不存在的路径。"

#: ../NEWS:2200
msgid ""
":gh:`114071`: Support tuple subclasses using auto() for enum member value."
msgstr ":gh:`114071`: 支持使用auto()为枚举成员值的元组子类。"

#: ../NEWS:2202
msgid ""
":gh:`114763`: Protect modules loaded with :class:`importlib.util.LazyLoader`"
" from race conditions when multiple threads try to access attributes before "
"the loading is complete."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114763`: 保护使用 :class:`importlib.util.LazyLoader` "
"加载的模块，防止在加载完成前多个线程尝试访问属性时出现竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:2206
msgid ""
":gh:`97959`: Fix rendering class methods, bound methods, method and function"
" aliases in :mod:`pydoc`. Class methods no longer have \"method of "
"builtins.type instance\" note. Corresponding notes are now added for class "
"and unbound methods. Method and function aliases now have references to the "
"module or the class where the origin was defined if it differs from the "
"current. Bound methods are now listed in the static methods section. Methods"
" of builtin classes are now supported as well as methods of Python classes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97959`: 修复 :mod:`pydoc` "
"中类方法、绑定方法、方法及函数别名的渲染问题。类方法不再显示“builtins.type实例的方法”注释。现在为类和未绑定方法添加了相应的注释。方法和函数别名现在如果原始定义与当前不同，会引用到定义原始内容的模块或类。绑定方法现在列在静态方法部分。内置类的方法现在和Python类的方法一样得到支持。"

#: ../NEWS:2215
msgid ""
":gh:`112281`: Allow creating :ref:`union of types<types-union>` for "
":class:`typing.Annotated` with unhashable metadata."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112281`: 允许为 :class:`typing.Annotated` 创建 :ref:`类型的联合 <types-"
"union>`，即使元数据不可哈希。"

#: ../NEWS:2218
msgid ""
":gh:`111775`: Fix :meth:`importlib.resources.simple.ResourceHandle.open` for"
" text mode, added missed ``stream`` argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111775`: 修复了 :meth:`importlib.resources.simple.ResourceHandle.open` "
"在文本模式下的问题，添加了遗漏的 ``stream`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:2221
msgid ":gh:`90095`: Make .pdbrc and -c work with any valid pdb commands."
msgstr ":gh:`90095`: 使 .pdbrc 和 -c 可以与任何有效的 pdb 命令一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:2223
msgid ""
":gh:`107155`: Fix incorrect output of ``help(x)`` where ``x`` is a "
":keyword:`lambda` function, which has an ``__annotations__`` dictionary "
"attribute with a ``\"return\"`` key."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107155`: 修复了 ``help(x)`` 的错误输出，其中 ``x`` 是一个 :keyword:`lambda` "
"函数，该函数有一个带有 ``\"return\"`` 键的 ``__annotations__`` 字典属性。"

#: ../NEWS:2227
msgid ""
":gh:`105866`: Fixed ``_get_slots`` bug which caused error when defining "
"dataclasses with slots and a weakref_slot."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105866`: 修复了 ``_get_slots`` 的 bug，该 bug 在定义带有 slots 和 weakref_slot "
"的数据类时会导致错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2230
msgid ":gh:`60346`: Fix ArgumentParser inconsistent with parse_known_args."
msgstr ":gh:`60346`: 修复 ArgumentParser 与 parse_known_args 不一致的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2232
msgid ""
":gh:`100985`: Update HTTPSConnection to consistently wrap IPv6 Addresses "
"when using a proxy."
msgstr ":gh:`100985`: 更新 HTTPSConnection 以在使用代理时一致地包装 IPv6 地址。"

#: ../NEWS:2235
msgid ""
":gh:`100884`: email: fix misfolding of comma in address-lists over multiple "
"lines in combination with unicode encoding."
msgstr ":gh:`100884`: email: 修复在多行地址列表中结合 Unicode 编码时逗号的错误折叠问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2238
msgid ""
":gh:`95782`: Fix :func:`io.BufferedReader.tell`, "
":func:`io.BufferedReader.seek`, :func:`!_pyio.BufferedReader.tell`, "
":func:`io.BufferedRandom.tell`, :func:`io.BufferedRandom.seek` and "
":func:`!_pyio.BufferedRandom.tell` being able to return negative offsets."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95782`: 修复 :func:`io.BufferedReader.tell`, "
":func:`io.BufferedReader.seek`, :func:`!_pyio.BufferedReader.tell`, "
":func:`io.BufferedRandom.tell`, :func:`io.BufferedRandom.seek` 和 "
":func:`!_pyio.BufferedRandom.tell` 可能返回负偏移量的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2243
msgid ""
":gh:`96310`: Fix a traceback in :mod:`argparse` when all options in a "
"mutually exclusive group are suppressed."
msgstr ":gh:`96310`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中当互斥组中的所有选项被抑制时出现的回溯问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2246
msgid ""
":gh:`93205`: Fixed a bug in "
":class:`logging.handlers.TimedRotatingFileHandler` where multiple rotating "
"handler instances pointing to files with the same name but different "
"extensions would conflict and not delete the correct files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93205`: 修复 :class:`logging.handlers.TimedRotatingFileHandler` "
"中的一个错误，其中指向具有相同名称但不同扩展名的文件的多个旋转处理程序实例会冲突并且不会删除正确的文件。"

#: ../NEWS:2251
msgid ""
":issue:`44865`: Add missing call to localization function in "
":mod:`argparse`."
msgstr ":issue:`44865`: 在 :mod:`argparse` 中添加对本地化函数的缺失调用。"

#: ../NEWS:2253
msgid ""
":issue:`43952`: Fix :meth:`multiprocessing.connection.Listener.accept` to "
"accept empty bytes as authkey. Not accepting empty bytes as key causes it to"
" hang indefinitely."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43952`: 修复 :meth:`multiprocessing.connection.Listener.accept` "
"以接受空字节作为 authkey。不接受空字节作为密钥会导致其无限期挂起。"

#: ../NEWS:2257
msgid ""
":issue:`42125`: linecache: get module name from ``__spec__`` if available. "
"This allows getting source code for the ``__main__`` module when a custom "
"loader is used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42125`: linecache: 如果可用，从 ``__spec__`` 获取模块名称。这允许在使用自定义加载器时获取 "
"``__main__`` 模块的源代码。"

#: ../NEWS:2261
msgid ""
":gh:`66543`: Make :func:`mimetypes.guess_type` properly parsing of URLs with"
" only a host name, URLs containing fragment or query, and filenames with "
"only a UNC sharepoint on Windows. Based on patch by Dong-hee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`66543`: 使 :func:`mimetypes.guess_type` "
"能够正确解析仅包含主机名的URL、包含片段或查询的URL以及Windows上仅包含UNC共享点的文件名。基于 Dong-hee Na 的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2265
msgid ""
":issue:`33775`: Add 'default' and 'version' help text for localization in "
"argparse."
msgstr ":issue:`33775`: 在 argparse 中为本地化添加了 'default' 和 'version' 帮助文本。"

#: ../NEWS:2271
msgid ""
":gh:`115399`: Document :cve:`2023-52425` of Expat <2.6.0 under \"XML "
"vulnerabilities\"."
msgstr ":gh:`115399`: 在 \"XML 漏洞\" 下记录了 Expat <2.6.0 的 :cve:`2023-52425`。"

#: ../NEWS:2274
msgid ""
":gh:`115233`: Fix an example for :class:`~logging.LoggerAdapter` in the "
"Logging Cookbook."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115233`: 修复 Logging Cookbook 中 :class:`~logging.LoggerAdapter` 的一个例子。"

#: ../NEWS:2280
msgid ""
":gh:`83434`: Disable JUnit XML output (``--junit-xml=FILE`` command line "
"option) in regrtest when hunting for reference leaks (``-R`` option). Patch "
"by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`83434`: 在regrtest中搜索引用泄漏（``-R``选项）时禁用JUnit XML输出（``--junit-"
"xml=FILE``命令行选项）。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2284
msgid ":gh:`117187`: Fix XML tests for vanilla Expat <2.6.0."
msgstr ":gh:`117187`: 修复对 vanilla Expat <2.6.0 的XML测试。"

#: ../NEWS:2286
msgid ""
":gh:`116333`: Tests of TLS related things (error codes, etc) were updated to"
" be more lenient about specific error message strings and behaviors as seen "
"in the BoringSSL and AWS-LC forks of OpenSSL."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116333`: 更新了TLS相关事物的测试（错误代码等），以对在OpenSSL的BoringSSL和AWS-"
"LC分支中看到的特定错误消息字符串和行为更加宽容。"

#: ../NEWS:2290
msgid ""
":gh:`115979`: Update test_importlib so that it passes under WASI SDK 21."
msgstr ":gh:`115979`: 更新 test_importlib，使其在 WASI SDK 21 下通过。"

#: ../NEWS:2292
msgid ""
":gh:`112536`: Add --tsan to test.regrtest for running TSAN tests in "
"reasonable execution times. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112536`: 在合理的执行时间内运行TSAN测试，为test.regrtest添加--tsan选项。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2295
msgid ""
":gh:`116307`: Added import helper ``isolated_modules`` as ``CleanImport`` "
"does not remove modules imported during the context. Use it in "
"importlib.resources tests to avoid leaving ``mod`` around to impede "
"importlib.metadata tests."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116307`: 添加了导入助手 ``isolated_modules``，因为 ``CleanImport`` "
"不会移除上下文期间导入的模块。在importlib.resources测试中使用它，避免留下 ``mod`` "
"影响importlib.metadata测试。"

#: ../NEWS:2300
msgid ""
":gh:`115720`: Leak tests (``-R``, ``--huntrleaks``) now show a summary of "
"the number of leaks found in each iteration."
msgstr ":gh:`115720`: 泄漏测试（``-R``, ``--huntrleaks``）现在显示每次迭代中发现泄漏数量的摘要。"

#: ../NEWS:2303
msgid ""
":gh:`115122`: Add ``--bisect`` option to regrtest test runner: run failed "
"tests with ``test.bisect_cmd`` to identify failing tests. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115122`: 为 regrtest 测试运行器添加 ``--bisect`` 选项：使用 ``test.bisect_cmd`` "
"运行失败的测试以识别失败的测试。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2307
msgid ""
":gh:`115596`: Fix ``ProgramPriorityTests`` in ``test_os`` permanently "
"changing the process priority."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115596`: 修复 ``test_os`` 中的 ``ProgramPriorityTests`` 永久改变进程优先级的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2313
msgid ""
":gh:`116313`: Get WASI builds to work under wasmtime 18 w/ WASI 0.2/preview2"
" primitives."
msgstr ":gh:`116313`: 使 WASI 构建在 wasmtime 18 下使用 WASI 0.2/preview2 原语工作。"

#: ../NEWS:2316
msgid ""
":gh:`116117`: Backport ``libb2``'s PR #42 to fix compiling CPython on 32-bit"
" Windows with ``clang-cl``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116117`: 回退 ``libb2`` 的 PR #42 以修复在 32 位 Windows 上用 ``clang-cl`` 编译 "
"CPython 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2319
msgid ""
":gh:`115167`: Avoid vendoring ``vcruntime140_threads.dll`` when building "
"with Visual Studio 2022 version 17.8."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115167`: 使用 Visual Studio 2022 版本 17.8 构建时避免提供 "
"``vcruntime140_threads.dll``。"

#: ../NEWS:2322
msgid ":gh:`112536`: Add support for thread sanitizer (TSAN)"
msgstr ":gh:`112536`: 添加对线程消毒剂（TSAN）的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:2327
msgid ""
":gh:`117267`: Ensure ``DirEntry.stat().st_ctime`` behaves consistently with "
":func:`os.stat` during the deprecation period of ``st_ctime`` by containing "
"the same value as ``st_birthtime``. After the deprecation period, "
"``st_ctime`` will be the metadata change time (or unavailable through "
"``DirEntry``), and only ``st_birthtime`` will contain the creation time."
msgstr ""
":gh:`117267`: 在 ``st_ctime`` 的弃用期内，确保 ``DirEntry.stat().st_ctime`` 与 "
":func:`os.stat` 行为一致，包含与 ``st_birthtime`` 相同的值。弃用期过后，``st_ctime`` "
"将是元数据更改时间（或通过 ``DirEntry`` 不可用），只有 ``st_birthtime`` 将包含创建时间。"

#: ../NEWS:2334
msgid ""
":gh:`116773`: Fix instances of ``<_overlapped.Overlapped object at 0xXXX> "
"still has pending operation at deallocation, the process may crash``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116773`: 修复``<_overlapped.Overlapped object at 0xXXX> still has pending"
" operation at deallocation, the process may crash``的实例。"

#: ../NEWS:2337
msgid ""
":gh:`91227`: Fix the asyncio ProactorEventLoop implementation so that "
"sending a datagram to an address that is not listening does not prevent "
"receiving any more datagrams."
msgstr ":gh:`91227`: 修复asyncio ProactorEventLoop实现，以便向未监听的地址发送数据报不会阻止接收更多数据报。"

#: ../NEWS:2341
msgid ""
":gh:`115554`: The installer now has more strict rules about updating the "
":ref:`launcher`. In general, most users only have a single launcher "
"installed and will see no difference. When multiple launchers have been "
"installed, the option to install the launcher is disabled until all but one "
"have been removed. Downgrading the launcher (which was never allowed) is now"
" more obviously blocked."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115554`: 安装程序现在对于更新 :ref:`launcher` "
"有更严格的规则。一般来说，大多数用户只安装了一个启动器，不会看到任何区别。当安装了多个启动器时，安装启动器的选项将被禁用，直到只剩下一个。降级启动器（从未允许）现在被更明显地阻止。"

#: ../NEWS:2348
msgid ""
":gh:`115543`: :ref:`launcher` can now detect Python 3.13 when installed from"
" the Microsoft Store, and will install Python 3.12 by default when "
":envvar:`PYLAUNCHER_ALLOW_INSTALL` is set."
msgstr ""
":gh:`115543`: :ref:`launcher` 现在可以检测从 Microsoft Store 安装的 Python 3.13，并且在设置 "
":envvar:`PYLAUNCHER_ALLOW_INSTALL` 时默认安装 Python 3.12。"

#: ../NEWS:2352
msgid ""
":gh:`115049`: Fixes ``py.exe`` launcher failing when run as users without "
"user profiles."
msgstr ":gh:`115049`: 修复 ``py.exe`` 启动器在没有用户配置文件的用户下运行时失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2355
msgid ":gh:`115009`: Update Windows installer to use SQLite 3.45.1."
msgstr ":gh:`115009`: 更新 Windows 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.45.1。"

#: ../NEWS:2360
msgid ""
":gh:`88516`: On macOS show a proxy icon in the title bar of editor windows "
"to match platform behaviour."
msgstr ":gh:`88516`: 在 macOS 上，在编辑器窗口的标题栏中显示代理图标以匹配平台行为。"

#: ../NEWS:2366
msgid ":gh:`113516`: Don't set ``LDSHARED`` when building for WASI."
msgstr ":gh:`113516`: 在构建WASI时不要设置 ``LDSHARED``。"

#: ../NEWS:2371
msgid ""
":gh:`117021`: Fix integer overflow in :c:func:`PyLong_AsPid` on non-Windows "
"64-bit platforms."
msgstr ":gh:`117021`: 修复非 Windows 64 位平台上 :c:func:`PyLong_AsPid` 中的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2374
msgid ""
":gh:`116869`: Make the C API compatible with ``-Werror=declaration-after-"
"statement`` compiler flag again. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`116869`: 使 C API 再次兼容 ``-Werror=declaration-after-statement`` 编译器标志。补丁由"
" Victor Stinner 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:2380
msgid "Python 3.12.2 final"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:2382
msgid "*Release date: 2024-02-06*"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:2387
msgid ""
":gh:`113659`: Skip ``.pth`` files with names starting with a dot or hidden "
"file attribute."
msgstr ":gh:`113659`: 跳过名称以点开头或具有隐藏文件属性的 ``.pth`` 文件。"

#: ../NEWS:2393
msgid ""
":gh:`114887`: Changed socket type validation in "
":meth:`~asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint` to accept all non-stream "
"sockets. This fixes a regression in compatibility with raw sockets."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114887`: 更改 :meth:`~asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint` "
"中的套接字类型验证，以接受所有非流套接字。这修复了与原始套接字兼容性的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2397
msgid ""
":gh:`114388`: Fix a :exc:`RuntimeWarning` emitted when assign an integer-"
"like value that is not an instance of :class:`int` to an attribute that "
"corresponds to a C struct member of :ref:`type <PyMemberDef-types>` T_UINT "
"and T_ULONG. Fix a double :exc:`RuntimeWarning` emitted when assign a "
"negative integer value to an attribute that corresponds to a C struct member"
" of type T_UINT."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114388`: 修复了当将不是 :class:`int` 实例的类似整数值分配给对应于 :ref:`type <PyMemberDef-"
"types>` T_UINT 和 T_ULONG 的 C 结构成员的属性时发出的 "
":exc:`RuntimeWarning`。修复了当将负整数值分配给对应于类型 T_UINT 的 C 结构成员的属性时发出的双重 "
":exc:`RuntimeWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:2404
msgid ""
":gh:`113703`: Fix a regression in the :mod:`codeop` module that was causing "
"it to incorrectly identify incomplete f-strings. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`113703`: 修复了 :mod:`codeop` 模块中的一个回归问题，该问题导致它错误地识别不完整的 f-strings。由 Pablo"
" Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:2407
msgid ""
":gh:`89811`: Check for a valid ``tp_version_tag`` before performing bytecode"
" specializations that rely on this value being usable."
msgstr ":gh:`89811`: 在执行依赖于此值可用的字节码特殊化之前，检查有效的 ``tp_version_tag``。"

#: ../NEWS:2410
msgid ""
":gh:`113602`: Fix an error that was causing the parser to try to overwrite "
"existing errors and crashing in the process. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`113602`: 修复了一个导致解析器尝试覆盖现有错误并在过程中崩溃的错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:2413
msgid ""
":gh:`113297`: Fix segfault in the compiler on with statement with 19 context"
" managers."
msgstr ":gh:`113297`: 修复了编译器在使用 19 个上下文管理器的 with 语句时出现的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2416
msgid ""
":gh:`106905`: Use per AST-parser state rather than global state to track "
"recursion depth within the AST parser to prevent potential race condition "
"due to simultaneous parsing."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106905`: 使用每个 AST 解析器状态而非全局状态来跟踪 AST 解析器内的递归深度，以防止由于同时解析而导致的潜在竞争条件。"

#: ../NEWS:2420
msgid ""
"The issue primarily showed up in 3.11 by multithreaded users of "
":func:`ast.parse`.  In 3.12 a change to when garbage collection can be "
"triggered prevented the race condition from occurring."
msgstr ""
"该问题主要在3.11版本中由 :func:`ast.parse` 的多线程用户发现。在3.12版本中，对垃圾回收触发时机的更改防止了竞态条件的发生。"

#: ../NEWS:2424
msgid ""
":gh:`112943`: Correctly compute end column offsets for multiline tokens in "
"the :mod:`tokenize` module. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`112943`: 在 :mod:`tokenize` 模块中正确计算多行令牌的结束列偏移。补丁由Pablo Galindo提供。"

#: ../NEWS:2427
msgid ""
":gh:`112716`: Fix SystemError in the ``import`` statement and in "
"``__reduce__()`` methods of builtin types when ``__builtins__`` is not a "
"dict."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112716`: 修复当 ``__builtins__`` 不是字典时，``import`` 语句和内置类型的 "
"``__reduce__()``方法中的SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:2431
msgid ""
":gh:`94606`: Fix UnicodeEncodeError when :func:`email.message.get_payload` "
"reads a message with a Unicode surrogate character and the message content "
"is not well-formed for surrogateescape encoding. Patch by Sidney Markowitz."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94606`: 修复当 :func:`email.message.get_payload` 读取含有 Unicode 代理字符且消息内容不适合"
" surrogateescape 编码的消息时的 UnicodeEncodeError。由 Sidney Markowitz 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2439
msgid ":gh:`114965`: Update bundled pip to 24.0"
msgstr ":gh:`114965`: 更新捆绑的pip到24.0版本。"

#: ../NEWS:2441
msgid ""
":gh:`114959`: :mod:`tarfile` no longer ignores errors when trying to extract"
" a directory on top of a file."
msgstr ":gh:`114959`: :mod:`tarfile` 在尝试在文件上提取目录时不再忽略错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2444
msgid ""
":gh:`109475`: Fix support of explicit option value \"--\" in :mod:`argparse`"
" (e.g. ``--option=--``)."
msgstr ":gh:`109475`: 修复 :mod:`argparse` 中对明确选项值\"--\"的支持（例如 ``--option=--``）。"

#: ../NEWS:2447
msgid ""
":gh:`110190`: Fix ctypes structs with array on Windows ARM64 platform by "
"setting ``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` to 32 in stgdict. Patch by Diego Russo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`110190`: 通过在 stgdict 中将 ``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` 设置为 32，修复 Windows ARM64 "
"平台上带数组的 ctypes 结构体。由 Diego Russo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2450
msgid ""
":gh:`113280`: Fix a leak of open socket in rare cases when error occurred in"
" :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` creation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113280`: 修复在 :class:`ssl.SSLSocket` 创建过程中发生错误时，在罕见情况下出现的开放套接字泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2453
msgid ""
":gh:`77749`: :meth:`email.policy.EmailPolicy.fold` now always encodes non-"
"ASCII characters in headers if :attr:`~email.policy.EmailPolicy.utf8` is "
"false."
msgstr ""
":gh:`77749`: :meth:`email.policy.EmailPolicy.fold` 现在如果 "
":attr:`~email.policy.EmailPolicy.utf8` 为 false，总是编码头部的非 ASCII 字符。"

#: ../NEWS:2457
msgid ""
":gh:`114492`: Make the result of :func:`termios.tcgetattr` reproducible on "
"Alpine Linux. Previously it could leave a random garbage in some fields."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114492`: 使 :func:`termios.tcgetattr` 在Alpine "
"Linux上的结果可重现。之前它可能会在某些字段留下随机垃圾。"

#: ../NEWS:2460
msgid ""
":gh:`113267`: Revert changes in :gh:`106584` which made calls of "
"``TestResult`` methods ``startTest()`` and ``stopTest()`` unbalanced."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113267`: 撤销 :gh:`106584` 中的更改，这些更改使得 ``TestResult`` 方法的 ``startTest()``"
" 和 ``stopTest()`` 调用不平衡。"

#: ../NEWS:2463
msgid ""
":gh:`75128`: Ignore an :exc:`OSError` in "
":meth:`asyncio.BaseEventLoop.create_server` when IPv6 is available but the "
"interface cannot actually support it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`75128`: 在 :meth:`asyncio.BaseEventLoop.create_server` 中忽略 "
":exc:`OSError`，当IPv6可用但接口实际上不支持它时。"

#: ../NEWS:2467
msgid ""
":gh:`114257`: Dismiss the :exc:`FileNotFound` error in "
":func:`ctypes.util.find_library` and just return ``None`` on Linux."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114257`: 在 :func:`ctypes.util.find_library` 中忽略 :exc:`FileNotFound` "
"错误，在Linux上直接返回 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:2470
msgid ""
":gh:`114328`: The :func:`tty.setcbreak` and new :func:`tty.cfmakecbreak` no "
"longer clears the terminal input ICRLF flag. This fixes a regression "
"introduced in 3.12 that no longer matched how OSes define cbreak mode in "
"their ``stty(1)`` manual pages."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114328`: :func:`tty.setcbreak` 和新的 :func:`tty.cfmakecbreak` "
"不再清除终端输入ICRLF标志。这修复了3.12中引入的一个回归问题，该问题不再匹配操作系统在其 ``stty(1)`` "
"手册页中定义的cbreak模式。"

#: ../NEWS:2475
msgid ""
":gh:`101438`: Avoid reference cycle in ElementTree.iterparse. The iterator "
"returned by ``ElementTree.iterparse`` may hold on to a file descriptor. The "
"reference cycle prevented prompt clean-up of the file descriptor if the "
"returned iterator was not exhausted."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101438`: 避免在ElementTree.iterparse中出现引用循环。由 ``ElementTree.iterparse`` "
"返回的迭代器可能会持有一个文件描述符。如果返回的迭代器未被耗尽，引用循环会阻止文件描述符的及时清理。"

#: ../NEWS:2480
msgid ""
":gh:`104522`: :exc:`OSError` raised when run a subprocess now only has "
"*filename* attribute set to *cwd* if the error was caused by a failed "
"attempt to change the current directory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104522`: 运行子进程时引发的 :exc:`OSError` 现在仅在错误是由于尝试更改当前目录失败时，才会将 *filename* "
"属性设置为*cwd*。"

#: ../NEWS:2484
msgid ""
":gh:`114149`: Enum: correctly handle tuple subclasses in custom ``__new__``."
msgstr ":gh:`114149`: Enum: 在自定义的 ``__new__`` 中正确处理元组子类。"

#: ../NEWS:2486
msgid ""
":gh:`109534`: Fix a reference leak in "
":class:`asyncio.selector_events.BaseSelectorEventLoop` when SSL handshakes "
"fail. Patch contributed by Jamie Phan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109534`: 修复了 :class:`asyncio.selector_events.BaseSelectorEventLoop` "
"中SSL握手失败时的引用泄漏问题。由Jamie Phan提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2490
msgid ""
":gh:`114077`: Fix possible :exc:`OverflowError` in "
":meth:`socket.socket.sendfile` when pass *count* larger than 2 GiB on 32-bit"
" platform."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114077`: 修复在 32 位平台上传递大于 2 GiB 的 *count* 时 "
":meth:`socket.socket.sendfile` 中可能出现的 :exc:`OverflowError`。"

#: ../NEWS:2494
msgid ""
":gh:`114014`: Fixed a bug in :class:`fractions.Fraction` where an invalid "
"string using ``d`` in the decimals part creates a different error compared "
"to other invalid letters/characters. Patch by Jeremiah Gabriel Pascual."
msgstr ""
":gh:`114014`: 修复了 :class:`fractions.Fraction` 中的一个 bug，该 bug 在使用 ``d`` "
"作为小数部分的无效字符串时，会生成与其他无效字母/字符不同的错误。由 Jeremiah Gabriel Pascual 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2498
msgid ""
":gh:`113951`: Fix the behavior of ``tag_unbind()`` methods of "
":class:`tkinter.Text` and :class:`tkinter.Canvas` classes with three "
"arguments. Previously, ``widget.tag_unbind(tag, sequence, funcid)`` "
"destroyed the current binding for *sequence*, leaving *sequence* unbound, "
"and deleted the *funcid* command. Now it removes only *funcid* from the "
"binding for *sequence*, keeping other commands, and deletes the *funcid* "
"command. It leaves *sequence* unbound only if *funcid* was the last bound "
"command."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113951`: 修复了 :class:`tkinter.Text` 和 :class:`tkinter.Canvas` 类的 "
"``tag_unbind()`` 方法在三参数情况下的行为。以前，``widget.tag_unbind(tag, sequence, "
"funcid)`` 会销毁 *sequence* 的当前绑定，使 *sequence* 变为未绑定状态，并删除 *funcid* 命令。现在它仅从 "
"*sequence* 的绑定中移除 *funcid*，保留其他命令，并删除 *funcid* 命令。只有当 *funcid* "
"是最后一个绑定的命令时，才会使 *sequence* 变为未绑定状态。"

#: ../NEWS:2507
msgid ""
":gh:`113877`: Fix :mod:`tkinter` method ``winfo_pathname()`` on 64-bit "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113877`: 修复 64 位 Windows 上的 :mod:`tkinter` 方法 ``winfo_pathname()``。"

#: ../NEWS:2510
msgid ""
":gh:`113661`: unittest runner: Don't exit 5 if tests were skipped. The "
"intention of exiting 5 was to detect issues where the test suite wasn't "
"discovered at all. If we skipped tests, it was correctly discovered."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113661`: unittest 运行器：如果测试被跳过，不要退出 5。退出 5 "
"的意图是检测测试套件根本没有被发现的问题。如果我们跳过了测试，那么它已经被正确发现了。"

#: ../NEWS:2514
msgid ""
":gh:`113781`: Silence unraisable AttributeError when warnings are emitted "
"during Python finalization."
msgstr ":gh:`113781`: 在 Python 结束期间发出警告时，静默不可引发的 AttributeError。"

#: ../NEWS:2517
msgid ""
":gh:`112932`: Restore the ability for :mod:`zipfile` to ``extractall`` from "
"zip files with a \"/\" directory entry in them as is commonly added to zips "
"by some wiki or bug tracker data exporters."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112932`: 恢复 :mod:`zipfile` 从含有 \"/\" 目录条目的 zip 文件中 ``extractall`` "
"的能力，这是某些 wiki 或 bug 跟踪器数据导出器常见添加到 zip 文件中的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:2521
msgid ""
":gh:`113594`: Fix :exc:`UnicodeEncodeError` in :mod:`email` when re-fold "
"lines that contain unknown-8bit encoded part followed by non-unknown-8bit "
"encoded part."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113594`: 修复 :mod:`email` 中当重新折叠包含 unknown-8bit 编码部分后跟非 unknown-8bit "
"编码部分的行时引发的 :exc:`UnicodeEncodeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:2525
msgid ""
":gh:`113538`: In :meth:`asyncio.StreamReaderProtocol.connection_made`, there"
" is callback that logs an error if the task wrapping the \"connected "
"callback\" fails. This callback would itself fail if the task was cancelled."
" Prevent this by checking whether the task was cancelled first. If so, close"
" the transport but don't log an error."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113538`: 在 :meth:`asyncio.StreamReaderProtocol.connection_made` "
"中，有一个回调函数，如果包装“连接回调”的任务失败，则会记录错误。如果任务被取消，这个回调本身会失败。通过首先检查任务是否被取消来防止这种情况。如果是，关闭传输但不记录错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2531
msgid ""
":gh:`85567`: Fix resource warnings for unclosed files in :mod:`pickle` and "
":mod:`pickletools` command line interfaces."
msgstr ":gh:`85567`: 修复 :mod:`pickle` 和 :mod:`pickletools` 命令行界面中未关闭文件的资源警告。"

#: ../NEWS:2534
msgid ""
":gh:`101225`: Increase the backlog for "
":class:`multiprocessing.connection.Listener` objects created by "
":mod:`multiprocessing.manager` and :mod:`multiprocessing.resource_sharer` to"
" significantly reduce the risk of getting a connection refused error when "
"creating a :class:`multiprocessing.connection.Connection` to them."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101225`: 增加由 :mod:`multiprocessing.manager` 和 "
":mod:`multiprocessing.resource_sharer` 创建的 "
":class:`multiprocessing.connection.Listener` 对象的积压，以显著降低在创建到它们的 "
":class:`multiprocessing.connection.Connection` 时遇到连接拒绝错误的风险。"

#: ../NEWS:2540
msgid ""
":gh:`113543`: Make sure that ``webbrowser.MacOSXOSAScript`` sends "
"``webbrowser.open`` audit event."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113543`: 确保 ``webbrowser.MacOSXOSAScript`` 发送 ``webbrowser.open`` 审计事件。"

#: ../NEWS:2543
msgid ""
":gh:`113028`: When a second reference to a string appears in the input to "
":mod:`pickle`, and the Python implementation is in use, we are guaranteed "
"that a single copy gets pickled and a single object is shared when reloaded."
" Previously, in protocol 0, when a string contained certain characters (e.g."
" newline) it resulted in duplicate objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113028`: 当字符串的第二个引用出现在 :mod:`pickle` 的输入中，并且使用 Python 实现时，我们保证只有一个副本被 "
"pickle，并且在重新加载时共享一个对象。以前，在协议 0 中，当字符串包含某些字符（如换行符）时，会导致对象重复。"

#: ../NEWS:2549
msgid ":gh:`113421`: Fix multiprocessing logger for ``%(filename)s``."
msgstr ":gh:`113421`: 修复多进程日志记录器对于 ``%(filename)s`` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2551
msgid ""
":gh:`111784`: Fix segfaults in the ``_elementtree`` module. Fix first "
"segfault during deallocation of ``_elementtree.XMLParser`` instances by "
"keeping strong reference to ``pyexpat`` module in module state for capsule "
"lifetime. Fix second segfault which happens in the same deallocation process"
"  by keeping strong reference to ``_elementtree`` module in ``XMLParser`` "
"structure for ``_elementtree`` module lifetime."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111784`: 修复 ``_elementtree`` 模块中的段错误。通过在模块状态中为胶囊生命周期保持对 ``pyexpat`` "
"模块的强引用，修复在 ``_elementtree.XMLParser`` 实例的释放过程中第一次出现的段错误。通过在 ``XMLParser`` "
"结构中为 ``_elementtree`` 模块生命周期保持对 ``_elementtree`` 模块的强引用，修复在同一释放过程中第二次出现的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2558
msgid ""
":gh:`113407`: Fix import of :mod:`unittest.mock` when CPython is built "
"without docstrings."
msgstr ":gh:`113407`: 修复当 CPython 构建时没有文档字符串时导入 :mod:`unittest.mock` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2561
msgid ""
":gh:`113320`: Fix regression in Python 3.12 where :class:`~typing.Protocol` "
"classes that were not marked as :func:`runtime-checkable "
"<typing.runtime_checkable>` would be unnecessarily introspected, potentially"
" causing exceptions to be raised if the protocol had problematic members. "
"Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113320`: 修复 Python 3.12 中的一个回归问题，其中未标记为 :func:`runtime-checkable "
"<typing.runtime_checkable>` 的 :class:`~typing.Protocol` "
"类会被不必要地内省，如果协议有问题的成员，可能会导致异常被引发。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2567
msgid ""
":gh:`113358`: Fix rendering tracebacks for exceptions with a broken "
"``__getattr__``."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:2570
msgid ""
":gh:`113214`: Fix an ``AttributeError`` during asyncio SSL protocol aborts "
"in SSL-over-SSL scenarios."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113214`: 修复了在 SSL-over-SSL 场景中 asyncio SSL 协议中止时出现的 ``AttributeError``。"

#: ../NEWS:2573
msgid ":gh:`113246`: Update bundled pip to 23.3.2."
msgstr ":gh:`113246`: 更新捆绑的 pip 到 23.3.2 版本。"

#: ../NEWS:2575
msgid ""
":gh:`113199`: Make ``http.client.HTTPResponse.read1`` and "
"``http.client.HTTPResponse.readline`` close IO after reading all data when "
"content length is known. Patch by Illia Volochii."
msgstr ""
":gh:`113199`: 使得 ``http.client.HTTPResponse.read1`` 和 "
"``http.client.HTTPResponse.readline`` 在知道内容长度时读取所有数据后关闭 IO。由 Illia Volochii "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2579
msgid ""
":gh:`113188`: Fix :func:`shutil.copymode` and :func:`shutil.copystat` on "
"Windows. Previously they worked differenly if *dst* is a symbolic link: they"
" modified the permission bits of *dst* itself rather than the file it points"
" to if *follow_symlinks* is true or *src* is not a symbolic link, and did "
"not modify the permission bits if *follow_symlinks* is false and *src* is a "
"symbolic link."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:2586
msgid ":gh:`61648`: Detect line numbers of properties in doctests."
msgstr ":gh:`61648`: 检测 doctests 中属性的行号。"

#: ../NEWS:2588
msgid ""
":gh:`112559`: :func:`signal.signal` and :func:`signal.getsignal` no longer "
"call ``repr`` on callable handlers. :func:`asyncio.run` and "
":meth:`asyncio.Runner.run` no longer call ``repr`` on the task results. "
"Patch by Yilei Yang."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112559`: :func:`signal.signal` 和 :func:`signal.getsignal` 不再对可调用的处理器调用 "
"``repr``。:func:`asyncio.run` 和 :meth:`asyncio.Runner.run` 不再对任务结果调用 "
"``repr``。由 Yilei Yang 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2593
msgid ""
":gh:`110190`: Fix ctypes structs with array on PPC64LE platform by setting "
"``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` to 64 in stgdict. Patch by Diego Russo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110190`: 通过在 stgdict 中将 ``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` 设置为 64，修复了 PPC64LE 平台上带有数组的"
" ctypes 结构体。由 Diego Russo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2596
msgid ""
":gh:`79429`: Ignore FileNotFoundError when remove a temporary directory in "
"the multiprocessing finalizer."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:2599
msgid ""
":gh:`81194`: Fix a crash in :func:`socket.if_indextoname` with specific "
"value (UINT_MAX). Fix an integer overflow in :func:`socket.if_indextoname` "
"on 64-bit non-Windows platforms."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81194`: 修复了 :func:`socket.if_indextoname` "
"在特定值（UINT_MAX）下的崩溃问题。修复了64位非Windows平台上 :func:`socket.if_indextoname` "
"的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2603
msgid ""
":gh:`112343`: Improve handling of pdb convenience variables to avoid "
"replacing string contents."
msgstr ":gh:`112343`: 改进pdb便利变量的处理，避免替换字符串内容。"

#: ../NEWS:2606
msgid ""
":gh:`111615`: Fix a regression caused by a fix to :gh:`93162` whereby you "
"couldn't configure a :class:`QueueHandler` without specifying handlers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111615`: 修复了由 :gh:`93162` 的修复引起的回归问题，该问题导致无法在不指定 handlers 的情况下配置 "
":class:`QueueHandler`。"

#: ../NEWS:2609
msgid ""
":gh:`111049`: Fix crash during garbage collection of the :class:`io.BytesIO`"
" buffer object."
msgstr ":gh:`111049`: 修复了 :class:`io.BytesIO` 缓冲对象在垃圾回收过程中的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2612
msgid ""
":gh:`110345`: Show the Tcl/Tk patchlevel (rather than version) in "
":meth:`tkinter._test`."
msgstr ":gh:`110345`: 在 :meth:`tkinter._test` 中显示 Tcl/Tk 补丁级别（而非版本）。"

#: ../NEWS:2615
msgid ""
":gh:`109858`: Protect :mod:`zipfile` from \"quoted-overlap\" zipbomb. It now"
" raises BadZipFile when try to read an entry that overlaps with other entry "
"or central directory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109858`: 保护 :mod:`zipfile` 免受“引用覆盖”zip炸弹攻击。现在在尝试读取与其他条目或中央目录重叠的条目时会引发 "
"BadZipFile。"

#: ../NEWS:2619
msgid ""
":gh:`114440`: On Windows, closing the connection writer when cleaning up a "
"broken :class:`multiprocessing.Queue` queue is now done for all queues, "
"rather than only in :mod:`concurrent.futures` manager thread. This can "
"prevent a deadlock when a ``multiprocessing`` worker process terminates "
"without cleaning up. This completes the backport of patches by Victor "
"Stinner and Serhiy Storchaka."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:2626
msgid ""
":gh:`38807`: Fix race condition in :mod:`trace`. Instead of checking if a "
"directory exists and creating it, directly call :func:`os.makedirs` with the"
" kwarg ``exist_ok=True``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`38807`: 修复了 :mod:`trace` 中的竞态条件。不再检查目录是否存在并创建它，而是直接调用 "
":func:`os.makedirs` 并传递 ``exist_ok=True`` 关键字参数。"

#: ../NEWS:2630
msgid ""
":gh:`75705`: Set unixfrom envelope in :class:`mailbox.mbox` and "
":class:`mailbox.MMDF`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`75705`: 在 :class:`mailbox.mbox` 和 :class:`mailbox.MMDF` 中设置 unixfrom "
"信封。"

#: ../NEWS:2633
msgid ""
":gh:`106233`: Fix stacklevel in ``InvalidTZPathWarning`` during "
":mod:`zoneinfo` module import."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106233`: 修复了在导入 :mod:`zoneinfo` 模块期间 ``InvalidTZPathWarning`` 的堆栈级别。"

#: ../NEWS:2636
msgid ""
":gh:`105102`: Allow :class:`ctypes.Union` to be nested in "
":class:`ctypes.Structure` when the system endianness is the opposite of the "
"classes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105102`: 允许 :class:`ctypes.Union` 嵌套在 :class:`ctypes.Structure` "
"中，当系统字节序与类的字节序相反时。"

#: ../NEWS:2640
msgid ""
":gh:`104282`: Fix null pointer dereference in "
":func:`lzma._decode_filter_properties` due to improper handling of BCJ "
"filters with properties of zero length. Patch by Radislav Chugunov."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104282`: 修复了由于对具有零长度属性的 BCJ 过滤器处理不当导致的 "
