"include a formatting spec. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`110259`: 正确识别f-字符串中的格式说明符（使用单引号或三引号），这些f-字符串在表达式部分有多行，并包含格式说明。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2895
msgid ""
":gh:`110237`: Fix missing error checks for calls to ``PyList_Append`` in "
"``_PyEval_MatchClass``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110237`: 修复在 ``_PyEval_MatchClass`` 中对 ``PyList_Append`` 调用缺少错误检查的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:2898
msgid ""
":gh:`109889`: Fix the compiler's redundant NOP detection algorithm to skip "
"over NOPs with no line number when looking for the next instruction's "
"lineno."
msgstr ":gh:`109889`: 修复编译器的冗余NOP检测算法，使其在查找下一个指令的行号时跳过没有行号的NOP。"

#: ../NEWS:2902
msgid ""
":gh:`109853`: ``sys.path[0]`` is now set correctly for subinterpreters."
msgstr ":gh:`109853`: ``sys.path[0]`` 现在为子解释器正确设置。"

#: ../NEWS:2904
msgid ""
":gh:`105716`: Subinterpreters now correctly handle the case where they have "
"threads running in the background.  Before, such threads would interfere "
"with cleaning up and destroying them, as well as prevent running another "
"script."
msgstr ":gh:`105716`: 子解释器现在能正确处理后台有线程运行的情况。在此之前，这些线程会干扰清理和销毁操作，并阻止运行另一个脚本。"

#: ../NEWS:2909
msgid ""
":gh:`109793`: The main thread no longer exits prematurely when a "
"subinterpreter is cleaned up during runtime finalization.  The bug was a "
"problem particularly because, when triggered, the Python process would "
"always return with a 0 exitcode, even if it failed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109793`: "
"主线程不再在运行时终结期间清理子解释器时过早退出。这个bug尤其成问题，因为一旦触发，Python进程总是会以0退出码返回，即使它失败了。"

#: ../NEWS:2914
msgid ""
":gh:`109596`: Fix some tokens in the grammar that were incorrectly marked as"
" soft keywords. Also fix some repeated rule names and ensure that repeated "
"rules are not allowed. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`109596`: 修复语法中一些被错误标记为软关键字的令牌。同时修复一些重复的规则名称，并确保不允许重复规则。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2918
msgid ""
":gh:`109351`: Fix crash when compiling an invalid AST involving a named "
"(walrus) expression."
msgstr ":gh:`109351`: 修复编译涉及命名（海象）表达式的无效AST时崩溃的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2921
msgid ":gh:`109216`: Fix possible memory leak in :opcode:`BUILD_MAP`."
msgstr ":gh:`109216`: 修复 :opcode:`BUILD_MAP` 中可能的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:2923
msgid ""
":gh:`109207`: Fix a SystemError in ``__repr__`` of symtable entry object."
msgstr ":gh:`109207`: 修复符号表条目对象的 ``__repr__`` 中的SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:2925
msgid ""
":gh:`109179`: Fix bug where the C traceback display drops notes from "
":exc:`SyntaxError`."
msgstr ":gh:`109179`: 修复C回溯显示中从 :exc:`SyntaxError` 中删除注释的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2928
msgid ""
":gh:`109052`: Use the base opcode when comparing code objects to avoid "
"interference from instrumentation"
msgstr ":gh:`109052`: 在比较代码对象时使用基础操作码，以避免检测的干扰。"

#: ../NEWS:2931
msgid ""
":gh:`88943`: Improve syntax error for non-ASCII character that follows a "
"numerical literal. It now points on the invalid non-ASCII character, not on "
"the valid numerical literal."
msgstr ":gh:`88943`: 改进跟随数字文字的非ASCII字符的语法错误。现在它指向无效的非ASCII字符，而不是有效的数字文字。"

#: ../NEWS:2935
msgid ""
":gh:`106931`: Statically allocated string objects are now interned globally "
"instead of per-interpreter.  This fixes a situation where such a string "
"would only be interned in a single interpreter. Normal string objects are "
"unaffected."
msgstr ""
":gh:`106931`: "
"静态分配的字符串对象现在全局内联，而不是每个解释器内联。这修复了此类字符串仅在单个解释器中内联的情况。普通字符串对象不受影响。"

#: ../NEWS:2943
msgid ""
":gh:`79325`: Fix an infinite recursion error in "
":func:`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` cleanup on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`79325`: 修复了 Windows 上 :func:`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` 清理过程中的无限递归错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2946
msgid ""
":gh:`112645`: Remove deprecation error on passing ``onerror`` to "
":func:`shutil.rmtree`."
msgstr ":gh:`112645`: 移除了向 :func:`shutil.rmtree` 传递 ``onerror`` 时的弃用错误。"

#: ../NEWS:2949
msgid ""
":gh:`112618`: Fix a caching bug relating to :data:`typing.Annotated`. "
"``Annotated[str, True]`` is no longer identical to ``Annotated[str, 1]``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112618`: 修复了与 :data:`typing.Annotated` 相关的缓存错误。``Annotated[str, True]``"
" 不再与 ``Annotated[str, 1]`` 相同。"

#: ../NEWS:2952
msgid ""
":gh:`112334`: Fixed a performance regression in 3.12's :mod:`subprocess` on "
"Linux where it would no longer use the fast-path ``vfork()`` system call "
"when it should have due to a logic bug, instead always falling back to the "
"safe but slower ``fork()``."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:2957
msgid ""
"Also fixed a related 3.12 security regression: If a value of "
"``extra_groups=[]`` was passed to :mod:`subprocess.Popen` or related APIs, "
"the underlying ``setgroups(0, NULL)`` system call to clear the groups list "
"would not be made in the child process prior to ``exec()``.  This has been "
"assigned :cve:`2023-6507`."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:2963
msgid ""
"This was identified via code inspection in the process of fixing the first "
"bug."
msgstr "这是在修复第一个漏洞的过程中通过代码审查发现的。"

#: ../NEWS:2966
msgid ""
":gh:`110190`: Fix ctypes structs with array on Arm platform by setting "
"``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` to 32 in stgdict. Patch by Diego Russo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110190`: 通过在stgdict中将 ``MAX_STRUCT_SIZE`` "
"设置为32，修复了Arm平台上带有数组的ctypes结构体问题。由Diego Russo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2969
msgid ""
":gh:`112578`: Fix a spurious :exc:`RuntimeWarning` when executing the "
":mod:`zipfile` module."
msgstr ":gh:`112578`: 修复了执行 :mod:`zipfile` 模块时出现的虚假 :exc:`RuntimeWarning`。"

#: ../NEWS:2972
msgid ""
":gh:`112509`: Fix edge cases that could cause a key to be present in both "
"the ``__required_keys__`` and ``__optional_keys__`` attributes of a "
":class:`typing.TypedDict`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112509`: 修复了可能导致键同时出现在 :class:`typing.TypedDict` 的 "
"``__required_keys__`` 和``__optional_keys__``属性中的边缘情况。由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2976
msgid ""
":gh:`112414`: Fix regression in Python 3.12 where calling :func:`repr` on a "
"module that had been imported using a custom :term:`loader` could fail with "
":exc:`AttributeError`. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112414`: 修复了Python 3.12中的一个回归问题，该问题导致在使用自定义 :term:`loader` 导入的模块上调用 "
":func:`repr` 时可能因 :exc:`AttributeError` 而失败。由Alex Waygood提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:2980
msgid ""
":gh:`112358`: Revert change to :class:`struct.Struct` initialization that "
"broke some cases of subclassing."
msgstr ":gh:`112358`: 恢复对 :class:`struct.Struct` 初始化的更改，该更改破坏了某些子类化的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:2983
msgid ""
":gh:`94722`: Fix bug where comparison between instances of "
":class:`~doctest.DocTest` fails if one of them has ``None`` as its lineno."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94722`: 修复了一个错误，即当其中一个实例的 lineno 为 ``None`` 时，:class:`~doctest.DocTest`"
" 实例之间的比较会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:2986
msgid ""
":gh:`112105`: Make :func:`readline.set_completer_delims` work with libedit"
msgstr ":gh:`112105`: 使 :func:`readline.set_completer_delims` 与 libedit 一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:2988
msgid ""
":gh:`111942`: Fix SystemError in the TextIOWrapper constructor with non-"
"encodable \"errors\" argument in non-debug mode."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111942`: 在非调试模式下修复 TextIOWrapper 构造器中使用不可编码的“errors”参数时的 SystemError。"

#: ../NEWS:2991
msgid ""
":gh:`109538`: Issue warning message instead of having :class:`RuntimeError` "
"be displayed when event loop has already been closed at "
":meth:`StreamWriter.__del__`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109538`: 当事件循环在 :meth:`StreamWriter.__del__` 中已经关闭时，显示警告信息而不是显示 "
":class:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:2995
msgid ""
":gh:`111942`: Fix crashes in :meth:`io.TextIOWrapper.reconfigure` when pass "
"invalid arguments, e.g. non-string encoding."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111942`: 修复在 :meth:`io.TextIOWrapper.reconfigure` "
"中传递无效参数（例如非字符串编码）时导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:2998
msgid ""
":gh:`111460`: :mod:`curses`: restore wide character support (including "
":func:`curses.unget_wch` and :meth:`~curses.window.get_wch`) on macOS, which"
" was unavailable due to a regression in Python 3.12."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111460`: :mod:`curses`: 在 macOS 上恢复宽字符支持（包括 :func:`curses.unget_wch` 和 "
":meth:`~curses.window.get_wch`），这在 Python 3.12 中因回归问题而不可用。"

#: ../NEWS:3002
msgid ""
":gh:`103791`: :class:`contextlib.suppress` now supports suppressing "
"exceptions raised as part of a :exc:`BaseExceptionGroup`, in addition to the"
" recent support for :exc:`ExceptionGroup`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103791`: :class:`contextlib.suppress` 现在支持抑制作为 "
":exc:`BaseExceptionGroup` 一部分引发的异常，以及最近对 :exc:`ExceptionGroup` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:3006
msgid ""
":gh:`111804`: Remove posix.fallocate() under WASI as the underlying "
"posix_fallocate() is not available in WASI preview2."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111804`: 在 WASI 下移除 posix.fallocate()，因为底层的 posix_fallocate() 在 WASI "
"preview2 中不可用。"

#: ../NEWS:3009
msgid ""
":gh:`111841`: Fix truncating arguments on an embedded null character in "
":meth:`os.putenv` and :meth:`os.unsetenv` on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111841`: 修复在 Windows 上的 :meth:`os.putenv` 和 :meth:`os.unsetenv` "
"中在嵌入的空字符处截断参数的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3012
msgid ""
":gh:`111541`: Fix :mod:`doctest` for :exc:`SyntaxError` not-builtin "
"subclasses."
msgstr ":gh:`111541`: 修复 :mod:`doctest` 对于非内置子类的 :exc:`SyntaxError` 的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:3015
msgid ""
":gh:`110894`: Call loop exception handler for exceptions in "
"``client_connected_cb`` of :func:`asyncio.start_server` so that applications"
" can handle it. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110894`: 为 :func:`asyncio.start_server` 的 ``client_connected_cb`` "
"中的异常调用循环异常处理器，以便应用程序可以处理它。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3019
msgid ""
":gh:`111531`: Fix reference leaks in ``bind_class()`` and ``bind_all()`` "
"methods of :mod:`tkinter` widgets."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111531`: 修复 :mod:`tkinter` 小部件的 ``bind_class()`` 和 ``bind_all()`` "
"方法中的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3022
msgid ""
":gh:`111356`: Added :func:`io.text_encoding`, "
":data:`io.DEFAULT_BUFFER_SIZE`, and :class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder` to"
" ``io.__all__``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111356`: 将 :func:`io.text_encoding`、:data:`io.DEFAULT_BUFFER_SIZE` 和 "
":class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder` 添加到 ``io.__all__``。"

#: ../NEWS:3025
msgid ":gh:`111342`: Fixed typo in :func:`math.sumprod`."
msgstr ":gh:`111342`: 修正了 :func:`math.sumprod` 中的拼写错误。"

#: ../NEWS:3027
msgid ""
":gh:`68166`: Remove mention of not supported \"vsapi\" element type in "
":meth:`tkinter.ttk.Style.element_create`. Add tests for ``element_create()``"
" and other ``ttk.Style`` methods. Add examples for ``element_create()`` in "
"the documentation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`68166`: 在 :meth:`tkinter.ttk.Style.element_create` 中移除了对不支持的 \"vsapi\" "
"元素类型的提及。为 ``element_create()`` 和其他 ``ttk.Style`` 方法添加了测试。在文档中为 "
"``element_create()`` 添加了示例。"

#: ../NEWS:3032
msgid ""
":gh:`75666`: Fix the behavior of :mod:`tkinter` widget's ``unbind()`` method"
" with two arguments. Previously, ``widget.unbind(sequence, funcid)`` "
"destroyed the current binding for *sequence*, leaving *sequence* unbound, "
"and deleted the *funcid* command. Now it removes only *funcid* from the "
"binding for *sequence*, keeping other commands, and deletes the *funcid* "
"command. It leaves *sequence* unbound only if *funcid* was the last bound "
"command."
msgstr ""
":gh:`75666`: 修复了 :mod:`tkinter` 小部件的 ``unbind()`` "
"方法在两个参数下的行为。之前，``widget.unbind(sequence, funcid)`` 会销毁 *sequence* 的当前绑定，使 "
"*sequence* 无绑定，并删除 *funcid* 命令。现在它只从 *sequence* 的绑定中移除 *funcid*，保留其他命令，并删除 "
"*funcid* 命令。只有当 *funcid* 是最后一个绑定命令时，才会使 *sequence* 无绑定。"

#: ../NEWS:3040
msgid ""
":gh:`79033`: Another attempt at fixing :func:`asyncio.Server.wait_closed`. "
"It now blocks until both conditions are true: the server is closed, *and* "
"there are no more active connections. (This means that in some cases where "
"in 3.12.0 this function would *incorrectly* have returned immediately, it "
"will now block; in particular, when there are no active connections but the "
"server hasn't been closed yet.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`79033`: 又一次尝试修复 "
":func:`asyncio.Server.wait_closed`。现在它会阻塞，直到两个条件都为真：服务器已关闭，*并且* "
"没有更多活跃连接。（这意味着在某些情况下，在 3.12.0 中此函数 *错误地* 立即返回，现在将会阻塞；特别是，当没有活跃连接但服务器尚未关闭时。）"

#: ../NEWS:3047
msgid ""
":gh:`111295`: Fix :mod:`time` not checking for errors when initializing."
msgstr ":gh:`111295`: 修复 :mod:`time` 在初始化时不检查错误的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3049
msgid ":gh:`111253`: Add error checking during :mod:`!_socket` module init."
msgstr ":gh:`111253`: 在 :mod:`!_socket` 模块初始化期间添加错误检查。"

#: ../NEWS:3051
msgid ""
":gh:`111251`: Fix :mod:`_blake2` not checking for errors when initializing."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:3053
msgid ""
":gh:`111174`: Fix crash in :meth:`io.BytesIO.getbuffer` called repeatedly "
"for empty BytesIO."
msgstr ":gh:`111174`: 修复在为空 BytesIO 重复调用 :meth:`io.BytesIO.getbuffer` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3056
msgid ""
":gh:`111187`: Postpone removal version for locale.getdefaultlocale() to "
"Python 3.15."
msgstr ":gh:`111187`: 将 locale.getdefaultlocale() 的移除版本推迟到 Python 3.15。"

#: ../NEWS:3059
msgid ""
":gh:`111159`: Fix :mod:`doctest` output comparison for exceptions with "
"notes."
msgstr ":gh:`111159`: 修复 :mod:`doctest` 对带有注释的异常的输出比较。"

#: ../NEWS:3061
msgid ""
":gh:`110910`: Fix invalid state handling in :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` and "
":class:`asyncio.Timeout`. They now raise proper RuntimeError if they are "
"improperly used and are left in consistent state after this."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110910`: 修复 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` 和 :class:`asyncio.Timeout` "
"中的无效状态处理。如果使用不当，现在会正确抛出 RuntimeError，并在之后保持状态一致。"

#: ../NEWS:3065
msgid ":gh:`111092`: Make turtledemo run without default root enabled."
msgstr ":gh:`111092`: 使 turtledemo 在没有启用默认根的情况下运行。"

#: ../NEWS:3067
msgid ""
":gh:`110488`: Fix a couple of issues in :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_name`: "
"a single dot was incorrectly considered a valid name, and in "
":class:`PureWindowsPath`, a name with an NTFS alternate data stream, like "
"``a:b``, was incorrectly considered invalid."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110488`: 修复 :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.with_name` 中的几个问题：单个点被错误地认为是有效名称，而在"
" :class:`PureWindowsPath` 中，具有NTFS替代数据流的名称，如 ``a:b``，被错误地认为是无效的。"

#: ../NEWS:3072
msgid ""
":gh:`110392`: Fix :func:`tty.setraw` and :func:`tty.setcbreak`: previously "
"they returned partially modified list of the original tty attributes. "
":func:`tty.cfmakeraw` and :func:`tty.cfmakecbreak` now make a copy of the "
"list of special characters before modifying it."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110392`: 修复 :func:`tty.setraw` 和 :func:`tty.setcbreak`：之前它们返回了原始 tty "
"属性的部分修改列表。:func:`tty.cfmakeraw` 和 :func:`tty.cfmakecbreak` "
"现在在修改特殊字符列表之前先复制一份。"

#: ../NEWS:3077
msgid ""
":gh:`110590`: Fix a bug in :meth:`!_sre.compile` where :exc:`TypeError` "
"would be overwritten by :exc:`OverflowError` when the *code* argument was a "
"list of non-ints."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110590`: 修复 :meth:`!_sre.compile` 中的一个bug，当 *code* "
"参数是非整数列表时，:exc:`TypeError` 会被 :exc:`OverflowError` 覆盖。"

#: ../NEWS:3081
msgid ""
":gh:`65052`: Prevent :mod:`pdb` from crashing when trying to display "
"undisplayable objects"
msgstr ":gh:`65052`: 防止 :mod:`pdb` 在尝试显示不可显示对象时崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:3084
msgid ""
":gh:`110519`: Deprecation warning about non-integer number in :mod:`gettext`"
" now alwais refers to the line in the user code where gettext function or "
"method is used. Previously it could refer to a line in ``gettext`` code."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:3088
msgid ""
":gh:`110395`: Ensure that :func:`select.kqueue` objects correctly appear as "
"closed in forked children, to prevent operations on an invalid file "
"descriptor."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110395`: 确保 :func:`select.kqueue` 对象在 fork 的子进程中正确显示为关闭，以防止对无效文件描述符的操作。"

#: ../NEWS:3092
msgid ""
":gh:`110378`: :func:`~contextlib.contextmanager` and "
":func:`~contextlib.asynccontextmanager` context managers now close an "
"invalid underlying generator object that yields more then one value."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110378`: :func:`~contextlib.contextmanager` 和 "
":func:`~contextlib.asynccontextmanager` 上下文管理器现在会关闭一个产生多个值的无效底层生成器对象。"

#: ../NEWS:3096
msgid ""
":gh:`110365`: Fix :func:`termios.tcsetattr` bug that was overwritting "
"existing errors during parsing integers from ``term`` list."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:3099
msgid ""
":gh:`109653`: Fix a Python 3.12 regression in the import time of "
":mod:`random`. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109653`: 修复 :mod:`random` 在 Python 3.12 导入时间的回归。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3102
msgid ""
":gh:`110196`: Add ``__reduce__`` method to :class:`IPv6Address` in order to "
"keep ``scope_id``"
msgstr ""
":gh:`110196`: 向 :class:`IPv6Address` 添加 ``__reduce__`` 方法以保留 ``scope_id``。"

#: ../NEWS:3105
msgid ""
":gh:`110036`: On Windows, multiprocessing ``Popen.terminate()`` now catchs "
":exc:`PermissionError` and get the process exit code. If the process is "
"still running, raise again the :exc:`PermissionError`. Otherwise, the "
"process terminated as expected: store its exit code. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:3111
msgid ""
":gh:`110038`: Fixed an issue that caused :meth:`KqueueSelector.select` to "
"not return all the ready events in some cases when a file descriptor is "
"registered for both read and write."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110038`: 修复了一个问题，该问题导致 :meth:`KqueueSelector.select` "
"在某些情况下当文件描述符被同时注册为读和写时，不返回所有就绪的事件。"

#: ../NEWS:3115
msgid ""
":gh:`109631`: :mod:`re` functions such as :func:`re.findall`, "
":func:`re.split`, :func:`re.search` and :func:`re.sub` which perform short "
"repeated matches can now be interrupted by user."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109631`: 现在可以中断执行短重复匹配的 :mod:`re` 函数，如 :func:`re.findall`, "
":func:`re.split`, :func:`re.search` 和 :func:`re.sub`。"

#: ../NEWS:3119
msgid ""
":gh:`109747`: Improve errors for unsupported look-behind patterns. Now "
"re.error is raised instead of OverflowError or RuntimeError for too large "
"width of look-behind pattern."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109747`: 改进对不支持的后视模式的错误提示。现在对于后视模式宽度过大的情况，会抛出 re.error 而不是 "
"OverflowError 或 RuntimeError。"

#: ../NEWS:3123
msgid ""
":gh:`109818`: Fix :func:`reprlib.recursive_repr` not copying "
"``__type_params__`` from decorated function."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109818`: 修复 :func:`reprlib.recursive_repr` 不复制装饰函数的 ``__type_params__``"
" 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3126
msgid ""
":gh:`109047`: :mod:`concurrent.futures`: The *executor manager thread* now "
"catches exceptions when adding an item to the *call queue*. During Python "
"finalization, creating a new thread can now raise :exc:`RuntimeError`. Catch"
" the exception and call ``terminate_broken()`` in this case. Patch by Victor"
" Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109047`: :mod:`concurrent.futures`: *executor manager thread* 现在在向 "
"*call queue* 添加项时捕获异常。在 Python 终止期间，创建新线程现在可能抛出 "
":exc:`RuntimeError`。在这种情况下捕获异常并调用 ``terminate_broken()``。由 Victor Stinner "
"提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3132
msgid ""
":gh:`109782`: Ensure the signature of :func:`os.path.isdir` is identical on "
"all platforms. Patch by Amin Alaee."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109782`: 确保 :func:`os.path.isdir` 的签名在所有平台上相同。由 Amin Alaee 提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3135
msgid ""
":gh:`109590`: :func:`shutil.which` will prefer files with an extension in "
"``PATHEXT`` if the given mode includes ``os.X_OK`` on win32. If no "
"``PATHEXT`` match is found, a file without an extension in ``PATHEXT`` can "
"be returned. This change will have :func:`shutil.which` act more similarly "
"to previous behavior in Python 3.11."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109590`: 在win32上，如果给定的模式包含 ``os.X_OK``，:func:`shutil.which` "
"将优先选择``PATHEXT``中有扩展名的文件。如果没有找到 ``PATHEXT`` 匹配项，可以返回一个没有 ``PATHEXT`` "
"扩展名的文件。这一变化将使 :func:`shutil.which` 的行为更类似于Python 3.11中的先前行为。"

#: ../NEWS:3141
msgid ""
":gh:`109786`: Fix possible reference leaks and crash when re-enter the "
"``__next__()`` method of :class:`itertools.pairwise`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109786`: 修复了重新进入 :class:`itertools.pairwise` 的 ``__next__()`` "
"方法时可能出现的引用泄漏和崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3144
msgid ""
":gh:`109593`: Avoid deadlocking on a reentrant call to the multiprocessing "
"resource tracker. Such a reentrant call, though unlikely, can happen if a GC"
" pass invokes the finalizer for a multiprocessing object such as SemLock."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109593`: "
"避免在多进程资源跟踪器的重入调用上死锁。虽然不太可能，但如果GC传递调用了如SemLock这样的多进程对象的终结器，就可能发生这种重入调用。"

#: ../NEWS:3149
msgid ""
":gh:`109613`: Fix :func:`os.stat` and :meth:`os.DirEntry.stat`: check for "
"exceptions. Previously, on Python built in debug mode, these functions could"
" trigger a fatal Python error (and abort the process) when a function "
"succeeded with an exception set. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109613`: 修复 :func:`os.stat` 和 "
":meth:`os.DirEntry.stat`：检查异常。以前，在Python调试模式下构建时，当函数成功但设置了异常时，这些函数可能会触发致命的Python错误（并中止进程）。由Victor"
" Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3154
msgid ""
":gh:`109375`: The :mod:`pdb` ``alias`` command now prevents registering "
"aliases without arguments."
msgstr ":gh:`109375`: :mod:`pdb` 的 ``alias`` 命令现在阻止注册没有参数的别名。"

#: ../NEWS:3157
msgid ""
":gh:`107219`: Fix a race condition in ``concurrent.futures``. When a process"
" in the process pool was terminated abruptly (while the future was running "
"or pending), close the connection write end. If the call queue is blocked on"
" sending bytes to a worker process, closing the connection write end "
"interrupts the send, so the queue can be closed. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`107219`: 修复了 ``concurrent.futures`` 中的竞争条件。当进程池中的进程被突然终止时（而 future "
"正在运行或挂起），关闭连接的写入端。如果调用队列在发送字节到工作进程时被阻塞，关闭连接的写入端会中断发送，因此队列可以被关闭。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3163
msgid ""
":gh:`50644`: Attempts to pickle or create a shallow or deep copy of "
":mod:`codecs` streams now raise a TypeError. Previously, copying failed with"
" a RecursionError, while pickling produced wrong results that eventually "
"caused unpickling to fail with a RecursionError."
msgstr ""
":gh:`50644`: 现在尝试 pickle 或创建 :mod:`codecs` 流的浅拷贝或深拷贝会引发 TypeError。之前，复制会因 "
"RecursionError 失败，而 pickle 会产生错误的结果，最终导致解 pickle 时因 RecursionError 失败。"

#: ../NEWS:3168
msgid ""
":gh:`108987`: Fix :func:`_thread.start_new_thread` race condition. If a "
"thread is created during Python finalization, the newly spawned thread now "
"exits immediately instead of trying to access freed memory and lead to a "
"crash. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108987`: 修复 :func:`_thread.start_new_thread` 的竞争条件。如果在 Python "
"终止过程中创建了一个线程，新生成的线程现在会立即退出，而不是尝试访问已释放的内存并导致崩溃。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3173
msgid ""
":gh:`108791`: Improved error handling in :mod:`pdb` command line interface, "
"making it produce more concise error messages."
msgstr ":gh:`108791`: 改进了 :mod:`pdb` 命令行接口中的错误处理，使其产生更简洁的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:3176
msgid ":gh:`105829`: Fix concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor deadlock"
msgstr ":gh:`105829`: 修复 concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor 死锁"

#: ../NEWS:3178
msgid ""
":gh:`106584`: Fix exit code for ``unittest`` if all tests are skipped. Patch"
" by Egor Eliseev."
msgstr ":gh:`106584`: 如果所有测试都被跳过，修复 ``unittest`` 的退出代码。由Egor Eliseev提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3181
msgid ""
":gh:`102956`: Fix returning of empty byte strings after seek in zipfile "
"module"
msgstr ":gh:`102956`: 修复 zipfile 模块中 seek 后返回空字节字符串的问题"

#: ../NEWS:3184
msgid ""
":gh:`84867`: :class:`unittest.TestLoader` no longer loads test cases from "
"exact :class:`unittest.TestCase` and :class:`unittest.FunctionTestCase` "
"classes."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84867`: :class:`unittest.TestLoader` 不再从确切的 :class:`unittest.TestCase` "
"和 :class:`unittest.FunctionTestCase` 类加载测试用例。"

#: ../NEWS:3188
msgid ""
":gh:`91133`: Fix a bug in :class:`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` cleanup, "
"which now no longer dereferences symlinks when working around file system "
"permission errors."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91133`: 修复了 :class:`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` "
"清理中的一个错误，现在在解决文件系统权限错误时不再解引用符号链接。"

#: ../NEWS:3192
msgid ""
":gh:`73561`: Omit the interface scope from an IPv6 address when used as Host"
" header by :mod:`http.client`."
msgstr ":gh:`73561`: 当 :mod:`http.client` 使用IPv6地址作为Host头时，省略接口范围。"

#: ../NEWS:3195
msgid ""
":gh:`86826`: :mod:`zipinfo` now supports the full range of values in the TZ "
"string determined by RFC 8536 and detects all invalid formats. Both Python "
"and C implementations now raise exceptions of the same type on invalid data."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86826`: :mod:`zipinfo` 现在支持RFC "
"8536确定的TZ字符串中的全部值范围，并检测所有无效格式。Python和C实现现在在无效数据上抛出相同类型的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:3200
msgid ""
":issue:`43153`: On Windows, ``tempfile.TemporaryDirectory`` previously "
"masked a ``PermissionError`` with ``NotADirectoryError`` during directory "
"cleanup. It now correctly raises ``PermissionError`` if errors are not "
"ignored. Patch by Andrei Kulakov and Ken Jin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43153`: 在 Windows 上，``tempfile.TemporaryDirectory`` 之前在目录清理过程中将 "
"``PermissionError`` 掩盖为 ``NotADirectoryError``。现在如果错误未被忽略，它会正确地引发 "
"``PermissionError``。由 Andrei Kulakov 和 Ken Jin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3205
msgid ""
":issue:`35332`: The :func:`shutil.rmtree` function now ignores errors when "
"calling :func:`os.close` when *ignore_errors* is ``True``, and "
":func:`os.close` no longer retried after error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35332`: :func:`shutil.rmtree` 函数现在在 *ignore_errors* 为 ``True`` 时忽略调用"
" :func:`os.close` 时的错误，并且 :func:`os.close` 在出错后不再重试。"

#: ../NEWS:3209
msgid ""
":issue:`41422`: Fixed memory leaks of :class:`pickle.Pickler` and "
":class:`pickle.Unpickler` involving cyclic references via the internal memo "
"mapping."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41422`: 修复了 :class:`pickle.Pickler` 和 :class:`pickle.Unpickler` "
"通过内部备忘录映射涉及循环引用的内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:3213
msgid ""
":issue:`40262`: The :meth:`ssl.SSLSocket.recv_into` method no longer "
"requires the *buffer* argument to implement ``__len__`` and supports buffers"
" with arbitrary item size."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40262`: :meth:`ssl.SSLSocket.recv_into` 方法不再要求 *buffer* 参数实现 "
"``__len__``，并且支持具有任意项目大小的缓冲区。"

#: ../NEWS:3220
msgid ""
":gh:`111699`: Relocate ``smtpd`` deprecation notice to its own section "
"rather than under ``locale`` in What's New in Python 3.12 document"
msgstr ""
":gh:`111699`: 在 Python 3.12 文档的“新变化”中，将 ``smtpd`` 的弃用通知从其自己的部分移至 ``locale`` "
"下。"

#: ../NEWS:3223
msgid ""
":gh:`108826`: :mod:`dis` module command-line interface is now mentioned in "
"documentation."
msgstr ":gh:`108826`: :mod:`dis` 模块的命令行界面现在在文档中被提及。"

#: ../NEWS:3229
msgid ""
":gh:`112769`: The tests now correctly compare zlib version when "
":const:`zlib.ZLIB_RUNTIME_VERSION` contains non-integer suffixes. For "
"example zlib-ng defines the version as ``1.3.0.zlib-ng``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112769`: 现在，当 :const:`zlib.ZLIB_RUNTIME_VERSION` 包含非整数后缀时，测试正确比较 zlib "
"版本。例如，zlib-ng 将版本定义为 ``1.3.0.zlib-ng``。"

#: ../NEWS:3233
msgid ""
":gh:`110367`: Make regrtest ``--verbose3`` option compatible with "
"``--huntrleaks -jN`` options. The ``./python -m test -j1 -R 3:3 --verbose3``"
" command now works as expected. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110367`: 使regrtest的 ``--verbose3`` 选项与 ``--huntrleaks -jN`` "
"选项兼容。``./python -m test -j1 -R 3:3 --verbose3``命令现在按预期工作。由Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3237
msgid ""
":gh:`111165`: Remove no longer used functions ``run_unittest()`` and "
"``run_doctest()`` from the :mod:`test.support` module."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111165`: 从 :mod:`test.support` 模块中移除不再使用的函数 ``run_unittest()`` "
"和``run_doctest()``。"

#: ../NEWS:3240
msgid ""
":gh:`110932`: Fix regrtest if the ``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` environment variable"
" is defined: use the variable value as the random seed. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110932`: 如果定义了 ``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` "
"环境变量，修复regrtest：使用变量值作为随机种子。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3244
msgid ""
":gh:`110995`: test_gdb: Fix detection of gdb built without Python scripting "
"support. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ":gh:`110995`: test_gdb: 修复对未构建Python脚本支持的gdb的检测。由Victor Stinner提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3247
msgid ""
":gh:`110918`: Test case matching patterns specified by options ``--match``, "
"``--ignore``, ``--matchfile`` and ``--ignorefile`` are now tested in the "
"order of specification, and the last match determines whether the test case "
"be run or ignored."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110918`: 现在按照指定的顺序测试由选项 ``--match``、``--ignore``、``--matchfile`` "
"和``--ignorefile``指定的测试用例匹配模式，最后一个匹配决定测试用例是否运行或被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:3252
msgid ""
":gh:`110647`: Fix test_stress_modifying_handlers() of test_signal. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110647`: 修复 test_signal 的 test_stress_modifying_handlers()。由Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3255
msgid ""
":gh:`103053`: Fix test_tools.test_freeze on FreeBSD: run \"make distclean\" "
"instead of \"make clean\" in the copied source directory to remove also the "
"\"python\" program. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103053`: 在FreeBSD上修复 test_tools.test_freeze：在复制的源代码目录中运行\"make "
"distclean\"而不是\"make clean\"以同时删除\"python\"程序。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3259
msgid ""
":gh:`110167`: Fix a deadlock in test_socket when server fails with a timeout"
" but the client is still running in its thread. Don't hold a lock to call "
"cleanup functions in doCleanups(). One of the cleanup function waits until "
"the client completes, whereas the client could deadlock if it called "
"addCleanup() in such situation. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110167`: 修复 test_socket 中的死锁问题，当服务器因超时失败但客户端仍在自己的线程中运行时。不要在 "
"doCleanups() 中持有锁调用清理函数。其中一个清理函数会等待客户端完成，而如果客户端在这种情况下调用 "
"addCleanup()，可能会导致死锁。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3265
msgid ":gh:`110388`: Add tests for :mod:`tty`."
msgstr ":gh:`110388`: 为 :mod:`tty` 添加测试。"

#: ../NEWS:3267
msgid ":gh:`81002`: Add tests for :mod:`termios`."
msgstr ":gh:`81002`: 为 :mod:`termios` 添加测试。"

#: ../NEWS:3269
msgid ""
":gh:`110267`: Add tests for pickling and copying PyStructSequence objects. "
"Patched by Xuehai Pan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110267`: 添加对 PyStructSequence 对象的 pickle 和 copy 操作的测试。由 Xuehai Pan "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3272
msgid ""
":gh:`110031`: Skip test_threading tests using thread+fork if Python is built"
" with Address Sanitizer (ASAN). Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110031`: 如果 Python 是用地址消毒剂 (ASAN) 构建的，跳过使用 thread+fork 的 test_threading"
" 测试。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3275
msgid ""
":gh:`110088`: Fix test_asyncio timeouts: don't measure the maximum duration,"
" a test should not measure a CI performance. Only measure the minimum "
"duration when a task has a timeout or delay. Add ``CLOCK_RES`` to "
"``test_asyncio.utils``. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110088`: 修复 test_asyncio 超时：不测量最大持续时间，测试不应测量 CI "
"性能。仅在有任务有超时或延迟时测量最小持续时间。向 ``test_asyncio.utils`` 添加 ``CLOCK_RES``。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3280
msgid ""
":gh:`109974`: Fix race conditions in test_threading lock tests. Wait until a"
" condition is met rather than using :func:`time.sleep` with a hardcoded "
"number of seconds. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109974`: 修复 test_threading 锁测试中的竞态条件。等待条件满足，而不是使用带有硬编码秒数的 "
":func:`time.sleep`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3284
msgid ""
":gh:`110033`: Fix ``test_interprocess_signal()`` of ``test_signal``. Make "
"sure that the ``subprocess.Popen`` object is deleted before the test raising"
" an exception in a signal handler. Otherwise, ``Popen.__del__()`` can get "
"the exception which is logged as ``Exception ignored in: ...`` and the test "
"fails. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`110033`: 修复 ``test_signal`` 的 "
"``test_interprocess_signal()``。确保在信号处理程序中引发异常之前删除 ``subprocess.Popen`` "
"对象。否则，``Popen.__del__()`` 可能会获取到被记录为 ``Exception ignored in: ...`` "
"的异常，导致测试失败。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3290
msgid ""
":gh:`109594`: Fix test_timeout() of test_concurrent_futures.test_wait. "
"Remove the future which may or may not complete depending if it takes longer"
" than the timeout ot not. Keep the second future which does not complete "
"before wait() timeout. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:3295
msgid ""
":gh:`109972`: Split test_gdb.py file into a test_gdb package made of "
"multiple tests, so tests can now be run in parallel. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109972`: 将 test_gdb.py 文件拆分为由多个测试组成的 test_gdb 包，现在可以并行运行测试。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3298
msgid ""
":gh:`103053`: Skip test_freeze_simple_script() of test_tools.test_freeze if "
"Python is built with ``./configure --enable-optimizations``, which means "
"with Profile Guided Optimization (PGO): it just makes the test too slow. The"
" freeze tool is tested by many other CIs with other (faster) compiler flags."
" Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103053`: 如果 Python 是用 ``./configure --enable-optimizations`` 构建的（意味着启用了"
" Profile Guided Optimization (PGO)），则跳过 test_tools.test_freeze 的 "
"test_freeze_simple_script()：这只会使测试变得太慢。冻结工具由许多其他 CI 使用其他（更快的）编译器标志进行测试。由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3304
msgid ""
":gh:`109580`: Skip ``test_perf_profiler`` if Python is built with ASAN, MSAN"
" or UBSAN sanitizer. Python does crash randomly in this test on such build. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`109580`: 如果 Python 是用 ASAN、MSAN 或 UBSAN 消毒剂构建的，则跳过 "
"``test_perf_profiler``。在这种构建上，Python 在这个测试中会随机崩溃。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3308 ../NEWS:3525
msgid ""
":gh:`104736`: Fix test_gdb on Python built with LLVM clang 16 on Linux "
"ppc64le (ex: Fedora 38). Search patterns in gdb \"bt\" command output to "
"detect when gdb fails to retrieve the traceback. For example, skip a test if"
" ``Backtrace stopped: frame did not save the PC`` is found. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104736`: 修复在 Linux ppc64le 上用 LLVM clang 16 构建的 Python 上的 test_gdb（例如 "
"Fedora 38）。在 gdb \"bt\" 命令输出中搜索模式以检测 gdb 是否未能检索到回溯。例如，如果找到 ``Backtrace "
"stopped: frame did not save the PC`` 则跳过测试。补丁由 Victor Stinner 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:3314
msgid ""
":gh:`108927`: Fixed order dependence in running tests in the same process "
"when a test that has submodules (e.g. test_importlib) follows a test that "
"imports its submodule (e.g. test_importlib.util) and precedes a test (e.g. "
"test_unittest or test_compileall) that uses that submodule."
msgstr ""
":gh:`108927`: 修复了在同一进程中运行测试时的顺序依赖问题，当一个具有子模块的测试（如 "
"test_importlib）跟随一个导入其子模块的测试（如 test_importlib.util）并先于一个使用该子模块的测试（如 "
"test_unittest 或 test_compileall）时。"

#: ../NEWS:3322
msgid ""
":gh:`112088`: Add ``Tools/build/regen-configure.sh`` script to regenerate "
"the ``configure`` with an Ubuntu container image. The "
"``quay.io/tiran/cpython_autoconf:271`` container image "
"(`tiran/cpython_autoconf <https://github.com/tiran/cpython_autoconf>`_) is "
"no longer used. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`112088`: 添加 ``Tools/build/regen-configure.sh`` "
"脚本以使用Ubuntu容器镜像重新生成``configure``。不再使用 ``quay.io/tiran/cpython_autoconf:271``"
" 容器镜像(`tiran/cpython_autoconf "
"<https://github.com/tiran/cpython_autoconf>`_)。由Victor Stinner提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3328
msgid ""
":gh:`111046`: For wasi-threads, memory is now exported to fix compatibility "
"issues with some wasm runtimes."
msgstr ":gh:`111046`: 对于wasi-threads，现在导出内存以修复与某些wasm运行时的兼容性问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3331
msgid ""
":gh:`103053`: \"make check-clean-src\" now also checks if the \"python\" "
"program is found in the source directory: fail with an error if it does "
"exist. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103053`: \"make check-clean-src\" 现在也会检查源目录中是否找到 \"python\" "
"程序：如果确实存在则失败并报错。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:3335
msgid ""
":gh:`109191`: Fix compile error when building with recent versions of "
"libedit."
msgstr ":gh:`109191`: 修复在使用最新版本 libedit 构建时的编译错误。"

#: ../NEWS:3341
msgid ""
":gh:`111856`: Fixes :func:`~os.fstat` on file systems that do not support "
"file ID requests. This includes FAT32 and exFAT."
msgstr ":gh:`111856`: 修复在不支持文件ID请求的文件系统上的 :func:`~os.fstat`。这包括FAT32和exFAT。"

#: ../NEWS:3344
msgid ""
":gh:`111293`: Fix :data:`os.DirEntry.inode` dropping higher 64 bits of a "
"file id on some filesystems on Windows."
msgstr ""
":gh:`111293`: 修复 :data:`os.DirEntry.inode` 在Windows上某些文件系统中丢弃文件ID的高64位的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:3347
msgid ""
":gh:`110913`: WindowsConsoleIO now correctly chunks large buffers without "
"splitting up UTF-8 sequences."
msgstr ":gh:`110913`: WindowsConsoleIO现在正确地分块大缓冲区而不拆分UTF-8序列。"

#: ../NEWS:3350
msgid ""
":gh:`110437`: Allows overriding the source of VC redistributables so that "
"releases can be guaranteed to never downgrade between updates."
msgstr ":gh:`110437`: 允许覆盖 VC 可再发行组件的来源，以确保在更新之间永远不会降级。"

#: ../NEWS:3353
msgid ":gh:`109286`: Update Windows installer to use SQLite 3.43.1."
msgstr ":gh:`109286`: 更新 Windows 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.43.1。"

