msgstr ""
":gh:`98963`: 通过忽略在此类类上设置文档字符串的失败，恢复 :class:`property` 子类定义 ``__slots__`` "
"或以其他方式无字典的能力。此行为在 3.12beta1 中出现了倒退。在之前没有的情况下出现的 :exc:`AttributeError` "
"对现有代码造成了干扰。"

#: ../NEWS:4353
msgid ""
":gh:`105194`: Do not escape with backslashes f-string format specifiers. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`105194`: 不要对f-string格式说明符使用反斜杠转义。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4356
msgid ""
":gh:`105162`: Fixed bug in generator.close()/throw() where an inner iterator"
" would be ignored when the outer iterator was instrumented."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105162`: 修复了generator.close()/throw()中的一个错误，当外部迭代器被检测时，内部迭代器会被忽略。"

#: ../NEWS:4359
msgid ""
":gh:`105164`: Ensure annotations are set up correctly if the only annotation"
" in a block is within a :keyword:`match` block. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105164`: 确保如果一个块中唯一的注解位于 :keyword:`match` 块内，则正确设置注解。由Jelle "
"Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4362
msgid ""
":gh:`104799`: Attributes of :mod:`ast` nodes that are lists now default to "
"the empty list if omitted. This means that some code that previously raised "
":exc:`TypeError` when the AST node was used will now proceed with the empty "
"list instead. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104799`: :mod:`ast` 节点的属性如果是列表，现在如果省略则默认为空列表。这意味着一些以前在使用AST节点时会引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 的代码现在将使用空列表继续执行。由Jelle Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4367
msgid ""
":gh:`105035`: Fix :func:`super` calls on types with custom "
":attr:`tp_getattro` implementation (e.g. meta-types.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:4370
msgid ""
":gh:`105017`: Show CRLF lines in the tokenize string attribute in both NL "
"and NEWLINE tokens. Patch by Marta Gómez."
msgstr ":gh:`105017`: 在NL和NEWLINE标记中显示tokenize字符串属性中的CRLF行。由Marta Gómez提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4373
msgid ""
":gh:`105013`: Fix handling of multiline parenthesized lambdas in "
":func:`inspect.getsource`. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`105013`: 修复 :func:`inspect.getsource` 中多行括号lambda的处理。由Pablo "
"Galindo提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4376
msgid ""
":gh:`105017`: Do not include an additional final ``NL`` token when parsing "
"files having CRLF lines. Patch by Marta Gómez."
msgstr ":gh:`105017`: 解析具有CRLF行的文件时，不包含额外的最终 ``NL`` 标记。由Marta Gómez提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4379
msgid ""
":gh:`104976`: Ensure that trailing ``DEDENT`` :class:`tokenize.TokenInfo` "
"objects emitted by the :mod:`tokenize` module are reported as in Python "
"3.11. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`104976`: 确保 :mod:`tokenize` 模块发出的尾随 ``DEDENT`` "
":class:`tokenize.TokenInfo` 对象如Python 3.11中报告的那样。由Pablo Galindo提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4383
msgid ""
":gh:`104972`: Ensure that the ``line`` attribute in "
":class:`tokenize.TokenInfo` objects in the :mod:`tokenize` module are always"
" correct. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`104972`: 确保 :mod:`tokenize` 模块中 :class:`tokenize.TokenInfo` 对象的 "
"``line`` 属性始终正确。由Pablo Galindo提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4387
msgid ""
":gh:`104955`: Fix signature for the new :meth:`~object.__release_buffer__` "
"slot. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104955`: 修复新的 :meth:`~object.__release_buffer__` 槽的签名。由Jelle "
"Zijlstra提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4390
msgid ""
":gh:`104690`: Starting new threads and process creation through "
":func:`os.fork` during interpreter shutdown (such as from :mod:`atexit` "
"handlers) is no longer supported.  It can lead to race condition between the"
" main Python runtime thread freeing thread states while internal "
":mod:`threading` routines are trying to allocate and use the state of just "
"created threads. Or forked children trying to use the mid-shutdown runtime "
"and thread state in the child process."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104690`: 在解释器关闭期间（例如从 :mod:`atexit` 处理程序中）启动新线程和通过 :func:`os.fork` "
"创建进程不再受支持。这可能导致主Python运行时线程释放线程状态与内部 :mod:`threading` "
"例程尝试分配和使用刚创建线程的状态之间的竞争条件。或者fork的子进程尝试在子进程中使用关闭中的运行时和线程状态。"

#: ../NEWS:4398
msgid ""
":gh:`104879`: Fix crash when accessing the ``__module__`` attribute of type "
"aliases defined outside a module. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104879`: 修复访问在模块外定义的类型别名的 ``__module__`` 属性时的崩溃。由Jelle Zijlstra提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4401
msgid ""
":gh:`104825`: Tokens emitted by the :mod:`tokenize` module do not include an"
" implicit ``\\n`` character in the ``line`` attribute anymore. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`104825`: :mod:`tokenize` 模块发出的标记不再在 ``line`` 属性中包含隐式的 ``\\n`` 字符。由Pablo"
" Galindo提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4408
msgid ""
":gh:`105280`: Fix bug where ``isinstance([], collections.abc.Mapping)`` "
"could evaluate to ``True`` if garbage collection happened at the wrong time."
" The bug was caused by changes to the implementation of "
":class:`typing.Protocol` in Python 3.12."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105280`: 修复了如果在错误时间发生垃圾回收，``isinstance([], collections.abc.Mapping)`` "
"可能评估为 ``True`` 的错误。该错误是由 Python 3.12 中 :class:`typing.Protocol` 实现的更改引起的。"

#: ../NEWS:4413
msgid ""
":gh:`105239`: Fix longstanding bug where ``issubclass(object, "
"typing.Protocol)`` would evaluate to ``True`` in some edge cases. Patch by "
"Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105239`: 修复了一个长期存在的错误，即在某些边缘情况下 ``issubclass(object, typing.Protocol)``"
" 会评估为 ``True``。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4417
msgid ""
":gh:`105080`: Fixed inconsistent signature on derived classes for "
":func:`inspect.signature`"
msgstr ":gh:`105080`: 修复了 :func:`inspect.signature` 在派生类上的不一致签名问题"

#: ../NEWS:4420
msgid ""
":gh:`105144`: Fix a recent regression in the :mod:`typing` module. The "
"regression meant that doing ``class Foo(X, typing.Protocol)``, where ``X`` "
"was a class that had :class:`abc.ABCMeta` as its metaclass, would then cause"
" subsequent ``isinstance(1, X)`` calls to erroneously raise "
":exc:`TypeError`. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`105144`: 修复了 :mod:`typing` 模块中最近的回归问题。这个回归问题意味着，当执行 ``class Foo(X, "
"typing.Protocol)``，其中 ``X`` 是一个以 :class:`abc.ABCMeta` 作为其元类的类时，会导致随后的 "
"``isinstance(1, X)`` 调用错误地引发 :exc:`TypeError`。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4426
msgid ""
":gh:`105113`: Improve performance of :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.match` by "
"compiling an :class:`re.Pattern` object for the entire pattern."
msgstr ""

