#: ../NEWS:4438
msgid ""
":gh:`104935`: Fix bugs with the interaction between "
":func:`typing.runtime_checkable` and :class:`typing.Generic` that were "
"introduced by the :pep:`695` implementation. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`104935`: 修复由 :pep:`695` 实现引入的 :func:`typing.runtime_checkable` 和 "
":class:`typing.Generic` 之间交互的 bug。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:4442
msgid ""
":gh:`104874`: Document the ``__name__`` and ``__supertype__`` attributes of "
