#: ../NEWS:4445
msgid ""
":gh:`104799`: Adjust the location of the (see :pep:`695`) ``type_params`` "
"field on :class:`ast.ClassDef`, :class:`ast.AsyncFunctionDef`, and "
":class:`ast.FunctionDef` to better preserve backward compatibility. Patch by"
