":gh:`102192`: 弃用 ``_PyErr_ChainExceptions``，推荐使用 "
"``_PyErr_ChainExceptions1``。"

#: ../NEWS:5472
msgid ""
":gh:`89987`: Reduce the number of inline :opcode:`CACHE` entries for "
":opcode:`BINARY_SUBSCR`."
msgstr ":gh:`89987`: 减少 :opcode:`BINARY_SUBSCR` 的内联 :opcode:`CACHE` 条目数量。"

#: ../NEWS:5475
msgid ""
":gh:`102859`: Removed :opcode:`!JUMP_IF_FALSE_OR_POP` and "
":opcode:`!JUMP_IF_TRUE_OR_POP` instructions."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102859`: 移除了 :opcode:`!JUMP_IF_FALSE_OR_POP` 和 "
