#: ../NEWS:5678
msgid ""
":gh:`96931`: Fix incorrect results from :meth:`ssl.SSLSocket.shared_ciphers`"
msgstr ":gh:`96931`: 修复了 :meth:`ssl.SSLSocket.shared_ciphers` 返回不正确结果的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5680
msgid ""
":gh:`95495`: When built against OpenSSL 3.0, the :mod:`ssl` module had a bug"
" where it reported unauthenticated EOFs (i.e. without close_notify) as a "
"clean TLS-level EOF. It now raises :exc:`~ssl.SSLEOFError`, matching the "
"behavior in previous versions of OpenSSL. The "
":attr:`~ssl.SSLContext.options` attribute on :class:`~ssl.SSLContext` also "
"no longer includes :const:`~ssl.OP_IGNORE_UNEXPECTED_EOF` by default. This "
"option may be set to specify the previous OpenSSL 3.0 behavior."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95495`: 当针对 OpenSSL 3.0 构建时，:mod:`ssl` 模块存在一个错误，该错误将未经认证的 EOF（即没有 "
"close_notify）报告为干净的 TLS 级 EOF。现在它会引发 :exc:`~ssl.SSLEOFError`，与之前版本的 OpenSSL "
"行为一致。:class:`~ssl.SSLContext` 上的 :attr:`~ssl.SSLContext.options` 属性默认也不再包括 "
":const:`~ssl.OP_IGNORE_UNEXPECTED_EOF`。可以设置此选项以指定之前的 OpenSSL 3.0 行为。"

#: ../NEWS:5688
msgid ""
":gh:`94684`: Now :func:`uuid.uuid3` and :func:`uuid.uuid5` functions support"
" :class:`bytes` objects as their *name* argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94684`: 现在 :func:`uuid.uuid3` 和 :func:`uuid.uuid5` 函数支持 :class:`bytes` "
"对象作为它们的 *name* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:5691
msgid ""
":gh:`94440`: Fix a :mod:`concurrent.futures.process` bug where "
"``ProcessPoolExecutor`` shutdown could hang after a future has been quickly "
"submitted and canceled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94440`: 修复了 :mod:`concurrent.futures.process` 中的一个错误，即在快速提交并取消一个 future"
" 后，``ProcessPoolExecutor`` 关闭可能会挂起。"

#: ../NEWS:5695
msgid ""
":gh:`72346`: Added deprecation warning to *isdst* parameter of "
":func:`email.utils.localtime`."
msgstr ":gh:`72346`: 向 :func:`email.utils.localtime` 的 *isdst* 参数添加了弃用警告。"

#: ../NEWS:5698
msgid ""
":issue:`36305`: Fix handling of Windows filenames that resemble drives, such"
