msgstr ""
":issue:`36305`: 在 :mod:`pathlib` 中修复了对类似于驱动器的 Windows 文件名（如 ``./a:b``）的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:5704
msgid ""
":gh:`103112`: Add docstring to :meth:`http.client.HTTPResponse.read` to fix "
"``pydoc`` output."
msgstr ""
":gh:`103112`: 向 :meth:`http.client.HTTPResponse.read` 添加了文档字符串以修复 ``pydoc`` "
