#: ../NEWS:5747
msgid "Python 3.12.0 alpha 6"
msgstr "Python 3.12.0 alpha 6"

#: ../NEWS:5749
msgid "*Release date: 2023-03-07*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2023-03-07*"

#: ../NEWS:5754
msgid ""
":gh:`99108`: Replace builtin hashlib implementations of MD5 and SHA1 with "
"verified ones from the HACL* project."
msgstr ":gh:`99108`: 用来自 HACL* 项目的已验证实现替换内置的 MD5 和 SHA1 哈希库实现。"

#: ../NEWS:5757
msgid ""
":gh:`101727`: Updated the OpenSSL version used in Windows and macOS binary "
"release builds to 1.1.1t to address :cve:`2023-0286`, :cve:`2022-4303`, and "
":cve:`2022-4303` per `the OpenSSL 2023-02-07 security advisory "
"<https://openssl-library.org/news/secadv/20230207.txt>`_."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101727`: 将 Windows 和 macOS 二进制发布构建中使用的 OpenSSL 版本更新至 1.1.1t，以解决 "
":cve:`2023-0286`、:cve:`2022-4303` 和 :cve:`2022-4303`，根据 `OpenSSL 2023-02-07 "
"安全公告 <https://openssl-library.org/news/secadv/20230207.txt>`_。"

#: ../NEWS:5762
msgid ""
":gh:`99108`: Replace the builtin :mod:`hashlib` implementations of SHA2-384 "
"and SHA2-512 originally from LibTomCrypt with formally verified, side-"
"channel resistant code from the `HACL* <https://github.com/hacl-star/hacl-"
"star/>`_ project. The builtins remain a fallback only used when OpenSSL does"
" not provide them."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99108`: 用来自 `HACL* <https://github.com/hacl-star/hacl-star/>`_ "
"项目的正式验证、抗侧信道攻击的代码替换内置的 :mod:`hashlib` 中原本来自 LibTomCrypt 的 SHA2-384 和 "
"SHA2-512 实现。内置实现仅在 OpenSSL 不提供时才作为后备使用。"

#: ../NEWS:5768
msgid ""
":gh:`101283`: :class:`subprocess.Popen` now uses a safer approach to find "
"``cmd.exe`` when launching with ``shell=True``. Patch by Eryk Sun, based on "
"a patch by Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101283`: :class:`subprocess.Popen` 现在使用更安全的方法在 ``shell=True`` 启动时查找 "
"``cmd.exe``。由 Eryk Sun 基于 Oleg Iarygin 的补丁提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5775
msgid ""
":gh:`102493`: Fix regression in semantics of normalisation in "
"``PyErr_SetObject``."
msgstr ":gh:`102493`: 修复 ``PyErr_SetObject`` 中标准化语义的回归。"

#: ../NEWS:5778
msgid ""
":gh:`102416`: Do not memoize incorrectly automatically generated loop rules "
"in the parser. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":gh:`102416`: 不记忆解析器中自动生成的错误循环规则。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5781
msgid ""
":gh:`102356`: Fix a bug that caused a crash when deallocating deeply nested "
"filter objects. Patch by Marta Gómez Macías."
msgstr ":gh:`102356`: 修复了一个在释放深度嵌套的过滤器对象时导致崩溃的 bug。由 Marta Gómez Macías 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5784
msgid ""
":gh:`102336`: Cleanup Windows 7 specific special handling. Patch by Max "
"Bachmann."
msgstr ":gh:`102336`: 清理 Windows 7 特定的特殊处理。由 Max Bachmann 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5787
msgid ""
":gh:`102250`: Fixed a segfault occurring when the interpreter calls a "
"``__bool__`` method that raises."
msgstr ":gh:`102250`: 修复了当解释器调用引发异常的 ``__bool__`` 方法时发生的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:5790
msgid ""
":gh:`102126`: Fix deadlock at shutdown when clearing thread states if any "
"finalizer tries to acquire the runtime head lock. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`102126`: 修复在关闭时清除线程状态时如果任何终结器尝试获取运行时头锁导致的死锁。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5793
msgid ""
":gh:`102027`: Use ``GetCurrentProcessId`` on Windows when ``getpid`` is "
"unavailable. Patch by Max Bachmann."
msgstr ""
":gh:`102027`: 在Windows上 ``getpid`` 不可用时使用 ``GetCurrentProcessId``。由Max "
"Bachmann提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5796
msgid ""
":gh:`102056`: Fix error handling bugs in interpreter's exception printing "
"code, which could cause a crash on infinite recursion."
msgstr ":gh:`102056`: 修复解释器异常打印代码中的错误处理漏洞，该漏洞可能在无限递归时导致崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:5799
msgid ""
":gh:`100982`: Restrict the scope of the :opcode:`FOR_ITER_RANGE` instruction"
" to the scope of the original :opcode:`FOR_ITER` instruction, to allow "
"instrumentation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100982`: 限制 :opcode:`FOR_ITER_RANGE` 指令的范围到原始 :opcode:`FOR_ITER` "
"指令的范围，以允许插桩。"

#: ../NEWS:5803
msgid ""
":gh:`101967`: Fix possible segfault in ``positional_only_passed_as_keyword``"
" function, when new list created."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101967`: 修复在 ``positional_only_passed_as_keyword`` 函数中创建新列表时可能发生的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:5806
msgid ""
":gh:`101952`: Fix possible segfault in ``BUILD_SET`` opcode, when new set "
"created."
msgstr ":gh:`101952`: 修复在 ``BUILD_SET`` 操作码创建新集合时可能发生的段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:5809
msgid ""
":gh:`74895`: :mod:`socket.getaddrinfo` no longer raises "
":class:`OverflowError` for :class:`int` **port** values outside of the C "
"long range. Out of range values are left up to the underlying string based C"
" library API to report. A :class:`socket.gaierror` ``SAI_SERVICE`` may occur"
" instead, or no error at all as not all platform C libraries generate an "
"error."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74895`: :mod:`socket.getaddrinfo` 不再为超出C long范围的 :class:`int` "
"**port**值抛出 :class:`OverflowError`。超出范围的值将由底层的基于字符串的C库API报告。可能会出现 "
":class:`socket.gaierror` ``SAI_SERVICE``，或者根本没有错误，因为并非所有平台的C库都会生成错误。"

#: ../NEWS:5816
msgid ""
":gh:`101799`: Add :opcode:`CALL_INTRINSIC_2` and use it instead of "
":opcode:`!PREP_RERAISE_STAR`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101799`: 添加 :opcode:`CALL_INTRINSIC_2` 并用其替代 "
":opcode:`!PREP_RERAISE_STAR`。"

#: ../NEWS:5819
msgid ""
":gh:`101857`: Fix xattr support detection on Linux systems by widening the "
"check to linux, not just glibc. This fixes support for musl."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101857`: 通过将检查范围扩大到linux而不仅仅是glibc来修复Linux系统上的xattr支持检测。这修复了对musl的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:5822
msgid ""
":gh:`84783`: Make the slice object hashable. Patch by Will Bradshaw and "
"Furkan Onder."
msgstr ":gh:`84783`: 使切片对象可哈希。由Will Bradshaw和Furkan Onder提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5825
msgid ""
":gh:`87849`: Change the ``SEND`` instruction to leave the receiver on the "
"stack. This allows the specialized form of ``SEND`` to skip the chain of C "
"calls and jump directly to the ``RESUME`` in the generator or coroutine."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87849`: 更改 ``SEND`` 指令以将接收者留在堆栈上。这允许 ``SEND`` 的特殊形式跳过C调用链并直接跳转到生成器或协程中的"
" ``RESUME``。"

#: ../NEWS:5829
msgid ""
":gh:`101765`: Fix SystemError / segmentation fault in iter ``__reduce__`` "
"when internal access of ``builtins.__dict__`` keys mutates the iter object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101765`: 修复在迭代 ``__reduce__`` 中当 ``builtins.__dict__`` "
"键的内部访问改变迭代对象时的SystemError / 段错误。"

#: ../NEWS:5833
msgid ""
":gh:`101430`: Update :mod:`tracemalloc` to handle presize of object "
"properly. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ":gh:`101430`: 更新 :mod:`tracemalloc` 以正确处理对象的预大小。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5836
msgid ""
":gh:`101696`: Invalidate type version tag in ``_PyStaticType_Dealloc`` for "
"static types, avoiding bug where a false cache hit could crash the "
"interpreter. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101696`: 在 ``_PyStaticType_Dealloc`` "
"中使静态类型的类型版本标签无效，避免因虚假缓存命中导致解释器崩溃的错误。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5840
msgid ":gh:`101632`: Adds a new :opcode:`RETURN_CONST` instruction."
msgstr ":gh:`101632`: 添加一个新的 :opcode:`RETURN_CONST` 指令。"

#: ../NEWS:5842
msgid ""
":gh:`100719`: Remove gi_code field from generator (and coroutine and async "
"generator) objects as it is redundant. The frame already includes a "
"reference to the code object."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100719`: 从生成器（以及协程和异步生成器）对象中移除 gi_code 字段，因为它是多余的。框架已经包含了对代码对象的引用。"

#: ../NEWS:5846
msgid ""
":gh:`98627`: When an interpreter is configured to check (and only then), "
"importing an extension module will now fail when the extension does not "
"support multiple interpreters (i.e. doesn't implement PEP 489 multi-phase "
"init). This does not apply to the main interpreter, nor to subinterpreters "
"created with ``Py_NewInterpreter()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98627`: 当解释器配置为检查时（且仅在那时），导入扩展模块现在会在扩展不支持多解释器（即未实现 PEP 489 "
"多阶段初始化）时失败。这不适用于主解释器，也不适用于使用 ``Py_NewInterpreter()`` 创建的子解释器。"

#: ../NEWS:5855
msgid ""
":gh:`102302`: Micro-optimise hashing of :class:`inspect.Parameter`, reducing"
" the time it takes to hash an instance by around 40%."
msgstr ":gh:`102302`: 微优化 :class:`inspect.Parameter` 的哈希处理，将哈希实例所需的时间减少约 40%。"

#: ../NEWS:5858
msgid ""
":gh:`101979`: Fix a bug where parentheses in the ``metavar`` argument to "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument` were dropped. Patch by Yeojin "
"Kim."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101979`: 修复了一个错误，其中 :meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument` 的 "
"``metavar`` 参数中的括号被丢弃。由 Yeojin Kim 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5862
msgid ""
":gh:`91038`: :meth:`platform.platform` now has boolean default arguments."
msgstr ":gh:`91038`: :meth:`platform.platform` 现在有布尔默认参数。"

#: ../NEWS:5864
msgid ""
":gh:`81652`: Add :const:`mmap.MAP_ALIGNED_SUPER` FreeBSD and "
":const:`mmap.MAP_CONCEAL` OpenBSD constants to :mod:`mmap`. Patch by Yeojin "
"Kim."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81652`: 将 FreeBSD 的 :const:`mmap.MAP_ALIGNED_SUPER` 和 OpenBSD 的 "
":const:`mmap.MAP_CONCEAL` 常量添加到 :mod:`mmap` 中。由 Yeojin Kim 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:5868
msgid ":gh:`102179`: Fix :func:`os.dup2` error message for negative fds."
msgstr ":gh:`102179`: 修复 :func:`os.dup2` 对于负文件描述符的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:5870
msgid ""
":gh:`101961`: For the binary mode, :func:`fileinput.hookcompressed` doesn't "
"set the ``encoding`` value even if the value is ``None``. Patch by Gihwan "
"Kim."
msgstr ""
