"``_sha2`` 模块中，而不是单独的 ``_sha256`` 和 ``_sha512`` 模块。"

#: ../NEWS:5895
msgid ""
":gh:`101892`: Callable iterators no longer raise :class:`SystemError` when "
"the callable object exhausts the iterator but forgets to either return a "
"sentinel value or raise :class:`StopIteration`."
