msgstr ":gh:`63301`: 当 :mod:`tabnanny` CLI 因错误退出时设置退出代码。"

#: ../NEWS:5945
msgid ""
":gh:`101360`: Fix anchor matching in :meth:`pathlib.PureWindowsPath.match`. "
"Path and pattern anchors are now matched with :mod:`fnmatch`, just like "
"other path parts. This allows patterns such as ``\"*:/Users/*\"`` to be "
