msgstr ""
":gh:`101360`: 修复 :meth:`pathlib.PureWindowsPath.match` "
"中的锚点匹配。路径和模式的锚点现在像其他路径部分一样与 :mod:`fnmatch` 匹配。这使得可以匹配如 ``\"*:/Users/*\"`` "
"这样的模式。"

#: ../NEWS:5950
msgid ""
":gh:`101277`: Remove global state from :mod:`itertools` module (:pep:`687`)."
" Patches by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`101277`: 从 :mod:`itertools` 模块中移除全局状态 (:pep:`687`)。由 Erlend E. Aasland "
