"和 :class:`bz2.BZ2Decompressor` 对象时的段错误，以及修复多次调用 "
":class:`lzma.LZMADecompressor`、:class:`lzma.LZMACompressor`、:class:`bz2.BZ2Compressor`"
" 和 :class:`bz2.BZ2Decompressor` 对象的 ``__init__()`` 方法时的锁和内部缓冲区泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:5975
msgid ""
":gh:`85417`: Update :mod:`cmath` documentation to clarify behaviour on "
