msgstr ":gh:`101881`: 在Windows上正确处理非阻塞管道的读写操作。"

#: ../NEWS:6020
msgid ""
":gh:`101881`: Add support for the os.get_blocking() and os.set_blocking() "
"functions on Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`101881`: 在Windows上添加对os.get_blocking()和os.set_blocking()函数的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:6023
msgid ""
":gh:`101849`: Ensures installer will correctly upgrade existing ``py.exe`` "
