msgid ""
":gh:`98030`: Add missing TCP socket options from Linux: ``TCP_MD5SIG``, "
"``TCP_THIN_LINEAR_TIMEOUTS``, ``TCP_THIN_DUPACK``, ``TCP_REPAIR``, "
"``TCP_REPAIR_QUEUE``, ``TCP_QUEUE_SEQ``, ``TCP_REPAIR_OPTIONS``, "
"``TCP_TIMESTAMP``, ``TCP_CC_INFO``, ``TCP_SAVE_SYN``, ``TCP_SAVED_SYN``, "
"``TCP_REPAIR_WINDOW``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_CONNECT``, ``TCP_ULP``, "
"``TCP_MD5SIG_EXT``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_KEY``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_NO_COOKIE``, "
"``TCP_ZEROCOPY_RECEIVE``, ``TCP_INQ``, ``TCP_TX_DELAY``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98030`: 从Linux添加缺失的TCP套接字选项: ``TCP_MD5SIG``, "
"``TCP_THIN_LINEAR_TIMEOUTS``, ``TCP_THIN_DUPACK``, ``TCP_REPAIR``, "
"``TCP_REPAIR_QUEUE``, ``TCP_QUEUE_SEQ``, ``TCP_REPAIR_OPTIONS``, "
"``TCP_TIMESTAMP``, ``TCP_CC_INFO``, ``TCP_SAVE_SYN``, ``TCP_SAVED_SYN``, "
"``TCP_REPAIR_WINDOW``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_CONNECT``, ``TCP_ULP``, "
"``TCP_MD5SIG_EXT``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_KEY``, ``TCP_FASTOPEN_NO_COOKIE``, "
"``TCP_ZEROCOPY_RECEIVE``, ``TCP_INQ``, ``TCP_TX_DELAY``."

#: ../NEWS:6614
msgid ""
":gh:`88500`: Reduced the memory usage of :func:`urllib.parse.unquote` and "
":func:`urllib.parse.unquote_to_bytes` on large values."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88500`: 减少了 :func:`urllib.parse.unquote` 和 "
":func:`urllib.parse.unquote_to_bytes` 在大值上的内存使用。"

#: ../NEWS:6617
msgid ""
":gh:`96127`: ``inspect.signature`` was raising ``TypeError`` on call with "
"mock objects. Now it correctly returns ``(*args, **kwargs)`` as inferred "
"signature."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96127`: ``inspect.signature`` 在使用模拟对象调用时会引发 ``TypeError``。现在它正确地返回 "
"``(*args, **kwargs)`` 作为推断签名。"

#: ../NEWS:6621
msgid ""
":gh:`95882`: Fix a 3.11 regression in "
":func:`~contextlib.asynccontextmanager`, which caused it to propagate "
"exceptions with incorrect tracebacks and fix a 3.11 regression in "
":func:`~contextlib.contextmanager`, which caused it to propagate exceptions "
"with incorrect tracebacks for :exc:`StopIteration`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95882`: 修复了 :func:`~contextlib.asynccontextmanager` "
"中的3.11回归问题，该问题导致它传播带有不正确回溯的异常；并修复了 :func:`~contextlib.contextmanager` "
"中的3.11回归问题，该问题导致它为 :exc:`StopIteration` 传播带有不正确回溯的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:6627
msgid ""
":gh:`78707`: Deprecate passing more than one positional argument to "
":meth:`pathlib.PurePath.relative_to` and "
":meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.is_relative_to`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`78707`: 弃用向 :meth:`pathlib.PurePath.relative_to` 和 "
":meth:`~pathlib.PurePath.is_relative_to` 传递多于一个位置参数。"

#: ../NEWS:6631
msgid ""
":gh:`92122`: Fix reStructuredText syntax errors in docstrings in the "
":mod:`enum` module."
msgstr ":gh:`92122`: 修复了 :mod:`enum` 模块中文档字符串的reStructuredText语法错误。"

#: ../NEWS:6634
msgid ""
":gh:`91851`: Optimize the :class:`~fractions.Fraction` arithmetics for small"
" components."
msgstr ":gh:`91851`: 优化了 :class:`~fractions.Fraction` 对小组件的算术运算。"

#: ../NEWS:6637
msgid ""
":issue:`24132`: Make :class:`pathlib.PurePath` and :class:`~pathlib.Path` "
"subclassable (private to start). Previously, attempting to instantiate a "
"subclass resulted in an :exc:`AttributeError` being raised. Patch by Barney "
"Gale."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24132`: 使 :class:`pathlib.PurePath` 和 :class:`~pathlib.Path` "
"可子类化（初始为私有）。之前，尝试实例化一个子类会引发 :exc:`AttributeError`。由Barney Gale提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6642
msgid ""
":issue:`40447`: Accept :class:`os.PathLike` (such as :class:`pathlib.Path`) "
"in the ``stripdir`` arguments of :meth:`compileall.compile_file` and "
":meth:`compileall.compile_dir`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40447`: 在 :meth:`compileall.compile_file` 和 "
":meth:`compileall.compile_dir` 的 ``stripdir`` 参数中接受 :class:`os.PathLike` (如 "
":class:`pathlib.Path`) 。"

#: ../NEWS:6646
msgid ""
":issue:`36880`: Fix a reference counting issue when a :mod:`ctypes` callback"
" with return type :class:`~ctypes.py_object` returns ``None``, which could "
"cause crashes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36880`: 修复了当 :mod:`ctypes` 回调返回类型为 :class:`~ctypes.py_object` 且返回 "
"``None`` 时的引用计数问题，该问题可能导致崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:6653
msgid ""
":gh:`100616`: Document existing ``attr`` parameter to "
":func:`curses.window.vline` function in :mod:`curses`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100616`: 在 :mod:`curses` 模块中，为 :func:`curses.window.vline` 函数记录现有的 "
"``attr`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:6656
msgid ""
":gh:`100472`: Remove claim in documentation that the ``stripdir``, "
"``prependdir`` and ``limit_sl_dest`` parameters of "
":func:`compileall.compile_dir` and :func:`compileall.compile_file` could be "
":class:`bytes`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100472`: 从文档中移除关于 :func:`compileall.compile_dir` 和 "
":func:`compileall.compile_file` 函数的 ``stripdir``、``prependdir`` 和 "
"``limit_sl_dest`` 参数可以是 :class:`bytes` 类型的声明。"

#: ../NEWS:6661
msgid ""
":issue:`25377`: Clarify use of octal format of mode argument in "
"help(os.chmod) as well as help(os.fchmod)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`25377`: 在 help(os.chmod) 和 help(os.fchmod) 中阐明 mode 参数的八进制格式使用。"

#: ../NEWS:6667
msgid ":gh:`100454`: Start running SSL tests with OpenSSL 3.1.0-beta1."
msgstr ":gh:`100454`: 开始使用 OpenSSL 3.1.0-beta1 运行 SSL 测试。"

#: ../NEWS:6669
msgid ""
":gh:`100086`: The Python test runner (libregrtest) now logs Python build "
"information like \"debug\" vs \"release\" build, or LTO and PGO "
"optimizations. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100086`: Python 测试运行器 (libregrtest) 现在会记录 Python "
"构建信息，如“debug”与“release”构建，或 LTO 和 PGO 优化。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6673
msgid ""
":gh:`93018`: Make two tests forgiving towards host system libexpat with "
"backported security fixes applied."
msgstr ":gh:`93018`: 对应用了回溯安全修复的主机系统 libexpat 进行两项测试的宽容处理。"

#: ../NEWS:6679
msgid ""
":gh:`100540`: Removed the ``--with-system-ffi`` ``configure`` option; "
"``libffi`` must now always be supplied by the system on all non-Windows "
"platforms.  The option has had no effect on non-Darwin platforms for several"
" releases, and in 3.11 only had the non-obvious effect of invoking ``pkg-"
"config`` to find ``libffi`` and never setting ``-DUSING_APPLE_OS_LIBFFI``.  "
"Now on Darwin platforms ``configure`` will first check for the OS ``libffi``"
" and then fall back to the same processing as other platforms if it is not "
"found."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100540`: 移除了 ``configure`` 选项 ``--with-system-ffi``；现在在所有非 Windows "
"平台上，``libffi`` 必须始终由系统提供。该选项在非 Darwin 平台上多个版本以来已无效果，而在 3.11 "
"版本中仅有一个不明显的作用，即调用 ``pkg-config`` 来查找 ``libffi`` 且从未设置 "
"``-DUSING_APPLE_OS_LIBFFI``。现在在 Darwin 平台上，``configure`` 将首先检查操作系统 "
"``libffi``，如果未找到，则回退到与其他平台相同的处理方式。"

#: ../NEWS:6688
msgid ""
":gh:`88267`: Avoid exporting Python symbols in linked Windows applications "
"when the core is built as static."
msgstr ":gh:`88267`: 当核心作为静态构建时，避免在链接的 Windows 应用程序中导出 Python 符号。"

#: ../NEWS:6691
msgid ""
":issue:`41916`: Allow override of ac_cv_cxx_thread so that cross compiled "
"python can set -pthread for CXX."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41916`: 允许覆盖 ac_cv_cxx_thread，以便交叉编译的 Python 可以为 CXX 设置 -pthread。"

#: ../NEWS:6697
msgid ":gh:`100180`: Update Windows installer to OpenSSL 1.1.1s"
msgstr ":gh:`100180`: 将 Windows 安装程序更新至 OpenSSL 1.1.1s。"

#: ../NEWS:6699
msgid ""
":gh:`99191`: Use ``_MSVC_LANG >= 202002L`` instead of less-precise "
"``_MSC_VER >=1929`` to more accurately test for C++20 support in "
":file:`PC/_wmimodule.cpp`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99191`: 在 :file:`PC/_wmimodule.cpp` 中使用 ``_MSVC_LANG >= 202002L`` "
"而不是不太精确的 ``_MSC_VER >=1929`` 来更准确地测试 C++20 支持。"

#: ../NEWS:6703
msgid ""
":gh:`79218`: Define ``MS_WIN64`` for Mingw-w64 64bit, fix cython compilation"
" failure."
msgstr ":gh:`79218`: 为 Mingw-w64 64bit 定义 ``MS_WIN64``，修复 cython 编译失败。"

#: ../NEWS:6706
msgid ""
":gh:`99941`: Ensure that :func:`asyncio.Protocol.data_received` receives an "
"immutable :class:`bytes` object (as documented), instead of "
":class:`bytearray`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99941`: 确保 :func:`asyncio.Protocol.data_received` 接收一个不可变的 "
":class:`bytes` 对象（如文档所述），而不是 :class:`bytearray`。"

#: ../NEWS:6710
msgid ""
":issue:`43984`: :meth:`winreg.SetValueEx` now leaves the target value "
"untouched in the case of conversion errors. Previously, ``-1`` would be "
"written in case of such errors."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43984`: 现在，:meth:`winreg.SetValueEx` 在转换错误的情况下会保持目标值不变。此前，此类错误会写入 "
"``-1``。"

#: ../NEWS:6714
msgid ""
":issue:`34816`: ``hasattr(ctypes.windll, 'nonexistant')`` now returns "
"``False`` instead of raising :exc:`OSError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34816`: 现在，``hasattr(ctypes.windll, 'nonexistant')`` 返回 ``False`` "
"而不是抛出 :exc:`OSError`。"

#: ../NEWS:6720
msgid ":gh:`100180`: Update macOS installer to OpenSSL 1.1.1s"
msgstr ":gh:`100180`: 将 macOS 安装程序更新至 OpenSSL 1.1.1s"

#: ../NEWS:6722
msgid ""
":gh:`100540`: Removed obsolete ``dlfcn.h`` shim from the ``_ctypes`` "
"extension module, which has not been necessary since Mac OS X 10.2."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100540`: 从 ``_ctypes`` 扩展模块中移除了自 Mac OS X 10.2 起就不再必要的过时 ``dlfcn.h`` "
"垫片。"

#: ../NEWS:6728
msgid ""
":issue:`45256`: Fix a bug that caused an :exc:`AttributeError` to be raised "
"in ``python-gdb.py`` when ``py-locals`` is used without a frame."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45256`: 修复了一个在 ``python-gdb.py`` 中当 ``py-locals`` 在没有帧的情况下使用时会导致抛出 "
":exc:`AttributeError` 的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:6731
msgid ""
":gh:`100342`: Add missing ``NULL`` check for possible allocation failure in "
"``*args`` parsing in Argument Clinic."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100342`: 在 Argument Clinic 的 ``*args`` 解析中添加了对可能分配失败的缺失 ``NULL`` 检查。"

#: ../NEWS:6737
msgid ""
":gh:`99947`: Raising SystemError on import will now have its cause be set to"
" the original unexpected exception."
msgstr ":gh:`99947`: 现在，导入时引发的 SystemError 的原因会被设置为原始的意外异常。"

#: ../NEWS:6740
msgid ""
":gh:`99240`: In argument parsing, after deallocating newly allocated memory,"
" reset its pointer to NULL."
msgstr ":gh:`99240`: 在参数解析中，释放新分配的内存后，将其指针重置为 NULL。"

#: ../NEWS:6743
msgid ""
":gh:`98724`: The :c:macro:`Py_CLEAR`, :c:macro:`Py_SETREF` and "
":c:macro:`Py_XSETREF` macros now only evaluate their arguments once. If an "
"argument has side effects, these side effects are no longer duplicated. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98724`: 现在，:c:macro:`Py_CLEAR`、:c:macro:`Py_SETREF` 和 "
":c:macro:`Py_XSETREF` 宏只对它们的参数求值一次。如果参数有副作用，这些副作用不再被重复。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6750
msgid "Python 3.12.0 alpha 3"
msgstr "Python 3.12.0 alpha 3"

#: ../NEWS:6752
msgid "*Release date: 2022-12-06*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2022-12-06*"

#: ../NEWS:6757
msgid ""
":gh:`100001`: ``python -m http.server`` no longer allows terminal control "
"characters sent within a garbage request to be printed to the stderr server "
"log."
msgstr ""
":gh:`100001`: ``python -m http.server`` 不再允许垃圾请求中发送的终端控制字符被打印到 stderr "
"服务器日志中。"

#: ../NEWS:6761
msgid ""
"This is done by changing the :mod:`http.server` "
":class:`BaseHTTPRequestHandler` ``.log_message`` method to replace control "
"characters with a :samp:`\\\\x{HH}` hex escape before printing."
msgstr ""
"这是通过更改 :mod:`http.server` :class:`BaseHTTPRequestHandler` 的 ``.log_message``"
" 方法实现的，该方法在打印之前将控制字符替换为 :samp:`\\\\x{HH}` 十六进制转义。"

#: ../NEWS:6765
msgid ""
":gh:`87604`: Avoid publishing list of active per-interpreter audit hooks via"
" the :mod:`gc` module"
msgstr ":gh:`87604`: 避免通过 :mod:`gc` 模块发布每个解释器的活动审计钩子列表"

#: ../NEWS:6771
msgid ""
":gh:`99891`: Fix a bug in the tokenizer that could cause infinite recursion "
"when showing syntax warnings that happen in the first line of the source. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`99891`: 修复了分词器中的一个 bug，该 bug 在显示源代码第一行发生的语法警告时可能导致无限递归。由 Pablo Galindo "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6775
msgid ""
":gh:`91054`: Add :c:func:`PyCode_AddWatcher` and "
":c:func:`PyCode_ClearWatcher` APIs to register callbacks to receive "
"notification on creation and destruction of code objects."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91054`: 添加 :c:func:`PyCode_AddWatcher` 和 :c:func:`PyCode_ClearWatcher` "
"API，用于注册回调以接收代码对象创建和销毁的通知。"

#: ../NEWS:6779
msgid ""
":gh:`99729`: Fix an issue that could cause frames to be visible to Python "
"code as they are being torn down, possibly leading to memory corruption or "
"hard crashes of the interpreter."
msgstr ":gh:`99729`: 修复一个问题，该问题可能导致帧在销毁时对 Python 代码可见，可能引发内存损坏或解释器硬崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:6783
msgid ""
":gh:`99708`: Fix bug where compiler crashes on an if expression with an "
"empty body block."
msgstr ":gh:`99708`: 修复编译器在遇到空体块的 if 表达式时崩溃的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:6786
msgid ""
":gh:`99578`: Fix a reference bug in :func:`!_imp.create_builtin` after the "
"creation of the first sub-interpreter for modules ``builtins`` and ``sys``. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99578`: 修复 :func:`!_imp.create_builtin` 在第一个子解释器为模块 ``builtins`` 和 "
"``sys`` 创建后的引用 bug。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6790
msgid ""
":gh:`99581`: Fixed a bug that was causing a buffer overflow if the tokenizer"
" copies a line missing the newline character from a file that is as long as "
"the available tokenizer buffer. Patch by Pablo galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`99581`: 修复了一个 bug，该 bug 会在标记器从文件中复制缺少换行符且长度与可用标记器缓冲区相同的行时导致缓冲区溢出。由 "
"Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6794
msgid ""
":gh:`99553`: Fix bug where an :exc:`ExceptionGroup` subclass can wrap a "
":exc:`BaseException`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99553`: 修复 :exc:`ExceptionGroup` 子类可以包装 :exc:`BaseException` 的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:6797
msgid ""
":gh:`99547`: Add a function to os.path to check if a path is a junction: "
"isjunction. Add similar functionality to pathlib.Path as is_junction."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99547`: 在 os.path 中添加一个函数来检查路径是否为连接点：isjunction。在 pathlib.Path "
"中添加类似功能作为 is_junction。"

#: ../NEWS:6800
msgid ""
":gh:`99370`: Fix zip path for venv created from a non-installed python on "
"POSIX platforms."
msgstr ":gh:`99370`: 为从非安装的 python 在 POSIX 平台上创建的 venv 修复 zip 路径。"

#: ../NEWS:6803
msgid ""
":gh:`99377`: Add audit events for thread creation and clear operations."
msgstr ":gh:`99377`: 为线程创建和清除操作添加审计事件。"

#: ../NEWS:6805
msgid ""
":gh:`98686`: Remove the ``BINARY_OP_GENERIC`` and ``COMPARE_OP_GENERIC`` "
"\"specializations\"."
msgstr ":gh:`98686`: 移除 ``BINARY_OP_GENERIC`` 和 ``COMPARE_OP_GENERIC`` 的“特化”。"

#: ../NEWS:6808
msgid ""
":gh:`99298`: Remove the remaining error paths for attribute specializations,"
" and refuse to specialize attribute accesses on types that haven't had "
":c:func:`PyType_Ready` called on them yet."
msgstr ""
":gh:`99298`: 移除属性特化的剩余错误路径，并拒绝在尚未调用 :c:func:`PyType_Ready` 的类型上进行属性访问特化。"

#: ../NEWS:6812
msgid ""
":gh:`99127`: Allow some features of :mod:`syslog` to the main interpreter "
"only. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ":gh:`99127`: 允许 :mod:`syslog` 的某些功能仅对主解释器可用。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6815
msgid ""
":gh:`91053`: Optimizing interpreters and JIT compilers may need to "
"invalidate internal metadata when functions are modified. This change adds "
"the ability to provide a callback that will be invoked each time a function "
"is created, modified, or destroyed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91053`: 优化解释器和 JIT "
"编译器可能需要在函数被修改时使内部元数据无效。此更改增加了提供回调的能力，该回调将在每次函数创建、修改或销毁时被调用。"

#: ../NEWS:6820
msgid ""
":gh:`90994`: Improve error messages when there's a syntax error with call "
"arguments. The following three cases are covered: - No value is assigned to "
"a named argument, eg ``foo(a=)``. - A value is assigned to a star argument, "
"eg ``foo(*args=[0])``. - A value is assigned to a double-star keyword "
"argument, eg ``foo(**kwarg={'a': 0})``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90994`: 改进调用参数语法错误时的错误信息。以下三种情况被覆盖：- 未给命名参数赋值，例如 ``foo(a=)``。- "
"给星号参数赋值，例如 ``foo(*args=[0])``。- 给双星号关键字参数赋值，例如 ``foo(**kwarg={'a': 0})``。"

#: ../NEWS:6826
msgid ""
":issue:`45026`: Optimize the :class:`range` object iterator. It is now "
"smaller, faster iteration of ranges containing large numbers. Smaller "
"pickles, faster unpickling."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45026`: 优化 :class:`range` 对象迭代器。现在对包含大数的范围进行迭代更小、更快。更小的 pickle，更快的 "
"unpickling。"

#: ../NEWS:6830
msgid ""
":issue:`31718`: Raise :exc:`ValueError` instead of :exc:`SystemError` when "
"methods of uninitialized :class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder` objects are "
"called. Patch by Oren Milman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31718`: 当调用未初始化的 :class:`io.IncrementalNewlineDecoder` 对象的方法时，抛出 "
":exc:`ValueError` 而不是 :exc:`SystemError`。由 Oren Milman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:6834
msgid ""
":issue:`38031`: Fix a possible assertion failure in :class:`io.FileIO` when "
"the opener returns an invalid file descriptor."
msgstr ":issue:`38031`: 修复 :class:`io.FileIO` 中当开启器返回无效文件描述符时可能出现的断言失败。"

#: ../NEWS:6840
msgid ""
":gh:`100001`: Also \\ escape \\s in the http.server "
"BaseHTTPRequestHandler.log_message so that it is technically possible to "
