"600 instead of 644 (Microsoft Windows is not affected)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`79096`: LWPCookieJar和MozillaCookieJar创建的文件模式改为600而非644（Microsoft "
"Windows不受影响）"

#: ../NEWS:7554
msgid ""
":gh:`92888`: Fix ``memoryview`` use after free when accessing the backing "
"buffer in certain cases."
msgstr ":gh:`92888`: 修复了在某些情况下访问底层缓冲区时的 ``memoryview`` 释放后使用问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7557
msgid ""
":gh:`68966`: The deprecated mailcap module now refuses to inject unsafe text"
" (filenames, MIME types, parameters) into shell commands. Instead of using "
"such text, it will warn and act as if a match was not found (or for test "
"commands, as if the test failed)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`68966`: "
"已弃用的mailcap模块现在拒绝将不安全的文本（文件名、MIME类型、参数）注入到shell命令中。它将发出警告并视为未找到匹配（或对于测试命令，视为测试失败），而不是使用此类文本。"

#: ../NEWS:7565
msgid ""
":gh:`98374`: Suppress ImportError for invalid query for help() command. "
"Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ":gh:`98374`: 抑制help()命令无效查询时的ImportError。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7568
msgid ""
":gh:`98461`: Fix source location in bytecode for list, set and dict "
"comprehensions as well as generator expressions."
msgstr ":gh:`98461`: 修复了列表、集合和字典推导式以及生成器表达式在字节码中的源位置。"

#: ../NEWS:7571
msgid ""
":gh:`98354`: Added unicode check for ``name`` attribute of ``spec`` argument"
" passed in :func:`!_imp.create_builtin` function."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98354`: 为传递给 :func:`!_imp.create_builtin` 函数的 ``spec`` 参数的 ``name`` "
"属性添加了Unicode检查。"

#: ../NEWS:7574
msgid ":gh:`98398`: Fix source location of 'assert' bytecodes."
msgstr ":gh:`98398`: 修复了'assert'字节码的源位置。"

#: ../NEWS:7576
msgid ""
":gh:`98390`: Fix location of sub-expressions of boolean expressions, by "
"reducing their scope to that of the sub-expression."
msgstr ":gh:`98390`: 通过将布尔表达式的子表达式范围缩小到子表达式本身的范围，修复了布尔表达式的子表达式位置问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7579
msgid ""
":gh:`98254`: Modules from the standard library are now potentially suggested"
" as part of the error messages displayed by the interpreter when an "
":exc:`NameError` is raised to the top level. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`98254`: 当解释器将 :exc:`NameError` 提升到顶层时，标准库中的模块现在可能作为错误信息的一部分被建议。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7583
msgid ""
":gh:`97997`: Add running column offset to the tokenizer state to avoid "
"calculating AST column information with pointer arithmetic."
msgstr ":gh:`97997`: 向分词器状态添加运行列偏移，以避免使用指针算术计算 AST 列信息。"

#: ../NEWS:7586
msgid ""
":gh:`97973`: Modify the tokenizer to return all necessary information the "
"parser needs to set location information in the AST nodes, so that the "
"parser does not have to calculate those doing pointer arithmetic."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97973`: 修改分词器以返回解析器所需的所有必要信息，以便解析器无需通过指针算术计算这些信息来设置 AST 节点中的位置信息。"

#: ../NEWS:7590
msgid ""
":gh:`96078`: :func:`os.sched_yield` now release the GIL while calling "
"sched_yield(2). Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96078`: :func:`os.sched_yield` 现在在调用 sched_yield(2) 时释放 GIL。由 Donghee "
"Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7593
msgid ":gh:`97955`: Migrate :mod:`zoneinfo` to Argument Clinic."
msgstr ":gh:`97955`: 将 :mod:`zoneinfo` 迁移到 Argument Clinic。"

#: ../NEWS:7595
msgid ""
":gh:`97912`: The compiler now avoids quadratic behavior when finding which "
"instructions should use the :opcode:`LOAD_FAST_CHECK` opcode."
msgstr ":gh:`97912`: 编译器现在在确定哪些指令应使用 :opcode:`LOAD_FAST_CHECK` 操作码时避免了二次行为。"

#: ../NEWS:7598
msgid ""
":gh:`97002`: Fix an issue where several frame objects could be backed by the"
" same interpreter frame, possibly leading to corrupted memory and hard "
"crashes of the interpreter."
msgstr ":gh:`97002`: 修复了一个问题，其中多个帧对象可能由同一个解释器帧支持，可能导致内存损坏和解释器的硬崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7602
msgid ""
":gh:`97943`: Bugfix: :c:func:`PyFunction_GetAnnotations` should return a "
"borrowed reference. It was returning a new reference."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97943`: 错误修复：:c:func:`PyFunction_GetAnnotations` "
"应该返回一个借用引用。它之前返回了一个新的引用。"

#: ../NEWS:7605
msgid ""
":gh:`97922`: The Garbage Collector now runs only on the eval breaker "
"mechanism of the Python bytecode evaluation loop instead on object "
"allocations. The GC can also run when :c:func:`PyErr_CheckSignals` is called"
" so C extensions that need to run for a long time without executing any "
"Python code also have a chance to execute the GC periodically."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97922`: 垃圾收集器现在只在 Python 字节码评估循环的 eval breaker 机制上运行，而不是在对象分配上。GC "
"也可以在调用 :c:func:`PyErr_CheckSignals` 时运行，因此需要在长时间内不执行任何 Python 代码的 C "
"扩展也有机会定期执行 GC。"

#: ../NEWS:7611
msgid ""
":gh:`65961`: When ``__package__`` is different than ``__spec__.parent``, "
"raise a ``DeprecationWarning`` instead of ``ImportWarning``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`65961`: 当 ``__package__`` 与 ``__spec__.parent`` 不同时，发出 "
"``DeprecationWarning`` 而不是 ``ImportWarning``。"

#: ../NEWS:7614
msgid ""
"Also remove ``importlib.util.set_package()`` which was scheduled for "
"removal."
msgstr "同时移除计划中被移除的 ``importlib.util.set_package()``。"

#: ../NEWS:7617
msgid ""
":gh:`97850`: Long deprecated, ``module_repr()`` should now be completely "
"eradicated."
msgstr ":gh:`97850`: 长期弃用的 ``module_repr()`` 现在应该完全被淘汰。"

#: ../NEWS:7620
msgid ""
":gh:`86298`: In cases where ``warnings.warn_explicit()`` consults the "
"module's loader, an ``DeprecationWarning`` is issued when ``m.__loader__`` "
"differs from ``m.__spec__.loader``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`86298`: 在 ``warnings.warn_explicit()`` 咨询模块的加载器的情况下，当 ``m.__loader__`` "
"与 ``m.__spec__.loader`` 不同时，发出 ``DeprecationWarning``。"

#: ../NEWS:7624
msgid ""
":gh:`97779`: Ensure that all Python frame objects are backed by \"complete\""
" frames."
msgstr ":gh:`97779`: 确保所有Python框架对象都由“完整”框架支持。"

#: ../NEWS:7627
msgid ""
":gh:`91052`: Add API for subscribing to modification events on selected "
"dictionaries."
msgstr ":gh:`91052`: 添加API以订阅选定字典的修改事件。"

#: ../NEWS:7630
msgid ""
":gh:`97752`: Fix possible data corruption or crashes when accessing the "
"``f_back`` member of newly-created generator or coroutine frames."
msgstr ":gh:`97752`: 修复访问新创建的生成器或协程框架的 ``f_back`` 成员时可能出现的数据损坏或崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7633
msgid ""
":gh:`97591`: Fixed a missing incref/decref pair in "
"``Exception.__setstate__()``. Patch by Ofey Chan."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97591`: 修复了 ``Exception.__setstate__()`` 中缺少的incref/decref对。补丁由Ofey "
"Chan提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7636
msgid ""
":gh:`97670`: Remove the :func:`sys.getdxp` function and the "
"``Tools/scripts/analyze_dxp.py`` script. DXP stands for \"dynamic execution "
"pairs\". They were related to ``DYNAMIC_EXECUTION_PROFILE`` and ``DXPAIRS`` "
"macros which have been removed in Python 3.11. Python can now be built with "
":option:`./configure --enable-pystats <--enable-pystats>` to gather "
"statistics on Python opcodes.  Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97670`: 移除 :func:`sys.getdxp` 函数和 ``Tools/scripts/analyze_dxp.py`` "
"脚本。DXP代表“动态执行对”。它们与 ``DYNAMIC_EXECUTION_PROFILE`` 和 ``DXPAIRS`` "
"宏相关，这些宏已在Python 3.11中移除。现在可以通过 :option:`./configure --enable-pystats "
"<--enable-pystats>` 构建Python以收集Python操作码的统计数据。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7643
msgid ""
":gh:`94526`: Fix the Python path configuration used to initialized "
":data:`sys.path` at Python startup. Paths are no longer encoded to "
"UTF-8/strict to avoid encoding errors if it contains surrogate characters "
"(bytes paths are decoded with the surrogateescape error handler). Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94526`: 修复用于初始化Python启动时 :data:`sys.path` "
"的Python路径配置。路径不再编码为UTF-8/strict以避免如果包含代理字符时出现编码错误（字节路径使用surrogateescape错误处理程序解码）。由Victor"
" Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7649
msgid ""
":gh:`96670`: The parser now raises :exc:`SyntaxError` when parsing source "
"code containing null bytes. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`96670`: 解析器现在在解析包含空字节的源代码时引发 :exc:`SyntaxError`。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7652
msgid ""
":gh:`96975`: Fix a crash occurring when :c:func:`PyEval_GetFrame` is called "
"while the topmost Python frame is in a partially-initialized state."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96975`: 修复当调用 :c:func:`PyEval_GetFrame` 时最顶层的Python框架处于部分初始化状态时发生的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7655
msgid ""
":gh:`96848`: Fix command line parsing: reject :option:`-X int_max_str_digits"
" <-X>` option with no value (invalid) when the "
":envvar:`PYTHONINTMAXSTRDIGITS` environment variable is set to a valid "
"limit. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96848`: 修复命令行解析：当 :envvar:`PYTHONINTMAXSTRDIGITS` 环境变量设置为有效限制时，拒绝没有值的 "
":option:`-X int_max_str_digits <-X>` 选项（无效）。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7660
msgid ""
":gh:`95921`: Fix overly-broad source position information for chained "
"comparisons used as branching conditions."
msgstr ":gh:`95921`: 修复用作分支条件的链式比较的过于宽泛的源位置信息。"

#: ../NEWS:7663
msgid ":gh:`96821`: Fix undefined behaviour in ``audioop.c``."
msgstr ":gh:`96821`: 修复 ``audioop.c`` 中的未定义行为。"

#: ../NEWS:7665
msgid ":gh:`96821`: Fix undefined behaviour in ``_testcapimodule.c``."
msgstr ":gh:`96821`: 修复 ``_testcapimodule.c`` 中的未定义行为。"

#: ../NEWS:7667
msgid ""
":gh:`95778`: When :exc:`ValueError` is raised if an integer is larger than "
"the limit, mention the :func:`sys.set_int_max_str_digits` function in the "
"error message. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95778`: 当整数超过限制时引发 :exc:`ValueError` 时，在错误消息中提到 "
":func:`sys.set_int_max_str_digits` 函数。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7671
msgid ""
":gh:`96387`: At Python exit, sometimes a thread holding the GIL can wait "
"forever for a thread (usually a daemon thread) which requested to drop the "
"GIL, whereas the thread already exited. To fix the race condition, the "
"thread which requested the GIL drop now resets its request before exiting. "
"Issue discovered and analyzed by Mingliang ZHAO. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96387`: 在 Python 退出时，有时持有 GIL 的线程会永远等待一个（通常是守护线程）请求放弃 GIL "
"的线程，而该线程已经退出。为了修复这个竞态条件，请求放弃 GIL 的线程现在在退出前重置其请求。问题由 Mingliang ZHAO 发现并分析。由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7677
msgid ""
":gh:`96864`: Fix a possible assertion failure, fatal error, or "
":exc:`SystemError` if a line tracing event raises an exception while opcode "
"tracing is enabled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96864`: 修复当操作码跟踪启用时，行跟踪事件引发异常可能导致断言失败、致命错误或 :exc:`SystemError` 的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7681
msgid ""
":gh:`95778`: The ``PyLong_FromString`` function was refactored to make it "
"more maintainable and extensible."
msgstr ":gh:`95778`: ``PyLong_FromString`` 函数被重构，以使其更易于维护和扩展。"

#: ../NEWS:7684
msgid ""
":gh:`96678`: Fix undefined behaviour in C code of null pointer arithmetic."
msgstr ":gh:`96678`: 修复 C 代码中的空指针算术未定义行为。"

#: ../NEWS:7686
msgid ""
":gh:`96754`: Make sure that all frame objects created are created from valid"
" interpreter frames. Prevents the possibility of invalid frames in "
"backtraces and signal handlers."
msgstr ":gh:`96754`: 确保所有创建的帧对象都是从有效的解释器帧创建的。防止回溯和信号处理程序中出现无效帧的可能性。"

#: ../NEWS:7690
msgid ""
":gh:`90997`: Improve the performance of reading and writing inline bytecode "
"caches on some platforms."
msgstr ":gh:`90997`: 提高在某些平台上读写内联字节码缓存的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:7693
msgid ":gh:`96751`: Remove dead code from ``CALL_FUNCTION_EX`` opcode."
msgstr ":gh:`96751`: 从 ``CALL_FUNCTION_EX`` 操作码中移除死代码。"

#: ../NEWS:7695
msgid ""
":gh:`90751`: :class:`memoryview` now supports half-floats. Patch by Donghee "
"Na and Antoine Pitrou."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90751`: :class:`memoryview` 现在支持半精度浮点数。由 Donghee Na 和 Antoine Pitrou "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7698
msgid ":gh:`96678`: Fix case of undefined behavior in ceval.c"
msgstr ":gh:`96678`: 修复 ceval.c 中的未定义行为情况。"

#: ../NEWS:7700
msgid ":gh:`64373`: Convert :mod:`!_functools` to argument clinic."
msgstr ":gh:`64373`: 将 :mod:`!_functools` 转换为参数诊所。"

#: ../NEWS:7702
msgid ":gh:`96641`: Do not expose ``KeyWrapper`` in :mod:`!_functools`."
msgstr ":gh:`96641`: 不要在 :mod:`!_functools` 中暴露 ``KeyWrapper``。"

#: ../NEWS:7704
msgid ""
":gh:`96636`: Ensure that tracing, ``sys.setrace()``, is turned on "
"immediately. In pre-release versions of 3.11, some tracing events might have"
" been lost when turning on tracing in a ``__del__`` method or interrupt."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96636`: 确保跟踪 ``sys.setrace()`` 立即开启。在 3.11 的预发布版本中，当在 ``__del__`` "
"方法或中断中开启跟踪时，可能会丢失一些跟踪事件。"

#: ../NEWS:7709
msgid ""
":gh:`96572`: Fix use after free in trace refs build mode. Patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`96572`: 修复跟踪引用构建模式中的释放后使用问题。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7712
msgid ""
":gh:`96611`: When loading a file with invalid UTF-8 inside a multi-line "
"string, a correct SyntaxError is emitted."
msgstr ":gh:`96611`: 当在多行字符串中加载包含无效 UTF-8 的文件时，会发出正确的 SyntaxError。"

#: ../NEWS:7715
msgid ""
":gh:`96612`: Make sure that incomplete frames do not show up in tracemalloc "
"traces."
msgstr ":gh:`96612`: 确保不完整的帧不会出现在 tracemalloc 跟踪中。"

#: ../NEWS:7718
msgid ""
":gh:`90230`: Fix compiler warnings and test failures when building with "
"``--enable-pystats``."
msgstr ":gh:`90230`: 修复在使用 ``--enable-pystats`` 构建时的编译器警告和测试失败问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7721
msgid ""
":gh:`96587`: Correctly raise ``SyntaxError`` on exception groups "
"(:pep:`654`) on python versions prior to 3.11"
msgstr ""
":gh:`96587`: 在 Python 3.11 之前的版本中，正确地针对异常组 (:pep:`654`) 抛出 ``SyntaxError``。"

#: ../NEWS:7724
msgid ""
":gh:`96569`: Remove two cases of undefined behavior, by adding NULL checks."
msgstr ":gh:`96569`: 通过添加 NULL 检查，移除两种未定义行为的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:7726
msgid ""
":gh:`96582`: Fix possible ``NULL`` pointer dereference in "
"``_PyThread_CurrentFrames``. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96582`: 修复 ``_PyThread_CurrentFrames`` 中可能的 ``NULL`` 指针解引用问题。由 Kumar "
"Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7729
msgid ""
":gh:`91079`: Separate Python recursion checking from C recursion checking "
"which reduces the chance of C stack overflow and allows the recursion limit "
"to be increased safely."
msgstr ":gh:`91079`: 将 Python 递归检查与 C 递归检查分开，减少 C 栈溢出的可能性，并允许安全地增加递归限制。"

#: ../NEWS:7733
msgid ""
":gh:`93911`: Fix an issue that could prevent :opcode:`LOAD_ATTR` from "
"specializing properly when accessing properties."
msgstr ":gh:`93911`: 修复一个可能阻止 :opcode:`LOAD_ATTR` 在访问属性时正确专门化的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7736
msgid ""
":gh:`96348`: Emit a DeprecationWarning when :meth:`~generator.throw`, "
":meth:`~coroutine.throw` or :meth:`~agen.athrow` are called with more than "
"one argument."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96348`: 当调用 :meth:`~generator.throw`、:meth:`~coroutine.throw` 或 "
":meth:`~agen.athrow` 时，如果参数超过一个，发出 DeprecationWarning。"

#: ../NEWS:7740
msgid ""
":gh:`95196`: Disable incorrect pickling of the C implemented classmethod "
"descriptors."
msgstr ":gh:`95196`: 禁用对 C 实现的类方法描述符的错误 pickling。"

#: ../NEWS:7743
msgid ""
":gh:`96364`: Fix text signatures of ``list.__getitem__`` and "
"``dict.__getitem__``."
msgstr ":gh:`96364`: 修复 ``list.__getitem__`` 和 ``dict.__getitem__`` 的文本签名。"

#: ../NEWS:7746
msgid ""
":gh:`96352`: Fix :exc:`AttributeError` missing ``name`` and ``obj`` "
"attributes in :meth:`object.__getattribute__`. Patch by Philip Georgi."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96352`: 修复 :exc:`AttributeError` 在 :meth:`object.__getattribute__` 中缺少 "
"``name`` 和 ``obj`` 属性的问题。由 Philip Georgi 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7749
msgid ""
":gh:`93554`: Change the jump opcodes so that all conditional jumps are "
"forward jumps. Backward jumps are converted by the assembler into a "
"conditional forward jump whose target is the fallthrough block (and with a "
"reversed condition), followed by an unconditional backward jump. For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
":gh:`93554`: 修改跳转操作码，使所有条件跳转都是向前跳转。向后跳转由汇编器转换为条件向前跳转，其目标是 fallthrough "
"块（且条件反转），后跟无条件向后跳转。例如："

#: ../NEWS:7755
msgid ""
"``POP_JUMP_IF_TRUE BACKWARD_TARGET`` becomes ``POP_JUMP_IF_FALSE NEXT_BLOCK;"
" JUMP BACKWARD_TARGET``."
msgstr ""
"``POP_JUMP_IF_TRUE BACKWARD_TARGET`` 变为 ``POP_JUMP_IF_FALSE NEXT_BLOCK; JUMP"
" BACKWARD_TARGET``。"

#: ../NEWS:7758
msgid ""
"All the directed conditional jump opcodes were removed: "
"``POP_JUMP_FORWARD_IF_TRUE``, ``POP_JUMP_BACKWARD_IF_TRUE``, "
"``POP_JUMP_FORWARD_IF_FALSE``, ``POP_JUMP_BACKWARD_IF_FALSE``, "
"``POP_JUMP_FORWARD_IF_NONE``, ``POP_JUMP_BACKWARD_IF_NONE``, "
"``POP_JUMP_FORWARD_IF_NOT_NONE``, ``POP_JUMP_BACKWARD_IF_NOT_NONE``."
msgstr ""
"所有有向条件跳转操作码已被移除：``POP_JUMP_FORWARD_IF_TRUE``、``POP_JUMP_BACKWARD_IF_TRUE``、``POP_JUMP_FORWARD_IF_FALSE``、``POP_JUMP_BACKWARD_IF_FALSE``、``POP_JUMP_FORWARD_IF_NONE``、``POP_JUMP_BACKWARD_IF_NONE``、``POP_JUMP_FORWARD_IF_NOT_NONE``、``POP_JUMP_BACKWARD_IF_NOT_NONE``。"

#: ../NEWS:7764
msgid ""
"The corresponding opcodes without direction are no longer pseudo-"
"instructions, and they implement the forward conditional jumps."
msgstr "对应的无方向操作码不再是伪指令，它们实现了向前条件跳转。"

#: ../NEWS:7767
msgid ""
":gh:`96268`: Loading a file with invalid UTF-8 will now report the broken "
"character at the correct location."
msgstr ":gh:`96268`: 加载包含无效 UTF-8 编码的文件现在会在正确的位置报告损坏的字符。"

#: ../NEWS:7770
msgid ""
":gh:`96237`: The internal field ``_PyInterpreterFrame.f_func`` is renamed to"
" ``_PyInterpreterFrame.f_funcobj`` and may be any object. The ``f_globals`` "
"and ``f_builtin`` fields may hold junk values."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96237`: 内部字段 ``_PyInterpreterFrame.f_func`` 更名为 "
"``_PyInterpreterFrame.f_funcobj`` 并且可以是任何对象。``f_globals`` 和 ``f_builtin`` "
"字段可能包含垃圾值。"

#: ../NEWS:7774
msgid "It is safest to treat the ``_PyInterpreterFrame`` struct as opaque."
msgstr "最安全的做法是将 ``_PyInterpreterFrame`` 结构视为不透明的。"

#: ../NEWS:7776
msgid ""
":gh:`96187`: Fixed a bug that caused ``_PyCode_GetExtra`` to return garbage "
"for negative indexes. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`96187`: 修复了一个导致 ``_PyCode_GetExtra`` 对于负索引返回垃圾值的 bug。由 Pablo Galindo "
"提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:7779
msgid ""
":gh:`96143`: Add a new ``-X perf`` Python command line option as well as "
":func:`sys.activate_stack_trampoline` and "
":func:`sys.deactivate_stack_trampoline` function in the :mod:`sys` module "
"that allows to set/unset the interpreter in a way that the Linux ``perf`` "
"profiler can detect Python calls. The new "
":func:`sys.is_stack_trampoline_active` function allows to query the state of"
" the perf trampoline. Design by Pablo Galindo. Patch by Pablo Galindo and "
"Christian Heimes with contributions from Gregory P. Smith [Google] and Mark "
"Shannon."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96143`: 添加了一个新的 ``-X perf`` Python 命令行选项以及 "
":func:`sys.activate_stack_trampoline` 和 "
":func:`sys.deactivate_stack_trampoline` 函数在 :mod:`sys` 模块中，允许以 Linux "
"``perf`` 分析器可以检测 Python 调用的方式设置/取消设置解释器。新的 "
":func:`sys.is_stack_trampoline_active` 函数允许查询 perf 蹦床的状态。设计由 Pablo Galindo "
"完成。由 Pablo Galindo 和 Christian Heimes 提供补丁，贡献来自 Gregory P. Smith [Google] 和 "
"Mark Shannon。"

#: ../NEWS:7789
msgid ""
":gh:`96071`: Fix a deadlock in :c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure` when allocating "
"new thread state. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96071`: 修复了在分配新线程状态时 :c:func:`PyGILState_Ensure` 中的死锁问题。由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7792
msgid ""
":gh:`96046`: :c:func:`PyType_Ready` now initializes ``ht_cached_keys`` and "
"performs additional checks to ensure that type objects are properly "
"configured. This avoids crashes in 3rd party packages that don't use regular"
" API to create new types."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96046`: :c:func:`PyType_Ready` 现在初始化 ``ht_cached_keys`` "
"并执行额外检查以确保类型对象正确配置。这避免了不使用常规 API 创建新类型的第三方包中的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7797
msgid ""
":gh:`96005`: On WASI :const:`~errno.ENOTCAPABLE` is now mapped to "
":exc:`PermissionError`. The :mod:`errno` modules exposes the new error "
"number. ``getpath.py`` now ignores :exc:`PermissionError` when it cannot "
"open landmark files ``pybuilddir.txt`` and ``pyenv.cfg``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96005`: 在 WASI 上，:const:`~errno.ENOTCAPABLE` 现在被映射到 "
":exc:`PermissionError`。:mod:`errno` 模块暴露了新的错误号。``getpath.py`` 现在在无法打开标记文件 "
"``pybuilddir.txt`` 和 ``pyenv.cfg`` 时忽略 :exc:`PermissionError`。"

#: ../NEWS:7802
msgid ""
":gh:`93678`: Added test a harness for direct unit tests of the compiler's "
"optimization stage. The ``_testinternalcapi.optimize_cfg()`` function runs "
"the optimiser on a sequence of instructions. The ``CfgOptimizationTestCase``"
" class in ``test.support`` has utilities for invoking the optimizer and "
"checking the output."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93678`: 添加了编译器优化阶段直接单元测试的测试工具。``_testinternalcapi.optimize_cfg()`` "
"函数在一系列指令上运行优化器。``test.support`` 中的 ``CfgOptimizationTestCase`` "
"类提供了调用优化器和检查输出的实用工具。"

#: ../NEWS:7808
msgid ""
":gh:`95245`: Reduces the size of a \"simple\" Python object from 8 to 6 "
"words by moving the weakreflist pointer into the pre-header directly before "
"the object's dict/values pointer."
msgstr ":gh:`95245`: 通过将弱引用列表指针直接移动到对象字典/值指针前的预头部，将\"简单\"Python对象的大小从8个词减少到6个词。"

#: ../NEWS:7812
msgid ""
":gh:`90997`: Compile virtual :keyword:`try`/:keyword:`except` blocks to "
"handle exceptions raised during :meth:`~generator.close` or "
":meth:`~generator.throw` calls through a suspended frame."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90997`: 编译虚拟 :keyword:`try`/:keyword:`except` 块，以处理在 "
":susp:`~generator.close` 或 :susp:`~generator.throw` 调用通过挂起帧时引发的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:7816
msgid ""
":gh:`95977`: Optimized calling :meth:`~object.__get__` with vectorcall. "
"Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95977`: 使用vectorcall优化调用 :susp:`~object.__get__`。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7819
msgid ""
":gh:`91210`: Improve error message when a parameter without a default value "
"follows one with a default value, and show the same message, even when the "
"non-default/default sequence is preceded by positional-only parameters."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91210`: 改进当没有默认值的参数跟在有默认值的参数后面时的错误消息，并显示相同的消息，即使非默认/默认序列前面有仅位置参数。"

#: ../NEWS:7823
msgid ""
":gh:`95922`: Fixed bug where the compiler's ``eliminate_empty_basic_blocks``"
" function ignores the last block of the code unit."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95922`: 修复了编译器 ``eliminate_empty_basic_blocks`` 函数忽略代码单元最后一个块的bug。"

#: ../NEWS:7826
msgid ""
":gh:`95818`: Skip over incomplete frames in "
":c:func:`PyThreadState_GetFrame`."
msgstr ":gh:`95818`: 在 :c:func:`PyThreadState_GetFrame` 中跳过不完整的帧。"

#: ../NEWS:7828
msgid ""
":gh:`95876`: Fix format string in ``_PyPegen_raise_error_known_location`` "
"that can lead to memory corruption on some 64bit systems. The function was "
"building a tuple with ``i`` (int) instead of ``n`` (Py_ssize_t) for "
"Py_ssize_t arguments."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95876`: 修复 ``_PyPegen_raise_error_known_location`` "
"中的格式字符串，该字符串在某些64位系统上可能导致内存损坏。该函数在为Py_ssize_t参数构建元组时使用了 ``i`` (int) 而不是 "
"``n`` (Py_ssize_t) 。"

#: ../NEWS:7833
msgid ""
":gh:`95605`: Fix misleading contents of error message when converting an "
"all-whitespace string to :class:`float`."
msgstr ":gh:`95605`: 修复将全空白字符串转换为 :class:`float` 时错误消息内容误导性的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7836
msgid ""
":gh:`95150`: Update code object hashing and equality to consider all "
"debugging and exception handling tables. This fixes an issue where certain "
"non-identical code objects could be \"deduplicated\" during compilation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95150`: 更新代码对象的哈希和相等性考虑，以考虑所有调试和异常处理表。这修复了在编译过程中某些非相同代码对象可能被\"去重\"的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7840
msgid ""
":gh:`91146`: Reduce allocation size of :class:`list` from :meth:`str.split` "
"and :meth:`str.rsplit`. Patch by Donghee Na and Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91146`: 减少由 :susp:`str.split` 和 :susp:`str.rsplit` 生成的 :class:`list` "
"的分配大小。补丁由Donghee Na和Inada Naoki提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7843
msgid ""
":gh:`87092`: Create a 'jump target label' abstraction in the compiler so "
"that the compiler's codegen stage does not work directly with basic blocks. "
"This prepares the code for changes to the underlying CFG generation "
"mechanism."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87092`: 在编译器中创建一个'跳转目标标签'抽象，使编译器的代码生成阶段不直接与基本块一起工作。这为底层CFG生成机制的更改准备了代码。"

#: ../NEWS:7848
msgid ""
":gh:`95355`: ``_PyPegen_Parser_New`` now properly detects token memory "
"allocation errors. Patch by Honglin Zhu."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95355`: ``_PyPegen_Parser_New`` 现在能正确检测令牌内存分配错误。补丁由Honglin Zhu提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7851
msgid ""
":gh:`90081`: Run Python code in tracer/profiler function at full speed. "
"Fixes slowdown in earlier versions of 3.11."
msgstr ":gh:`90081`: 在追踪器/分析器函数中以全速运行Python代码。修复了早期3.11版本中的速度下降问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7854
msgid ""
":gh:`95324`: Emit a warning in debug mode if an object does not call "
":c:func:`PyObject_GC_UnTrack` before deallocation. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95324`: 在调试模式下，如果对象在释放前未调用 :c:func:`PyObject_GC_UnTrack`，则发出警告。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7857
msgid ""
":gh:`95245`: Merge managed dict and values pointer into a single tagged "
"pointer to save one word in the pre-header."
msgstr ":gh:`95245`: 将管理的字典和值指针合并为一个带标签的指针，以在预头部节省一个字。"

#: ../NEWS:7860
msgid ""
":gh:`93678`: Add cfg_builder struct and refactor the relevant code so that a"
" cfg can be constructed without an instance of the compiler struct."
msgstr ":gh:`93678`: 添加cfg_builder结构并重构相关代码，以便可以在没有编译器结构实例的情况下构建cfg。"

#: ../NEWS:7863
msgid ""
":gh:`95185`: Prevented crashes in the AST constructor when compiling some "
"absurdly long expressions like ``\"+0\"*1000000``. :exc:`RecursionError` is "
"now raised instead. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`95185`: 防止在编译一些极长表达式如 ``\"+0\"*1000000`` 时AST构造器崩溃。现在会改为抛出 "
":exc:`RecursionError`。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7867
msgid ""
":gh:`93351`: :class:`ast.AST` node positions are now validated when provided"
" to :func:`compile` and other related functions. If invalid positions are "
"detected, a :exc:`ValueError` will be raised."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93351`: 现在，当向 :func:`compile` 和其他相关函数提供 :class:`ast.AST` "
"节点位置时，会验证这些位置。如果检测到无效位置，将抛出 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:7871
msgid ""
":gh:`94438`: Fix an issue that caused extended opcode arguments and some "
"conditional pops to be ignored when calculating valid jump targets for "
"assignments to the ``f_lineno`` attribute of frame objects. In some cases, "
"this could cause inconsistent internal state, resulting in a hard crash of "
"the interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94438`: 修复了一个问题，该问题导致在计算对帧对象的 ``f_lineno`` "
"属性赋值的有效跳转目标时，忽略扩展操作码参数和一些条件弹出。在某些情况下，这可能导致内部状态不一致，导致解释器硬崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7877
msgid ""
":gh:`95060`: Undocumented ``PyCode_Addr2Location`` function now properly "
"returns when ``addrq`` argument is less than zero."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95060`: 未记录的 ``PyCode_Addr2Location`` 函数现在在 ``addrq`` 参数小于零时正确返回。"

#: ../NEWS:7880
msgid ""
":gh:`95113`: Replace all ``EXTENDED_ARG_QUICK`` instructions with basic "
":opcode:`EXTENDED_ARG` instructions in unquickened code. Consumers of non-"
"adaptive bytecode should be able to handle extended arguments the same way "
"they were handled in CPython 3.10 and older."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95113`: 在非快速化代码中，将所有 ``EXTENDED_ARG_QUICK`` 指令替换为基本的 "
":opcode:`EXTENDED_ARG` 指令。非自适应字节码的使用者应该能够以与CPython 3.10及更早版本相同的方式处理扩展参数。"

#: ../NEWS:7885
msgid ""
":gh:`91409`: Fix incorrect source location info caused by certain "
"optimizations in the bytecode compiler."
msgstr ":gh:`91409`: 修复由字节码编译器中的某些优化引起的错误源代码位置信息。"

#: ../NEWS:7888
msgid ""
":gh:`95023`: Implement :func:`os.setns` and  :func:`os.unshare` for Linux. "
"Patch by Noam Cohen."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95023`: 为Linux实现 :func:`os.setns` 和 :func:`os.unshare`。由Noam Cohen提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7891
msgid ""
":gh:`94036`: Fix incorrect source location info for some multi-line "
"attribute accesses and method calls."
msgstr ":gh:`94036`: 修复一些多行属性访问和方法调用的错误源代码位置信息。"

#: ../NEWS:7894
msgid ""
":gh:`94938`: Fix error detection in some builtin functions when keyword "
"argument name is an instance of a str subclass with overloaded ``__eq__`` "
"and ``__hash__``. Previously it could cause SystemError or other undesired "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94938`: 修复当关键字参数名称是重载了 ``__eq__`` 和 ``__hash__`` 的 str "
"子类实例时，某些内置函数中的错误检测。之前这可能导致 SystemError 或其他不希望的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:7899
msgid ""
":gh:`94996`: :func:`ast.parse` will no longer parse function definitions "
"with positional-only params when passed ``feature_version`` less than ``(3, "
"8)``. Patch by Shantanu Jain."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94996`: :func:`ast.parse` 在传递的 ``feature_version`` 小于 ``(3, 8)`` "
"时，将不再解析带有位置唯一参数（positional-only params）的函数定义。由 Shantanu Jain 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7903
msgid ""
":gh:`94739`: Allow jumping within, out of, and across exception handlers in "
"the debugger."
msgstr ":gh:`94739`: 允许在调试器中跳入、跳出以及跨异常处理器跳转。"

#: ../NEWS:7906
msgid ""
":gh:`94949`: :func:`ast.parse` will no longer parse parenthesized context "
"managers when passed ``feature_version`` less than ``(3, 9)``. Patch by "
"Shantanu Jain."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94949`: :func:`ast.parse` 在传递的 ``feature_version`` 小于 ``(3, 9)`` "
"时，将不再解析带括号的上下文管理器。由 Shantanu Jain 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7910
msgid ""
":gh:`94947`: :func:`ast.parse` will no longer parse assignment expressions "
"when passed ``feature_version`` less than ``(3, 8)``. Patch by Shantanu "
"Jain."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94947`: :func:`ast.parse` 在传递的 ``feature_version`` 小于 ``(3, 8)`` "
"时，将不再解析赋值表达式。由 Shantanu Jain 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7914
msgid ""
":gh:`91256`: Ensures the program name is known for help text during "
"interpreter startup."
msgstr ":gh:`91256`: 确保解释器启动期间帮助文本的程序名称是已知的。"

#: ../NEWS:7917
msgid ""
":gh:`94869`: Fix the column offsets for some expressions in multi-line "
"f-strings :mod:`ast` nodes. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":gh:`94869`: 修复多行 f-字符串 :mod:`ast` 节点中某些表达式的列偏移。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7920
msgid ""
":gh:`94893`: Fix an issue where frame object manipulations could corrupt "
"inline bytecode caches."
msgstr ":gh:`94893`: 修复一个帧对象操作可能损坏内联字节码缓存的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7923
msgid ""
":gh:`94822`: Fix an issue where lookups of metaclass descriptors may be "
"ignored when an identically-named attribute also exists on the class itself."
msgstr ":gh:`94822`: 修复当类本身也存在同名属性时，元类描述符的查找可能被忽略的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7927
msgid ""
":gh:`91153`: Fix an issue where a :class:`bytearray` item assignment could "
"crash if it's resized by the new value's :meth:`__index__` method."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91153`: 修复 :class:`bytearray` 项赋值在通过新值的 :meth:`__index__` "
"方法调整大小时可能崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:7930
msgid ""
":gh:`90699`: Fix reference counting bug in :meth:`bool.__repr__`. Patch by "
"Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`90699`: 修复 :meth:`bool.__repr__` 中的引用计数错误。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7933
msgid ""
":gh:`94694`: Fix an issue that could cause code with multi-line method "
"lookups to have misleading or incorrect column offset information. In some "
"cases (when compiling a hand-built AST) this could have resulted in a hard "
"crash of the interpreter."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94694`: 修复可能导致具有多行方法查找的代码具有误导性或错误的列偏移信息的问题。在某些情况下（当编译手动构建的 AST "
"时），这可能导致解释器硬崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7938
msgid ""
":gh:`93252`: Fix an issue that caused internal frames to outlive failed "
"Python function calls, possibly resulting in memory leaks or hard "
"interpreter crashes."
msgstr ":gh:`93252`: 修复导致内部帧在失败的 Python 函数调用后仍然存活的问题，可能导致内存泄漏或解释器硬崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7942
msgid ""
":gh:`94215`: Fix an issue where exceptions raised by line-tracing events "
"would cause frames to be left in an invalid state, possibly resulting in a "
"hard crash of the interpreter."
msgstr ":gh:`94215`: 修复了一个问题，即由行追踪事件引发的异常会导致帧处于无效状态，可能导致解释器硬崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7946
msgid ""
":gh:`92228`: Disable the compiler's inline-small-exit-blocks optimization "
"for exit blocks that are associated with source code lines. This fixes a bug"
" where the debugger cannot tell where an exception handler ends and the "
"following code block begins."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92228`: "
"对于与源代码行相关联的退出块，禁用编译器的内联小退出块优化。这修复了一个bug，即调试器无法区分异常处理器的结束和后续代码块的开始。"

#: ../NEWS:7951
msgid ""
":gh:`94485`: Line number of a module's ``RESUME`` instruction is set to 0 as"
" specified in :pep:`626`."
msgstr ":gh:`94485`: 根据 :pep:`626` 的规定，模块的 ``RESUME`` 指令的行号被设置为0。"

#: ../NEWS:7954
msgid ""
":gh:`94438`: Account for instructions that can push NULL to the stack when "
"setting line number in a frame. Prevents some (unlikely) crashes."
msgstr ":gh:`94438`: 在设置帧中的行号时，考虑可以推NULL到堆栈的指令。防止一些（不太可能的）崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:7957
msgid ""
":gh:`91719`: Reload ``opcode`` when raising ``unknown opcode error`` in the "
"interpreter main loop, for C compilers to generate dispatching code "
"independently."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91719`: 在解释器主循环中引发 ``unknown opcode error`` 时重新加载 "
"``opcode``，以便C编译器独立生成调度代码。"

#: ../NEWS:7961
msgid ""
":gh:`94329`: Compile and run code with unpacking of extremely large "
"sequences (1000s of elements). Such code failed to compile. It now compiles "
"and runs correctly."
msgstr ":gh:`94329`: 编译并运行具有极大序列（1000多个元素）解包的代码。此类代码之前无法编译。现在可以正确编译并运行。"

#: ../NEWS:7965
msgid ""
":gh:`94360`: Fixed a tokenizer crash when reading encoded files with syntax "
"errors from ``stdin`` with non utf-8 encoded text. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`94360`: 修复了当从 ``stdin`` 读取带有语法错误的非utf-8编码文本文件时，分词器崩溃的问题。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7968
msgid ""
":gh:`88116`: Fix an issue when reading line numbers from code objects if the"
" encoded line numbers are close to ``INT_MIN``. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`88116`: 修复了当从代码对象读取行号时，如果编码的行号接近 ``INT_MIN`` 时的问题。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:7971
msgid ""
":gh:`94262`: Don't create frame objects for incomplete frames. Prevents the "
"creation of generators and closures from being observable to Python and C "
"extensions, restoring the behavior of 3.10 and earlier."
msgstr ":gh:`94262`: 不为不完整的帧创建帧对象。防止Python和C扩展可以观察到生成器和闭包的创建，恢复了3.10及更早版本的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:7975
msgid ""
":gh:`94192`: Fix error for dictionary literals with invalid expression as "
"value."
msgstr ":gh:`94192`: 修复了字典字面量中值表达式无效时的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:7978
msgid ""
":gh:`87995`: :class:`types.MappingProxyType` instances are now hashable if "
"the underlying mapping is hashable."
msgstr ":gh:`87995`: :class:`types.MappingProxyType` 实例现在如果底层映射是可哈希的，则也是可哈希的。"

#: ../NEWS:7981
msgid ""
":gh:`93883`: Revise the display strategy of traceback enhanced error "
"locations.  The indicators are only shown when the location doesn't span the"
" whole line."
msgstr ":gh:`93883`: 修订了回溯增强错误位置的显示策略。指示器仅在位置不跨越整行时显示。"

#: ../NEWS:7985
msgid ""
":gh:`94163`: Add :opcode:`BINARY_SLICE` and :opcode:`STORE_SLICE` "
"instructions for more efficient handling and better specialization of "
"slicing operations, where the slice is explicit in the source code."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94163`: 添加 :opcode:`BINARY_SLICE` 和 :opcode:`STORE_SLICE` "
"指令，以更高效地处理和更好地专门化切片操作，其中切片在源代码中是显式的。"

#: ../NEWS:7989
msgid ":gh:`94021`: Fix unreachable code warning in ``Python/specialize.c``."
msgstr ":gh:`94021`: 修复 ``Python/specialize.c`` 中不可达代码的警告。"

#: ../NEWS:7991
msgid ""
":gh:`93911`: Specialize ``LOAD_ATTR`` for objects with custom "
"``__getattribute__``."
msgstr ":gh:`93911`: 为具有自定义 ``__getattribute__`` 的对象专门化 ``LOAD_ATTR``。"

#: ../NEWS:7994
msgid ""
":gh:`93955`: Improve performance of attribute lookups on objects with custom"
" ``__getattribute__`` and ``__getattr__``. Patch by Ken Jin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93955`: 提高具有自定义 ``__getattribute__`` 和 ``__getattr__`` 对象的属性查找性能。补丁由 "
"Ken Jin 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:7997
msgid ":gh:`93911`: Specialize ``LOAD_ATTR`` for ``property()`` attributes."
msgstr ":gh:`93911`: 为 ``property()`` 属性专门化 ``LOAD_ATTR``。"

#: ../NEWS:7999
msgid ""
":gh:`93678`: Refactor compiler optimisation code so that it no longer needs "
"the ``struct assembler`` and ``struct compiler`` passed around. Instead, "
"each function takes the CFG and other data that it actually needs. This will"
" make it possible to test this code directly."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93678`: 重构编译器优化代码，使其不再需要传递 ``struct assembler`` 和 ``struct "
"compiler``。相反，每个函数都采用它实际需要的 CFG 和其他数据。这将使得直接测试这段代码成为可能。"

#: ../NEWS:8004
msgid ""
":gh:`93841`: When built with ``-enable-pystats``, ``sys._stats_on()``, "
"``sys._stats_off()``, ``sys._stats_clear()`` and ``sys._stats_dump()`` "
"functions have been added to enable gathering stats for parts of programs."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93841`: 当使用 ``-enable-pystats`` 构建时，添加了 "
"``sys._stats_on()``、``sys._stats_off()``、``sys._stats_clear()`` 和 "
"``sys._stats_dump()`` 函数，以启用对程序部分的统计收集。"

#: ../NEWS:8008
msgid ""
":gh:`93516`: Store offset of first traceable instruction in code object to "
"avoid having to recompute it for each instruction when tracing."
msgstr ":gh:`93516`: 在代码对象中存储第一个可跟踪指令的偏移量，以避免在跟踪时对每个指令重新计算。"

#: ../NEWS:8011
msgid ""
":gh:`93516`: Lazily create a table mapping bytecode offsets to line numbers "
"to speed up calculation of line numbers when tracing."
msgstr ":gh:`93516`: 延迟创建将字节码偏移量映射到行号的表，以加快跟踪时行号的计算速度。"

#: ../NEWS:8014
msgid ""
":gh:`89828`: :class:`types.GenericAlias` no longer relays the ``__class__`` "
"attribute. For example, ``isinstance(list[int], type)`` no longer returns "
"``True``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89828`: :class:`types.GenericAlias` 不再中继 ``__class__`` "
"属性。例如，``isinstance(list[int], type)`` 不再返回 ``True``。"

#: ../NEWS:8018
msgid ""
":gh:`93678`: Refactor the compiler to reduce boilerplate and repetition."
msgstr ":gh:`93678`: 重构编译器以减少样板和重复。"

#: ../NEWS:8020
msgid ""
":gh:`93671`: Fix some exponential backtrace case happening with deeply "
"nested sequence patterns in match statements. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":gh:`93671`: 修复在匹配语句中深度嵌套序列模式时发生的一些指数回溯情况。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8023
msgid ""
":gh:`93662`: Make sure that the end column offsets are correct in multi-line"
" method calls. Previously, the end column could precede the column offset."
msgstr ":gh:`93662`: 确保在多行方法调用中结束列偏移是正确的。以前，结束列可能会在列偏移之前。"

#: ../NEWS:8026
msgid ""
":gh:`93461`: :func:`importlib.invalidate_caches` now drops entries from "
":data:`sys.path_importer_cache` with a relative path as name. This solves a "
"caching issue when a process changes its current working directory."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93461`: :func:`importlib.invalidate_caches` 现在会从 "
":data:`sys.path_importer_cache` 中删除以相对路径为名称的条目。这解决了进程改变其当前工作目录时的缓存问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8030
msgid ""
"``FileFinder`` no longer inserts a dot in the path, e.g. ``/egg/./spam`` is "
"now ``/egg/spam``."
msgstr "``FileFinder`` 不再在路径中插入点，例如 ``/egg/./spam`` 现在是 ``/egg/spam``。"

#: ../NEWS:8033
msgid ""
":gh:`93621`: Change order of bytecode instructions emitted for "
":keyword:`with` and :keyword:`async with` to reduce the number of entries in"
" the exception table."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93621`: 改变 :keyword:`with` 和 :keyword:`async with` "
"发出的字节码指令顺序，以减少异常表中的条目数量。"

#: ../NEWS:8037
msgid ""
":gh:`93533`: Reduce the size of the inline cache for ``LOAD_METHOD`` by 2 "
"bytes."
msgstr ":gh:`93533`: 将 ``LOAD_METHOD`` 的内联缓存大小减少 2 字节。"

#: ../NEWS:8040
msgid ""
":gh:`93444`: Removed redundant fields from the compiler's basicblock struct:"
" ``b_nofallthrough``, ``b_exit``, ``b_return``. They can be easily "
"calculated from the opcode of the last instruction of the block."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93444`: "
"从编译器的基础块结构中移除了冗余字段：``b_nofallthrough``、``b_exit``、``b_return``。它们可以从块的最后一条指令的操作码中轻松计算出来。"

#: ../NEWS:8044
msgid ""
":gh:`93429`: ``LOAD_METHOD`` instruction has been removed. It was merged "
"back into ``LOAD_ATTR``."
msgstr ":gh:`93429`: ``LOAD_METHOD`` 指令已被移除。它被合并回 ``LOAD_ATTR``。"

#: ../NEWS:8047
msgid ""
":gh:`93418`: Fixed an assert where an f-string has an equal sign '=' "
"following an expression, but there's no trailing brace. For example, "
"f\"{i=\"."
msgstr ":gh:`93418`: 修复了一个断言错误，其中 f-string 在表达式后有一个等号 '='，但没有尾随的大括号。例如，f\"{i=\"。"

#: ../NEWS:8051
msgid ""
":gh:`93382`: Cache the result of :c:func:`PyCode_GetCode` function to "
"restore the *O*\\ (1) lookup of the :attr:`~types.CodeType.co_code` "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93382`: 缓存 :c:func:`PyCode_GetCode` 函数的结果，以恢复 "
":attr:`~types.CodeType.co_code` 属性的 *O*\\ (1) 查找。"

#: ../NEWS:8054
msgid ""
":gh:`93359`: Ensure that custom :mod:`ast` nodes without explicit end "
"positions can be compiled. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":gh:`93359`: 确保没有明确结束位置的自定义 :mod:`ast` 节点可以被编译。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8057
msgid ""
":gh:`93356`: Code for exception handlers is emitted at the end of the code "
"unit's bytecode. This avoids one jump when no exception is raised."
msgstr ":gh:`93356`: 异常处理器的代码在代码单元的字节码末尾发出。这在没有引发异常时避免了一次跳转。"

#: ../NEWS:8060
msgid ""
":gh:`93354`: Use exponential backoff for specialization counters in the "
"interpreter. Can reduce the number of failed specializations significantly "
"and avoid slowdown for those parts of a program that are not suitable for "
"specialization."
msgstr ":gh:`93354`: 在解释器中对专门化计数器使用指数退避。可以显著减少失败专门化的数量，并避免对程序中不适合专门化的部分造成减速。"

#: ../NEWS:8065
msgid ""
":gh:`93283`: Improve error message for invalid syntax of conversion "
"character in f-string expressions."
msgstr ":gh:`93283`: 改进了 f-string 表达式中无效转换字符语法错误的消息。"

#: ../NEWS:8068
msgid ""
":gh:`93345`: Fix a crash in substitution of a ``TypeVar`` in nested generic "
"alias after ``TypeVarTuple``."
msgstr ":gh:`93345`: 修复了在 ``TypeVarTuple`` 之后嵌套泛型别名中替换 ``TypeVar`` 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8071
msgid ""
":gh:`93223`: When a bytecode instruction jumps to an unconditional jump "
"instruction, the first instruction can often be optimized to target the "
"unconditional jump's target directly. For tracing reasons, this would "
"previously only occur if both instructions have the same line number. This "
"also now occurs if the unconditional jump is artificial, i.e., if it has no "
"associated line number."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93223`: "
"当一个字节码指令跳转到一个无条件跳转指令时，第一条指令通常可以优化为直接跳转到无条件跳转的目标。出于追踪原因，以前只有在两条指令具有相同行号时才会发生这种情况。现在，如果无条件跳转是人工的，即没有关联的行号，也会发生这种情况。"

#: ../NEWS:8078
msgid ""
":gh:`84694`: The ``--experimental-isolated-subinterpreters`` configure "
"option and ``EXPERIMENTAL_ISOLATED_SUBINTERPRETERS`` macro have been "
"removed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`84694`: 配置选项 ``--experimental-isolated-subinterpreters`` 和宏 "
"``EXPERIMENTAL_ISOLATED_SUBINTERPRETERS`` 已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:8081
msgid ""
":gh:`91924`: Fix ``__lltrace__`` debug feature if the stdout encoding is not"
" UTF-8. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91924`: 修复了当标准输出编码不是 UTF-8 时的 ``__lltrace__`` 调试功能。由 Victor Stinner "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8084
msgid ""
":gh:`93040`: Wraps unused parameters in ``Objects/obmalloc.c`` with "
"``Py_UNUSED``."
msgstr ":gh:`93040`: 在 ``Objects/obmalloc.c`` 中用 ``Py_UNUSED`` 包裹未使用的参数。"

#: ../NEWS:8087
msgid ""
":gh:`93143`: Avoid ``NULL`` checks for uninitialized local variables by "
"determining at compile time which variables must be initialized."
msgstr ":gh:`93143`: 通过在编译时确定哪些变量必须初始化，避免对未初始化的局部变量进行 ``NULL`` 检查。"

#: ../NEWS:8090
msgid ""
":gh:`93061`: Backward jumps after ``async for`` loops are no longer given "
"dubious line numbers."
msgstr ":gh:`93061`: ``async for`` 循环后的向后跳转不再赋予可疑的行号。"

#: ../NEWS:8093
msgid ""
":gh:`93065`: Fix contextvars HAMT implementation to handle iteration over "
"deep trees."
msgstr ":gh:`93065`: 修复了 contextvars HAMT 实现以处理对深树的迭代。"

#: ../NEWS:8096
msgid ""
"The bug was discovered and fixed by Eli Libman. See "
"`MagicStack/immutables#84 "
"<https://github.com/MagicStack/immutables/issues/84>`_ for more details."
msgstr ""
"该错误由 Eli Libman 发现并修复。更多详情请见 `MagicStack/immutables#84 "
"<https://github.com/MagicStack/immutables/issues/84>`_。"

#: ../NEWS:8100
msgid ""
":gh:`93012`: Added the new function :c:func:`PyType_FromMetaclass`, which "
"generalizes the existing :c:func:`PyType_FromModuleAndSpec` using an "
"additional metaclass argument. This is useful for language binding tools, "
"where it can be used to intercept type-related operations like subclassing "
"or static attribute access by specifying a metaclass with custom slots."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93012`: 添加了新函数 :c:func:`PyType_FromMetaclass`，该函数通过额外的元类参数泛化了现有的 "
":c:func:`PyType_FromModuleAndSpec`。这对于语言绑定工具非常有用，可以通过指定具有自定义槽的元类来拦截类型相关的操作，如子类化或静态属性访问。"

#: ../NEWS:8106
msgid ""
"Importantly, :c:func:`PyType_FromMetaclass` is available in the Limited API,"
" which provides a path towards migrating more binding tools onto the Stable "
"ABI."
msgstr ""
"重要的是，:c:func:`PyType_FromMetaclass` 可在有限 API 中使用，这为将更多绑定工具迁移到稳定 ABI 上提供了途径。"

#: ../NEWS:8110
msgid ""
":gh:`93021`: Fix the :attr:`__text_signature__` for :meth:`__get__` methods "
"implemented in C. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93021`: 修复了在 C 中实现的 :meth:`__get__` 方法的 :attr:`__text_signature__`。补丁由 "
"Jelle Zijlstra 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:8113
msgid ""
":gh:`89914`: The operand of the ``YIELD_VALUE`` instruction is set to the "
"stack depth. This is done to help frame handling on ``yield`` and may assist"
" debuggers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89914`: ``YIELD_VALUE`` 指令的操作数被设置为堆栈深度。这样做是为了帮助在 ``yield`` "
"时的帧处理，并可能协助调试器。"

#: ../NEWS:8117
msgid ""
":gh:`92955`: Fix memory leak in code object's lines and positions iterators "
"as they were not finalized at exit. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`92955`: 修复代码对象的行和位置迭代器中的内存泄漏，因为它们未在退出时完成。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8120
msgid ""
":gh:`92930`: Fixed a crash in ``_pickle.c`` from mutating collections during"
" ``__reduce__`` or ``persistent_id``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92930`: 修复了在 ``__reduce__`` 或 ``persistent_id`` 期间修改集合导致的 ``_pickle.c``"
" 崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:8123
msgid ""
":gh:`90690`: The PRECALL instruction has been removed. It offered only a "
"small advantage for specialization and is not needed in the vast majority of"
" cases."
msgstr ":gh:`90690`: PRECALL 指令已被移除。它对特殊化仅提供小优势且在绝大多数情况下不需要。"

#: ../NEWS:8127
msgid ""
":gh:`92914`: Always round the allocated size for lists up to the nearest "
"even number."
msgstr ":gh:`92914`: 总是将列表的分配大小向上舍入到最近的偶数。"

#: ../NEWS:8130
msgid ""
":gh:`92858`: Improve error message for some suites with syntax error before "
"':'"
msgstr ":gh:`92858`: 改进在 ':' 之前有语法错误的某些套件的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:8133
msgid ""
":gh:`90473`: Decrease default recursion limit on WASI to address limited "
"call stack size."
msgstr ":gh:`90473`: 在 WASI 上降低默认递归限制以解决有限的调用栈大小问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8136
msgid ""
":gh:`92804`: Fix memory leak in ``memoryview`` iterator as it was not "
"finalized at exit. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92804`: 修复 ``memoryview`` 迭代器中的内存泄漏，因为它未在退出时完成。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8139
msgid ""
":gh:`92777`: Specialize ``LOAD_METHOD`` for objects with lazy dictionaries. "
"Patch by Ken Jin."
msgstr ":gh:`92777`: 为具有懒字典的对象专门化 ``LOAD_METHOD``。由 Ken Jin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8142
msgid ""
":gh:`92658`: Add support for connecting and binding to Hyper-V sockets on "
"Windows Hyper-V hosts and guests."
msgstr ":gh:`92658`: 增加对 Windows Hyper-V 主机和客机上 Hyper-V 套接字的连接和绑定支持。"

#: ../NEWS:8145
msgid ""
":gh:`92236`: Remove spurious \"LINE\" event when starting a generator or "
"coroutine, visible tracing functions implemented in C."
msgstr ":gh:`92236`: 移除在启动生成器或协程时可见的虚假 \"LINE\" 事件，这些事件在 C 中实现的追踪函数中可见。"

#: ../NEWS:8148
msgid ""
":gh:`91102`: :meth:`!_warnings.warn_explicit` is ported to Argument Clinic."
msgstr ":gh:`91102`: :meth:`!_warnings.warn_explicit` 已移植到 Argument Clinic。"

#: ../NEWS:8150
msgid ""
":gh:`92619`: Make the compiler duplicate an exit block only if none of its "
"instructions have a lineno (previously only the first instruction in the "
"block was checked, leading to unnecessarily duplicated blocks)."
msgstr ":gh:`92619`: 使编译器仅在退出块中的指令都没有行号时才复制退出块（之前仅检查块中的第一条指令，导致不必要的块复制）。"

#: ../NEWS:8154
msgid ""
":gh:`88750`: The deprecated debug build only ``PYTHONTHREADDEBUG`` "
"environment variable no longer does anything."
msgstr ":gh:`88750`: 弃用的仅调试构建 ``PYTHONTHREADDEBUG`` 环境变量不再有任何作用。"

#: ../NEWS:8157
msgid ":gh:`92261`: Fix hang when trying to iterate over a ``typing.Union``."
msgstr ":gh:`92261`: 修复尝试迭代 ``typing.Union`` 时的挂起问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8159
msgid ""
":gh:`91432`: Specialized the :opcode:`FOR_ITER` opcode using the PEP 659 "
"machinery"
msgstr ":gh:`91432`: 使用 PEP 659 机制专门化 :opcode:`FOR_ITER` 操作码"

#: ../NEWS:8162
msgid ""
":gh:`91399`: Removed duplicate '{0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}' entry in "
"'Objects/unicodetype_db.h'."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91399`: 移除了 'Objects/unicodetype_db.h' 中重复的 '{0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}' 条目。"

#: ../NEWS:8165
msgid ":gh:`91578`: Updates the error message for abstract class."
msgstr ":gh:`91578`: 更新了抽象类的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:8167
msgid ""
":issue:`47091`: Improve performance of repetition of :class:`list` and "
":class:`tuple` by using ``memcpy`` to copy data and performing the reference"
" increments in one step."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47091`: 通过使用 ``memcpy`` 复制数据并在一步中执行引用增量来提高 :class:`list` 和 "
":class:`tuple` 重复的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:8171
msgid ""
":issue:`46142`: Make ``--help`` output shorter by moving some info to the "
"new ``--help-env`` and ``--help-xoptions`` command-line options. Also add "
"``--help-all`` option to print complete usage."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46142`: 通过将一些信息移至新的命令行选项 ``--help-env`` 和 ``--help-xoptions``，使 "
"``--help`` 输出更简短。同时添加 ``--help-all`` 选项以打印完整用法。"

#: ../NEWS:8175
msgid ""
":issue:`42316`: Document some places where an assignment expression needs "
"parentheses."
msgstr ":issue:`42316`: 记录一些需要括号的赋值表达式的地方。"

#: ../NEWS:8181
msgid ""
":gh:`89237`: Fix hang on Windows in ``subprocess.wait_closed()`` in "
":mod:`asyncio` with :class:`~asyncio.ProactorEventLoop`. Patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89237`: 修复了在 Windows 上使用 :class:`~asyncio.ProactorEventLoop` "
"时，:mod:`asyncio` 中 ``subprocess.wait_closed()`` 的挂起问题。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8185
msgid ""
":gh:`97928`: :meth:`tkinter.Text.count` raises now an exception for options "
"starting with \"-\" instead of silently ignoring them."
msgstr ":gh:`97928`: :meth:`tkinter.Text.count` 现在会对以 \"-\" 开头的选项抛出异常，而不是静默忽略它们。"

#: ../NEWS:8188
msgid ""
":gh:`98393`: The :mod:`os` module no longer accepts bytes-like paths, like "
":class:`bytearray` and :class:`memoryview` types: only the exact "
":class:`bytes` type is accepted for bytes strings. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98393`: :mod:`os` 模块不再接受类似 :class:`bytearray` 和 :class:`memoryview` "
"类型的字节类路径：只有确切的 :class:`bytes` 类型被接受用于字节字符串。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8193
msgid ""
":gh:`98363`: Added itertools.batched() to batch data into lists of a given "
"length with the last list possibly being shorter than the others."
msgstr ":gh:`98363`: 添加了 itertools.batched() 以将数据分批成给定长度的列表，最后一个列表可能比其他列表短。"

#: ../NEWS:8196
msgid ""
":gh:`98331`: Update the bundled copies of pip and setuptools to versions "
"22.3 and 65.5.0 respectively."
msgstr ":gh:`98331`: 将捆绑的 pip 和 setuptools 的副本分别更新到 22.3 和 65.5.0 版本。"

#: ../NEWS:8199
msgid ""
":gh:`98307`: A :meth:`~logging.handlers.SysLogHandler.createSocket` method "
"was added to :class:`~logging.handlers.SysLogHandler`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98307`: 向 :class:`~logging.handlers.SysLogHandler` 添加了一个 "
":meth:`~logging.handlers.SysLogHandler.createSocket` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:8202
msgid ""
":gh:`96035`: Fix bug in :func:`urllib.parse.urlparse` that causes certain "
"port numbers containing whitespace, underscores, plus and minus signs, or "
"non-ASCII digits to be incorrectly accepted."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96035`: 修复了 :func:`urllib.parse.urlparse` "
"中的一个错误，该错误导致某些包含空格、下划线、加号和减号或非ASCII数字的端口号被错误地接受。"

#: ../NEWS:8206
msgid ""
":gh:`98257`: Make :func:`sys.setprofile` and :func:`sys.settrace` functions "
"reentrant. They can no long fail with: ``RuntimeError(\"Cannot install a "
"trace function while another trace function is being installed\")``. Patch "
"by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98257`: 使 :func:`sys.setprofile` 和 :func:`sys.settrace` "
"函数可重入。它们不再会失败并显示：``RuntimeError(\"Cannot install a trace function while "
"another trace function is being installed\")``。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8211
msgid ""
":gh:`98251`: Allow :mod:`venv` to pass along :envvar:`!PYTHON*` variables to"
" ``ensurepip`` and ``pip`` when they do not impact path resolution"
msgstr ""
":gh:`98251`: 允许 :mod:`venv` 在不影响路径解析的情况下，将 :envvar:`!PYTHON*` 变量传递给 "
"``ensurepip`` 和 ``pip``。"

#: ../NEWS:8214
msgid ""
":gh:`94597`: Deprecated "
":meth:`asyncio.AbstractEventLoopPolicy.get_child_watcher` and "
":meth:`asyncio.AbstractEventLoopPolicy.set_child_watcher` methods to be "
"removed in Python 3.14. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94597`: 弃用了 :meth:`asyncio.AbstractEventLoopPolicy.get_child_watcher` 和"
" :meth:`asyncio.AbstractEventLoopPolicy.set_child_watcher` 方法，将在 Python 3.14"
" 中移除。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8219
msgid ""
":gh:`98178`: On macOS, fix a crash in :func:`syslog.syslog` in multi-"
"threaded applications. On macOS, the libc ``syslog()`` function is not "
"thread-safe, so :func:`syslog.syslog` no longer releases the GIL to call it."
" Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98178`: 在 macOS 上，修复 :func:`syslog.syslog` 在多线程应用程序中的崩溃问题。在 macOS "
"上，libc ``syslog()`` 函数不是线程安全的，因此 :func:`syslog.syslog` 不再释放 GIL 来调用它。由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8224
msgid ""
":gh:`44098`: Release the GIL when creating :class:`mmap.mmap` objects on "
"Unix."
msgstr ":gh:`44098`: 在 Unix 上创建 :class:`mmap.mmap` 对象时释放 GIL。"

#: ../NEWS:8227
msgid ""
":gh:`87730`: Wrap network errors consistently in urllib FTP support, so the "
"test suite doesn't fail when a network is available but the public internet "
"is not reachable."
msgstr ":gh:`87730`: 在 urllib FTP 支持中一致地包装网络错误，因此当网络可用但无法访问公共互联网时，测试套件不会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:8231
msgid ""
":gh:`94597`: The child watcher classes "
":class:`~asyncio.MultiLoopChildWatcher`, :class:`~asyncio.FastChildWatcher` "
"and :class:`~asyncio.SafeChildWatcher` are deprecated and will be removed in"
" Python 3.14. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94597`: 子监视器类 "
":class:`~asyncio.MultiLoopChildWatcher`、:class:`~asyncio.FastChildWatcher` 和"
" :class:`~asyncio.SafeChildWatcher` 已被弃用，将在 Python 3.14 中移除。由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8236
msgid ""
":gh:`98023`: Change default child watcher to "
":class:`~asyncio.PidfdChildWatcher` on Linux systems which supports it. "
"Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
