"\"variable\"，不同父部件中的复选框可以有相同的短名称并共享相同的状态。现在它们是全局唯一的。"

#: ../NEWS:8305
msgid ":gh:`96865`: fix Flag to use boundary CONFORM"
msgstr ":gh:`96865`: 修复 Flag 以使用边界 CONFORM"

#: ../NEWS:8307
msgid ""
"This restores previous Flag behavior of allowing flags with non-sequential "
