msgstr ":gh:`94821`: 修复 Linux 上 Unix 套接字绑定到空地址时使用抽象命名空间中的可用地址，而不是 \"\\0\"。"

#: ../NEWS:8534
msgid ""
":gh:`94736`: Fix crash when deallocating an instance of a subclass of "
"``_multiprocessing.SemLock``. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94736`: 修复在释放 ``_multiprocessing.SemLock`` 子类实例时的崩溃问题。由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8537
msgid ":gh:`81620`: Add random.binomialvariate()."
msgstr ":gh:`81620`: 添加 random.binomialvariate()。"

#: ../NEWS:8539
msgid ""
":gh:`74116`: Allow :meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.drain` to be awaited "
"concurrently by multiple tasks. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`74116`: 允许 :meth:`asyncio.StreamWriter.drain` 被多个任务并发等待。由 Kumar Aditya "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8542
msgid ""
":gh:`87822`: When called with ``capture_locals=True``, the :mod:`traceback` "
"module functions swallow exceptions raised from calls to ``repr()`` on local"
" variables of frames. This is in order to prioritize the original exception "
"over rendering errors.  An indication of the failure is printed in place of "
"the missing value.  (Patch by Simon-Martin Schroeder)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87822`: 当以 ``capture_locals=True`` 调用时，:mod:`traceback` "
"模块函数会吞掉在帧的局部变量上调用 ``repr()`` 时引发的异常。这是为了优先考虑原始异常而非渲染错误。失败指示会代替缺失的值被打印出来。（由 "
"Simon-Martin Schroeder 提供补丁）。"

#: ../NEWS:8548
msgid ""
":gh:`88050`: Fix :mod:`asyncio` subprocess transport to kill process cleanly"
" when process is blocked and avoid ``RuntimeError`` when loop is closed. "
"Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`88050`: 修复 :mod:`asyncio` 子进程传输，以便在进程被阻塞时干净地杀死进程，并避免在循环关闭时出现 "
"``RuntimeError``。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8552
msgid ""
":gh:`94637`: :meth:`SSLContext.set_default_verify_paths` now releases the "
"GIL around ``SSL_CTX_set_default_verify_paths`` call. The function call "
"performs I/O and CPU intensive work."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94637`: :meth:`SSLContext.set_default_verify_paths` 现在在 "
"``SSL_CTX_set_default_verify_paths`` 调用周围释放 GIL。该函数调用执行 I/O 和 CPU 密集型工作。"

#: ../NEWS:8556
msgid ""
":gh:`94309`: Deprecate aliases :class:`typing.Hashable` and "
":class:`typing.Sized`"
msgstr ":gh:`94309`: 弃用别名 :class:`typing.Hashable` 和 :class:`typing.Sized`"

#: ../NEWS:8559
msgid ""
":gh:`92546`: An undocumented ``python -m pprint`` benchmark is moved into "
"``pprint`` suite of pyperformance. Patch by Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92546`: 一个未记录的 ``python -m pprint`` 基准测试被移动到 pyperformance 的 ``pprint``"
" 套件中。由 Oleg Iarygin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8562
msgid ""
":gh:`94607`: Fix subclassing complex generics with type variables in "
":mod:`typing`. Previously an error message saying ``Some type variables ... "
"are not listed in Generic[...]`` was shown. :mod:`typing` no longer "
"populates ``__parameters__`` with the ``__parameters__`` of a Python class."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94607`: 修复在 :mod:`typing` 中使用类型变量子类化复杂泛型的问题。之前会显示错误消息 ``Some type "
"variables ... are not listed in Generic[...]``。:mod:`typing` 不再用 Python 类的 "
"``__parameters__`` 填充 ``__parameters__``。"

#: ../NEWS:8568
msgid ""
":gh:`94619`: Remove the long-deprecated ``module_repr()`` from "
":mod:`importlib`."
msgstr ":gh:`94619`: 从 :mod:`importlib` 中移除长期弃用的 ``module_repr()``。"

#: ../NEWS:8571
msgid ""
":gh:`93910`: The ability to access the other values of an enum on an enum "
"(e.g. ``Color.RED.BLUE``) has been restored in order to fix a performance "
"regression."
msgstr ":gh:`93910`: 恢复了访问枚举上其他值的能力（例如 ``Color.RED.BLUE``），以修复性能回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:8575
msgid ""
":gh:`93896`: Fix :func:`asyncio.run` and "
":class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` to always the set event loop as it"
" was done in Python 3.10 and earlier. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93896`: 修复 :func:`asyncio.run` 和 "
":class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 以始终设置事件循环，如同在 Python 3.10 "
"及更早版本中所做的那样。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8579
msgid ""
":gh:`94343`: Allow setting the attributes of ``reprlib.Repr`` during object "
"initialization"
msgstr ":gh:`94343`: 允许在对象初始化期间设置 ``reprlib.Repr`` 的属性"

#: ../NEWS:8582
msgid ""
":gh:`94382`: Port static types of ``_multiprocessing`` module to heap types."
" Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94382`: 将 ``_multiprocessing`` 模块的静态类型移植到堆类型。补丁由 Kumar Aditya 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:8585
msgid ""
":gh:`78724`: Fix crash in :class:`struct.Struct` when it was not completely "
"initialized by initializing it in :meth:`~object.__new__`.  Patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`78724`: 通过在 :meth:`~object.__new__` 中初始化 :class:`struct.Struct` "
"来修复当其未被完全初始化时的崩溃问题。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8589
msgid ""
":gh:`94510`: Re-entrant calls to :func:`sys.setprofile` and "
":func:`sys.settrace` now raise :exc:`RuntimeError`. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94510`: 对 :func:`sys.setprofile` 和 :func:`sys.settrace` 的重新进入调用现在会引发 "
":exc:`RuntimeError`。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8593
msgid ""
":gh:`92336`: Fix bug where :meth:`linecache.getline` fails on bad files with"
