"或 :exc:`SyntaxError` 而失败的错误。根据文档，现在它返回一个空字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:8597
msgid ""
":gh:`94398`: Once a :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` has started shutting down "
"(i.e., at least one task has failed and the task group has started "
"cancelling the remaining tasks), it should not be possible to add new tasks "
"to the task group."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94398`: 一旦 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` "
"开始关闭（即，至少一个任务失败并且任务组开始取消剩余任务），就不应再向任务组添加新任务。"

#: ../NEWS:8602
msgid ""
":gh:`94383`: :mod:`xml.etree`: Remove the ``ElementTree.Element.copy()`` "
"method of the pure Python implementation, deprecated in Python 3.10, use the"
" :func:`copy.copy` function instead. The C implementation of "
":mod:`xml.etree` has no ``copy()`` method, only a ``__copy__()`` method. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94383`: :mod:`xml.etree`: 移除纯 Python 实现中的 "
"``ElementTree.Element.copy()`` 方法，该方法已在 Python 3.10 中弃用，改用 :func:`copy.copy`"
" 函数。:mod:`xml.etree` 的 C 实现没有 ``copy()`` 方法，只有 ``__copy__()`` 方法。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8608
msgid ""
":gh:`94379`: :mod:`zipimport`: Remove ``find_loader()`` and "
"``find_module()`` methods, deprecated in Python 3.10: use the "
"``find_spec()`` method instead. See :pep:`451` for the rationale. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94379`: :mod:`zipimport`: 移除 ``find_loader()`` 和 ``find_module()`` "
"方法，这些方法已在 Python 3.10 中弃用：改用 ``find_spec()`` 方法。理由请见 :pep:`451`。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:8612
msgid ""
":gh:`94352`: :func:`shlex.split`: Passing ``None`` for *s* argument now "
"raises an exception, rather than reading :data:`sys.stdin`. The feature was "
"deprecated in Python 3.9. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
