"模块的构建问题。调试构建不再强制内联函数。"

#: ../NEWS:9361
msgid ""
":gh:`94841`: Fix the possible performance regression of "
":c:func:`PyObject_Free` compiled with MSVC version 1932."
msgstr ":gh:`94841`: 修复了使用 MSVC 版本 1932 编译的 :c:func:`PyObject_Free` 可能的性能回归。"

#: ../NEWS:9364
msgid ""
":gh:`94801`: ``configure`` now uses custom flags like ``ZLIB_CFLAGS`` and "
"``ZLIB_LIBS`` when searching for headers and libraries."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94801`: ``configure`` 现在在搜索头文件和库时使用自定义标志如 ``ZLIB_CFLAGS`` 和 "
"``ZLIB_LIBS``。"

#: ../NEWS:9367
msgid ""
":gh:`94773`: ``deepfreeze.py`` now supports code object with frozensets that"
" contain incompatible, unsortable types."
msgstr ":gh:`94773`: ``deepfreeze.py`` 现在支持包含不兼容、不可排序类型的 frozensets 的代码对象。"

#: ../NEWS:9370
msgid ":gh:`94682`: Build and test with OpenSSL 1.1.1q"
msgstr ":gh:`94682`: 使用 OpenSSL 1.1.1q 进行构建和测试"

#: ../NEWS:9372
msgid ""
":gh:`90005`: Dependencies of :mod:`readline` and :mod:`curses` module are "
"now detected in ``configure`` script with ``pkg-config``. Only ``ncurses`` /"
" ``ncursesw`` are detected automatically. The old ``curses`` library is not "
"configured automatically. Workaround for missing ``termcap`` or ``tinfo`` "
"library has been removed."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90005`: :mod:`readline` 和 :mod:`curses` 模块的依赖现在在 ``configure`` 脚本中通过 "
"``pkg-config`` 检测。只有 ``ncurses`` / ``ncursesw`` 被自动检测。旧的 ``curses`` "
"库不再自动配置。对于缺失 ``termcap`` 或 ``tinfo`` 库的变通方法已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:9378
msgid ""
":gh:`90005`: Fix building ``_ctypes`` extension without ``pkg-config``."
msgstr ":gh:`90005`: 修复了在没有 ``pkg-config`` 的情况下构建 ``_ctypes`` 扩展的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9380
msgid ""
":gh:`90005`: ``_dbm`` module dependencies are now detected by configure."
msgstr ":gh:`90005`: ``_dbm`` 模块的依赖现在由 configure 检测。"

#: ../NEWS:9382
msgid ""
":gh:`94404`: ``makesetup`` now works around an issue with sed on macOS and "
"uses correct CFLAGS for object files that end up in a shared extension. "
"Module CFLAGS are used before PY_STDMODULE_CFLAGS to avoid clashes with "
"system headers."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94404`: ``makesetup`` 现在解决了 macOS 上 sed 的问题，并为最终出现在共享扩展中的对象文件使用了正确的 "
"CFLAGS。模块 CFLAGS 在 PY_STDMODULE_CFLAGS 之前使用，以避免与系统头文件冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:9387
msgid ""
":gh:`93939`: C extension modules are now built by ``configure`` and ``make``"
" instead of ``distutils`` and ``setup.py``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93939`: C 扩展模块现在由 ``configure`` 和 ``make`` 构建，而不是 ``distutils`` 和 "
"``setup.py``。"

#: ../NEWS:9390
msgid ""
":gh:`93939`: The ``2to3``, ``idle``, and ``pydoc`` scripts are now generated"
" and installed by ``Makefile`` instead of ``setup.py``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93939`: ``2to3``、``idle`` 和 ``pydoc`` 脚本现在由 ``Makefile`` 生成和安装，而不是 "
"``setup.py``。"

#: ../NEWS:9393
msgid ""
":gh:`94280`: Updated pegen regeneration script on Windows to find and use "
"Python 3.9 or higher.  Prior to this, pegen regeneration already required "
"3.9 or higher, but the script may have used lower versions of Python."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94280`: 在Windows上更新了pegen重新生成脚本，以查找并使用Python "
"3.9或更高版本。在此之前，pegen重新生成已经要求3.9或更高版本，但脚本可能使用了较低版本的Python。"

#: ../NEWS:9397
msgid ""
":gh:`93584`: Address race condition in ``Makefile`` when installing a PGO "
"build. All ``test`` and ``install`` targets now depend on ``all`` target."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93584`: 解决了在安装PGO构建时 ``Makefile``中的竞争条件。所有 ``test`` 和 ``install`` "
"目标现在都依赖于 ``all`` 目标。"

#: ../NEWS:9400
msgid ""
":gh:`93491`: ``configure`` now detects and reports :pep:`11` support tiers."
msgstr ":gh:`93491`: ``configure`` 现在检测并报告 :pep:`11` 支持层级。"

#: ../NEWS:9402
msgid ""
":gh:`69093`: Fix ``Modules/Setup.stdlib.in`` rule for ``_sqlite3`` "
"extension."
msgstr ":gh:`69093`: 修复了 ``Modules/Setup.stdlib.in`` 中 ``_sqlite3`` 扩展的规则。"

#: ../NEWS:9404
msgid ""
":gh:`93207`: ``va_start()`` with two parameters, like ``va_start(args, "
"format),`` is now required to build Python. ``va_start()`` is no longer "
"called with a single parameter. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93207`: 现在构建Python需要带有两个参数的 ``va_start()``，如``va_start(args, "
"format),``。``va_start()``不再使用单个参数调用。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9408
msgid ""
":gh:`93202`: Python now always use the ``%zu`` and ``%zd`` printf formats to"
" format a :c:type:`size_t` or ``Py_ssize_t`` number. Building Python 3.12 "
"requires a C11 compiler, so these printf formats are now always supported. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93202`: Python现在总是使用 ``%zu`` 和 ``%zd`` printf格式来格式化 :c:type:`size_t` "
"或``Py_ssize_t``数字。构建Python 3.12需要一个C11编译器，因此现在总是支持这些printf格式。补丁由Victor "
"Stinner提供。"

#: ../NEWS:9413
msgid ""
":gh:`90473`: Disable pymalloc and increase stack size on ``wasm32-wasi``."
msgstr ":gh:`90473`: 在 ``wasm32-wasi`` 上禁用pymalloc并增加堆栈大小。"

#: ../NEWS:9415
msgid ""
":issue:`34449`: Drop invalid compiler switch ``-fPIC`` for HP aCC on HP-UX. "
"Patch by Michael Osipov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34449`: 为HP-UX上的HP aCC移除无效的编译器开关 ``-fPIC``。由Michael Osipov提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9421
msgid ""
":gh:`98360`: Fixes :mod:`multiprocessing` spawning child processes on "
"Windows from a virtual environment to ensure that child processes that also "
"use :mod:`multiprocessing` to spawn more children will recognize that they "
"are in a virtual environment."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98360`: 修复了 :mod:`multiprocessing` 在Windows上从虚拟环境生成子进程的问题，以确保同样使用 "
":mod:`multiprocessing` 生成更多子进程的子进程能够识别它们处于虚拟环境中。"

#: ../NEWS:9426
msgid ""
":gh:`98414`: Fix :file:`py.exe` launcher handling of :samp:`-V:{<company>}/`"
" option when default preferences have been set in environment variables or "
"configuration files."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98414`: 修复了 :file:`py.exe` 启动器对 :samp:`-V:{<company>}/` "
"选项的处理，当默认首选项已在环境变量或配置文件中设置时。"

#: ../NEWS:9430
msgid ""
":gh:`97728`: Fix possible crashes caused by the use of uninitialized "
"variables when pass invalid arguments in :func:`os.system` on Windows and in"
" Windows-specific modules (like ``winreg``)."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97728`: 修复了在Windows上 :func:`os.system` 和Windows特定模块（如 "
"``winreg``）中传递无效参数时使用未初始化变量可能导致的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:9434
msgid ""
":gh:`90989`: Made :ref:`launcher` install per-user by default (unless an all"
" users install already exists), and clarify some text in the installer."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90989`: 默认情况下使 :ref:`launcher` 按用户安装（除非已经存在所有用户安装），并澄清安装程序中的一些文本。"

#: ../NEWS:9437
msgid ":gh:`97649`: The ``Tools`` directory is no longer installed on Windows"
msgstr ":gh:`97649`: ``Tools`` 目录不再安装在Windows上。"

#: ../NEWS:9439
msgid ":gh:`96965`: Update libffi to 3.4.3"
msgstr ":gh:`96965`: 将libffi更新至3.4.3。"

#: ../NEWS:9441
msgid ":gh:`96577`: Fixes a potential buffer overrun in :mod:`msilib`."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:9443
msgid ""
":gh:`96559`: Fixes the Windows launcher not using the compatible "
"interpretation of default tags found in configuration files when no tag was "
"passed to the command."
msgstr ":gh:`96559`: 修复了当没有向命令传递标签时，Windows启动器不使用配置文件中找到的默认标签的兼容性解释的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9447
msgid ""
":gh:`94781`: Fix :file:`pcbuild.proj` to clean previous instances of output "
"files in ``Python\\deepfreeze`` and ``Python\\frozen_modules`` directories "
"on Windows. Patch by Charlie Zhao."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94781`: 修复 :file:`pcbuild.proj` 以清理 Windows 上 ``Python\\deepfreeze`` 和 "
"``Python\\frozen_modules`` 目录中输出文件的先前实例。由 Charlie Zhao 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9451
msgid ""
":gh:`89545`: Updates :mod:`platform` code getting the Windows version to use"
" native Windows Management Instrumentation (WMI) queries to determine OS "
"version, type, and architecture."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89545`: 更新 :mod:`platform` 代码，获取 Windows 版本以使用本机 Windows Management "
"Instrumentation (WMI) 查询来确定操作系统版本、类型和架构。"

#: ../NEWS:9455
msgid ""
":gh:`95733`: Make certain requirements of the Windows Store package optional"
" to allow installing on earlier updates of Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`95733`: 使 Windows Store 包的某些要求成为可选，以允许在 Windows 的早期更新上安装。"

#: ../NEWS:9458
msgid ""
":gh:`95656`: Enable the :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.enable_load_extension` "
":mod:`sqlite3` API."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95656`: 启用 :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.enable_load_extension` "
":mod:`sqlite3` API。"

#: ../NEWS:9461
msgid ""
":gh:`95587`: Fixes some issues where the Windows installer would incorrectly"
" detect certain features of an existing install when upgrading."
msgstr ":gh:`95587`: 修复了 Windows 安装程序在升级时错误检测现有安装的某些功能的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9464
msgid ""
":gh:`94399`: Restores the behaviour of :ref:`launcher` for ``/usr/bin/env`` "
"shebang lines, which will now search :envvar:`PATH` for an executable "
"matching the given command. If none is found, the usual search process is "
"used."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94399`: 恢复了 :ref:`launcher` 对于 ``/usr/bin/env`` shebang 行的行为，现在将在 "
":envvar:`PATH` 中搜索与给定命令匹配的可执行文件。如果没有找到，则使用通常的搜索过程。"

#: ../NEWS:9469
msgid ""
":gh:`95445`: Fixes the unsuccessful removal of the HTML document directory "
"when uninstalling with Windows msi."
msgstr ":gh:`95445`: 修复了在使用 Windows msi 卸载时未能成功删除 HTML 文档目录的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9472
msgid ""
":gh:`95359`: Fix :ref:`launcher` handling of :file:`py.ini` commands (it was"
" incorrectly expecting a ``py_`` prefix on keys) and crashes when reading "
"per-user configuration file."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95359`: 修复 :ref:`launcher` 对 :file:`py.ini` 命令的处理（它错误地期望键上有 ``py_`` "
"前缀）以及在读取每用户配置文件时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9476
msgid ""
":gh:`95285`: Fix :ref:`launcher` handling of command lines where it is only "
"passed a short executable name."
msgstr ":gh:`95285`: 修复 :ref:`launcher` 处理仅传递短可执行名称的命令行的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9479
msgid ""
":gh:`90844`: Allow virtual environments to correctly launch when they have "
"spaces in the path."
msgstr ":gh:`90844`: 允许虚拟环境在路径中有空格时正确启动。"

#: ../NEWS:9482
msgid ""
":gh:`94772`: Fix incorrect handling of shebang lines in py.exe launcher"
msgstr ":gh:`94772`: 修复 py.exe 启动器中 shebang 行的错误处理"

#: ../NEWS:9484
msgid ""
":gh:`94018`: :mod:`zipfile` will now remove trailing spaces from path "
"components when extracting files on Windows."
msgstr ":gh:`94018`: :mod:`zipfile` 现在将在 Windows 上提取文件时从路径组件中删除尾随空格。"

#: ../NEWS:9487
msgid ""
":gh:`93824`: Drag and drop of files onto Python files in Windows Explorer "
"has been enabled for Windows ARM64."
msgstr ":gh:`93824`: 对于 Windows ARM64，已启用将文件拖放到 Windows 资源管理器中的 Python 文件上。"

#: ../NEWS:9490
msgid ""
":gh:`43414`: :func:`os.get_terminal_size` now attempts to read the size from"
" any provided handle, rather than only supporting file descriptors 0, 1 and "
"2."
msgstr ""
":gh:`43414`: :func:`os.get_terminal_size` 现在尝试从任何提供的句柄读取大小，而不仅支持文件描述符 0、1 和 "
"2。"

#: ../NEWS:9494
msgid ""
":gh:`92817`: Ensures that :file:`py.exe` will prefer an active virtual "
"environment over default tags specified with environment variables or "
"through a :file:`py.ini` file."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92817`: 确保 :file:`py.exe` 将优先选择活动的虚拟环境，而不是通过环境变量或 :file:`py.ini` "
"文件指定的默认标签。"

#: ../NEWS:9498
msgid ""
":gh:`92984`: Explicitly disable incremental linking for non-Debug builds"
msgstr ":gh:`92984`: 明确为非调试构建禁用增量链接"

#: ../NEWS:9500
msgid ""
":gh:`92841`: :mod:`asyncio` no longer throws ``RuntimeError: Event loop is "
"closed`` on interpreter exit after asynchronous socket activity. Patch by "
"Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92841`: :mod:`asyncio` 在异步套接字活动后解释器退出时不再抛出 ``RuntimeError: Event loop "
"is closed``。由 Oleg Iarygin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9504
msgid ":issue:`46907`: Update Windows installer to use SQLite 3.38.4."
msgstr ":issue:`46907`: 更新 Windows 安装程序以使用 SQLite 3.38.4。"

#: ../NEWS:9506
msgid ":gh:`91061`: Accept os.PathLike for the argument to winsound.PlaySound"
msgstr ":gh:`91061`: 接受 os.PathLike 作为 winsound.PlaySound 的参数"

#: ../NEWS:9508
msgid ""
":issue:`42658`: Support native Windows case-insensitive path comparisons by "
"using ``LCMapStringEx`` instead of :func:`str.lower` in "
":func:`ntpath.normcase`. Add ``LCMapStringEx`` to the :mod:`!_winapi` "
"module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42658`: 通过使用 ``LCMapStringEx`` 而不是 :func:`str.lower` 在 "
":func:`ntpath.normcase` 中支持原生的 Windows 大小写不敏感路径比较。将 ``LCMapStringEx`` 添加到 "
":mod:`!_winapi` 模块。"

#: ../NEWS:9513
msgid ":issue:`38704`: Prevent installation on unsupported Windows versions."
msgstr ":issue:`38704`: 阻止在不支持的 Windows 版本上安装。"

#: ../NEWS:9518
msgid ""
":gh:`97897`: The macOS 13 SDK includes support for the ``mkfifoat`` and "
"``mknodat`` system calls. Using the ``dir_fd`` option with either "
":func:`os.mkfifo` or :func:`os.mknod` could result in a segfault if cpython "
"is built with the macOS 13 SDK but run on an earlier version of macOS. "
"Prevent this by adding runtime support for detection of these system calls "
"(\"weaklinking\") as is done for other newer syscalls on macOS."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97897`: macOS 13 SDK 包含对 ``mkfifoat`` 和 ``mknodat`` 系统调用的支持。如果在使用 macOS"
" 13 SDK 构建的 cpython 但在较早版本的 macOS 上运行时，使用 ``dir_fd`` 选项与 :func:`os.mkfifo` 或"
" :func:`os.mknod` 可能导致段错误。通过添加对这些系统调用的运行时支持检测（“弱链接”）来防止这种情况，就像在 macOS "
"上对其他更新的系统调用所做的那样。"

#: ../NEWS:9528
msgid ""
":gh:`97527`: Fix a bug in the previous bugfix that caused IDLE to not start "
"when run with 3.10.8, 3.12.0a1, and at least Microsoft Python 3.10.2288.0 "
"installed without the Lib/test package.  3.11.0 was never affected."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97527`: 修复了之前的一个 bug，该 bug 导致在运行 3.10.8、3.12.0a1 和至少 Microsoft Python "
"3.10.2288.0 且未安装 Lib/test 包时，IDLE 无法启动。3.11.0 从未受到影响。"

#: ../NEWS:9532
msgid ":gh:`65802`: Document handling of extensions in Save As dialogs."
msgstr ":gh:`65802`: 记录在另存为对话框中处理扩展名的方法。"

#: ../NEWS:9534
msgid ""
":gh:`95191`: Include prompts when saving Shell (interactive input and "
"output)."
msgstr ":gh:`95191`: 保存 Shell（交互式输入和输出）时包括提示。"

#: ../NEWS:9537
msgid ""
":gh:`95511`: Fix the Shell context menu copy-with-prompts bug of copying an "
"extra line when one selects whole lines."
msgstr ":gh:`95511`: 修复 Shell 上下文菜单复制带提示的 bug，即当选择整行时会复制额外的行。"

#: ../NEWS:9540
msgid ""
":gh:`95471`: In the Edit menu, move ``Select All`` and add a new separator."
msgstr ":gh:`95471`: 在编辑菜单中，移动 ``Select All`` 并添加一个新的分隔符。"

#: ../NEWS:9542
msgid ":gh:`95411`: Enable using IDLE's module browser with .pyw files."
msgstr ":gh:`95411`: 启用IDLE的模块浏览器以支持.pyw文件。"

#: ../NEWS:9544
msgid ""
":gh:`89610`: Add .pyi as a recognized extension for IDLE on macOS.    This "
"allows opening stub files by double clicking on them in the Finder."
msgstr ":gh:`89610`: 在macOS上为IDLE添加.pyi作为已识别的扩展名。这允许通过双击Finder中的存根文件来打开它们。"

#: ../NEWS:9550
msgid ":gh:`68686`: Remove ptags and eptags scripts."
msgstr ":gh:`68686`: 移除ptags和eptags脚本。"

#: ../NEWS:9552
msgid ""
":gh:`97681`: Remove the ``Tools/demo/`` directory which contained old demo "
"scripts. A copy can be found in the `old-demos project "
"<https://github.com/gvanrossum/old-demos>`_.  Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97681`: 移除包含旧演示脚本的 ``Tools/demo/`` 目录。副本可以在`old-demos项目 "
"<https://github.com/gvanrossum/old-demos>`_中找到。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9556
msgid ""
":gh:`97669`: Remove outdated example scripts of the ``Tools/scripts/`` "
"directory. A copy can be found in the `old-demos project "
"<https://github.com/gvanrossum/old-demos>`_. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`97669`: 移除 ``Tools/scripts/`` 目录中过时的示例脚本。副本可以在`old-demos项目 "
"<https://github.com/gvanrossum/old-demos>`_中找到。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9560
msgid ""
":gh:`95853`: The ``wasm_build.py`` script now pre-builds Emscripten ports, "
"checks for broken EMSDK versions, and warns about pkg-config env vars."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95853`: ``wasm_build.py`` 脚本现在预构建Emscripten端口，检查损坏的EMSDK版本，并警告关于pkg-"
"config环境变量。"

#: ../NEWS:9563
msgid ""
":gh:`95853`: The new tool ``Tools/wasm/wasm_builder.py`` automates "
"configure, compile, and test steps for building CPython on WebAssembly "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95853`: 新工具 ``Tools/wasm/wasm_builder.py`` "
"自动化了在WebAssembly平台上构建CPython的配置、编译和测试步骤。"

#: ../NEWS:9566
msgid ""
":gh:`95731`: Fix handling of module docstrings in "
":file:`Tools/i18n/pygettext.py`."
msgstr ":gh:`95731`: 修复 :file:`Tools/i18n/pygettext.py` 中模块文档字符串的处理。"

#: ../NEWS:9569
msgid ""
":gh:`93939`: Add script ``Tools/scripts/check_modules.py`` to check and "
"validate builtin and shared extension modules. The script also handles "
"``Modules/Setup`` and will eventually replace ``setup.py``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93939`: 添加脚本 ``Tools/scripts/check_modules.py`` 来检查和验证内置和共享扩展模块。该脚本还处理 "
"``Modules/Setup``，并将最终取代 ``setup.py``。"

#: ../NEWS:9573
msgid ""
":gh:`94538`: Fix Argument Clinic output to custom file destinations. Patch "
"by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ":gh:`94538`: 修复Argument Clinic输出到自定义文件目的地的问题。补丁由Erlend E. Aasland提供。"

#: ../NEWS:9576
msgid ""
":gh:`94430`: Allow parameters named ``module`` and ``self`` with custom C "
"names in Argument Clinic. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland"
msgstr ""
":gh:`94430`: 允许在Argument Clinic中使用名为 ``module`` 和 ``self`` "
"的参数，并带有自定义C名称。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9579
msgid ""
":gh:`86087`: The ``Tools/scripts/parseentities.py`` script used to parse "
"HTML4 entities has been removed."
msgstr ":gh:`86087`: 用于解析HTML4实体的 ``Tools/scripts/parseentities.py`` 脚本已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:9585
msgid ""
":gh:`98393`: The :c:func:`PyUnicode_FSDecoder` function no longer accepts "
"bytes-like paths, like :class:`bytearray` and :class:`memoryview` types: "
"only the exact :class:`bytes` type is accepted for bytes strings. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`98393`: :c:func:`PyUnicode_FSDecoder` 函数不再接受类似 :class:`bytearray` 和 "
":class:`memoryview` 类型的字节类路径：只有确切的 :class:`bytes` 类型被接受用于字节字符串。由Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9590
msgid ""
":gh:`91051`: Add :c:func:`PyType_Watch` and related APIs to allow callbacks "
"on :c:func:`PyType_Modified`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91051`: 添加 :c:func:`PyType_Watch` 和相关API，以允许在 :c:func:`PyType_Modified`"
" 上回调。"

#: ../NEWS:9593
msgid ""
":gh:`95756`: Lazily create and cache ``co_`` attributes for better "
"performance for code getters."
msgstr ":gh:`95756`: 延迟创建和缓存 ``co_`` 属性，以提高代码获取器的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:9596
msgid ""
":gh:`96512`: Configuration for the :ref:`integer string conversion length "
"limitation <int_max_str_digits>` now lives in the PyConfig C API struct."
msgstr ""
":gh:`96512`: 现在，:ref:`integer string conversion length limitation "
"<int_max_str_digits>` 的配置位于 PyConfig C API 结构体中。"

#: ../NEWS:9599
msgid ""
":gh:`95589`: Extensions classes that set ``tp_dictoffset`` and "
"``tp_weaklistoffset`` lose the support for multiple inheritance, but are now"
" safe. Extension classes should use :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_DICT` and "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_WEAKREF` instead."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95589`: 设置了 ``tp_dictoffset`` 和 ``tp_weaklistoffset`` "
"的扩展类不再支持多重继承，但现在更安全。扩展类应改用 :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_DICT` 和 "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_WEAKREF`。"

#: ../NEWS:9604
msgid ""
":gh:`95781`: An unrecognized format character in "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_FromFormat` and :c:func:`PyUnicode_FromFormatV` now sets "
"a :exc:`SystemError`. In previous versions it caused all the rest of the "
"format string to be copied as-is to the result string, and any extra "
"arguments discarded."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95781`: 在 :c:func:`PyUnicode_FromFormat` 和 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_FromFormatV` 中，无法识别的格式字符现在会设置 "
":exc:`SystemError`。在之前的版本中，这会导致格式字符串的其余部分按原样复制到结果字符串中，并且任何额外的参数都会被丢弃。"

#: ../NEWS:9610
msgid ""
":gh:`92678`: Restore the 3.10 behavior for multiple inheritance of C "
"extension classes that store their dictionary at the end of the struct."
msgstr ":gh:`92678`: 恢复了 3.10 的行为，对于在结构体末尾存储字典的 C 扩展类支持多重继承。"

#: ../NEWS:9613
msgid ""
":gh:`92678`: Support C extensions using managed dictionaries by setting the "
"``Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_DICT`` flag."
msgstr ":gh:`92678`: 通过设置 ``Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_DICT`` 标志，支持使用托管字典的 C 扩展。"

#: ../NEWS:9616
msgid ""
":gh:`93274`: API for implementing vectorcall "
"(:c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VECTORCALL`, :c:func:`PyVectorcall_NARGS` and "
":c:func:`PyVectorcall_Call`) was added to the limited API and stable ABI."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93274`: 实现 vectorcall 的 "
"API（:c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VECTORCALL`、:c:func:`PyVectorcall_NARGS` 和 "
":c:func:`PyVectorcall_Call`）已被添加到有限 API 和稳定 ABI 中。"

#: ../NEWS:9620
msgid ""
":gh:`95504`: Fix sign placement when specifying width or precision in "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_FromFormat` and :c:func:`PyUnicode_FromFormatV`. Patch by"
" Philip Georgi."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95504`: 修复了在 :c:func:`PyUnicode_FromFormat` 和 "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_FromFormatV` 中指定宽度或精度时的符号位置问题。由 Philip Georgi 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9624
msgid ""
":gh:`93012`: The :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VECTORCALL` flag is now removed "
"from a class when the class's :py:meth:`~object.__call__` method is "
"reassigned. This makes vectorcall safe to use with mutable types (i.e. heap "
"types without the :const:`immutable <Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE>` flag). "
"Mutable types that do not override :c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_call` now "
"inherit the :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VECTORCALL` flag."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93012`: 现在，当类的 :py:meth:`~object.__call__` "
"方法被重新分配时，:c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VECTORCALL` 标志会从类中移除。这使得 vectorcall "
"可以安全地用于可变类型（即没有 :const:`immutable <Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE>` 标志的堆类型）。不覆盖 "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_call` 的可变类型现在会继承 "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VECTORCALL` 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:9632
msgid ""
":gh:`95388`: Creating :c:macro:`immutable types <Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE>` "
"with mutable bases is deprecated and is planned to be disabled in Python "
"3.14."
msgstr ""
":gh:`95388`: 创建具有可变基类的 :c:macro:`immutable types <Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE>`"
" 已被弃用，并计划在 Python 3.14 中禁用。"

#: ../NEWS:9636
msgid ""
":gh:`92678`: Adds unstable C-API functions ``_PyObject_VisitManagedDict`` "
"and ``_PyObject_ClearManagedDict`` to allow C extensions to allow the VM to "
"manage their object's dictionaries."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92678`: 添加了不稳定的 C-API 函数 ``_PyObject_VisitManagedDict`` 和 "
"``_PyObject_ClearManagedDict``，允许 C 扩展让虚拟机管理它们的对象字典。"

#: ../NEWS:9640
msgid ""
":gh:`94936`: Added :c:func:`PyCode_GetVarnames`, "
":c:func:`PyCode_GetCellvars` and :c:func:`PyCode_GetFreevars` for accessing "
"``co_varnames``, ``co_cellvars`` and ``co_freevars`` respectively via the C "
"API."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94936`: 添加了 :c:func:`PyCode_GetVarnames`、:c:func:`PyCode_GetCellvars` 和"
" :c:func:`PyCode_GetFreevars`，用于通过 C API 分别访问 "
"``co_varnames``、``co_cellvars`` 和 ``co_freevars``。"

#: ../NEWS:9644
msgid ""
":gh:`94930`: Fix ``SystemError`` raised when "
":c:func:`PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords` is used with ``#`` in ``(...)`` but "
"without ``PY_SSIZE_T_CLEAN`` defined."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94930`: 修复了当 :c:func:`PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords` 与 ``#`` 在 ``(...)`` "
"中一起使用但未定义 ``PY_SSIZE_T_CLEAN`` 时引发的 ``SystemError``。"

#: ../NEWS:9648
msgid ""
":gh:`94731`: Python again uses C-style casts for most casting operations "
"when compiled with C++. This may trigger compiler warnings, if they are "
"enabled with e.g. ``-Wold-style-cast`` or ``-Wzero-as-null-pointer-"
"constant`` options for ``g++``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`94731`: Python 在使用 C++ 编译时，再次对大多数类型转换操作使用 C 风格的转换。这可能会触发编译器警告，如果它们是通过例如"
" ``g++`` 的 ``-Wold-style-cast`` 或 ``-Wzero-as-null-pointer-constant`` 选项启用的。"

#: ../NEWS:9653
msgid ""
":gh:`93937`: The following frame functions and type are now directly "
"available with ``#include <Python.h>``, it's no longer needed to add "
"``#include <frameobject.h>``:"
msgstr ""
":gh:`93937`: 以下帧函数和类型现在可以直接通过 ``#include <Python.h>`` 使用，不再需要添加 ``#include "
"<frameobject.h>``："

#: ../NEWS:9657
msgid ":c:func:`PyFrame_Check`"
msgstr ":c:func:`PyFrame_Check`"

#: ../NEWS:9658
msgid ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetBack`"
msgstr ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetBack`"

#: ../NEWS:9659
msgid ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetBuiltins`"
msgstr ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetBuiltins`"

#: ../NEWS:9660
msgid ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetGenerator`"
msgstr ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetGenerator`"

#: ../NEWS:9661
msgid ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetGlobals`"
msgstr ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetGlobals`"

#: ../NEWS:9662
msgid ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetLasti`"
msgstr ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetLasti`"

#: ../NEWS:9663
msgid ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals`"
msgstr ":c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals`"

#: ../NEWS:9664
msgid ":c:type:`PyFrame_Type`"
msgstr ":c:type:`PyFrame_Type`"

#: ../NEWS:9666 ../NEWS:13317 ../NEWS:13345 ../NEWS:14071 ../NEWS:15201
#: ../NEWS:16330 ../NEWS:16386
msgid "Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr "由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9668
msgid ""
":gh:`91321`: Fix the compatibility of the Python C API with C++ older than "
"C++11. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ":gh:`91321`: 修复了 Python C API 与 C++11 之前版本的兼容性。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9671
msgid ""
":gh:`91731`: Avoid defining the ``static_assert`` when compiling with C++ "
"11, where this is a keyword and redefining it can lead to undefined "
"behavior. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`91731`: 在使用 C++11 编译时避免定义 ``static_assert``，因为在 C++11 "
"中这是一个关键字，重新定义它可能导致未定义行为。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9675
msgid ""
":gh:`89546`: :c:func:`PyType_FromMetaclass` (and other ``PyType_From*`` "
"functions) now check that offsets and the base class's "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_basicsize` fit in the new class's "
"``tp_basicsize``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89546`: :c:func:`PyType_FromMetaclass` (以及其他 ``PyType_From*`` 函数) "
"现在检查偏移量和基类的 :c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_basicsize` 是否适合新类的 ``tp_basicsize``。"

#: ../NEWS:9680
msgid ""
":gh:`93503`: Add two new public functions to the public C-API, "
":c:func:`PyEval_SetProfileAllThreads` and "
":c:func:`PyEval_SetTraceAllThreads`, that allow to set tracing and profiling"
" functions in all running threads in addition to the calling one. Also, two "
"analogous functions to the :mod:`threading` module "
"(:func:`threading.setprofile_all_threads` and "
":func:`threading.settrace_all_threads`) that allow to do the same from "
"Python. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":gh:`93503`: 向公共 C-API 添加了两个新的公共函数 :c:func:`PyEval_SetProfileAllThreads` 和 "
":c:func:`PyEval_SetTraceAllThreads`，允许在所有运行的线程中设置跟踪和分析函数，除了调用线程。此外，:mod:`threading`"
" 模块的两个类似函数（:func:`threading.setprofile_all_threads` 和 "
":func:`threading.settrace_all_threads`）允许从 Python 中做同样的事情。由 Pablo Galindo "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9689
msgid ""
":gh:`93442`: Add C++ overloads for _Py_CAST_impl() to handle 0/NULL.  This "
"will allow C++ extensions that pass 0 or NULL to macros using _Py_CAST() to "
"continue to compile."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93442`: 为 _Py_CAST_impl() 添加 C++ 重载以处理 0/NULL。这将允许传递 0 或 NULL 到使用 "
"_Py_CAST() 的宏的 C++ 扩展继续编译。"

#: ../NEWS:9693
msgid ""
":gh:`93466`: Slot IDs in PyType_Spec may not be repeated. The documentation "
"was updated to mention this. For some cases of repeated slots, "
"PyType_FromSpec and related functions will now raise an exception."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93466`: PyType_Spec 中的槽 ID 不能重复。文档已更新以提及这一点。对于某些槽重复的情况，PyType_FromSpec "
"及相关函数现在将引发异常。"

#: ../NEWS:9697
msgid ""
":gh:`92898`: Fix C++ compiler warnings when casting function arguments to "
"``PyObject*``. Patch by Serge Guelton."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92898`: 修复将函数参数转换为 ``PyObject*`` 时产生的 C++ 编译器警告。由 Serge Guelton 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9700
msgid ""
":gh:`93103`: Deprecate global configuration variables, like "
":c:var:`Py_IgnoreEnvironmentFlag`, in the documentation: the "
":c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API should be instead. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`93103`: 在文档中弃用全局配置变量，如 :c:var:`Py_IgnoreEnvironmentFlag`，应改用 "
":c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9705
msgid ""
":gh:`77782`: Deprecate global configuration variable like "
":c:var:`Py_IgnoreEnvironmentFlag`: the :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API"
" should be instead. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`77782`: 弃用全局配置变量如 :c:var:`Py_IgnoreEnvironmentFlag`，应改用 "
":c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9709
msgid ""
":gh:`92913`: Ensures changes to :c:member:`PyConfig.module_search_paths` are"
" ignored unless :c:member:`PyConfig.module_search_paths_set` is set"
msgstr ""
":gh:`92913`: 确保除非设置了 :c:member:`PyConfig.module_search_paths_set`，否则对 "
":c:member:`PyConfig.module_search_paths` 的更改将被忽略"

#: ../NEWS:9712
msgid ""
":gh:`92781`: Avoid mixing declarations and code in the C API to fix the "
"compiler warning: \"ISO C90 forbids mixed declarations and code\" "
"[-Werror=declaration-after-statement]. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92781`: 避免在 C API 中混合声明和代码以修复编译器警告：\"ISO C90 禁止混合声明和代码\" "
"[-Werror=declaration-after-statement]。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9716
msgid ""
":gh:`92651`: Remove the ``token.h`` header file. There was never any public "
"tokenizer C API. The ``token.h`` header file was only designed to be used by"
" Python internals. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92651`: 移除 ``token.h`` 头文件。从未有任何公共的标记器 C API。``token.h`` 头文件仅设计用于 "
"Python 内部。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9720
msgid ":gh:`92536`: Remove legacy Unicode APIs based on ``Py_UNICODE*``."
msgstr ":gh:`92536`: 移除基于 ``Py_UNICODE*`` 的旧版 Unicode API。"

#: ../NEWS:9722
msgid ""
":gh:`85858`: Remove the ``PyUnicode_InternImmortal()`` function and the "
"``SSTATE_INTERNED_IMMORTAL`` macro. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`85858`: 移除 ``PyUnicode_InternImmortal()`` 函数和 "
"``SSTATE_INTERNED_IMMORTAL`` 宏。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9725
msgid ""
":gh:`92193`: Add new function :c:func:`PyFunction_SetVectorcall` to the C "
"API which sets the vectorcall field of a given :c:type:`PyFunctionObject`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92193`: 向 C API 添加新函数 :c:func:`PyFunction_SetVectorcall`，该函数设置给定 "
":c:type:`PyFunctionObject` 的 vectorcall 字段。"

#: ../NEWS:9728
msgid ""
"Warning: extensions using this API must preserve the behavior of the "
"unaltered function!"
msgstr "警告：使用此 API 的扩展必须保留未更改函数的行为！"

#: ../NEWS:9731
msgid ""
":gh:`59121`: Fixed an assert that prevented ``PyRun_InteractiveOne`` from "
"providing tracebacks when parsing from the provided FD."
msgstr ""
":gh:`59121`: 修复了一个断言，该断言阻止了 ``PyRun_InteractiveOne`` 在从提供的 FD 解析时提供追溯。"

#: ../NEWS:9734
msgid ""
":issue:`45383`: The :c:func:`PyType_FromSpec` API will now find and use a "
"metaclass based on the provided bases. An error will be raised if there is a"
" metaclass conflict."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45383`: :c:func:`PyType_FromSpec` API "
"现在将根据提供的基类查找并使用元类。如果存在元类冲突，将会引发错误。"

#: ../NEWS:9740
msgid "Python 3.11.0 beta 1"
msgstr "Python 3.11.0 beta 1"

#: ../NEWS:9742
msgid "*Release date: 2022-05-06*"
msgstr "*发布日期：2022-05-06*"

#: ../NEWS:9747
msgid ""
":gh:`57684`: Add the :option:`-P` command line option and the "
":envvar:`PYTHONSAFEPATH` environment variable to not prepend a potentially "
"unsafe path to :data:`sys.path`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`57684`: 添加 :option:`-P` 命令行选项和 :envvar:`PYTHONSAFEPATH` "
"环境变量，以避免将可能不安全的路径前置到 :data:`sys.path`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9754
msgid ""
":gh:`89519`: Chaining classmethod descriptors (introduced in :issue:`19072`)"
" is deprecated. It can no longer be used to wrap other descriptors such as "
"property().  The core design of this feature was flawed, and it caused a "
"number of downstream problems."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89519`: 链式 classmethod 描述符（在 :issue:`19072` 中引入）已被弃用。它不能再用于包装其他描述符，如 "
"property()。此功能的核心设计存在缺陷，并导致了一系列下游问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9759
msgid ""
":gh:`92345`: ``pymain_run_python()`` now imports ``readline`` and "
"``rlcompleter`` before sys.path is extended to include the current working "
"directory of an interactive interpreter. Non-interactive interpreters are "
"not affected."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92345`: ``pymain_run_python()`` 现在在 sys.path 被扩展以包括交互式解释器的当前工作目录之前导入 "
"``readline`` 和 ``rlcompleter``。非交互式解释器不受影响。"

#: ../NEWS:9764
msgid ""
":issue:`43857`: Improve the :exc:`AttributeError` message when deleting a "
"missing attribute. Patch by Géry Ogam."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43857`: 当删除一个缺失的属性时，改进 :exc:`AttributeError` 消息。由 Géry Ogam 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9767
msgid ""
":gh:`92245`: Make sure that PEP 523 is respected in all cases. In 3.11a7, "
"specialization may have prevented Python-to-Python calls respecting PEP 523."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92245`: 确保在所有情况下都遵循 PEP 523。在 3.11a7 中，专业化可能阻止了 Python 到 Python 的调用遵循 "
"PEP 523。"

#: ../NEWS:9771
msgid ""
":gh:`92203`: Add a closure keyword-only parameter to :func:`exec`. It can "
"only be specified when exec-ing a code object that uses free variables. When"
" specified, it must be a tuple, with exactly the number of cell variables "
"referenced by the code object. closure has a default value of ``None``, and "
"it must be ``None`` if the code object doesn't refer to any free variables."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92203`: 向 :func:`exec` 添加一个仅限关键字的参数 closure。它只能在 exec "
"一个使用自由变量的代码对象时指定。指定时，它必须是一个元组，且恰好与代码对象引用的单元格变量数量相同。closure 的默认值为 "
"``None``，如果代码对象不引用任何自由变量，则必须为 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:9778
msgid ""
":gh:`91173`: Disable frozen modules in debug builds. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`91173`: 在调试构建中禁用冻结模块。由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9780
msgid ""
":gh:`92114`: Improve error message when subscript a type with "
"``__class_getitem__`` set to ``None``."
msgstr ":gh:`92114`: 当使用设置为 ``None`` 的 ``__class_getitem__`` 下标类型时，改进错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:9783
msgid ""
":gh:`92112`: Fix crash triggered by an evil custom ``mro()`` on a metaclass."
msgstr ":gh:`92112`: 修复由元类上的恶意自定义 ``mro()`` 触发的崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:9785
msgid ""
":gh:`92063`: The ``PRECALL_METHOD_DESCRIPTOR_FAST_WITH_KEYWORDS`` "
"instruction now ensures methods are called only on objects of the correct "
"type."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92063`: ``PRECALL_METHOD_DESCRIPTOR_FAST_WITH_KEYWORDS`` "
"指令现在确保方法仅在正确类型的对象上调用。"

#: ../NEWS:9788
msgid ""
":gh:`92031`: Deoptimize statically allocated code objects during "
"``Py_FINALIZE()`` so that future ``_PyCode_Quicken`` calls always start with"
" unquickened code."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92031`: 在 ``Py_FINALIZE()`` 期间静态分配的代码对象进行去优化，以便未来的 ``_PyCode_Quicken`` "
"调用总是从未优化的代码开始。"

#: ../NEWS:9792
msgid ""
":gh:`92036`: Fix a crash in subinterpreters related to the garbage "
"collector. When a subinterpreter is deleted, untrack all objects tracked by "
"its GC. To prevent a crash in deallocator functions expecting objects to be "
"tracked by the GC, leak a strong reference to these objects on purpose, so "
"they are never deleted and their deallocator functions are not called. Patch"
" by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92036`: "
"修复了与垃圾收集器相关的子解释器崩溃问题。当删除子解释器时，取消跟踪其垃圾收集器跟踪的所有对象。为了防止在期望对象被垃圾收集器跟踪的析构函数中崩溃，有意泄露这些对象的强引用，这样它们就永远不会被删除，它们的析构函数也不会被调用。由Victor"
" Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9799
msgid ""
":gh:`92032`: The interpreter can now autocomplete soft keywords, as of now "
"``match``, ``case``, and ``_`` (wildcard pattern) from :pep:`634`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92032`: 解释器现在可以自动完成软关键字，截至目前包括来自 :pep:`634` 的 ``match``、``case`` 和 "
"``_`` (通配符模式) 。"

#: ../NEWS:9802
msgid ""
":gh:`87999`: The warning emitted by the Python parser for a numeric literal "
"immediately followed by keyword has been changed from deprecation warning to"
" syntax warning."
msgstr ":gh:`87999`: Python解析器对于紧跟在关键字后的数字字面量发出的警告已从弃用警告更改为语法警告。"

#: ../NEWS:9806
msgid ""
":gh:`91869`: Fix an issue where specialized opcodes with extended arguments "
"could produce incorrect tracing output or lead to assertion failures."
msgstr ":gh:`91869`: 修复了一个问题，即带有扩展参数的专业操作码可能产生不正确的跟踪输出或导致断言失败。"

#: ../NEWS:9809
msgid ""
":gh:`91603`: Speed up :class:`types.UnionType` instantiation. Based on patch"
" provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ":gh:`91603`: 加速 :class:`types.UnionType` 的实例化。基于Yurii Karabas提供的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9812
msgid ""
":gh:`89373`: If Python is built in debug mode, Python now ensures that "
"deallocator functions leave the current exception unchanged. Patch by Victor"
" Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89373`: 如果Python在调试模式下构建，Python现在确保析构函数不会改变当前异常。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9816
msgid ""
":gh:`91632`: Fix a minor memory leak at exit: release the memory of the "
":class:`generic_alias_iterator` type. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91632`: 修复了一个退出时的轻微内存泄漏：释放 :class:`generic_alias_iterator` "
"类型的内存。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9819
msgid ""
":gh:`81548`: Octal escapes with value larger than ``0o377`` now produce a "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`. In a future Python version they will be a "
":exc:`SyntaxWarning` and eventually a :exc:`SyntaxError`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`81548`: 值大于 ``0o377`` 的八进制转义现在会产生 "
":exc:`DeprecationWarning`。在未来的Python版本中，它们将变为 :exc:`SyntaxWarning`，最终变为 "
":exc:`SyntaxError`。"

#: ../NEWS:9823
msgid ""
":issue:`43950`: Use a single compact table for line starts, ends and column "
"offsets. Reduces memory consumption for location info by half"
msgstr ":issue:`43950`: 使用单个紧凑表来表示行的开始、结束和列偏移。将位置信息的内存消耗减少了一半。"

#: ../NEWS:9826
msgid ""
":gh:`91102`: Use Argument Clinic for :class:`EncodingMap`.  Patch by Oleg "
"Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91102`: 对 :class:`EncodingMap` 使用Argument Clinic。由Oleg Iarygin提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9829
msgid ""
":gh:`91636`: Fixed a crash in a garbage-collection edge-case, in which a "
"``PyFunction_Type.tp_clear`` function could leave a python function object "
"in an inconsistent state."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91636`: 修复了垃圾回收边缘情况下的崩溃问题，其中 ``PyFunction_Type.tp_clear`` "
"函数可能让Python函数对象处于不一致状态。"

#: ../NEWS:9833
msgid ""
":gh:`91603`: Speed up :func:`isinstance` and :func:`issubclass` checks for "
":class:`types.UnionType`. Patch by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91603`: 加速 :func:`isinstance` 和 :func:`issubclass` 对 "
":class:`types.UnionType` 的检查。由Yurii Karabas提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9836
msgid ""
":gh:`91625`: Fixed a bug in which adaptive opcodes ignored any preceding "
"``EXTENDED_ARG``\\ s on specialization failure."
msgstr ":gh:`91625`: 修复了一个在自适应操作码特化失败时忽略任何前置 ``EXTENDED_ARG`` 的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:9839
msgid ""
":gh:`78607`: The LLTRACE special build now looks for the name "
"``__lltrace__`` defined in module globals, rather than the name "
"``__ltrace__``, which had been introduced as a typo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`78607`: LLTRACE特殊构建现在查找模块全局中定义的名称 ``__lltrace__``，而不是之前因拼写错误引入的名称 "
"``__ltrace__``。"

#: ../NEWS:9843
msgid ""
":gh:`91576`: Speed up iteration of ascii strings by 50%. Patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ":gh:`91576`: 通过Kumar Aditya的补丁，将ASCII字符串的迭代速度提高了50%。"

#: ../NEWS:9846
msgid ""
":gh:`89279`: Improve interpreter performance on Windows by inlining a few "
"specific macros."
msgstr ":gh:`89279`: 通过内联几个特定的宏来提高Windows上解释器的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:9849
msgid ""
":gh:`91502`: Add a new :c:func:`!_PyFrame_IsEntryFrame` API function, to "
"check if a :c:type:`PyFrameObject` is an entry frame. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91502`: 添加一个新的 :c:func:`!_PyFrame_IsEntryFrame` API函数，用于检查 "
":c:type:`PyFrameObject` 是否为入口帧。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9853
msgid ""
":gh:`91266`: Refactor the ``bytearray`` strip methods ``strip``, ``lstrip`` "
"and ``rstrip`` to use a common implementation."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91266`: 重构 ``bytearray`` 的去除方法 ``strip``、``lstrip`` 和 "
"``rstrip``，以使用共同的实现。"

#: ../NEWS:9856
msgid ""
":gh:`91479`: Replaced the ``__note__`` field of :exc:`BaseException` (added "
"in an earlier version of 3.11) with the final design of :pep:`678`. Namely, "
":exc:`BaseException` gets an :meth:`add_note` method, and its ``__notes__`` "
"field is created when necessary."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91479`: 将 :exc:`BaseException` 的 ``__note__`` 字段（在3.11的早期版本中添加）替换为 "
":pep:`678` 的最终设计。即 :exc:`BaseException` 获得一个 :meth:`add_note` 方法，其 "
"``__notes__`` 字段在必要时创建。"

#: ../NEWS:9861
msgid ""
":gh:`46055`: Speed up right shift of negative integers, by removing "
"unnecessary creation of temporaries. Original patch by Xinhang Xu, reworked "
"by Mark Dickinson."
msgstr ""
":gh:`46055`: 通过移除不必要的临时创建，加速负整数的右移操作。原始由Xinhang Xu提供补丁，由Mark Dickinson重新设计。"

#: ../NEWS:9865
msgid ""
":gh:`91462`: Make the interpreter's low-level tracing (lltrace) feature "
"output more readable by displaying opcode names (rather than just numbers), "
"and by displaying stack contents before each opcode."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91462`: 通过显示操作码名称（而不仅仅是数字）和每个操作码前的堆栈内容，使解释器的低级跟踪（lltrace）功能输出更易读。"

#: ../NEWS:9869
msgid ""
":gh:`89455`: Fixed an uninitialized bool value in the traceback printing "
"code path that was introduced by the initial :issue:`45292` exception groups"
" work."
msgstr ":gh:`89455`: 修复了由初始的 :issue:`45292` 异常组工作引入的跟踪打印代码路径中未初始化的布尔值。"

#: ../NEWS:9872
msgid ":gh:`91421`: Fix a potential integer overflow in _Py_DecodeUTF8Ex."
msgstr ":gh:`91421`: 修复了 _Py_DecodeUTF8Ex 中潜在的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9874
msgid ""
":gh:`91428`: Add ``static const char *const _PyOpcode_OpName[256] = {...};``"
" to ``opcode.h`` for debug builds to assist in debugging the Python "
"interpreter. It is now more convenient to make various forms of debugging "
"output more human-readable by including opcode names rather than just the "
"corresponding decimal digits."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91428`: 在调试版本的 ``opcode.h`` 中添加 ``static const char *const "
"_PyOpcode_OpName[256] = "
"{...};``，以帮助调试Python解释器。现在，通过包含操作码名称而不仅仅是相应的十进制数字，使得各种形式的调试输出更便于人类阅读变得更加方便。"

#: ../NEWS:9880
msgid ""
":issue:`47120`: Make :opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_TRUE`, "
":opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_FALSE`, :opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NONE` and "
":opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NOT_NONE` virtual, mapping to new relative jump "
"opcodes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47120`: 使 "
":opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_TRUE`、:opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_FALSE`、:opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NONE`"
" 和 :opcode:`POP_JUMP_IF_NOT_NONE` 虚拟化，映射到新的相对跳转操作码。"

#: ../NEWS:9884
msgid ""
":issue:`45317`: Add internal documentation explaining design of new (for "
"3.11) frame stack."
msgstr ":issue:`45317`: 添加内部文档，解释新的（针对3.11版本）帧栈的设计。"

#: ../NEWS:9887
msgid ""
":issue:`47197`: ctypes used to mishandle ``void`` return types, so that for "
"instance a function declared like ``ctypes.CFUNCTYPE(None, ctypes.c_int)`` "
"would be called with signature ``int f(int)`` instead of ``void f(int)``. "
"Wasm targets require function pointers to be called with the correct "
"signatures so this led to crashes. The problem is now fixed."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47197`: ctypes 过去错误处理 ``void`` 返回类型，例如，像 ``ctypes.CFUNCTYPE(None, "
"ctypes.c_int)`` 这样声明的函数会以 ``int f(int)`` 的签名被调用，而不是 ``void f(int)``。Wasm "
"目标要求以正确的签名调用函数指针，因此这导致了崩溃。现在这个问题已经修复。"

#: ../NEWS:9893
msgid ""
":issue:`47120`: Make opcodes :opcode:`!JUMP_IF_TRUE_OR_POP` and "
":opcode:`!JUMP_IF_FALSE_OR_POP` relative rather than absolute."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47120`: 使操作码 :opcode:`!JUMP_IF_TRUE_OR_POP` 和 "
":opcode:`!JUMP_IF_FALSE_OR_POP` 相对而不是绝对。"

#: ../NEWS:9896
msgid ""
":issue:`47177`: Replace the ``f_lasti`` member of the internal "
"``_PyInterpreterFrame`` structure with a ``prev_instr`` pointer, which "
"reduces overhead in the main interpreter loop. The ``f_lasti`` attribute of "
"Python-layer frame objects is preserved for backward-compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:9901
msgid ""
":issue:`46961`: Integer mod/remainder operations, including the three-"
"argument form of :func:`pow`, now consistently return ints from the global "
"small integer cache when applicable."
msgstr ":issue:`46961`: 整数模/余数操作，包括 :func:`pow` 的三参数形式，现在在适用时一致地从全局小整数缓存返回整数。"

#: ../NEWS:9905
msgid ""
":issue:`46962`: Classes and functions that unconditionally declared their "
"docstrings ignoring the ``--without-doc-strings`` compilation flag no longer"
" do so."
msgstr ":issue:`46962`: 类和函数不再无视 ``--without-doc-strings`` 编译标志无条件声明它们的文档字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:9909
msgid ""
"The classes affected are :class:`ctypes.UnionType`, "
":class:`pickle.PickleBuffer`, :class:`testcapi.RecursingInfinitelyError`, "
"and :class:`types.GenericAlias`."
msgstr ""
"受影响的类有 "
":class:`ctypes.UnionType`、:class:`pickle.PickleBuffer`、:class:`testcapi.RecursingInfinitelyError`"
" 和 :class:`types.GenericAlias`。"

#: ../NEWS:9913
msgid "The functions affected are 24 methods in :mod:`ctypes`."
msgstr "受影响的函数是 :mod:`ctypes` 中的24个方法。"

#: ../NEWS:9915
msgid "Patch by Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr "由 Oleg Iarygin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9917
msgid ""
":issue:`46942`: Use Argument Clinic for the :class:`types.MethodType` "
"constructor.  Patch by Oleg Iarygin."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46942`: 使用 Argument Clinic 为 :class:`types.MethodType` 构造函数。由 Oleg "
"Iarygin 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9920
msgid ":issue:`46764`: Fix wrapping bound methods with @classmethod"
msgstr ":issue:`46764`: 修复使用 @classmethod 包装绑定方法的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9922
msgid ""
":issue:`43464`: Optimize :meth:`set.intersection` for non-set arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`43464`: 为非集合参数优化 :meth:`set.intersection`。"

#: ../NEWS:9924
msgid ":issue:`46721`: Optimize :meth:`set.issuperset` for non-set argument."
msgstr ":issue:`46721`: 为非集合参数优化 :meth:`set.issuperset`。"

#: ../NEWS:9926
msgid ""
":issue:`46509`: Add type-specialized versions of the ``Py_DECREF()``, and "
"use them for ``float``, ``int``, ``str``, ``bool``, and ``None`` to avoid "
"pointer-chasing at runtime where types are known at C compile time."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46509`: 添加 ``Py_DECREF()`` 的类型特化版本，并为 "
"``float``、``int``、``str``、``bool`` 和 ``None`` 使用它们，以避免在运行时类型已知的情况下进行指针追踪。"

#: ../NEWS:9930 ../NEWS:11645
msgid ":issue:`46045`: Do not use POSIX semaphores on NetBSD"
msgstr ":issue:`46045`: 在 NetBSD 上不使用 POSIX 信号量。"

#: ../NEWS:9932
msgid ""
":issue:`36819`: Fix crashes in built-in encoders with error handlers that "
"return position less or equal than the starting position of non-encodable "
"characters."
msgstr ":issue:`36819`: 修复内置编码器中错误处理程序返回的位置小于或等于不可编码字符起始位置时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9936
msgid ""
":issue:`34093`: ``marshal.dumps()`` uses ``FLAG_REF`` for all interned "
"strings. This makes output more deterministic and helps reproducible build."
msgstr ""
":issue:`34093`: ``marshal.dumps()`` 对所有内部字符串使用 "
"``FLAG_REF``。这使得输出更加确定性，有助于可重现的构建。"

#: ../NEWS:9939
msgid ""
":issue:`26579`: Added ``object.__getstate__`` which provides the default "
"implementation of the ``__getstate__()`` method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26579`: 添加了 ``object.__getstate__``，提供了 ``__getstate__()`` 方法的默认实现。"

#: ../NEWS:9942
msgid ""
"Copying and pickling instances of subclasses of builtin types bytearray, "
"set, frozenset, collections.OrderedDict, collections.deque, weakref.WeakSet,"
" and datetime.tzinfo now copies and pickles instance attributes implemented "
"as slots."
msgstr ""
"现在复制和腌制内置类型 "
"bytearray、set、frozenset、collections.OrderedDict、collections.deque、weakref.WeakSet"
" 和 datetime.tzinfo 的子类实例时，会复制和腌制作为槽实现的实例属性。"

#: ../NEWS:9950
msgid ":gh:`87901`: Add the *encoding* parameter to :func:`os.popen`."
msgstr ":gh:`87901`: 向 :func:`os.popen` 添加 *encoding* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:9952
msgid ""
":gh:`90997`: Fix an issue where :mod:`dis` utilities may interpret populated"
" inline cache entries as valid instructions."
msgstr ":gh:`90997`: 修复 :mod:`dis` 工具可能将填充的内联缓存条目解释为有效指令的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9955
msgid ""
":gh:`92332`: Deprecate :class:`typing.Text` (removal of the class is "
"currently not planned). Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92332`: 弃用 :class:`typing.Text` (目前未计划移除该类) 。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9958
msgid ""
":gh:`78157`: Deprecate nested classes in enum definitions becoming members "
"-- in 3.13 they will be normal classes; add ``member`` and ``nonmember`` "
"functions to allow control over results now."
msgstr ""
":gh:`78157`: 弃用枚举定义中成为成员的嵌套类——在 3.13 中它们将成为普通类；添加 ``member`` 和 ``nonmember``"
" 函数以允许现在控制结果。"

#: ../NEWS:9962
msgid ":gh:`92356`: Fixed a performance regression in ctypes function calls."
msgstr ":gh:`92356`: 修复了 ctypes 函数调用中的性能回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:9964
msgid ""
":gh:`90997`: Show the actual named values stored in inline caches when "
"``show_caches=True`` is passed to :mod:`dis` utilities."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90997`: 当向 :mod:`dis` 工具传递 ``show_caches=True`` 时，显示存储在内联缓存中的实际命名值。"

#: ../NEWS:9967
msgid ""
":gh:`92301`: Prefer ``close_range()`` to iterating over procfs for file "
"descriptor closing in :mod:`subprocess` for better performance."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92301`: 在 :mod:`subprocess` 模块中，优先使用 ``close_range()`` "
"而非遍历procfs来关闭文件描述符，以获得更好的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:9970
msgid ":gh:`67248`: Sort the miscellaneous topics in Cmd.do_help()"
msgstr ":gh:`67248`: 在Cmd.do_help()中对杂项主题进行排序。"

#: ../NEWS:9972
msgid ""
":gh:`92210`: Port ``socket.__init__`` to Argument Clinic. Patch by Cinder."
msgstr ":gh:`92210`: 将 ``socket.__init__`` 移植到Argument Clinic。由Cinder提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9974
msgid ""
":gh:`80010`: Add support for generalized ISO 8601 parsing to "
":meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisoformat`, :meth:`datetime.date.fromisoformat`"
" and :meth:`datetime.time.fromisoformat`. Patch by Paul Ganssle."
msgstr ""
":gh:`80010`: 为 "
":meth:`datetime.datetime.fromisoformat`、:meth:`datetime.date.fromisoformat` "
"和 :meth:`datetime.time.fromisoformat` 添加对广义ISO 8601解析的支持。由Paul Ganssle提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9979
msgid ""
":gh:`92118`: Fix a 3.11 regression in :func:`~contextlib.contextmanager`, "
"which caused it to propagate exceptions with incorrect tracebacks."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92118`: 修复了 :func:`~contextlib.contextmanager` "
"在3.11版本中的一个回归问题，该问题导致异常传播时跟踪信息不正确。"

#: ../NEWS:9982
msgid ""
":gh:`90887`: Adding ``COPYFILE_STAT``, ``COPYFILE_ACL`` and "
"``COPYFILE_XATTR`` constants for :func:`os.fcopyfile` available in macOs."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90887`: 为macOs上的 :func:`os.fcopyfile` 添加 "
"``COPYFILE_STAT``、``COPYFILE_ACL`` 和``COPYFILE_XATTR``常量。"

#: ../NEWS:9985
msgid ""
":gh:`91215`: For :func:`@dataclass <dataclasses.dataclass>`, add "
"*weakref_slot*. The new parameter defaults to ``False``. If true, and if "
"``slots=True``, add a slot named ``\"__weakref__\"``, which will allow "
"instances to be weakref'd. Contributed by Eric V. Smith"
msgstr ""
":gh:`91215`: 对于 :func:`@dataclass <dataclasses.dataclass>`，添加 *weakref_slot*"
" 参数。新参数默认为 ``False``。如果为true，并且 ``slots=True``，则添加一个名为 ``\"__weakref__\"`` "
"的槽，这将允许实例被弱引用。由Eric V. Smith贡献"

#: ../NEWS:9990
msgid ":gh:`85984`: New function os.login_tty() for Unix."
msgstr ":gh:`85984`: 为Unix新增函数os.login_tty()。"

#: ../NEWS:9992
msgid ""
":gh:`92128`: Add :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__` to "
":class:`logging.LoggerAdapter` and :class:`logging.StreamHandler`, allowing "
"them to be parameterized at runtime. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92128`: 向 :class:`logging.LoggerAdapter` 和 "
":class:`logging.StreamHandler` 添加 :meth:`~object.__class_getitem__` "
"方法，允许它们在运行时被参数化。由Alex Waygood提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:9996
msgid ""
":gh:`92049`: Forbid pickling constants ``re._constants.SUCCESS`` etc. "
"Previously, pickling did not fail, but the result could not be unpickled."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92049`: 禁止pickling常量 ``re._constants.SUCCESS`` "
"等。之前，pickling不会失败，但结果无法被unpickle。"

#: ../NEWS:9999
msgid ""
":gh:`92062`: :class:`inspect.Parameter` now raises :exc:`ValueError` if "
"``name`` is a keyword, in addition to the existing check that it is an "
"identifier."
msgstr ""
":gh:`92062`: 如果 ``name`` 是一个关键字，除了现有的检查它是标识符外，:class:`inspect.Parameter` "
"现在会引发 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:10003
msgid ""
":gh:`87390`: Add an ``__unpacked__`` attribute to "
":class:`types.GenericAlias`. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":gh:`87390`: 向 :class:`types.GenericAlias` 添加一个 ``__unpacked__`` 属性。由Jelle "
"Zijlstra提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10006
msgid ":gh:`88089`: Add support for generic :class:`typing.NamedTuple`."
msgstr ":gh:`88089`: 添加对泛型 :class:`typing.NamedTuple` 的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:10008
msgid ""
":gh:`91996`: New http.HTTPMethod enum to represent all the available HTTP "
"request methods in a convenient way"
msgstr ":gh:`91996`: 新增http.HTTPMethod枚举，以方便的方式表示所有可用的HTTP请求方法"

#: ../NEWS:10011
msgid ""
":gh:`91984`: Modified test strings in test_argparse.py to not contain "
"trailing spaces before end of line."
msgstr ":gh:`91984`: 修改test_argparse.py中的测试字符串，使其在行尾不包含尾随空格。"

#: ../NEWS:10014
msgid ""
":gh:`91952`: Add ``encoding=\"locale\"`` support to "
":meth:`TextIOWrapper.reconfigure`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91952`: 向 :meth:`TextIOWrapper.reconfigure` 添加 ``encoding=\"locale\"`` "
"支持。"

#: ../NEWS:10017
msgid ""
":gh:`91954`: Add *encoding* and *errors* arguments to "
":func:`subprocess.getoutput` and :func:`subprocess.getstatusoutput`."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91954`: 向 :func:`subprocess.getoutput` 和 "
":func:`subprocess.getstatusoutput` 添加 *encoding* 和 *errors* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:10020
msgid ""
":issue:`47029`: Always close the read end of the pipe used by "
":class:`multiprocessing.Queue` *after* the last write of buffered data to "
"the write end of the pipe to avoid :exc:`BrokenPipeError` at garbage "
"collection and at :meth:`multiprocessing.Queue.close` calls. Patch by Géry "
"Ogam."
msgstr ""
":issue:`47029`: 在向管道的写入端最后一次写入缓冲数据*之后*，始终关闭 :class:`multiprocessing.Queue` "
"使用的管道的读取端，以避免在垃圾回收和调用 :meth:`multiprocessing.Queue.close` 时出现 "
":exc:`BrokenPipeError`。补丁由 Géry Ogam 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:10026
msgid ":gh:`91928`: Add ``datetime.UTC`` alias for ``datetime.timezone.utc``."
msgstr ":gh:`91928`: 为 ``datetime.timezone.utc`` 添加 ``datetime.UTC`` 别名。"

#: ../NEWS:10028
msgid "Patch by Kabir Kwatra."
msgstr "由 Kabir Kwatra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10030
msgid ""
":gh:`68966`: The :mod:`mailcap` module is now deprecated and will be removed"
" in Python 3.13. See :pep:`594` for the rationale and the :mod:`mimetypes` "
"module for an alternative. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:10034
msgid ""
":gh:`91401`: Provide a way to disable :mod:`subprocess` use of ``vfork()`` "
"just in case it is ever needed and document the existing mechanism for "
"``posix_spawn()``."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91401`: 提供一种方法来禁用 :mod:`subprocess` 使用 ``vfork()``，以防万一需要，并记录 "
"``posix_spawn()`` 的现有机制。"

#: ../NEWS:10038
msgid ""
":gh:`64783`: Fix :const:`signal.NSIG` value on FreeBSD to accept signal "
"numbers greater than 32, like :const:`signal.SIGRTMIN` and "
":const:`signal.SIGRTMAX`. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":gh:`64783`: 修复 FreeBSD 上的 :const:`signal.NSIG` 值，以接受大于 32 的信号编号，如 "
":const:`signal.SIGRTMIN` 和 :const:`signal.SIGRTMAX`。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10042
msgid ""
":gh:`91910`: Add missing f prefix to f-strings in error messages from the "
":mod:`multiprocessing` and :mod:`asyncio` modules."
msgstr ""
":gh:`91910`: 在 :mod:`multiprocessing` 和 :mod:`asyncio` 模块的错误消息中，为 f-字符串添加缺失的"
" f 前缀。"

#: ../NEWS:10045
msgid ""
