" latest Unicode version."
msgstr ":gh:`91575`: 将 :mod:`re` 模块中的大小写不敏感匹配更新至最新的 Unicode 版本。"

#: ../NEWS:10134
msgid ""
":gh:`90622`: In ``concurrent.futures.process.ProcessPoolExecutor`` disallow "
"the \"fork\" multiprocessing start method when the new "
"``max_tasks_per_child`` feature is used as the mix of threads+fork can hang "
"the child processes. Default to using the safe \"spawn\" start method in "
"that circumstance if no ``mp_context`` was supplied."
msgstr ""
":gh:`90622`: 在 ``concurrent.futures.process.ProcessPoolExecutor`` 中，当使用新的 "
"``max_tasks_per_child`` 特性时，禁止使用 \"fork\" 多进程启动方法，因为线程+fork "
"的混合会导致子进程挂起。在这种情况下，如果没有提供 ``mp_context``，默认使用安全的 \"spawn\" 启动方法。"

#: ../NEWS:10140
msgid ""
":gh:`89022`: In :mod:`sqlite3`, ``SQLITE_MISUSE`` result codes are now "
"mapped to :exc:`~sqlite3.InterfaceError` instead of "
":exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError`. Also, more accurate exceptions are raised "
"when binding parameters fail. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":gh:`89022`: 在 :mod:`sqlite3` 中，``SQLITE_MISUSE`` 结果代码现在映射到 "
":exc:`~sqlite3.InterfaceError` 而不是 "
":exc:`~sqlite3.ProgrammingError`。此外，当绑定参数失败时，会抛出更准确的异常。由 Erlend E. Aasland "
"提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:10145
msgid ""
":gh:`91526`: Stop calling ``os.device_encoding(file.fileno())`` in "
":class:`TextIOWrapper`. It was complex, never documented, and didn't work "
"for most cases. (Patch by Inada Naoki.)"
msgstr ""
":gh:`91526`: 停止在 :class:`TextIOWrapper` 中调用 "
"``os.device_encoding(file.fileno())``。它复杂，从未被文档化，并且在大多数情况下不起作用。（由 Inada "
"Naoki 提交的补丁。）"

#: ../NEWS:10149
msgid ""
":gh:`88116`: Change the frame-related functions in the :mod:`inspect` module"
