#: ../NEWS:12173
msgid ":issue:`16594`: Add allow allow_reuse_port flag in socketserver."
msgstr ":issue:`16594`: 在 socketserver 中添加 allow_reuse_port 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:12175
msgid ""
":issue:`27718`: Fix help for the :mod:`signal` module. Some functions (e.g. "
"``signal()`` and ``getsignal()``) were omitted."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27718`: 修复 :mod:`signal` 模块的帮助文档。一些函数（例如 ``signal()`` 和 "
"``getsignal()``）被遗漏了。"

#: ../NEWS:12178
msgid ""
":issue:`46032`: The ``registry()`` method of "
":func:`functools.singledispatch` functions checks now the first argument or "
"the first parameter annotation and raises a TypeError if it is not "
"supported. Previously unsupported \"types\" were ignored (e.g. "
"``typing.List[int]``) or caused an error at calling time (e.g. "
"``list[int]``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46032`: :func:`functools.singledispatch` 函数的 ``registry()`` "
"方法现在会检查第一个参数或第一个参数注解，并在不支持时抛出 TypeError。之前不支持的“类型”被忽略（例如 "
"``typing.List[int]``）或在调用时引发错误（例如 ``list[int]``）。"

#: ../NEWS:12184
msgid ""
":issue:`46014`: Add ability to use ``typing.Union`` and ``types.UnionType`` "
"as dispatch argument to ``functools.singledispatch``. Patch provided by "
"Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46014`: 添加使用 ``typing.Union`` 和 ``types.UnionType`` 作为 "
"``functools.singledispatch`` 的调度参数的能力。由 Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12188
msgid ""
":issue:`27062`: Add :attr:`__all__` to :mod:`inspect`, patch by Kumar "
"Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27062`: 向 :mod:`inspect` 添加 :attr:`__all__`，由 Kumar Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12190
msgid ""
":issue:`46018`: Ensure that :func:`math.expm1` does not raise on underflow."
msgstr ":issue:`46018`: 确保 :func:`math.expm1` 在下溢时不抛出异常。"

#: ../NEWS:12192
msgid ""
":issue:`46016`: Adding :const:`!F_DUP2FD` and :const:`!F_DUP2FD_CLOEXEC` "
"constants from FreeBSD into the :mod:`fcntl` module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46016`: 将来自 FreeBSD 的 :const:`!F_DUP2FD` 和 "
":const:`!F_DUP2FD_CLOEXEC` 常量添加到 :mod:`fcntl` 模块中。"

#: ../NEWS:12195
msgid ""
":issue:`45755`: :mod:`typing` generic aliases now reveal the class "
"attributes of the original generic class when passed to ``dir()``. This was "
"the behavior up to Python 3.6, but was changed in 3.7-3.9."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45755`: 现在，当传递给 ``dir()`` 时，:mod:`typing` 泛型别名会显示原始泛型类的类属性。这是 Python"
" 3.6 之前的行为，但在 3.7-3.9 中有所改变。"

#: ../NEWS:12199
msgid ""
":issue:`45874`: The empty query string, consisting of no query arguments, is"
" now handled correctly in ``urllib.parse.parse_qsl``. This caused problems "
"before when strict parsing was enabled."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45874`: 现在，``urllib.parse.parse_qsl`` "
"正确处理了不包含任何查询参数的空查询字符串。这在之前启用严格解析时会引发问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12203
msgid ""
":issue:`44674`: Change how dataclasses disallows mutable default values.  It"
" used to use a list of known types (list, dict, set).  Now it disallows "
"unhashable objects to be defaults.  It's using unhashability as a proxy for "
"mutability.  Patch by Eric V. Smith, idea by Raymond Hettinger."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44674`: "
"修改数据类如何禁止可变默认值的方式。过去是使用一系列已知类型（列表、字典、集合）。现在则禁止不可哈希的对象作为默认值。这是用不可哈希性作为可变性的代理。由Eric"
" V. Smith提供补丁，想法来自Raymond Hettinger。"

#: ../NEWS:12208
msgid ""
":issue:`23882`: Remove namespace package (PEP 420) support from unittest "
"discovery. It was introduced in Python 3.4 but has been broken since Python "
"3.7."
msgstr ""
":issue:`23882`: 从unittest发现中移除命名空间包（PEP 420）的支持。这一功能在Python 3.4中引入，但自Python "
"3.7以来已经损坏。"

#: ../NEWS:12212
msgid ""
":issue:`25066`: Added a :meth:`__repr__` method to "
":class:`multiprocessing.Event` objects, patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25066`: 为 :class:`multiprocessing.Event` 对象添加了 :meth:`__repr__` "
"方法，由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12215
msgid ""
":issue:`45643`: Added :const:`signal.SIGSTKFLT` on platforms where this "
"signal is defined."
msgstr ":issue:`45643`: 在定义了这个信号的平台上添加了 :const:`signal.SIGSTKFLT`。"

#: ../NEWS:12218
msgid ""
":issue:`44092`: Fetch across rollback no longer raises "
":exc:`~sqlite3.InterfaceError`. Instead we leave it to the SQLite library to"
" handle these cases. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44092`: 跨回滚的获取不再引发 "
":exc:`~sqlite3.InterfaceError`。相反，我们让SQLite库来处理这些情况。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12222
msgid ""
":issue:`42413`: Replace ``concurrent.futures.TimeoutError`` and "
"``asyncio.TimeoutError`` with builtin :exc:`TimeoutError`, keep these names "
"as deprecated aliases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42413`: 用内置的 :exc:`TimeoutError` 替换 "
"``concurrent.futures.TimeoutError`` "
"和``asyncio.TimeoutError``，保留这些名称作为已弃用的别名。"

#: ../NEWS:12229
msgid ":issue:`46196`: Document method :meth:`cmd.Cmd.columnize`."
msgstr ":issue:`46196`: 记录方法 :meth:`cmd.Cmd.columnize`。"

#: ../NEWS:12231
msgid ""
":issue:`46120`: State that ``|`` is preferred for readability over ``Union``"
" in the :mod:`typing` docs."
msgstr ":issue:`46120`: 在 :mod:`typing` 文档中说明 ``|`` 在可读性上优于 ``Union``。"

#: ../NEWS:12234
msgid ""
":issue:`46109`: Extracted ``importlib.resources`` and "
"``importlib.resources.abc`` documentation into separate files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46109`: 将 ``importlib.resources`` 和 ``importlib.resources.abc`` "
"的文档提取到单独的文件中。"

#: ../NEWS:12237
msgid ""
":issue:`19737`: Update the documentation for the :func:`globals` function."
msgstr ":issue:`19737`: 更新 :func:`globals` 函数的文档。"

#: ../NEWS:12242
msgid ""
":issue:`46296`: Add a test case for :mod:`enum` with ``_use_args_ == True`` "
"and ``_member_type_ == object``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46296`: 为 :mod:`enum` 添加一个测试用例，条件是 ``_use_args_ == True`` "
"和``_member_type_ == object``。"

#: ../NEWS:12245
msgid ":issue:`46205`: Fix hang in runtest_mp due to race condition"
msgstr ":issue:`46205`: 修复由于竞态条件导致的runtest_mp中的挂起问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12247
msgid ""
":issue:`46263`: Fix test_capi on FreeBSD 14-dev: instruct jemalloc to not "
"fill freed memory with junk byte."
msgstr ":issue:`46263`: 在FreeBSD 14-dev上修复test_capi：指示jemalloc不要用垃圾字节填充释放的内存。"

#: ../NEWS:12250
msgid ""
":issue:`46262`: Cover ``ValueError`` path in tests for "
":meth:`enum.Flag._missing_`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46262`: 在 :meth:`enum.Flag._missing_` 的测试中覆盖 ``ValueError`` 路径。"

#: ../NEWS:12253
msgid ""
":issue:`46150`: Now ``fakename`` in "
"``test_pathlib.PosixPathTest.test_expanduser`` is checked to be non-"
"existent."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46150`: 现在检查 ``test_pathlib.PosixPathTest.test_expanduser`` 中的 "
"``fakename`` 是否不存在。"

#: ../NEWS:12257
msgid ""
":issue:`46129`: Rewrite ``asyncio.locks`` tests with "
":class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` usage."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46129`: 使用 :class:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 重写 "
"``asyncio.locks`` 测试。"

#: ../NEWS:12260
msgid ""
":issue:`23819`: Fixed :mod:`asyncio` tests in python optimized mode. Patch "
"by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ":issue:`23819`: 修复了python优化模式下的 :mod:`asyncio` 测试。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12263
msgid ""
":issue:`46114`: Fix test case for OpenSSL 3.0.1 version. OpenSSL 3.0 uses "
"``0xMNN00PP0L``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46114`: 修复针对 OpenSSL 3.0.1 版本的测试用例。OpenSSL 3.0 使用 ``0xMNN00PP0L``。"

#: ../NEWS:12269
msgid ""
":issue:`44133`: When Python is configured with :option:`--without-static-"
"libpython`, the Python static library (libpython.a) is no longer built. "
"Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44133`: 当 Python 配置了 :option:`--without-static-libpython` 时，不再构建 "
"Python 静态库（libpython.a）。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12273
msgid ""
":issue:`44133`: When Python is built without :option:`--enable-shared`, the "
"``python`` program is now linked to object files, rather than being linked "
"to the Python static library (libpython.a), to make sure that all symbols "
"are exported. Previously, the linker omitted some symbols like the "
":c:func:`Py_FrozenMain` function. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44133`: 当 Python 构建时未使用 :option:`--enable-shared`，``python`` "
"程序现在链接到对象文件，而不是 Python 静态库（libpython.a），以确保所有符号都被导出。之前，链接器省略了一些符号，如 "
":c:func:`Py_FrozenMain` 函数。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12279
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: The ``configure`` script has a new option ``--with-"
"emscripten-target`` to select browser or node as Emscripten build target."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: ``configure`` 脚本新增了一个选项 ``--with-emscripten-"
"target``，用于选择浏览器或 node 作为 Emscripten 构建目标。"

#: ../NEWS:12283
msgid ""
":issue:`46315`: Added and fixed ``#ifdef HAVE_FEATURE`` checks for "
"functionality that is not available on WASI platform."
msgstr ":issue:`46315`: 添加并修复了 ``#ifdef HAVE_FEATURE`` 检查，针对 WASI 平台上不可用的功能。"

#: ../NEWS:12286
msgid ""
":issue:`45723`: Fixed a regression in ``configure`` check for "
":func:`select.epoll`."
msgstr ":issue:`45723`: 修复了 ``configure`` 对 :func:`select.epoll` 检查的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12289
msgid ""
":issue:`46263`: ``configure`` no longer sets ``MULTIARCH`` on FreeBSD "
"platforms."
msgstr ":issue:`46263`: ``configure`` 不再在 FreeBSD 平台上设置 ``MULTIARCH``。"

#: ../NEWS:12292
msgid ""
":issue:`46106`: Updated OpenSSL to 1.1.1m in Windows builds, macOS installer"
" builds, and CI. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46106`: 在 Windows 构建、macOS 安装包构建和 CI 中更新 OpenSSL 到 1.1.1m。由 Kumar "
"Aditya 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12295
msgid ""
":issue:`46088`: Automatically detect or install bootstrap Python runtime "
"when building from Visual Studio."
msgstr ":issue:`46088`: 从 Visual Studio 构建时自动检测或安装引导 Python 运行时。"

#: ../NEWS:12298
msgid ""
":issue:`46072`: Add a --with-pystats configure option to turn on internal "
"statistics gathering."
msgstr ":issue:`46072`: 添加一个 --with-pystats 配置选项，用于开启内部统计收集。"

#: ../NEWS:12301
msgid ""
":issue:`40280`: A new directory ``Tools/wasm`` contains WebAssembly-related "
"helpers like ``config.site`` override for wasm32-emscripten, wasm assets "
"generator to bundle the stdlib, and a README."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40280`: 新增一个目录 ``Tools/wasm``，包含 WebAssembly 相关的辅助工具，如针对 "
"wasm32-emscripten 的 ``config.site`` 覆盖、用于打包标准库的 wasm 资源生成器，以及一个 README。"

#: ../NEWS:12305
msgid ""
":issue:`46023`: :program:`makesetup` no longer builds extensions that have "
"been marked as *disabled*. This allows users to disable modules in "
"``Modules/Setup.local``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46023`: :program:`makesetup` 不再构建标记为 *disabled* 的扩展。这允许用户在 "
"``Modules/Setup.local`` 中禁用模块。"

#: ../NEWS:12309
msgid ""
":issue:`45949`: Use pure Python ``freeze_module`` for all but importlib "
"bootstrap files. ``--with-freeze-module`` :program:`configure` option is no "
"longer needed for cross builds."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45949`: 对除 importlib 引导文件外的所有文件使用纯 Python ``freeze_module``。交叉构建不再需要"
" ``--with-freeze-module`` :program:`configure` 选项。"

#: ../NEWS:12316
msgid ""
":issue:`46217`: Removed parameter that is unsupported on Windows 8.1 and "
"early Windows 10 and may have caused build or runtime failures."
msgstr ":issue:`46217`: 移除了在Windows 8.1和早期Windows 10上不受支持且可能导致构建或运行时失败的参数。"

#: ../NEWS:12322
msgid ""
":issue:`40477`: The Python Launcher app for macOS now properly launches "
"scripts and, if necessary, the Terminal app when running on recent macOS "
"releases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40477`: macOS的Python启动器应用程序现在能正确启动脚本，并在必要时在最近的macOS版本上运行终端应用程序。"

#: ../NEWS:12328
msgid ""
":issue:`46236`: Fix a bug in :c:func:`PyFunction_GetAnnotations` that caused"
" it to return a ``tuple`` instead of a ``dict``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46236`: 修复了 :c:func:`PyFunction_GetAnnotations` 中的一个错误，该错误导致它返回一个 "
"``tuple`` 而不是 ``dict``。"

#: ../NEWS:12331
msgid ""
":issue:`46140`: :c:func:`PyBuffer_GetPointer`, "
":c:func:`PyBuffer_FromContiguous`, :c:func:`PyBuffer_ToContiguous` and "
":c:func:`PyMemoryView_FromBuffer` now take buffer info by ``const Py_buffer "
"*`` instead of ``Py_buffer *``, as they do not need mutability. "
":c:func:`PyBuffer_FromContiguous` also now takes the source buffer as "
"``const void *``, and similarly :c:func:`PyBuffer_GetPointer` takes the "
"strides as ``const Py_ssize_t *``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46140`: :c:func:`PyBuffer_GetPointer`, "
":c:func:`PyBuffer_FromContiguous`, :c:func:`PyBuffer_ToContiguous` 和 "
":c:func:`PyMemoryView_FromBuffer` 现在通过 ``const Py_buffer *`` 而不是 ``Py_buffer"
" *`` 获取缓冲区信息，因为它们不需要可变性。:c:func:`PyBuffer_FromContiguous` 现在还将源缓冲区作为``const "
"void *``，类似地，:c:func:`PyBuffer_GetPointer` 将步幅作为 ``const Py_ssize_t *``。"

#: ../NEWS:12339
msgid ""
":issue:`45855`: Document that the *no_block* argument to "
":c:func:`PyCapsule_Import` is a no-op now."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45855`: 记录了 *c:func:`PyCapsule_Import` 的 *no_block* 参数现在是一个无操作。"

#: ../NEWS:12342
msgid ""
":issue:`45855`: Replaced deprecated usage of "
":c:func:`PyImport_ImportModuleNoBlock` with :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModule` "
"in stdlib modules. Patch by Kumar Aditya."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45855`: 在stdlib模块中，用 :c:func:`PyImport_ImportModule` 替换了已弃用的 "
":c:func:`PyImport_ImportModuleNoBlock` 的使用。由Kumar Aditya提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12346
msgid ""
":issue:`46007`: The :c:func:`!PyUnicode_CHECK_INTERNED` macro has been "
"excluded from the limited C API. It was never usable there, because it used "
"internal structures which are not available in the limited C API. Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46007`: :c:func:`!PyUnicode_CHECK_INTERNED` 宏已被排除在有限的C "
"API之外。它在那里从来不可用，因为它使用了在有限的C API中不可用的内部结构。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12353
msgid "Python 3.11.0 alpha 3"
msgstr "Python 3.11.0 alpha 3"

#: ../NEWS:12355
msgid "*Release date: 2021-12-08*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2021-12-08*"

#: ../NEWS:12360
msgid ""
":issue:`46009`: Restore behavior from 3.9 and earlier when sending non-None "
"to newly started generator. In 3.9 this did not affect the state of the "
"generator. In 3.10.0 and 3.10.1 ``gen_func().send(0)`` is equivalent to "
"``gen_func().throw(TypeError(...)`` which exhausts the generator. In 3.10.2 "
"onward, the behavior has been reverted to that of 3.9."
msgstr ""
":issue:`46009`: "
"恢复3.9及更早版本中向新启动的生成器发送非None时的行为。在3.9中，这不影响生成器的状态。在3.10.0和3.10.1中，``gen_func().send(0)``等同于``gen_func().throw(TypeError(...)``，这会耗尽生成器。在3.10.2及以后版本中，行为已恢复到3.9的状态。"

#: ../NEWS:12366
msgid ""
":issue:`46004`: Fix the :exc:`SyntaxError` location for errors involving for"
" loops with invalid targets. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`46004`: 修复了涉及带有无效目标的for循环的 :exc:`SyntaxError` 位置错误。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12369
msgid ""
":issue:`45711`: :c:func:`!_PyErr_ChainStackItem` no longer normalizes "
"``exc_info`` (including setting the traceback on the exception instance) "
"because ``exc_info`` is always normalized."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45711`: :c:func:`!_PyErr_ChainStackItem` 不再规范化 ``exc_info`` "
"(包括在异常实例上设置回溯) ，因为 ``exc_info`` 总是被规范化的。"

#: ../NEWS:12373
msgid ""
":issue:`45607`: The ``__note__`` field was added to :exc:`BaseException`. It"
" is ``None`` by default but can be set to a string which is added to the "
"exception's traceback."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45607`: 向 :exc:`BaseException` 添加了 ``__note__`` 字段。默认情况下为 "
"``None``，但可以设置为字符串，该字符串将添加到异常的跟踪信息中。"

#: ../NEWS:12377
msgid ""
":issue:`45947`: Place pointers to dict and values immediately before GC "
"header. This reduces number of dependent memory loads to access either dict "
"or values from 3 to 1."
msgstr ":issue:`45947`: 将指向字典和值的指针立即放置在GC头之前。这将访问字典或值时的依赖内存加载次数从3次减少到1次。"

#: ../NEWS:12381
msgid ""
":issue:`45915`: ``is_valid_fd`` now uses faster ``fcntl(fd, F_GETFD)`` on "
"Linux, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45915`: 在Linux、macOS和Windows上，``is_valid_fd`` 现在使用更快的 ``fcntl(fd, "
"F_GETFD)``。"

#: ../NEWS:12384
msgid ""
":issue:`44530`: Reverts a change to the ``code.__new__`` :ref:`audit event "
"<audit-events>` from an earlier prerelease."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44530`: 恢复了对 ``code.__new__`` :ref:`audit event <audit-events>` "
"的早期预发布版本的更改。"

#: ../NEWS:12387
msgid ""
":issue:`42268`: Fail the configure step if the selected compiler doesn't "
"support memory sanitizer. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`42268`: 如果所选编译器不支持内存清理器，则配置步骤失败。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:12390
msgid ""
":issue:`45711`: The three values of ``exc_info`` are now always consistent "
"with each other. In particular, the ``type`` and ``traceback`` fields are "
"now derived from the exception instance. This impacts the return values of "
":func:`sys.exc_info` and :c:func:`PyErr_GetExcInfo()` if the exception "
"instance is modified while the exception is handled, as well as "
":c:func:`PyErr_SetExcInfo()`, which now ignores the ``type`` and "
"``traceback`` arguments provided to it."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45711`: ``exc_info`` 的三个值现在总是相互一致。特别是，``type`` 和 ``traceback`` "
"字段现在是从异常实例派生的。这会影响 :func:`sys.exc_info` 和 :c:func:`PyErr_GetExcInfo()` "
"的返回值，如果在处理异常时修改了异常实例，以及 :c:func:`PyErr_SetExcInfo()`，现在它会忽略提供给它的 ``type`` 和 "
"``traceback`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:12398
msgid ""
":issue:`45727`: Refine the custom syntax error that suggests that a comma "
"may be missing to trigger only when the expressions are detected between "
"parentheses or brackets. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45727`: 改进了自定义语法错误，只有当表达式在括号或方括号之间被检测到时，才触发可能缺少逗号的建议。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:12402
msgid ""
":issue:`45885`: Specialized the ``COMPARE_OP`` opcode using the PEP 659 "
"machinery."
msgstr ":issue:`45885`: 使用PEP 659机制专门化了 ``COMPARE_OP`` 操作码。"

#: ../NEWS:12405
msgid ""
":issue:`45786`: Allocate space for the interpreter frame in the frame "
"object, to avoid an additional allocation when the frame object outlives the"
" frame activation."
msgstr ":issue:`45786`: 在帧对象中为解释器帧分配空间，以避免当帧对象比帧激活更持久时进行额外的分配。"

#: ../NEWS:12409
msgid ""
":issue:`45614`: Fix :mod:`traceback` display for exceptions with invalid "
"module name."
msgstr ":issue:`45614`: 修复了 :mod:`traceback` 对于模块名称无效的异常的显示。"

#: ../NEWS:12412
msgid ""
":issue:`45813`: Fix crash when calling coro.cr_frame.clear() after coroutine"
" has been freed."
msgstr ":issue:`45813`: 修复了在协程被释放后调用 coro.cr_frame.clear() 时的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12415
msgid ""
":issue:`45811`: Improve the tokenizer errors when encountering invisible "
"control characters in the parser. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`45811`: 改进解析器在遇到不可见控制字符时的分词器错误。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:12418
msgid ""
":issue:`45848`: Allow the parser to obtain error lines directly from encoded"
" files. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`45848`: 允许解析器直接从编码文件中获取错误行。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:12421
msgid ""
":issue:`45709`: Restore behavior from 3.10 when tracing an exception raised "
"within a with statement."
msgstr ":issue:`45709`: 恢复3.10版本中追踪在with语句内引发的异常时的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:12424
msgid ""
":issue:`44525`: Adds new :opcode:`COPY_FREE_VARS` opcode, to make copying of"
