#: ../NEWS:12835
msgid "Python 3.11.0 alpha 2"
msgstr "Python 3.11.0 alpha 2"

#: ../NEWS:12837
msgid "*Release date: 2021-11-05*"
msgstr "*发布日期: 2021-11-05*"

#: ../NEWS:12842
msgid ""
":issue:`45716`: Improve the :exc:`SyntaxError` message when using ``True``, "
"``None`` or ``False`` as keywords in a function call. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45716`: 改进在函数调用中使用 ``True``、``None`` 或 ``False`` 作为关键字时的 "
":exc:`SyntaxError` 消息。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12846
msgid ""
":issue:`45688`: :data:`sys.stdlib_module_names` now contains the macOS-"
"specific module :mod:`!_scproxy`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45688`: :data:`sys.stdlib_module_names` 现在包含了macOS特定的模块 "
":mod:`!_scproxy`。"

#: ../NEWS:12849
msgid ""
":issue:`45379`: Clarify :exc:`ImportError` message when we try to explicitly"
" import a frozen module but frozen modules are disabled."
msgstr ":issue:`45379`: 澄清当我们尝试显式导入一个冻结模块但冻结模块被禁用时的 :exc:`ImportError` 消息。"

#: ../NEWS:12852
msgid ""
":issue:`44525`: Specialize simple calls to Python functions (no starargs, "
"keyword dict, or closure)"
msgstr ":issue:`44525`: 专门化对Python函数的简单调用（无星号参数、关键字字典或闭包）。"

#: ../NEWS:12855
msgid ""
":issue:`45530`: Cases of sorting using tuples as keys may now be "
"significantly faster in some cases. Patch by Tim Peters."
msgstr ":issue:`45530`: 在某些情况下，使用元组作为键的排序现在可能显著更快。由Tim Peters提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12858
msgid ""
"The order of the result may differ from earlier releases if the tuple "
"elements don't define a total ordering (see :ref:`expressions-value-"
"comparisons` for information on total ordering). It's generally true that "
"the result of sorting simply isn't well-defined in the absence of a total "
"ordering on list elements."
msgstr ""
"如果元组元素没有定义一个全序（关于全序的信息见 :ref:`expressions-value-"
"comparisons`），结果顺序可能与早期版本不同。一般来说，在没有对列表元素进行全序的情况下，排序的结果是不明确的。"

#: ../NEWS:12864
msgid ""
":issue:`45526`: In obmalloc, set ADDRESS_BITS to not ignore any bits "
"(ignored 16 before). That is safer in the case that the kernel gives user-"
"space virtual addresses that span a range greater than 48 bits."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45526`: "
"在obmalloc中，设置ADDRESS_BITS不忽略任何位（之前忽略16位）。在内核给用户空间虚拟地址跨越大于48位的范围的情况下，这更安全。"

#: ../NEWS:12868
msgid ""
":issue:`30570`: Fixed a crash in ``issubclass()`` from infinite recursion "
"when searching pathological ``__bases__`` tuples."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30570`: 修复了在搜索病态的 ``__bases__`` 元组时 ``issubclass()`` 因无限递归而崩溃的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:12871
msgid ""
":issue:`45521`: Fix a bug in the obmalloc radix tree code.  On 64-bit "
"machines, the bug causes the tree to hold 46-bits of virtual addresses, "
"rather than the intended 48-bits."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45521`: 修复obmalloc基数树代码中的一个错误。在64位机器上，该错误导致树持有46位的虚拟地址，而不是预期的48位。"

#: ../NEWS:12875
msgid ""
":issue:`45494`: Fix parser crash when reporting errors involving invalid "
"continuation characters. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`45494`: 修复报告涉及无效延续字符错误时的解析器崩溃。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12878
msgid ""
":issue:`45445`: Python now fails to initialize if it finds an invalid "
":option:`-X` option in the command line. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45445`: 如果Python在命令行中发现无效的 :option:`-X` 选项，现在将初始化失败。由Pablo "
"Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12881
msgid ""
":issue:`45340`: Object attributes are held in an array instead of a "
"dictionary. An object's dictionary are created lazily, only when needed. "
"Reduces the memory consumption of a typical Python object by about 30%. "
"Patch by Mark Shannon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45340`: "
"对象属性现在保存在数组中而不是字典中。对象的字典是懒加载的，只有在需要时才创建。减少了典型Python对象的内存消耗约30%。由Mark "
"Shannon提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12886
msgid ""
":issue:`45408`: Fix a crash in the parser when reporting tokenizer errors "
"that occur at the same time unclosed parentheses are detected. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`45408`: 修复解析器在报告与未闭合括号同时发生的分词器错误时崩溃的问题。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12890
msgid ""
":issue:`29410`: Add SipHash13 for string hash algorithm and use it by "
"default."
msgstr ":issue:`29410`: 添加SipHash13作为字符串哈希算法并默认使用。"

#: ../NEWS:12892
msgid ""
":issue:`45385`: Fix reference leak from descr_check. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ":issue:`45385`: 修复来自descr_check的引用泄漏。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12894
msgid ""
":issue:`45367`: Specialized the ``BINARY_MULTIPLY`` opcode to "
"``BINARY_MULTIPLY_INT`` and ``BINARY_MULTIPLY_FLOAT`` using the PEP 659 "
"machinery."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45367`: 使用PEP 659机制将 ``BINARY_MULTIPLY`` 操作码专门化为 "
"``BINARY_MULTIPLY_INT``和 ``BINARY_MULTIPLY_FLOAT``。"

#: ../NEWS:12898
msgid ""
":issue:`21736`: Frozen stdlib modules now have ``__file__`` to the .py file "
"they would otherwise be loaded from, if possible.  For packages, "
"``__path__`` now has the correct entry instead of being an empty list, which"
" allows unfrozen submodules to be imported.  These are set only if the "
"stdlib directory is known when the runtime is initialized.  Note that the "
"file at ``__file__`` is not guaranteed to exist.  None of this affects non-"
"stdlib frozen modules nor, for now, frozen modules imported using "
"``PyImport_ImportFrozenModule()``.  Also, at the moment ``co_filename`` is "
"not updated for the module."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21736`: 冻结的标准库模块现在将 ``__file__`` "
"设置为它们原本会从中加载的.py文件，如果可能的话。对于包，``__path__``现在有了正确的条目，而不是空列表，这允许导入未冻结的子模块。这些仅在运行时初始化时知道标准库目录的情况下设置。注意，``__file__``处的文件不保证存在。这些都不影响非标准库的冻结模块，目前也不影响使用"
" ``PyImport_ImportFrozenModule()`` 导入的冻结模块。另外，目前模块的 ``co_filename`` 没有更新。"

#: ../NEWS:12908
msgid ""
":issue:`45020`: For frozen stdlib modules, record the original module name "
"as ``module.__spec__.loader_state.origname``.  If the value is different "
"than ``module.__spec__.name`` then the module was defined as an alias in "
"Tools/scripts/freeze_modules.py.  If it is ``None`` then the module comes "
"from a source file outside the stdlib."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45020`: "
"对于冻结的标准库模块，将原始模块名称记录为``module.__spec__.loader_state.origname``。如果该值与 "
"``module.__spec__.name`` 不同，则该模块在Tools/scripts/freeze_modules.py中被定义为别名。如果它是"
" ``None``，则该模块来自标准库之外的源文件。"

#: ../NEWS:12914
msgid ""
":issue:`45324`: In FrozenImporter.find_spec(), we now preserve the "
"information needed in exec_module() to load the module.  This change mostly "
"impacts internal details, rather than changing the importer's behavior."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45324`: "
"在FrozenImporter.find_spec()中，我们现在保留了在exec_module()中加载模块所需的信息。这一变化主要影响内部细节，而不是改变导入器的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:12918
msgid ""
":issue:`45292`: Implement :pep:`654`. Add :class:`ExceptionGroup` and "
":class:`BaseExceptionGroup`. Update traceback display code."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45292`: 实现 :pep:`654`。添加 :class:`ExceptionGroup` 和 "
":class:`BaseExceptionGroup`。更新回溯显示代码。"

#: ../NEWS:12921
msgid ""
":issue:`40116`: Change to the implementation of split dictionaries. Classes "
"where the instances differ either in the exact set of attributes, or in the "
"order in which those attributes are set, can still share keys. This should "
"have no observable effect on users of Python or the C-API. Patch by Mark "
"Shannon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40116`: 修改拆分字典的实现。实例在确切属性集或属性设置顺序上不同的类仍可共享键。这对Python或C-"
"API的用户应无可见影响。由Mark Shannon提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12927
msgid ""
":issue:`44050`: Extensions that indicate they use global state (by setting "
"``m_size`` to -1) can again be used in multiple interpreters. This reverts "
"to behavior of Python 3.8."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44050`: 通过设置 ``m_size`` 为-1来表明使用全局状态的扩展可以再次在多个解释器中使用。这恢复到Python "
"3.8的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:12931
msgid ""
":issue:`44525`: Setup initial specialization infrastructure for the "
"``CALL_FUNCTION`` opcode. Implemented initial specializations for C function"
" calls:"
msgstr ":issue:`44525`: 为 ``CALL_FUNCTION`` 操作码设置初始专业化基础设施。实现了C函数调用的初始专业化："

#: ../NEWS:12935
msgid "``CALL_FUNCTION_BUILTIN_O`` for ``METH_O`` flag."
msgstr "``CALL_FUNCTION_BUILTIN_O``对应 ``METH_O`` 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:12937
msgid ""
"``CALL_FUNCTION_BUILTIN_FAST`` for ``METH_FASTCALL`` flag without keywords."
msgstr "``CALL_FUNCTION_BUILTIN_FAST``对应不包含关键字的 ``METH_FASTCALL`` 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:12939
msgid "``CALL_FUNCTION_LEN`` for ``len(o)``."
msgstr "``CALL_FUNCTION_LEN``对应 ``len(o)``。"

#: ../NEWS:12941
msgid "``CALL_FUNCTION_ISINSTANCE`` for ``isinstance(o, t)``."
msgstr "``CALL_FUNCTION_ISINSTANCE``对应 ``isinstance(o, t)``。"

#: ../NEWS:12943
msgid ""
":issue:`44511`: Improve the generated bytecode for class and mapping "
"patterns."
msgstr ":issue:`44511`: 改进类和映射模式生成的字节码。"

#: ../NEWS:12945
msgid ""
":issue:`43706`: Speed up calls to ``enumerate()`` by using the :pep:`590` "
"``vectorcall`` calling convention. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43706`: 通过使用 :pep:`590` ``vectorcall`` 调用约定加速 ``enumerate()`` "
"的调用。由Donghee Na提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12951
msgid ""
":issue:`45679`: Fix caching of multi-value :data:`typing.Literal`. "
"``Literal[True, 2]`` is no longer equal to ``Literal[1, 2]``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45679`: 修复多值 :data:`typing.Literal` 的缓存问题。``Literal[True, 2]`` "
"不再等于``Literal[1, 2]``。"

#: ../NEWS:12954
msgid ""
":issue:`42064`: Convert :mod:`sqlite3` to multi-phase initialisation (PEP "
"489). Patches by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42064`: 将 :mod:`sqlite3` 转换为多阶段初始化（PEP 489）。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12957
msgid ""
":issue:`45438`: Fix typing.Signature string representation for generic "
"builtin types."
msgstr ":issue:`45438`: 修复泛型内置类型的typing.Signature字符串表示。"

#: ../NEWS:12960
msgid ""
":issue:`45613`: :mod:`sqlite3` now sets :attr:`sqlite3.threadsafety` based "
"on the default threading mode the underlying SQLite library has been "
"compiled with. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45613`: :mod:`sqlite3` 现在根据底层SQLite库编译时的默认线程模式设置 "
":attr:`sqlite3.threadsafety`。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12964
msgid ":issue:`45574`: Fix warning about ``print_escape`` being unused."
msgstr ":issue:`45574`: 修复关于 ``print_escape`` 未使用的警告。"

#: ../NEWS:12966
msgid ""
":issue:`45581`: :meth:`sqlite3.connect` now correctly raises "
":exc:`MemoryError` if the underlying SQLite API signals memory error. Patch "
"by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45581`: :meth:`sqlite3.connect` 现在在底层SQLite API发出内存错误信号时正确引发 "
":exc:`MemoryError`。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12970
msgid ""
":issue:`45557`: :func:`pprint.pprint` now handles *underscore_numbers* "
"correctly. Previously it was always setting it to ``False``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45557`: :func:`pprint.pprint` "
"现在正确处理*underscore_numbers*。之前总是将其设置为``False``。"

#: ../NEWS:12973
msgid ""
":issue:`44019`: Add :func:`operator.call` to ``operator.__all__``. Patch by "
"Kreusada."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44019`: 将 :func:`operator.call` 添加到 ``operator.__all__`` 中。由 "
"Kreusada 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12976
msgid ""
":issue:`42174`: :meth:`shutil.get_terminal_size` now falls back to sane "
"values if the column or line count are 0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42174`: 现在如果列数或行数为 0，:meth:`shutil.get_terminal_size` 会回退到合理的值。"

#: ../NEWS:12979
msgid ""
":issue:`35673`: Improve the introspectability of the ``__loader__`` "
"attribute for namespace packages.  "
":class:`importlib.machinery.NamespaceLoader` is now public, and implements "
"the :class:`importlib.abc.InspectLoader` interface. ``_NamespaceLoader`` is "
"kept for backward compatibility."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35673`: 改进了对命名空间包的 ``__loader__`` "
"属性的内省能力。:class:`importlib.machinery.NamespaceLoader` 现在是公开的，并且实现了 "
":class:`importlib.abc.InspectLoader` 接口。``_NamespaceLoader`` 保留以向后兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:12984
msgid ""
":issue:`45515`: Add references to :mod:`zoneinfo` in the :mod:`datetime` "
"documentation, mostly replacing outdated references to ``dateutil.tz``. "
"Change by Paul Ganssle."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45515`: 在 :mod:`datetime` 文档中添加了对 :mod:`zoneinfo` 的引用，主要替换了对 "
"``dateutil.tz`` 的过时引用。由 Paul Ganssle 更改。"

#: ../NEWS:12988
msgid ""
":issue:`45475`: Reverted optimization of iterating :class:`gzip.GzipFile`, "
":class:`bz2.BZ2File`, and :class:`lzma.LZMAFile` (see :issue:`43787`) "
"because it caused regression when user iterate them without having reference"
" of them. Patch by Inada Naoki."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45475`: 撤回了对 :class:`gzip.GzipFile`、:class:`bz2.BZ2File` 和 "
":class:`lzma.LZMAFile` 迭代的优化（参见 :issue:`43787`），因为在用户迭代它们时没有保持它们的引用导致回归。由 "
"Inada Naoki 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:12993
msgid ""
":issue:`45489`: Update :class:`~typing.ForwardRef` to support ``|`` "
"operator. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45489`: 更新 :class:`~typing.ForwardRef` 以支持 ``|`` 操作符。补丁由 Donghee Na "
"提供。"

#: ../NEWS:12996
msgid ""
":issue:`42222`: Removed deprecated support for float arguments in "
"*randrange()*."
msgstr ":issue:`42222`: 移除了在 *randrange()* 中对浮点数参数的弃用支持。"

#: ../NEWS:12999
msgid ""
":issue:`45428`: Fix a regression in py_compile when reading filenames from "
"standard input."
msgstr ":issue:`45428`: 修复了在从标准输入读取文件名时 py_compile 中的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13002
msgid ""
":issue:`45467`: Fix incremental decoder and stream reader in the \"raw-"
"unicode-escape\" codec. Previously they failed if the escape sequence was "
"split."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45467`: 修复了 \"raw-unicode-escape\" "
"编解码器中的增量解码器和流读取器。之前如果转义序列被分割，它们会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:13006
msgid ""
":issue:`45461`: Fix incremental decoder and stream reader in the \"unicode-"
"escape\" codec. Previously they failed if the escape sequence was split."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45461`: 修复了 \"unicode-escape\" 编解码器中的增量解码器和流读取器。之前如果转义序列被分割，它们会失败。"

#: ../NEWS:13010
msgid ""
":issue:`45239`: Fixed :func:`email.utils.parsedate_tz` crashing with "
":exc:`UnboundLocalError` on certain invalid input instead of returning "
"``None``. Patch by Ben Hoyt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45239`: 修复了 :func:`email.utils.parsedate_tz` 在某些无效输入上崩溃并抛出 "
":exc:`UnboundLocalError` 而不是返回 ``None`` 的问题。由 Ben Hoyt 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13014
msgid ""
":issue:`45417`: Fix quadratic behaviour in the enum module: Creation of enum"
" classes with a lot of entries was quadratic."
msgstr ":issue:`45417`: 修复了 enum 模块中的二次行为：创建具有大量条目的枚举类是二次的。"

#: ../NEWS:13017
msgid ""
":issue:`45249`: Fix the behaviour of :func:`traceback.print_exc` when "
"displaying the caret when the ``end_offset`` in the exception is set to 0. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45249`: 修复了当异常中的 ``end_offset`` 设置为 0 时，:func:`traceback.print_exc` "
"在显示插入符号时的行为。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13021
msgid ""
":issue:`45416`: Fix use of :class:`asyncio.Condition` with explicit "
":class:`asyncio.Lock` objects, which was a regression due to removal of "
"explicit loop arguments. Patch by Joongi Kim."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45416`: 修复了与显式 :class:`asyncio.Lock` 对象一起使用 "
":class:`asyncio.Condition` 的问题，这是由于移除了显式循环参数导致的回归。由 Joongi Kim 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13025
msgid ""
":issue:`20028`: Empty escapechar/quotechar is not allowed when initializing "
":class:`csv.Dialect`. Patch by Vajrasky Kok and Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20028`: 初始化 :class:`csv.Dialect` 时不允许空的 escapechar/quotechar。由 "
"Vajrasky Kok 和 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13028
msgid ""
":issue:`44904`: Fix bug in the :mod:`doctest` module that caused it to fail "
"if a docstring included an example with a ``classmethod`` ``property``. "
"Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44904`: 修复了 :mod:`doctest` 模块中的一个错误，该错误会在文档字符串包含一个带有 ``classmethod``"
" ``property`` 的示例时导致失败。由 Alex Waygood 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13032
msgid ""
":issue:`45406`: Make :func:`inspect.getmodule` catch ``FileNotFoundError`` "
"raised by :func:`inspect.getabsfile`, and return ``None`` to indicate that "
"the module could not be determined."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45406`: 使 :func:`inspect.getmodule` 捕获由 :func:`inspect.getabsfile` "
"引发的 ``FileNotFoundError``，并返回 ``None`` 表示无法确定模块。"

#: ../NEWS:13036
msgid ""
":issue:`45411`: Add extensions for files containing subtitles - .srt & .vtt "
"- to the mimetypes.py module."
msgstr ":issue:`45411`: 在 mimetypes.py 模块中添加了包含字幕的文件扩展名 - .srt 和 .vtt。"

#: ../NEWS:13039
msgid ""
":issue:`10716`: Migrated pydoc to HTML5 (without changing the look of it). "
"Side effect is to update xmlrpc's ``ServerHTMLDoc`` which now uses the CSS "
"too. cgitb now relies less on pydoc (as it can't use the CSS file)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`10716`: 将 pydoc 迁移到 HTML5（不改变其外观）。副作用是更新了 xmlrpc 的 "
"``ServerHTMLDoc``，现在也使用了 CSS。cgitb 现在较少依赖 pydoc（因为它不能使用 CSS 文件）。"

#: ../NEWS:13043
msgid ":issue:`27580`: Add support of null characters in :mod:`csv`."
msgstr ":issue:`27580`: 在 :mod:`csv` 中添加了对空字符的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:13045
msgid ""
":issue:`45262`: Prevent use-after-free in asyncio. Make sure the cached "
"running loop holder gets cleared on dealloc to prevent use-after-free in "
"get_running_loop"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45262`: 防止 asyncio 中的 use-after-free。确保缓存的运行循环持有人在释放时被清除，以防止在 "
"get_running_loop 中出现 use-after-free。"

#: ../NEWS:13049
msgid ""
":issue:`45386`: Make :mod:`xmlrpc.client` more robust to C runtimes where "
"the underlying C ``strftime`` function results in a ``ValueError`` when "
"testing for year formatting options."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45386`: 使 :mod:`xmlrpc.client` 对 C 运行时更加健壮，其中底层的 C ``strftime`` "
"函数在测试年份格式化选项时会导致 ``ValueError``。"

#: ../NEWS:13053
msgid ""
":issue:`20028`: Improve error message of :class:`csv.Dialect` when "
"initializing. Patch by Vajrasky Kok and Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20028`: 改进 :class:`csv.Dialect` 初始化时的错误消息。由 Vajrasky Kok 和 Donghee "
"Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13056
msgid ":issue:`45343`: Update bundled pip to 21.2.4 and setuptools to 58.1.0"
msgstr ":issue:`45343`: 将捆绑的 pip 更新到 21.2.4，setuptools 更新到 58.1.0。"

#: ../NEWS:13058
msgid ""
":issue:`45328`: Fixed :class:`http.client.HTTPConnection` to work properly "
"in OSs that don't support the ``TCP_NODELAY`` socket option."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45328`: 修复了 :class:`http.client.HTTPConnection` 在不支持 ``TCP_NODELAY``"
" 套接字选项的操作系统中正常工作的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13061
msgid ""
":issue:`45243`: Add :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.setlimit` and "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.getlimit` to :class:`sqlite3.Connection` for "
"setting and getting SQLite limits by connection basis. Patch by Erlend E. "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45243`: 向 :class:`sqlite3.Connection` 添加了 "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.setlimit` 和 :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.getlimit` "
"方法，用于基于连接设置和获取 SQLite 限制。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13066
msgid ":issue:`45320`: Removed from the :mod:`inspect` module:"
msgstr ":issue:`45320`: 从 :mod:`inspect` 模块中移除:"

#: ../NEWS:13068
msgid "the ``getargspec`` function, deprecated since Python 3.0;"
msgstr "自 Python 3.0 起弃用的 ``getargspec`` 函数；"

#: ../NEWS:13069
msgid ""
"use :func:`inspect.signature` or :func:`inspect.getfullargspec` instead."
msgstr "改用 :func:`inspect.signature` 或 :func:`inspect.getfullargspec`。"

#: ../NEWS:13071
msgid ""
"the ``formatargspec`` function, deprecated since Python 3.5; use the "
":func:`inspect.signature` function and :class:`Signature` object directly."
msgstr ""
"自 Python 3.5 起弃用的 ``formatargspec`` 函数；直接使用 :func:`inspect.signature` 函数和 "
":class:`Signature` 对象。"

#: ../NEWS:13075
msgid ""
"the undocumented ``Signature.from_builtin`` and ``Signature.from_function`` "
"functions, deprecated since Python 3.5; use the "
":meth:`Signature.from_callable() <inspect.Signature.from_callable>` method "
"instead."
