"自 Python 3.5 起弃用的未文档化 ``Signature.from_builtin`` 和 "
"``Signature.from_function`` 函数；改用 :meth:`Signature.from_callable() "
"<inspect.Signature.from_callable>` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:13082
msgid ""
":issue:`45192`: Fix the ``tempfile._infer_return_type`` function so that the"
" ``dir`` argument of the :mod:`tempfile` functions accepts an object "
"implementing the ``os.PathLike`` protocol."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45192`: 修复 ``tempfile._infer_return_type`` 函数，使得 :mod:`tempfile` 函数的"
" ``dir`` 参数接受实现 ``os.PathLike`` 协议的对象。"

#: ../NEWS:13086
msgid "Patch by Kyungmin Lee."
msgstr "由 Kyungmin Lee 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13088
msgid ""
":issue:`45160`: When tracing a tkinter variable used by a ttk OptionMenu, "
