msgstr ":issue:`45160`: 当追踪被 ttk OptionMenu 使用的 tkinter 变量时，回调不再被调用两次。"

#: ../NEWS:13091
msgid ""
":issue:`25625`: Added non parallel-safe :func:`~contextlib.chdir` context "
"manager to change the current working directory and then restore it on exit."
" Simple wrapper around :func:`~os.chdir`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25625`: 添加了非并行安全的 :func:`~contextlib.chdir` "
"上下文管理器，用于改变当前工作目录并在退出时恢复。:func:`~os.chdir` 的简单包装。"

#: ../NEWS:13095
msgid ""
":issue:`24139`: Add support for SQLite extended result codes in "
":exc:`sqlite3.Error`. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24139`: 在 :exc:`sqlite3.Error` 中添加对 SQLite 扩展结果代码的支持。由 Erlend E. "
"Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13098
msgid ""
":issue:`24444`: Fixed an error raised in :mod:`argparse` help display when "
"help for an option is set to 1+ blank spaces or when *choices* arg is an "
"empty container."
msgstr ""
":issue:`24444`: 修复了 :mod:`argparse` 帮助显示中当选项的帮助设置为 1+ 个空格或当 *choices* "
"参数为空容器时引发的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13102
msgid ""
":issue:`44547`: Implement ``Fraction.__int__``, so that a "
":class:`fractions.Fraction` instance ``f`` passes an ``isinstance(f, "
"typing.SupportsInt)`` check."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44547`: 实现 ``Fraction.__int__``，使得 :class:`fractions.Fraction` 实例 "
"``f`` 通过 ``isinstance(f, typing.SupportsInt)`` 检查。"

#: ../NEWS:13106
msgid ""
":issue:`40321`: Adds support for HTTP 308 redirects to :mod:`urllib`. See "
":rfc:`7538` for details. Patch by Jochem Schulenklopper."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40321`: 在 :mod:`urllib` 中添加对 HTTP 308 重定向的支持。详情见 :rfc:`7538`。由 "
"Jochem Schulenklopper 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13109
