msgstr ":issue:`41374`: 确保在 Cygwin 3.1.6 及更高版本中暴露 ``socket.TCP_*`` 常量。"

#: ../NEWS:13112
msgid ""
":issue:`35970`: Add help flag to the base64 module's command line interface."
