#: ../NEWS:13142
msgid ":issue:`45449`: Add note about :pep:`585` in :mod:`collections.abc`."
msgstr ":issue:`45449`: 在 :mod:`collections.abc` 中添加关于 :pep:`585` 的说明。"

#: ../NEWS:13144
msgid ""
":issue:`45516`: Add protocol description to the "
":class:`importlib.abc.Traversable` documentation."
msgstr ":issue:`45516`: 在 :class:`importlib.abc.Traversable` 文档中添加协议描述。"

#: ../NEWS:13147
msgid ""
":issue:`20692`: Add Programming FAQ entry explaining that int literal "
