"``test_sqlite3``，并将其重新定位到 ``Lib/test/test_sqlite3``。由Erlend E. Aasland提交的补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13202
msgid ""
":issue:`43158`: ``setup.py`` now uses values from configure script to build "
"the ``_uuid`` extension module. Configure now detects util-linux's "
"``libuuid``, too."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43158`: ``setup.py`` 现在使用来自配置脚本的值来构建 ``_uuid`` 扩展模块。配置现在也能检测util-"
"linux的 ``libuuid``。"

#: ../NEWS:13206
msgid ""
":issue:`45666`: Fix warning of ``swprintf`` and ``%s`` usage in "
"``_testembed.c``"
msgstr ":issue:`45666`: 修复 ``_testembed.c``中 ``swprintf`` 和 ``%s`` 使用的警告"

#: ../NEWS:13209
msgid ""
":issue:`45548`: ``Modules/Setup`` and ``Modules/makesetup`` have been "
"improved. The ``Setup`` file now contains working rules for all extensions. "
"Outdated comments have been removed. Rules defined by ``makesetup`` track "
"dependencies correctly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45548`: ``Modules/Setup``和 ``Modules/makesetup`` 已得到改进。``Setup`` "
"文件现在包含所有扩展的工作规则。过时的评论已被移除。由 ``makesetup`` 定义的规则正确跟踪依赖关系。"

#: ../NEWS:13214
msgid ""
":issue:`45548`: The :mod:`math` and :mod:`cmath` implementation now require "
"a C99 compatible ``libm`` and no longer ship with workarounds for missing "
"acosh, asinh, atanh, expm1, and log1p functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45548`: :mod:`math` 和 :mod:`cmath` 的实现现在需要C99兼容的 "
"``libm``，并且不再提供针对缺少acosh、asinh、atanh、expm1和log1p函数的变通方案。"

#: ../NEWS:13218
msgid ""
":issue:`45595`: ``setup.py`` and ``makesetup`` now track build dependencies "
"on all Python header files and module specific header files."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45595`: ``setup.py`` 和 ``makesetup`` 现在跟踪所有Python头文件和模块特定头文件的构建依赖。"

#: ../NEWS:13221
msgid ""
":issue:`45571`: ``Modules/Setup`` now use ``PY_CFLAGS_NODIST`` instead of "
"``PY_CFLAGS`` to compile shared modules."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45571`: ``Modules/Setup`` 现在使用 ``PY_CFLAGS_NODIST`` 而不是 "
"``PY_CFLAGS`` 来编译共享模块。"

#: ../NEWS:13224
msgid ""
":issue:`45570`: :mod:`pyexpat` and :mod:`!_elementtree` no longer define "
"obsolete macros ``HAVE_EXPAT_CONFIG_H`` and ``USE_PYEXPAT_CAPI``. "
"``XML_POOR_ENTROPY`` is now defined in ``expat_config.h``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45570`: :mod:`pyexpat` 和 :mod:`!_elementtree` 不再定义过时的宏 "
"``HAVE_EXPAT_CONFIG_H`` 和 ``USE_PYEXPAT_CAPI``。``XML_POOR_ENTROPY`` 现在在 "
"``expat_config.h`` 中定义。"

#: ../NEWS:13228
msgid ""
":issue:`43974`: ``setup.py`` no longer defines ``Py_BUILD_CORE_MODULE``. "
"Instead every module, that uses the internal API, defines the macro."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43974`: ``setup.py`` 不再定义 ``Py_BUILD_CORE_MODULE``。相反，每个使用内部 API "
"的模块都会定义这个宏。"

#: ../NEWS:13231
msgid ":issue:`45548`: Fill in missing entries in Modules/Setup."
msgstr ":issue:`45548`: 填充 Modules/Setup 中缺失的条目。"

#: ../NEWS:13233
msgid ""
":issue:`45532`: Update :data:`sys.version` to use ``main`` as fallback "
"information. Patch by Jeong YunWon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45532`: 更新 :data:`sys.version` 使用 ``main`` 作为后备信息。由 Jeong YunWon "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13236
msgid ""
":issue:`45536`: The ``configure`` script now checks whether OpenSSL headers "
"and libraries provide required APIs. Most common APIs are verified. The "
"check detects outdated or missing OpenSSL. Failures do not stop configure."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45536`: ``configure`` 脚本现在检查 OpenSSL 头文件和库是否提供所需的 API。大多数常见的 API "
"都经过验证。此检查能检测到过时或缺失的 OpenSSL。失败不会停止 configure。"

#: ../NEWS:13240
msgid ""
":issue:`45221`: Fixed regression in handling of ``LDFLAGS`` and ``CPPFLAGS``"
" options where :meth:`argparse.parse_known_args` could interpret an option "
"as one of the built-in command line argument, for example ``-h`` for help."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45221`: 修复了处理 ``LDFLAGS`` 和 ``CPPFLAGS`` 选项时的回归问题，其中 "
":meth:`argparse.parse_known_args` 可能会将选项解释为内置命令行参数之一，例如 ``-h`` 寻求帮助。"

#: ../NEWS:13244
msgid ""
":issue:`45440`: Building Python now requires a C99 ``<math.h>`` header file "
"providing the following functions: ``copysign()``, ``hypot()``, "
"``isfinite()``, ``isinf()``, ``isnan()``, ``round()``. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45440`: 构建 Python 现在需要一个提供以下函数的 C99 ``<math.h>`` 头文件：``copysign()``,"
" ``hypot()``, ``isfinite()``, ``isinf()``, ``isnan()``, ``round()``。补丁由 "
"Victor Stinner 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:13249
msgid ""
":issue:`45405`: Prevent ``internal configure error`` when running "
"``configure`` with recent versions of non-Apple clang.  Patch by David "
"Bohman."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45405`: 防止在使用非 Apple clang 的近期版本运行 ``configure`` 时出现 ``internal "
"configure error``。由 David Bohman 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13252
msgid ":issue:`45433`: Avoid linking libpython with libcrypt."
msgstr ":issue:`45433`: 避免将 libpython 与 libcrypt 链接。"

#: ../NEWS:13257
msgid ""
