#: ../NEWS:13326
msgid ""
":issue:`45434`: ``<Python.h>`` no longer includes the header files "
"``<stdlib.h>``, ``<stdio.h>``, ``<errno.h>`` and ``<string.h>`` when the "
"``Py_LIMITED_API`` macro is set to ``0x030b0000`` (Python 3.11) or higher. C"
