msgid ""
":issue:`44662`: Add ``__module__`` to ``types.Union``. This also fixes "
"``types.Union`` issues with ``typing.Annotated``. Patch provided by Yurii "
"Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44662`: 向 ``types.Union`` 添加 ``__module__``。这也修复了 ``types.Union`` 与 "
"``typing.Annotated`` 的问题。由 Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13628
msgid ""
":issue:`44655`: Include the name of the type in unset __slots__ attribute "
"errors. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44655`: 在未设置的 __slots__ 属性错误中包括类型名称。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13631
msgid ""
":issue:`44655`: Don't include a missing attribute with the same name as the "
"failing one when offering suggestions for missing attributes. Patch by Pablo"
" Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44655`: 当为缺失属性提供建议时，不包括与失败属性同名的缺失属性。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13635
msgid ""
":issue:`44646`: Fix the hash of the union type: it no longer depends on the "
"order of arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`44646`: 修复联合类型的哈希值：它不再依赖于参数的顺序。"

#: ../NEWS:13638
msgid ""
":issue:`44636`: Collapse union of equal types. E.g. the result of ``int | "
"int`` is now ``int``. Fix comparison of the union type with non-hashable "
"objects. E.g. ``int | str == {}`` no longer raises a TypeError."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44636`: 合并相同类型的联合。例如，``int | int`` 的结果现在是 "
"``int``。修复与非可哈希对象的联合类型比较。例如，``int | str == {}`` 不再引发 TypeError。"

#: ../NEWS:13642
msgid ""
":issue:`44611`: On Windows, :func:`os.urandom`: uses BCryptGenRandom API "
"instead of CryptGenRandom API which is deprecated from Microsoft Windows "
"API. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44611`: 在 Windows 上，:func:`os.urandom`: 使用 BCryptGenRandom API 而不是已被"
" Microsoft Windows API 弃用的 CryptGenRandom API。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13646
msgid ""
":issue:`44635`: Convert ``None`` to ``type(None)`` in the union type "
"constructor."
msgstr ":issue:`44635`: 在联合类型构造函数中将 ``None`` 转换为 ``type(None)``。"

#: ../NEWS:13649
msgid ":issue:`26280`: Implement adaptive specialization for BINARY_SUBSCR"
msgstr ":issue:`26280`: 为 BINARY_SUBSCR 实现自适应专门化。"

#: ../NEWS:13651
msgid "Three specialized forms of BINARY_SUBSCR are added:"
msgstr "添加了 BINARY_SUBSCR 的三种专门化形式："

#: ../NEWS:13653
msgid "BINARY_SUBSCR_LIST_INT"
msgstr "BINARY_SUBSCR_LIST_INT"

#: ../NEWS:13655
msgid "BINARY_SUBSCR_TUPLE_INT"
msgstr "BINARY_SUBSCR_TUPLE_INT"

#: ../NEWS:13657
msgid "BINARY_SUBSCR_DICT"
msgstr "BINARY_SUBSCR_DICT"

#: ../NEWS:13659
msgid ""
":issue:`44589`: Mapping patterns in ``match`` statements with two or more "
"equal literal keys will now raise a :exc:`SyntaxError` at compile-time."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44589`: ``match`` 语句中具有两个或更多相等字面键的映射模式现在会在编译时引发 :exc:`SyntaxError`。"

#: ../NEWS:13662
msgid ""
":issue:`44606`: Fix ``__instancecheck__`` and ``__subclasscheck__`` for the "
"union type."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44606`: 修复联合类型的 ``__instancecheck__`` 和 ``__subclasscheck__``。"

#: ../NEWS:13665
msgid ""
":issue:`42073`: The ``@classmethod`` decorator can now wrap other "
"classmethod-like descriptors."
msgstr ":issue:`42073`: ``@classmethod`` 装饰器现在可以包装其他类似 classmethod 的描述符。"

#: ../NEWS:13668
msgid ""
":issue:`41972`: Tuned the string-searching algorithm of fastsearch.h to have"
" a shorter inner loop for most cases."
msgstr ":issue:`41972`: 调整了 fastsearch.h 的字符串搜索算法，使其在大多数情况下具有更短的内循环。"

#: ../NEWS:13671
msgid ""
":issue:`44590`: All necessary data for executing a Python function (local "
"variables, stack, etc) is now kept in a per-thread stack. Frame objects are "
"lazily allocated on demand. This increases performance by about 7% on the "
"standard benchmark suite. Introspection and debugging are unaffected as "
"frame objects are always available when needed. Patch by Mark Shannon."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44590`: "
"现在，执行Python函数所需的所有数据（局部变量、栈等）都保存在每线程栈中。帧对象是按需延迟分配的。这使得标准基准测试套件的性能提高了约7%。自省和调试不受影响，因为帧对象在需要时总是可用的。由Mark"
" Shannon提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13677
msgid ""
":issue:`44584`: The threading debug (:envvar:`!PYTHONTHREADDEBUG` "
"environment variable) is deprecated in Python 3.10 and will be removed in "
"Python 3.12. This feature requires a debug build of Python. Patch by Victor "
"Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44584`: Python 3.10中已弃用线程调试（:envvar:`!PYTHONTHREADDEBUG` "
"环境变量），并将在Python 3.12中移除。此功能需要Python的调试版本。由Victor Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13681
msgid ""
":issue:`43895`: An obsolete internal cache of shared object file handles "
"added in 1995 that attempted, but did not guarantee, that a .so would not be"
" dlopen'ed twice to work around flaws in mid-1990s posix-ish operating "
"systems has been removed from dynload_shlib.c."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43895`: "
"1995年添加的一个过时的共享对象文件句柄内部缓存已被从dynload_shlib.c中移除。该缓存尝试（但未保证）不会对同一.so文件执行两次dlopen，以解决1990年代中期posix类操作系统的缺陷。"

#: ../NEWS:13686
msgid ""
":issue:`44490`: :mod:`typing` now searches for type parameters in "
"``types.Union`` objects. ``get_type_hints`` will also properly resolve "
"annotations with nested ``types.Union`` objects. Patch provided by Yurii "
"Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44490`: :mod:`typing` 现在会在 ``types.Union`` "
"对象中搜索类型参数。``get_type_hints``也将正确解析带有嵌套 ``types.Union`` 对象的注解。由Yurii "
"Karabas提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13691
msgid ""
":issue:`43950`: Code objects can now provide the column information for "
"instructions when available. This is levaraged during traceback printing to "
"show the expressions responsible for errors."
msgstr ":issue:`43950`: 代码对象现在可以在可用时提供指令的列信息。这在回溯打印过程中被利用，以显示导致错误的表达式。"

#: ../NEWS:13695
msgid ""
"Contributed by Pablo Galindo, Batuhan Taskaya and Ammar Askar as part of "
":pep:`657`."
msgstr "由Pablo Galindo、Batuhan Taskaya和Ammar Askar作为 :pep:`657` 的一部分贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:13698
msgid ""
":issue:`44562`: Remove uses of :c:func:`PyObject_GC_Del` in error path when "
"initializing :class:`types.GenericAlias`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44562`: 在初始化 :class:`types.GenericAlias` 时，错误路径中移除 "
":c:func:`PyObject_GC_Del` 的使用。"

#: ../NEWS:13701
msgid ""
":issue:`41486`: Fix a memory consumption and copying performance regression "
"in earlier 3.10 beta releases if someone used an output buffer larger than "
"4GiB with zlib.decompress on input data that expands that large."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41486`: 修复了早期3.10 "
"beta版本中，如果有人在输入数据扩展超过4GiB时使用大于4GiB的输出缓冲区与zlib.decompress一起使用时出现的内存消耗和复制性能回归。"

#: ../NEWS:13705
msgid ""
":issue:`43908`: Heap types with the :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE` flag"
" can now inherit the :pep:`590` vectorcall protocol.  Previously, this was "
"only possible for :ref:`static types <static-types>`.  Patch by Erlend E. "
"Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43908`: 带有 :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_IMMUTABLETYPE` 标志的堆类型现在可以继承 "
":pep:`590` 向量调用协议。以前，该特性仅支持 :ref:`static types <static-types>` 。由Erlend E. "
"Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13710
msgid ""
":issue:`44553`: Implement GC methods for ``types.Union`` to break reference "
"cycles and prevent memory leaks."
msgstr ":issue:`44553`: 为 ``types.Union`` 实现 GC 方法以打破引用循环并防止内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:13713
msgid ""
":issue:`44490`: Add ``__parameters__`` attribute and ``__getitem__`` "
"operator to ``types.Union``. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44490`: 向 ``types.Union`` 添加 ``__parameters__`` 属性和 ``__getitem__`` "
"操作符。由 Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13716
msgid ""
":issue:`44523`: Remove the pass-through for :func:`hash` of "
":class:`weakref.proxy` objects to prevent unintended consequences when the "
"original referred object dies while the proxy is part of a hashable object. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44523`: 移除 :func:`hash` 对 :class:`weakref.proxy` "
"对象的透传，以防止当原始引用对象死亡而代理是可哈希对象的一部分时产生意外后果。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13721
msgid ""
":issue:`44483`: Fix a crash in ``types.Union`` objects when creating a union"
" of an object with bad ``__module__`` field."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44483`: 修复在创建具有不良 ``__module__`` 字段的对象的联合时 ``types.Union`` 对象的崩溃问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13724
msgid ""
":issue:`44486`: Modules will always have a dictionary, even when created by "
"``types.ModuleType.__new__()``"
msgstr ":issue:`44486`: 模块即使是通过 ``types.ModuleType.__new__()`` 创建的也将始终拥有一个字典。"

#: ../NEWS:13727
msgid ""
":issue:`44472`: Fix ltrace functionality when exceptions are raised. Patch "
"by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44472`: 修复当异常被抛出时的 ltrace 功能。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13730
msgid ""
":issue:`12022`: A :exc:`TypeError` is now raised instead of an "
":exc:`AttributeError` in :keyword:`with` and :keyword:`async with` "
"statements for objects which do not support the :term:`context manager` or "
":term:`asynchronous context manager` protocols correspondingly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`12022`: 对于不支持 :term:`上下文管理器 <context manager>` 或 异步上下文管理器` 协议的对象，在 "
":keyword:`with` 和 :keyword:`async with` 语句中现在会抛出 :exc:`TypeError` 而不是 "
":exc:`AttributeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:13735
msgid ""
":issue:`44297`: Make sure that the line number is set when entering a "
"comprehension scope. This ensures that backtraces including generator "
"expressions show the correct line number."
msgstr ":issue:`44297`: 确保在进入理解作用域时设置行号。这确保了包括生成器表达式在内的回溯显示正确的行号。"

#: ../NEWS:13739
msgid ""
":issue:`44456`: Improve the syntax error when mixing positional and keyword "
"patterns. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44456`: 改进当混合位置和关键字模式时的语法错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13742
msgid ""
":issue:`44409`: Fix error location information for tokenizer errors raised "
"on initialization of the tokenizer. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44409`: 修复在初始化分词器时抛出的分词器错误的位置信息。补丁由 Pablo Galindo 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:13745
msgid ""
":issue:`44396`: Fix a possible crash in the tokenizer when raising syntax "
"errors for unclosed strings. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44396`: 修复分词器在抛出未闭合字符串的语法错误时可能崩溃的问题。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13748
msgid ""
":issue:`44376`: Exact integer exponentiation (like ``i**2`` or ``pow(i, "
"2)``) with a small exponent is much faster, due to reducing overhead in such"
" cases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44376`: 对于小指数的精确整数指数运算（如 ``i**2`` 或 ``pow(i, "
"2)``），由于减少了此类情况下的开销，运算速度大大提高。"

#: ../NEWS:13752
msgid ""
":issue:`44313`: Directly imported objects and modules (through import and "
"from import statements) don't generate ``LOAD_METHOD``/``CALL_METHOD`` for "
"directly accessed objects on their namespace. They now use the regular "
"``LOAD_ATTR``/``CALL_FUNCTION``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44313`: 直接导入的对象和模块（通过 import 和 from import 语句）不会为它们命名空间上直接访问的对象生成 "
"``LOAD_METHOD``/``CALL_METHOD``。现在它们使用常规的 ``LOAD_ATTR``/``CALL_FUNCTION``。"

#: ../NEWS:13757
msgid ":issue:`44338`: Implement adaptive specialization for LOAD_GLOBAL"
msgstr ":issue:`44338`: 为 LOAD_GLOBAL 实现自适应专业化"

#: ../NEWS:13759
msgid "Two specialized forms of LOAD_GLOBAL are added:"
msgstr "增加了两种 LOAD_GLOBAL 的专业化形式："

#: ../NEWS:13761
msgid "LOAD_GLOBAL_MODULE"
msgstr "LOAD_GLOBAL_MODULE"

#: ../NEWS:13763
msgid "LOAD_GLOBAL_BUILTIN"
msgstr "LOAD_GLOBAL_BUILTIN"

#: ../NEWS:13765
msgid ""
":issue:`44368`: Improve syntax errors for invalid \"as\" targets. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44368`: 改进无效 \"as\" 目标的语法错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:13768
msgid ""
":issue:`44349`: Fix an edge case when displaying text from files with "
"encoding in syntax errors. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44349`: 修复在显示编码文件中的文本时语法错误的一个边缘情况。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13771
msgid ""
":issue:`44337`: Initial implementation of adaptive specialization of "
"LOAD_ATTR"
msgstr ":issue:`44337`: LOAD_ATTR 的自适应专业化的初步实现"

#: ../NEWS:13773
msgid "Four specialized forms of LOAD_ATTR are added:"
msgstr "增加了四种 LOAD_ATTR 的专业化形式："

#: ../NEWS:13775
msgid "LOAD_ATTR_SLOT"
msgstr "LOAD_ATTR_SLOT"

#: ../NEWS:13777
msgid "LOAD_ATTR_SPLIT_KEYS"
msgstr "LOAD_ATTR_SPLIT_KEYS"

#: ../NEWS:13779
msgid "LOAD_ATTR_WITH_HINT"
msgstr "LOAD_ATTR_WITH_HINT"

#: ../NEWS:13781
msgid "LOAD_ATTR_MODULE"
msgstr "LOAD_ATTR_MODULE"

#: ../NEWS:13783
msgid ""
":issue:`44335`: Fix a regression when identifying incorrect characters in "
"syntax errors. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44335`: 修复识别语法错误中不正确字符时的回归问题。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:13786
msgid ""
":issue:`43693`: Computation of the offsets of cell variables is done in the "
"compiler instead of at runtime. This reduces the overhead of handling cell "
"and free variables, especially in the case where a variable is both an "
"argument and cell variable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43693`: "
"单元格变量的偏移量计算在编译器中完成，而不是在运行时。这减少了处理单元格和自由变量的开销，特别是在变量既是参数又是单元格变量的情况下。"

#: ../NEWS:13791
msgid ""
":issue:`44317`: Improve tokenizer error with improved locations. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44317`: 使用改进的位置信息改进分词器错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13794
msgid ""
":issue:`44304`: Fix a crash in the :mod:`sqlite3` module that happened when "
"the garbage collector clears :class:`sqlite.Statement` objects. Patch by "
"Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44304`: 修复 :mod:`sqlite3` 模块中垃圾回收器清除 :class:`sqlite.Statement` "
"对象时发生的崩溃。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:13798
msgid ""
":issue:`44305`: Improve error message for ``try`` blocks without ``except`` "
"or ``finally`` blocks. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44305`: 为没有 ``except`` 或 ``finally`` 块的 ``try`` 块改进错误消息。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13801
msgid ""
":issue:`43413`: Constructors of subclasses of some builtin classes (e.g. "
":class:`tuple`, :class:`list`, :class:`frozenset`) no longer accept "
"arbitrary keyword arguments. [reverted in 3.11a4] Subclass of :class:`set` "
"can now define a ``__new__()`` method with additional keyword parameters "
"without overriding also ``__init__()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43413`: 一些内置类（如 :class:`tuple`, :class:`list`, "
":class:`frozenset`）的子类的构造函数不再接受任意关键字参数。[在 3.11a4 中恢复] :class:`set` "
"的子类现在可以定义一个带有额外关键字参数的 ``__new__()`` 方法，而无需同时覆盖 ``__init__()``。"

#: ../NEWS:13807
msgid ""
":issue:`43667`: Improve Unicode support in non-UTF locales on Oracle "
"Solaris. This issue does not affect other Solaris systems."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43667`: 在 Oracle Solaris 上的非 UTF 语言环境中改进 Unicode 支持。此问题不影响其他 Solaris"
" 系统。"

#: ../NEWS:13810
msgid ""
":issue:`43693`: A new opcode MAKE_CELL has been added that effectively moves"
" some of the work done on function entry into the compiler and into the eval"
" loop.  In addition to creating the required cell objects, the new opcode "
"converts relevant arguments (and other locals) to cell variables on function"
" entry."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43693`: 新增了一个操作码 "
"MAKE_CELL，该操作码有效地将函数入口处完成的部分工作转移到编译器和评估循环中。除了创建所需的单元对象外，新操作码还在函数入口处将相关参数（及其他局部变量）转换为单元变量。"

#: ../NEWS:13816
msgid ""
":issue:`44232`: Fix a regression in :func:`type` when a metaclass raises an "
"exception. The C function :c:func:`type_new` must properly report the "
"exception when a metaclass constructor raises an exception and the winner "
"class is not the metaclass. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44232`: 修复了当元类引发异常时 :func:`type` 的回归问题。C 函数 :c:func:`type_new` "
"必须在元类构造函数引发异常且获胜类不是元类时正确报告异常。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13821
msgid ""
":issue:`44201`: Avoid side effects of checking for specialized syntax errors"
" in the REPL that was causing it to ask for extra tokens after a syntax "
"error had been detected. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44201`: 避免在 REPL 中检查特殊语法错误时的副作用，这些副作用导致在检测到语法错误后要求额外的标记。由 Pablo "
"Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13825
msgid ""
":issue:`43693`: ``PyCodeObject`` gained ``co_fastlocalnames`` and "
"``co_fastlocalkinds`` as the authoritative source of fast locals info. "
"Marshaled code objects have changed accordingly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43693`: ``PyCodeObject`` 增加了 ``co_fastlocalnames`` 和 "
"``co_fastlocalkinds`` 作为快速局部变量信息的权威来源。序列化的代码对象也相应发生了变化。"

#: ../NEWS:13829
msgid ""
":issue:`44184`: Fix a crash at Python exit when a deallocator function "
"removes the last strong reference to a heap type. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44184`: 修复了当解构函数移除堆类型最后一个强引用时 Python 退出的崩溃问题。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13832
msgid ""
":issue:`44187`: Implement quickening in the interpreter. This offers no "
"advantages as yet, but is an enabler of future optimizations. See PEP 659 "
"for full explanation."
msgstr ":issue:`44187`: 在解释器中实现了快速化。目前这没有任何优势，但为未来的优化奠定了基础。完整解释请参见 PEP 659。"

#: ../NEWS:13836
msgid ""
":issue:`44180`: The parser doesn't report generic syntax errors that happen "
"in a position further away that the one it reached in the first pass. Patch "
"by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44180`: 解析器不再报告在首次到达位置更远处发生的通用语法错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13840
msgid ""
":issue:`44168`: Fix error message in the parser involving keyword arguments "
"with invalid expressions. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`44168`: 修复了解析器中涉及带有无效表达式的关键字参数的错误消息。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13843
msgid ""
":issue:`44156`: String caches in ``compile.c`` are now subinterpreter "
"compatible."
msgstr ":issue:`44156`: ``compile.c`` 中的字符串缓存现在与子解释器兼容。"

#: ../NEWS:13846
msgid ""
":issue:`44143`: Fixed a crash in the parser that manifest when raising "
"tokenizer errors when an existing exception was present. Patch by Pablo "
"Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`44143`: 修复了当存在现有异常时引发标记化错误时出现的解析器崩溃问题。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13850
msgid ""
":issue:`44032`: Move 'fast' locals and other variables from the frame object"
" to a per-thread datastack."
msgstr ":issue:`44032`: 将 'fast' 局部变量和其他变量从帧对象移动到每线程的数据栈。"

#: ../NEWS:13853
msgid ""
":issue:`44114`: Fix incorrect dictkeys_reversed and dictitems_reversed "
"function signatures in C code, which broke webassembly builds."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44114`: 修复 C 代码中错误的 dictkeys_reversed 和 dictitems_reversed 函数签名，这破坏了"
" webassembly 构建。"

#: ../NEWS:13856
msgid ":issue:`44110`: Improve :func:`str.__getitem__` error message"
msgstr ":issue:`44110`: 改进 :func:`str.__getitem__` 的错误信息"

#: ../NEWS:13858
msgid ""
":issue:`26110`: Add ``CALL_METHOD_KW`` opcode to speed up method calls with "
"keyword arguments.  Idea originated from PyPy.  A side effect is executing "
"``CALL_METHOD`` is now branchless in the evaluation loop."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26110`: 添加 ``CALL_METHOD_KW`` 操作码以加速带有关键字参数的方法调用。想法源自 "
"PyPy。一个副作用是在评估循环中执行 ``CALL_METHOD`` 现在是无分支的。"

#: ../NEWS:13862
msgid ""
":issue:`28307`: Compiler now optimizes simple C-style formatting with "
"literal format containing only format codes %s, %r and %a by converting them"
" to f-string expressions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28307`: 编译器现在通过将简单的 C 风格格式化转换为 f-string 表达式来优化仅包含格式代码 %s、%r 和 %a "
"的文字格式。"

#: ../NEWS:13866
msgid ""
":issue:`43149`: Correct the syntax error message regarding multiple "
"exception types to not refer to \"exception groups\". Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ":issue:`43149`: 更正关于多种异常类型的语法错误消息，不再提及“异常组”。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:13869
msgid ""
":issue:`43822`: The parser will prioritize tokenizer errors over custom "
"syntax errors when raising exceptions. Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ":issue:`43822`: 当引发异常时，解析器将优先考虑分词器错误而非自定义语法错误。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13872
msgid ":issue:`40222`: \"Zero cost\" exception handling."
msgstr ":issue:`40222`: “零成本”异常处理。"

#: ../NEWS:13874
msgid "Uses a lookup table to determine how to handle exceptions."
msgstr "使用查找表来确定如何处理异常。"

#: ../NEWS:13875
msgid ""
"Removes SETUP_FINALLY and POP_TOP block instructions, eliminating the "
"runtime overhead of try statements."
msgstr "移除 SETUP_FINALLY 和 POP_TOP 块指令，消除了 try 语句的运行时开销。"

#: ../NEWS:13876
msgid "Reduces the size of the frame object by about 60%."
msgstr "将帧对象的大小减少了约 60%。"

#: ../NEWS:13878
msgid "Patch by Mark Shannon"
msgstr "由 Mark Shannon 提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:13880
msgid ""
":issue:`43918`: Document the signature and ``default`` argument in the "
"docstring of the new ``anext`` builtin."
msgstr ":issue:`43918`: 在新的 ``anext`` 内置函数的文档字符串中记录签名和 ``default`` 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:13883
msgid ""
":issue:`43833`: Emit a deprecation warning if the numeric literal is "
"immediately followed by one of keywords: and, else, for, if, in, is, or. "
"Raise a syntax error with more informative message if it is immediately "
"followed by other keyword or identifier."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43833`: "
"如果数字字面量紧跟着关键字之一：and、else、for、if、in、is、or，则发出弃用警告。如果紧跟着其他关键字或标识符，则引发带有更丰富信息的语法错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13888
msgid ""
":issue:`43879`: Add native_thread_id to PyThreadState. Patch by Gabriele N. "
"Tornetta."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43879`: 向 PyThreadState 添加 native_thread_id。由 Gabriele N. Tornetta "
"提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13891
msgid ""
":issue:`43693`: Compute cell offsets relative to locals in compiler. Allows "
"the interpreter to treats locals and cells a single array, which is slightly"
" more efficient. Also make the LOAD_CLOSURE opcode an alias for LOAD_FAST. "
"Preserving LOAD_CLOSURE helps keep bytecode a bit more readable."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43693`: 在编译器中计算相对于局部变量的单元格偏移量。允许解释器将局部变量和单元格视为单个数组，这稍微提高了效率。同时使 "
"LOAD_CLOSURE 操作码成为 LOAD_FAST 的别名。保留 LOAD_CLOSURE 有助于使字节码更具可读性。"

#: ../NEWS:13896
msgid ""
":issue:`17792`: More accurate error messages for access of unbound locals or"
" free vars."
msgstr ":issue:`17792`: 为未绑定的局部变量或自由变量的访问提供更准确的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:13899
msgid ":issue:`28146`: Fix a confusing error message in :func:`str.format`."
msgstr ":issue:`28146`: 修复 :func:`str.format` 中一个令人困惑的错误信息。"

#: ../NEWS:13901
msgid ""
":issue:`11105`: When compiling :class:`ast.AST` objects with recursive "
"references through :func:`compile`, the interpreter doesn't crash anymore "
"instead it raises a :exc:`RecursionError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`11105`: 当通过 :func:`compile` 编译带有递归引用的 :class:`ast.AST` "
"对象时，解释器不再崩溃，而是引发 :exc:`RecursionError`。"

#: ../NEWS:13905
msgid ""
":issue:`39091`: Fix crash when using passing a non-exception to a "
"generator's ``throw()`` method. Patch by Noah Oxer"
msgstr ":issue:`39091`: 修复向生成器的 ``throw()`` 方法传递非异常对象时导致的崩溃。由 Noah Oxer 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13908
msgid ""
":issue:`33346`: Asynchronous comprehensions are now allowed inside "
"comprehensions in asynchronous functions.  Outer comprehensions implicitly "
"become asynchronous."
msgstr ":issue:`33346`: 现在允许在异步函数的推导式中使用异步推导式。外部推导式隐式变为异步。"

#: ../NEWS:13915
msgid ""
":issue:`45371`: Fix clang rpath issue in ``distutils``. The UnixCCompiler "
"now uses correct clang option to add a runtime library directory (rpath) to "
"a shared library."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45371`: 修复 ``distutils`` 中的 clang rpath 问题。UnixCCompiler 现在使用正确的 "
"clang 选项向共享库添加运行时库目录 (rpath)。"

#: ../NEWS:13919
msgid ""
":issue:`45329`: Fix freed memory access in :class:`pyexpat.xmlparser` when "
"building it with an installed expat library <= 2.2.0."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45329`: 修复当使用已安装的 expat 库 <= 2.2.0 构建 :class:`pyexpat.xmlparser` "
"时访问已释放内存的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13922
msgid ""
":issue:`41710`: On Unix, if the ``sem_clockwait()`` function is available in"
" the C library (glibc 2.30 and newer), the :meth:`threading.Lock.acquire` "
"method now uses the monotonic clock (:const:`time.CLOCK_MONOTONIC`) for the "
"timeout, rather than using the system clock (:const:`time.CLOCK_REALTIME`), "
"to not be affected by system clock changes. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41710`: 在 Unix 上，如果 C 库（glibc 2.30 及更新版本）中可用 ``sem_clockwait()`` "
"函数，:meth:`threading.Lock.acquire` 方法现在使用单调时钟 (:const:`time.CLOCK_MONOTONIC`)"
" 来处理超时，而不是使用系统时钟 (:const:`time.CLOCK_REALTIME`)，以避免受系统时钟变化影响。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13929
msgid ""
":issue:`1596321`: Fix the :func:`threading._shutdown` function when the "
":mod:`threading` module was imported first from a thread different than the "
"main thread: no longer log an error at Python exit."
msgstr ""
":issue:`1596321`: 修复当 :mod:`threading` 模块首次从非主线程导入时 "
":func:`threading._shutdown` 函数的问题：在 Python 退出时不再记录错误。"

#: ../NEWS:13933
msgid ""
":issue:`45274`: Fix a race condition in the :meth:`Thread.join() "
"<threading.Thread.join>` method of the :mod:`threading` module. If the "
"function is interrupted by a signal and the signal handler raises an "
"exception, make sure that the thread remains in a consistent state to "
"prevent a deadlock. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45274`: 修复 :mod:`threading` 模块中 :meth:`Thread.join() "
"<threading.Thread.join>` 方法的竞态条件。如果函数被信号中断并且信号处理程序引发异常，确保线程保持在一个一致的状态以防止死锁。由"
" Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13939
msgid ""
":issue:`21302`: In Unix operating systems, :func:`time.sleep` now uses the "
"``nanosleep()`` function, if ``clock_nanosleep()`` is not available but "
"``nanosleep()`` is available. ``nanosleep()`` allows to sleep with "
"nanosecond precision."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21302`: 在 Unix 操作系统中，如果 ``clock_nanosleep()`` 不可用但 ``nanosleep()`` "
"可用，:func:`time.sleep` 现在使用 ``nanosleep()`` 函数。``nanosleep()`` 允许以纳秒精度睡眠。"

#: ../NEWS:13944
msgid ""
":issue:`21302`: On Windows, :func:`time.sleep` now uses a waitable timer "
"which has a resolution of 100 nanoseconds (10\\ :sup:`-7` seconds). "
"Previously, it had a resolution of 1 millisecond (10\\ :sup:`-3` seconds). "
"Patch by Benjamin Szőke and Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21302`: 在Windows上，:func:`time.sleep` 现在使用了一个可等待的计时器，其分辨率为100纳秒（10\\ "
":sup:`-7` 秒）。之前，它的分辨率为1毫秒（10\\ :sup:`-3` 秒）。由Benjamin Szőke和Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:13949
msgid ""
":issue:`45238`: Fix :meth:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase.debug`: it runs "
"now asynchronous methods and callbacks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45238`: 修复 "
":meth:`unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase.debug`：现在可以运行异步方法和回调。"

#: ../NEWS:13952
msgid ""
":issue:`36674`: :meth:`unittest.TestCase.debug` raises now a "
":class:`unittest.SkipTest` if the class or the test method are decorated "
"with the skipping decorator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`36674`: :meth:`unittest.TestCase.debug` 现在如果类或测试方法被跳过装饰器装饰，会引发 "
":class:`unittest.SkipTest`。"

#: ../NEWS:13956
msgid ""
":issue:`45235`: Fix an issue where argparse would not preserve values in a "
"provided namespace when using a subparser with defaults."
msgstr ":issue:`45235`: 修复了一个问题，即当使用带有默认值的子解析器时，argparse不会保留提供的命名空间中的值。"

#: ../NEWS:13959
msgid ""
":issue:`45183`: Have zipimport.zipimporter.find_spec() not raise an "
"exception when the underlying zip file has been deleted and the internal "
"cache has been reset via invalidate_cache()."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45183`: 让 zipimport.zipimporter.find_spec() 在底层的zip文件已被删除且内部缓存已通过 "
"invalidate_cache() 重置时不抛出异常。"

#: ../NEWS:13963
msgid ""
":issue:`45234`: Fixed a regression in :func:`~shutil.copyfile`, "
":func:`~shutil.copy`, :func:`~shutil.copy2` raising :exc:`FileNotFoundError`"
" when source is a directory, which should raise :exc:`IsADirectoryError`"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45234`: 修复了 :func:`~shutil.copyfile`, :func:`~shutil.copy`, "
":func:`~shutil.copy2` 中的一个回归问题，当源是目录时不应抛出 :exc:`FileNotFoundError` 而应抛出 "
":exc:`IsADirectoryError`。"

#: ../NEWS:13968
msgid ""
":issue:`45228`: Fix stack buffer overflow in parsing J1939 network address."
msgstr ":issue:`45228`: 修复解析J1939网络地址时的栈缓冲区溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:13970
msgid ":issue:`45225`: use map function instead of genexpr in capwords."
msgstr ":issue:`45225`: 在capwords中使用map函数代替genexpr。"

#: ../NEWS:13972
msgid ""
":issue:`42135`: Fix typo: ``importlib.find_loader`` is really slated for "
"removal in Python 3.12 not 3.10, like the others in PR 25169."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42135`: 修复拼写错误：``importlib.find_loader`` 实际上计划在Python "
"3.12中移除，而不是3.10，与PR 25169中的其他内容一样。"

#: ../NEWS:13977
msgid ""
":issue:`20524`: Improves error messages on ``.format()`` operation for "
"``str``, ``float``, ``int``, and ``complex``. New format now shows the "
"problematic pattern and the object type."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20524`: 改进了 ``.format()`` 操作对于 ``str``, ``float``, ``int``, 和 "
"``complex`` 的错误消息。新的格式现在显示有问题的模式和对象类型。"

#: ../NEWS:13981
msgid ""
":issue:`45168`: Change :func:`dis.dis` output to omit op arg values that "
"cannot be resolved due to ``co_consts``, ``co_names`` etc not being "
"provided. Previously the oparg itself was repeated in the value field, which"
" is not useful and can be confusing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45168`: 更改 :func:`dis.dis` 输出，以省略由于没有提供 ``co_consts``, ``co_names`` "
"等而无法解析的操作参数值。之前操作参数本身会在值字段中重复，这不仅没有用而且可能会造成混淆。"

#: ../NEWS:13986
msgid ""
":issue:`21302`: In Unix operating systems, :func:`time.sleep` now uses the "
"``clock_nanosleep()`` function, if available, which allows to sleep for an "
"interval specified with nanosecond precision."
msgstr ""
":issue:`21302`: 在Unix操作系统中，:func:`time.sleep` 现在使用 ``clock_nanosleep()`` "
"函数（如果可用），该函数允许以纳秒精度指定的间隔睡眠。"

#: ../NEWS:13990
msgid ""
":issue:`45173`: Remove from the :mod:`configparser` module: the "
":class:`!SafeConfigParser` class, the :attr:`!filename` property of the "
":class:`~configparser.ParsingError` class, the :meth:`!readfp` method of the"
" :class:`~configparser.ConfigParser` class, deprecated since Python 3.2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45173`: 从 :mod:`configparser` 模块中移除：:class:`!SafeConfigParser` "
"类、:class:`~configparser.ParsingError` 类的 :attr:`!filename` "
"属性、:class:`~configparser.ConfigParser` 类的 :meth:`!readfp` 方法，这些自 Python 3.2 "
"起已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:13998
msgid ""
":issue:`44987`: Pure ASCII strings are now normalized in constant time by "
":func:`unicodedata.normalize`. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44987`: 纯 ASCII 字符串现在通过 :func:`unicodedata.normalize` 在常数时间内完成规范化。由 "
"Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14001
msgid ""
":issue:`35474`: Calling :func:`mimetypes.guess_all_extensions` with "
"``strict=False`` no longer affects the result of the following call with "
"``strict=True``. Also, mutating the returned list no longer affects the "
"global state."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35474`: 使用 ``strict=False`` 调用 "
":func:`mimetypes.guess_all_extensions` 不再影响后续使用 ``strict=True`` "
"调用的结果。同时，修改返回的列表不再影响全局状态。"

#: ../NEWS:14006
msgid ""
":issue:`45166`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` now works with "
":data:`~typing.Final` wrapped in :class:`~typing.ForwardRef`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45166`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 现在可以与 :data:`~typing.Final` "
"包裹在 :class:`~typing.ForwardRef` 中的情况一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:14009
msgid ":issue:`45162`: Remove many old deprecated :mod:`unittest` features:"
msgstr ":issue:`45162`: 移除许多旧的已弃用的 :mod:`unittest` 功能："

#: ../NEWS:14011
msgid ""
"\"``fail*``\" and \"``assert*``\" aliases of :class:`~unittest.TestCase` "
"methods."
msgstr ":class:`~unittest.TestCase` 方法的 \"``fail*``\" 和 \"``assert*``\" 别名。"

#: ../NEWS:14012
msgid ""
"Broken from start :class:`~unittest.TestCase` method "
"``assertDictContainsSubset()``."
msgstr ""
"从一开始就损坏的 :class:`~unittest.TestCase` 方法 ``assertDictContainsSubset()``。"

#: ../NEWS:14013
msgid ""
"Ignored :meth:`<unittest.TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule> "
"TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule` parameter *use_load_tests*."
msgstr ""
"被忽略的 :meth:`<unittest.TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule> "
"TestLoader.loadTestsFromModule` 参数 *use_load_tests*。"

#: ../NEWS:14014
msgid "Old alias ``_TextTestResult`` of :class:`~unittest.TextTestResult`."
msgstr ":class:`~unittest.TextTestResult` 的旧别名 ``_TextTestResult``。"

#: ../NEWS:14016
msgid ""
":issue:`38371`: Remove the deprecated ``split()`` method of "
":class:`!_tkinter.TkappType`. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38371`: 移除已弃用的 :class:`!_tkinter.TkappType` 的 ``split()`` 方法。由 "
"Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14019
msgid ""
":issue:`20499`: Improve the speed and accuracy of statistics.pvariance()."
msgstr ":issue:`20499`: 提高 statistics.pvariance() 的速度和准确性。"

#: ../NEWS:14021
msgid ""
":issue:`45132`: Remove :meth:`~object.__getitem__` methods of "
":class:`xml.dom.pulldom.DOMEventStream`, :class:`wsgiref.util.FileWrapper` "
"and :class:`fileinput.FileInput`, deprecated since Python 3.9."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45132`: 移除 "
":class:`xml.dom.pulldom.DOMEventStream`、:class:`wsgiref.util.FileWrapper` 和 "
":class:`fileinput.FileInput` 的 :meth:`~object.__getitem__` 方法，这些自 Python 3.9"
" 起已被弃用。"

#: ../NEWS:14027
msgid ""
":issue:`45129`: Due to significant security concerns, the *reuse_address* "
"parameter of :meth:`asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint`, disabled in "
"Python 3.9, is now entirely removed. This is because of the behavior of the "
"socket option ``SO_REUSEADDR`` in UDP."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45129`: 由于重大的安全隐患，:meth:`asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint` 的 "
"*reuse_address* 参数在 Python 3.9 中被禁用，现在已被完全移除。这是因为 UDP 中 socket 选项 "
"``SO_REUSEADDR`` 的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:14034
msgid ""
":issue:`45124`: The ``bdist_msi`` command, deprecated in Python 3.9, is now "
"removed."
msgstr ":issue:`45124`: 在 Python 3.9 中弃用的 ``bdist_msi`` 命令现已被移除。"

#: ../NEWS:14037
msgid "Use ``bdist_wheel`` (wheel packages) instead."
msgstr "请改用 ``bdist_wheel`` (wheel 包) 。"

#: ../NEWS:14041
msgid ""
":issue:`30856`: :class:`unittest.TestResult` methods "
":meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addFailure`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addError`, :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addSkip` "
"and :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addSubTest` are now called immediately after"
" raising an exception in test or finishing a subtest. Previously they were "
"called only after finishing the test clean up."
msgstr ""
":issue:`30856`: :class:`unittest.TestResult` 的方法 "
":meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addFailure`, "
":meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addError`, :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addSkip` "
"和 :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.addSubTest` "
"现在会在测试中引发异常或完成子测试后立即调用。之前它们仅在完成测试清理后被调用。"

#: ../NEWS:14049
msgid ""
":issue:`45034`: Changes how error is formatted for ``struct.pack`` with "
"``'H'`` and ``'h'`` modes and too large / small numbers. Now it shows the "
"actual numeric limits, while previously it was showing arithmetic "
"expressions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45034`: 修改了 ``struct.pack`` 在 ``'H'`` 和 ``'h'`` "
"模式下对于过大/过小数字的错误格式化方式。现在它会显示实际的数字限制，而之前显示的是算术表达式。"

#: ../NEWS:14053
msgid ""
":issue:`25894`: :mod:`unittest` now always reports skipped and failed "
"subtests separately: separate characters in default mode and separate lines "
"in verbose mode. Also the test description is now output for errors in test "
"method, class and module cleanups."
msgstr ""
":issue:`25894`: :mod:`unittest` "
"现在总是单独报告跳过的和失败的子测试：默认模式下为单独的字符，详细模式下为单独的行。同时，现在在测试方法、类和模块清理的错误中也会输出测试描述。"

#: ../NEWS:14058
msgid ""
":issue:`45081`: Fix issue when dataclasses that inherit from "
"``typing.Protocol`` subclasses have wrong ``__init__``. Patch provided by "
"Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45081`: 修复了继承自 ``typing.Protocol`` 子类的数据类具有错误 ``__init__`` 的问题。由 "
"Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14062
msgid ""
":issue:`45085`: The ``binhex`` module, deprecated in Python 3.9, is now "
"removed. The following :mod:`binascii` functions, deprecated in Python 3.9, "
"are now also removed:"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45085`: 在 Python 3.9 中已弃用的 ``binhex`` 模块现已被移除。以下在 Python 3.9 中已弃用的 "
":mod:`binascii` 函数现在也被移除了："

#: ../NEWS:14066
msgid "``a2b_hqx()``, ``b2a_hqx()``;"
msgstr "``a2b_hqx()``, ``b2a_hqx()``;"

#: ../NEWS:14067
msgid "``rlecode_hqx()``, ``rledecode_hqx()``."
msgstr "``rlecode_hqx()``, ``rledecode_hqx()``."

#: ../NEWS:14069
msgid "The :func:`binascii.crc_hqx` function remains available."
msgstr ":func:`binascii.crc_hqx` 函数仍然可用。"

#: ../NEWS:14073
msgid ""
":issue:`40360`: The :mod:`lib2to3` package is now deprecated and may not be "
"able to parse Python 3.10 or newer. See the :pep:`617` (New PEG parser for "
"CPython). Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:14077
msgid ""
":issue:`45075`: Rename :meth:`traceback.StackSummary.format_frame` to "
":meth:`traceback.StackSummary.format_frame_summary`. This method was added "
"for 3.11 so it was not released yet."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45075`: 将 :meth:`traceback.StackSummary.format_frame` 重命名为 "
":meth:`traceback.StackSummary.format_frame_summary`。此方法是为 3.11 添加的，因此尚未发布。"

#: ../NEWS:14081
msgid "Updated code and docs to better distinguish frame and FrameSummary."
msgstr "更新了代码和文档以更好地区分 frame 和 FrameSummary。"

#: ../NEWS:14083
msgid ""
":issue:`31299`: Add option to completely drop frames from a traceback by "
"returning ``None`` from a :meth:`~traceback.StackSummary.format_frame` "
"override."
msgstr ""
":issue:`31299`: 添加了通过从 :meth:`~traceback.StackSummary.format_frame` 覆盖返回 "
"``None`` 来完全从回溯中删除帧的选项。"

#: ../NEWS:14087
msgid ""
":issue:`41620`: :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.run` now always return a "
":class:`~unittest.TestResult` instance. Previously it returned ``None`` if "
"the test class or method was decorated with a skipping decorator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41620`: :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.run` 现在总是返回一个 "
":class:`~unittest.TestResult` 实例。之前如果测试类或方法使用了跳过装饰器，它会返回 ``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:14091
msgid ""
":issue:`45021`: Fix a potential deadlock at shutdown of forked children when"
" using :mod:`concurrent.futures` module"
msgstr ""
":issue:`45021`: 修复了在使用 :mod:`concurrent.futures` 模块时，fork 的子进程在关闭时可能出现的死锁问题。"

#: ../NEWS:14094
msgid ""
":issue:`43913`: Fix bugs in cleaning up classes and modules in "
":mod:`unittest`:"
msgstr ":issue:`43913`: 修复了在 :mod:`unittest` 中清理类和模块时的错误："

#: ../NEWS:14096
msgid ""
"Functions registered with :func:`~unittest.addModuleCleanup` were not called"
" unless the user defines ``tearDownModule()`` in their test module."
msgstr ""
"使用 :func:`~unittest.addModuleCleanup` 注册的函数不会被调用，除非用户在测试模块中定义了 "
"``tearDownModule()``。"

#: ../NEWS:14097
msgid ""
"Functions registered with :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.addClassCleanup` were "
"not called if ``tearDownClass`` is set to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``tearDownClass`` 设置为 ``None``，使用 "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.addClassCleanup` 注册的函数不会被调用。"

#: ../NEWS:14098
msgid ""
"Buffering in :class:`~unittest.TestResult` did not work with functions "
"registered with ``addClassCleanup()`` and ``addModuleCleanup()``."
msgstr ""
":class:`~unittest.TestResult` 中的缓冲功能对使用 ``addClassCleanup()`` 和 "
"``addModuleCleanup()`` 注册的函数无效。"

#: ../NEWS:14099
msgid ""
"Errors in functions registered with ``addClassCleanup()`` and "
"``addModuleCleanup()`` were not handled correctly in buffered and debug "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"在缓冲和调试模式下，使用 ``addClassCleanup()`` 和 ``addModuleCleanup()`` 注册的函数中的错误未被正确处理。"

#: ../NEWS:14100
msgid ""
"Errors in ``setUpModule()`` and functions registered with "
"``addModuleCleanup()`` were reported in wrong order."
msgstr "``setUpModule()`` 和使用 ``addModuleCleanup()`` 注册的函数中的错误以错误的顺序报告。"

#: ../NEWS:14101
msgid "And several lesser bugs."
msgstr "以及几个较小的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:14103
msgid ""
":issue:`45030`: Fix integer overflow in pickling and copying the range "
"iterator."
msgstr ":issue:`45030`: 修复了在序列化和复制 range 迭代器时的整数溢出问题。"

#: ../NEWS:14106
msgid ""
":issue:`45001`: Made email date parsing more robust against malformed input,"
" namely a whitespace-only ``Date:`` header. Patch by Wouter Bolsterlee."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45001`: 使电子邮件日期解析对格式错误的输入更加健壮，特别是针对仅包含空白的 ``Date:`` 头。由 Wouter "
"Bolsterlee 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14109
msgid ""
":issue:`45010`: Remove support of special method ``__div__`` in "
":mod:`unittest.mock`. It is not used in Python 3."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45010`: 移除了 :mod:`unittest.mock` 中对特殊方法 ``__div__`` 的支持。它在 Python 3 "
"中未使用。"

#: ../NEWS:14112
msgid ""
":issue:`39218`: Improve accuracy of variance calculations by using ``x*x`` "
"instead of ``x**2``."
msgstr ":issue:`39218`: 通过使用 ``x*x`` 而非 ``x**2`` 来提高方差计算的准确性。"

#: ../NEWS:14115
msgid ""
":issue:`43613`: Improve the speed of :func:`gzip.compress` and "
":func:`gzip.decompress` by compressing and decompressing at once in memory "
"instead of in a streamed fashion."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43613`: 通过一次性在内存中压缩和解压缩，而不是流式处理，提高了 :func:`gzip.compress` 和 "
":func:`gzip.decompress` 的速度。"

#: ../NEWS:14119
msgid ""
":issue:`37596`: Ensure that :class:`set` and :class:`frozenset` objects are "
"always :mod:`marshalled <marshal>` reproducibly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37596`: 确保 :class:`set` 和 :class:`frozenset` 对象总是可以重复 "
":mod:`marshalled <marshal>`。"

#: ../NEWS:14122
msgid ""
":issue:`44019`: A new function ``operator.call`` has been added, such that "
"``operator.call(obj, *args, **kwargs) == obj(*args, **kwargs)``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44019`: 新增了一个函数 ``operator.call``，使得 ``operator.call(obj, *args, "
"**kwargs) == obj(*args, **kwargs)``。"

#: ../NEWS:14125
msgid ""
":issue:`42255`: :class:`webbrowser.MacOSX` is deprecated and will be removed"
" in Python 3.13. It is untested and undocumented and also not used by "
"webbrowser itself. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""

#: ../NEWS:14129
msgid ""
":issue:`44955`: Method :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.stopTestRun` is now "
"always called in pair with method :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.startTestRun` "
"for :class:`~unittest.TestResult` objects implicitly created in "
":meth:`~unittest.TestCase.run`. Previously it was not called for test "
"methods and classes decorated with a skipping decorator."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44955`: 对于 :meth:`~unittest.TestCase.run` 中隐式创建的 "
":class:`~unittest.TestResult` 对象，方法 :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.stopTestRun`"
" 现在总是与方法 :meth:`~unittest.TestResult.startTestRun` "
"成对调用。之前，对于使用跳过装饰器装饰的测试方法和类，它不会被调用。"

#: ../NEWS:14135
msgid ""
":issue:`39039`: tarfile.open raises :exc:`~tarfile.ReadError` when a zlib "
"error occurs during file extraction."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39039`: 当文件提取过程中发生 zlib 错误时，tarfile.open 会引发 "
":exc:`~tarfile.ReadError`。"

#: ../NEWS:14138
msgid ""
":issue:`44935`: :mod:`subprocess` on Solaris now also uses "
":func:`os.posix_spawn` for better performance."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44935`: Solaris 上的 :mod:`subprocess` 现在也使用 :func:`os.posix_spawn` "
"以提高性能。"

#: ../NEWS:14141
msgid ""
":issue:`44911`: :class:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` will no longer "
"throw an exception while cancelling leaked tasks. Patch by Bar Harel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44911`: :class:`~unittest.IsolatedAsyncioTestCase` 在取消泄漏任务时将不再抛出异常。由"
" Bar Harel 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14144
msgid ""
":issue:`41322`: Added ``DeprecationWarning`` for tests and async tests that "
"return a value!=None (as this may indicate an improperly written test, for "
"example a test written as a generator function)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41322`: 为返回值!=None 的测试和异步测试添加了 ``DeprecationWarning`` "
"(因为这可能表明测试编写不当，例如将测试编写为生成器函数) 。"

#: ../NEWS:14148
msgid ""
":issue:`44524`: Make exception message more useful when subclass from typing"
" special form alias. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ":issue:`44524`: 当从 typing 特殊形式别名子类化时，使异常消息更有用。由 Yurii Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14151
msgid ""
":issue:`38956`: :class:`argparse.BooleanOptionalAction`'s default value is "
"no longer printed twice when used with "
":class:`argparse.ArgumentDefaultsHelpFormatter`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38956`: 当与 :class:`argparse.ArgumentDefaultsHelpFormatter` "
"一起使用时，:class:`argparse.BooleanOptionalAction` 的默认值不再打印两次。"

#: ../NEWS:14155
msgid ""
":issue:`44860`: Fix the ``posix_user`` scheme in :mod:`sysconfig` to not "
"depend on :data:`sys.platlibdir`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44860`: 修复 :mod:`sysconfig` 中的 ``posix_user`` 方案，使其不依赖于 "
":data:`sys.platlibdir`。"

#: ../NEWS:14158
msgid ""
":issue:`44859`: Improve error handling in :mod:`sqlite3` and raise more "
"accurate exceptions."
msgstr ":issue:`44859`: 改进 :mod:`sqlite3` 中的错误处理，并引发更准确的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:14161
msgid ""
":exc:`MemoryError` is now raised instead of :exc:`sqlite3.Warning` when "
"memory is not enough for encoding a statement to UTF-8 in "
"``Connection.__call__()`` and ``Cursor.execute()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Connection.__call__()`` 和 ``Cursor.execute()`` 中，当内存不足以将语句编码为 UTF-8 "
"时，现在会引发 :exc:`MemoryError` 而不是 :exc:`sqlite3.Warning`。"

#: ../NEWS:14162
msgid ""
":exc:`UnicodEncodeError` is now raised instead of :exc:`sqlite3.Warning` "
"when the statement contains surrogate characters in "
"``Connection.__call__()`` and ``Cursor.execute()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Connection.__call__()`` 和 ``Cursor.execute()`` 中，当语句包含代理字符时，现在会引发 "
":exc:`UnicodEncodeError` 而不是 :exc:`sqlite3.Warning`。"

#: ../NEWS:14163
msgid ""
":exc:`TypeError` is now raised instead of :exc:`ValueError` for non-string "
"script argument in ``Cursor.executescript()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Cursor.executescript()`` 中，对于非字符串脚本参数，现在会引发 :exc:`TypeError` 而不是 "
":exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../NEWS:14164
msgid ""
":exc:`ValueError` is now raised for script containing the null character "
"instead of truncating it in ``Cursor.executescript()``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Cursor.executescript()`` 中，对于包含空字符的脚本，现在会引发 :exc:`ValueError` 而不是截断它。"

#: ../NEWS:14165
msgid ""
"Correctly handle exceptions raised when getting boolean value of the result "
"of the progress handler."
msgstr "正确处理获取进度处理器结果的布尔值时引发的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:14166
msgid "Add many tests covering different corner cases."
msgstr "添加了许多测试，覆盖了不同的边缘情况。"

#: ../NEWS:14168
msgid ":issue:`44581`: Upgrade bundled pip to 21.2.3 and setuptools to 57.4.0"
msgstr ":issue:`44581`: 将捆绑的 pip 升级到 21.2.3 和 setuptools 到 57.4.0。"

#: ../NEWS:14170
msgid ""
":issue:`44849`: Fix the :func:`os.set_inheritable` function on FreeBSD 14 "
"for file descriptor opened with the :const:`~os.O_PATH` flag: ignore the "
":const:`~errno.EBADF` error on ``ioctl()``, fallback on the ``fcntl()`` "
"implementation. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44849`: 修复 FreeBSD 14 上 :func:`os.set_inheritable` 函数对于以 "
":const:`~os.O_PATH` 标志打开的文件描述符的问题：忽略 ``ioctl()`` 上的 :const:`~errno.EBADF` "
"错误，回退到 ``fcntl()`` 实现。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14175
msgid ""
":issue:`44605`: The @functools.total_ordering() decorator now works with "
"metaclasses."
msgstr ":issue:`44605`: @functools.total_ordering() 装饰器现在可以与元类一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:14178
msgid ""
":issue:`44524`: Fixed an issue wherein the ``__name__`` and ``__qualname__``"
" attributes of subscribed specialforms could be ``None``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44524`: 修复了一个问题，其中订阅的特殊形式的 ``__name__`` 和 ``__qualname__`` 属性可能是 "
"``None``。"

#: ../NEWS:14181
msgid ""
":issue:`44839`: :class:`MemoryError` raised in user-defined functions will "
"now produce a ``MemoryError`` in :mod:`sqlite3`. :class:`OverflowError` will"
" now be converted to :class:`~sqlite3.DataError`. Previously "
":class:`~sqlite3.OperationalError` was produced in these cases."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44839`: 在用户定义函数中引发的 :class:`MemoryError` 现在会在 :mod:`sqlite3` 中产生一个 "
"``MemoryError``。:class:`OverflowError` 现在会被转换为 "
":class:`~sqlite3.DataError`。以前在这些情况下会产生 :class:`~sqlite3.OperationalError`。"

#: ../NEWS:14186
msgid ""
":issue:`44822`: :mod:`sqlite3` user-defined functions and aggregators "
"returning :class:`strings <str>` with embedded NUL characters are no longer "
"truncated. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44822`: :mod:`sqlite3` 用户定义的函数和聚合器返回带有嵌入 NUL 字符的 :class:`strings "
"<str>` 不再被截断。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14190
msgid ""
":issue:`44801`: Ensure that the :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` variable in "
"Callable can only be substituted with a parameters expression (a list of "
"types, an ellipsis, ParamSpec or Concatenate)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44801`: 确保 Callable 中的 :class:`~typing.ParamSpec` "
"变量只能被参数表达式（类型列表、省略号、ParamSpec 或 Concatenate）替换。"

#: ../NEWS:14194
msgid ""
":issue:`44806`: Non-protocol subclasses of :class:`typing.Protocol` ignore "
"now the ``__init__`` method inherited from protocol base classes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44806`: :class:`typing.Protocol` 的非协议子类现在会忽略从协议基类继承的 ``__init__`` "
"方法。"

#: ../NEWS:14197
msgid ""
":issue:`27275`: :meth:`collections.OrderedDict.popitem` and "
":meth:`collections.OrderedDict.pop` no longer call ``__getitem__`` and "
"``__delitem__`` methods of the OrderedDict subclasses."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27275`: :meth:`collections.OrderedDict.popitem` 和 "
":meth:`collections.OrderedDict.pop` 不再调用 OrderedDict 子类的 ``__getitem__`` 和 "
"``__delitem__`` 方法。"

#: ../NEWS:14201
msgid ""
":issue:`44793`: Fix checking the number of arguments when subscribe a "
"generic type with ``ParamSpec`` parameter."
msgstr ":issue:`44793`: 修复在订阅带有 ``ParamSpec`` 参数的泛型类型时检查参数数量的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:14204
msgid ""
":issue:`44784`: In importlib.metadata tests, override warnings behavior "
"under expected DeprecationWarnings (importlib_metadata 4.6.3)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44784`: 在 importlib.metadata 测试中，覆盖在预期的 DeprecationWarnings "
"下的警告行为（importlib_metadata 4.6.3）。"

#: ../NEWS:14207
msgid ""
":issue:`44667`: The :func:`tokenize.tokenize` doesn't incorrectly generate a"
" ``NEWLINE`` token if the source doesn't end with a new line character but "
"the last line is a comment, as the function is already generating a ``NL`` "
"token. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44667`: :func:`tokenize.tokenize` 不会在源代码不以换行符结束但最后一行是注释时错误地生成 "
"``NEWLINE`` 令牌，因为该函数已经生成了一个 ``NL`` 令牌。由 Pablo Galindo 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14212
msgid ""
":issue:`44771`: Added ``importlib.simple`` module implementing adapters from"
" a low-level resources reader interface to a ``TraversableResources`` "
"interface. Legacy API (``path``, ``contents``, ...) is now supported "
"entirely by the ``.files()`` API with a compatibility shim supplied for "
"resource loaders without that functionality. Feature parity with "
"``importlib_resources`` 5.2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44771`: 添加了 ``importlib.simple`` 模块，实现了从低级资源读取器接口到 "
"``TraversableResources`` 接口的适配器。旧版 API（``path``、``contents`` 等）现在完全由 "
"``.files()`` API 支持，并为不具备该功能的资源加载器提供了兼容性垫片。与 ``importlib_resources`` 5.2 "
"功能对等。"

#: ../NEWS:14219
msgid ""
":issue:`44752`: :mod:`rcompleter` does not call :func:`getattr` on "
":class:`property` objects to avoid the side-effect of  evaluating the "
"corresponding method."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44752`: :mod:`rcompleter` 不在 :class:`property` 对象上调用 :func:`getattr`"
" 以避免评估相应方法的副作用。"

#: ../NEWS:14223
msgid ""
":issue:`44747`: Refactor usage of ``sys._getframe`` in ``typing`` module. "
"Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44747`: 重构 ``typing`` 模块中 ``sys._getframe`` 的使用。补丁由 Yurii Karabas "
"提供。"

#: ../NEWS:14226
msgid ""
":issue:`42378`: Fixes the issue with log file being overwritten when "
":class:`logging.FileHandler` is used in :mod:`atexit` with *filemode* set to"
" ``'w'``. Note this will cause the message in *atexit* not being logged if "
"the log stream is already closed due to shutdown of logging."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42378`: 修复了当 :class:`logging.FileHandler` 在 :mod:`atexit` 中使用且 "
"*filemode* 设置为 ``'w'`` 时日志文件被覆盖的问题。注意，如果日志流由于日志关闭已经关闭，这将导致 *atexit* "
"中的消息不被记录。"

#: ../NEWS:14231
msgid ""
":issue:`44720`: ``weakref.proxy`` objects referencing non-iterators now "
"raise ``TypeError`` rather than dereferencing the null ``tp_iternext`` slot "
"and crashing."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44720`: ``weakref.proxy`` 对象引用非迭代器现在会引发 ``TypeError``，而不是解引用空的 "
"``tp_iternext`` 槽并崩溃。"

#: ../NEWS:14235
msgid ""
":issue:`44704`: The implementation of ``collections.abc.Set._hash()`` now "
"matches that of ``frozenset.__hash__()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44704`: ``collections.abc.Set._hash()`` 的实现现在与 "
"``frozenset.__hash__()`` 的实现匹配。"

#: ../NEWS:14238
msgid ""
":issue:`44666`: Fixed issue in :func:`compileall.compile_file` when "
"``sys.stdout`` is redirected. Patch by Stefan Hölzl."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44666`: 修复了当 ``sys.stdout`` 被重定向时 :func:`compileall.compile_file` "
"的问题。由 Stefan Hölzl 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14241
msgid ""
":issue:`44688`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_collation` now accepts non-"
"ASCII collation names. Patch by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44688`: :meth:`sqlite3.Connection.create_collation` 现在接受非 ASCII "
"排序名称。补丁由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:14244
msgid ""
":issue:`44690`: Adopt *binacii.a2b_base64*'s strict mode in "
"*base64.b64decode*."
msgstr ":issue:`44690`: 在 *base64.b64decode* 中采用 *binacii.a2b_base64* 的严格模式。"

#: ../NEWS:14246
msgid ""
":issue:`42854`: Fixed a bug in the :mod:`!_ssl` module that was throwing "
":exc:`OverflowError` when using :meth:`!_ssl._SSLSocket.write` and "
":meth:`!_ssl._SSLSocket.read` for a big value of the ``len`` parameter. "
"Patch by Pablo Galindo."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42854`: 修复了 :mod:`!_ssl` 模块中的一个bug，该bug在使用 "
":meth:`!_ssl._SSLSocket.write` 和 :meth:`!_ssl._SSLSocket.read` 时，当 ``len`` "
"参数值较大时会抛出 :exc:`OverflowError`。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14251
msgid ""
":issue:`44686`: Replace ``unittest.mock._importer`` with "
"``pkgutil.resolve_name``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44686`: 使用 ``pkgutil.resolve_name`` 替换 ``unittest.mock._importer``。"

#: ../NEWS:14254
msgid ""
":issue:`44353`: Make ``NewType.__call__`` faster by implementing it in C. "
"Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44353`: 通过在C中实现 ``NewType.__call__`` 来提高其速度。由Yurii Karabas提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14257
msgid ""
":issue:`44682`: Change the :mod:`pdb` *commands* directive to disallow "
"setting commands for an invalid breakpoint and to display an appropriate "
"error."
msgstr ":issue:`44682`: 修改 :mod:`pdb` 的 *commands* 指令，禁止为无效断点设置命令，并显示适当的错误。"

#: ../NEWS:14260
msgid ""
":issue:`44353`: Refactor ``typing.NewType`` from function into callable "
"class. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ":issue:`44353`: 将 ``typing.NewType`` 从函数重构为可调用类。由Yurii Karabas提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14263
msgid ""
":issue:`44678`: Added a separate error message for discontinuous padding in "
"*binascii.a2b_base64* strict mode."
msgstr ":issue:`44678`: 在 *binascii.a2b_base64* 的严格模式下，为不连续的填充添加了单独的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:14266
msgid ""
":issue:`44524`: Add missing ``__name__`` and ``__qualname__`` attributes to "
"``typing`` module classes. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44524`: 为 ``typing`` 模块类添加缺失的 ``__name__`` 和 ``__qualname__`` "
"属性。补丁由Yurii Karabas提供。"

#: ../NEWS:14269
msgid ""
":issue:`40897`: Give priority to using the current class constructor in "
":func:`inspect.signature`. Patch by Weipeng Hong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40897`: 在 :func:`inspect.signature` 中优先使用当前类的构造函数。由Weipeng Hong提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14272
msgid ""
":issue:`44638`: Add a reference to the zipp project and hint as to how to "
"use it."
msgstr ":issue:`44638`: 添加对zipp项目的引用以及如何使用它的提示。"

#: ../NEWS:14275
msgid ""
":issue:`44648`: Fixed wrong error being thrown by :func:`inspect.getsource` "
"when examining a class in the interactive session. Instead of "
":exc:`TypeError`, it should be :exc:`OSError` with appropriate error "
"message."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44648`: 修复了 :func:`inspect.getsource` 在检查交互式会话中的类时抛出的错误。应该是带有适当错误消息的"
" :exc:`OSError`，而不是 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:14280
msgid ""
":issue:`44608`: Fix memory leak in :func:`!_tkinter._flatten` if it is "
"called with a sequence or set, but not list or tuple."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44608`: 修复了 :func:`!_tkinter._flatten` "
"如果被调用时传入的是序列或集合但不是列表或元组时的内存泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:14283
msgid ""
":issue:`44594`: Fix an edge case of :class:`ExitStack` and "
":class:`AsyncExitStack` exception chaining.  They will now match ``with`` "
"block behavior when ``__context__`` is explicitly set to ``None`` when the "
"exception is in flight."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44594`: 修复了 :class:`ExitStack` 和 :class:`AsyncExitStack` "
"异常链的一个边缘情况。当异常在传播过程中 ``__context__`` 被显式设置为 ``None`` 时，它们现在将匹配 ``with`` "
"块的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:14288
msgid ""
":issue:`42799`: In :mod:`fnmatch`, the cache size for compiled regex "
"patterns (:func:`functools.lru_cache`) was bumped up from 256 to 32768, "
"affecting functions: :func:`fnmatch.fnmatch`, :func:`fnmatch.fnmatchcase`, "
":func:`fnmatch.filter`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42799`: 在 :mod:`fnmatch` "
"中，编译的正则表达式模式的缓存大小（:func:`functools.lru_cache`）从 256 增加到 "
"32768，影响的函数包括：:func:`fnmatch.fnmatch`、:func:`fnmatch.fnmatchcase`、:func:`fnmatch.filter`。"

#: ../NEWS:14293
msgid ""
":issue:`41928`: Update :func:`shutil.copyfile` to raise "
":exc:`FileNotFoundError` instead of confusing :exc:`IsADirectoryError` when "
"a path ending with a :const:`os.path.sep` does not exist; "
":func:`shutil.copy` and :func:`shutil.copy2` are also affected."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41928`: 更新 :func:`shutil.copyfile`，当以 :const:`os.path.sep` "
"结尾的路径不存在时，抛出 :exc:`FileNotFoundError` 而不是混淆的 "
":exc:`IsADirectoryError`；:func:`shutil.copy` 和 :func:`shutil.copy2` 也会受到影响。"

#: ../NEWS:14298
msgid ""
":issue:`44569`: Added the :func:`StackSummary.format_frame` function in "
":mod:`traceback`. This allows users to customize the way individual lines "
"are formatted in tracebacks without re-implementing logic to handle "
"recursive tracebacks."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44569`: 在 :mod:`traceback` 中添加了 :func:`StackSummary.format_frame` "
"函数。这使得用户能够自定义回溯中单行的格式化方式，而无需重新实现处理递归回溯的逻辑。"

#: ../NEWS:14303
msgid ""
":issue:`44566`: handle StopIteration subclass raised from "
"@contextlib.contextmanager generator"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44566`: 处理由 @contextlib.contextmanager 生成器引发的 StopIteration 子类。"

#: ../NEWS:14306
msgid ""
":issue:`44558`: Make the implementation consistency of "
":func:`~operator.indexOf` between C and Python versions. Patch by Donghee "
"Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44558`: 使 :func:`~operator.indexOf` 在 C 和 Python 版本中的实现保持一致。由 "
"Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14310
msgid ""
":issue:`41249`: Fixes ``TypedDict`` to work with ``typing.get_type_hints()``"
" and postponed evaluation of annotations across modules."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41249`: 修正 ``TypedDict`` 以使其能与 ``typing.get_type_hints()`` "
"和跨模块的注解延迟求值一起工作。"

#: ../NEWS:14313
msgid ""
":issue:`44554`: Refactor argument processing in :func:`pdb.main` to simplify"
" detection of errors in input loading and clarify behavior around module or "
"script invocation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44554`: 重构 :func:`pdb.main` 中的参数处理，以简化输入加载错误的检测，并澄清模块或脚本调用时的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:14317
msgid ""
":issue:`34798`: Break up paragraph about :class:`pprint.PrettyPrinter` "
"construction parameters to make it easier to read."
msgstr ":issue:`34798`: 拆分关于 :class:`pprint.PrettyPrinter` 构造参数的段落，使其更易于阅读。"

#: ../NEWS:14320
msgid ""
":issue:`44539`: Added support for recognizing JPEG files without JFIF or "
"Exif markers."
msgstr ":issue:`44539`: 添加了对识别没有 JFIF 或 Exif 标记的 JPEG 文件的支持。"

#: ../NEWS:14323
msgid ""
":issue:`44461`: Fix bug with :mod:`pdb`'s handling of import error due to a "
"package which does not have a ``__main__`` module"
msgstr ":issue:`44461`: 修复 :mod:`pdb` 处理由于包没有 ``__main__`` 模块而导致的导入错误的 bug。"

#: ../NEWS:14326
msgid ""
":issue:`43625`: Fix a bug in the detection of CSV file headers by "
":meth:`csv.Sniffer.has_header` and improve documentation of same."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43625`: 修复 :meth:`csv.Sniffer.has_header` 检测 CSV 文件头时的 bug，并改进相关文档。"

#: ../NEWS:14329
msgid ":issue:`44516`: Update vendored pip to 21.1.3"
msgstr ":issue:`44516`: 将捆绑的 pip 更新至 21.1.3 版本。"

#: ../NEWS:14331
msgid ""
":issue:`42892`: Fixed an exception thrown while parsing a malformed "
"multipart email by :class:`email.message.EmailMessage`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42892`: 修复 :class:`email.message.EmailMessage` 在解析格式错误的多部分邮件时抛出的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:14334
msgid ""
":issue:`44468`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` now finds annotations in "
"classes and base classes with unexpected ``__module__``. Previously, it "
"skipped those MRO elements."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44468`: :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 现在可以在类和基类中查找带有意外 "
"``__module__`` 的注解。之前，它会跳过这些MRO元素。"

#: ../NEWS:14338
msgid ""
":issue:`44491`: Allow clearing the :mod:`sqlite3` authorizer callback by "
"passing :const:`None` to :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`. Patch "
"by Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44491`: 允许通过向 :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer` 传递 "
":const:`None` 来清除 :mod:`sqlite3` 授权器回调。由Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14342
msgid ""
":issue:`43977`: Set the proper :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MAPPING` and "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_SEQUENCE` flags for subclasses created before a parent "
"has been registered as a :class:`collections.abc.Mapping` or "
":class:`collections.abc.Sequence`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43977`: 对于在父类被注册为 :class:`collections.abc.Mapping` 或 "
":class:`collections.abc.Sequence` 之前创建的子类，设置正确的 "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MAPPING` 和 :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_SEQUENCE` 标志。"

#: ../NEWS:14347
msgid ""
":issue:`44482`: Fix very unlikely resource leak in :mod:`glob` in alternate "
"Python implementations."
msgstr ":issue:`44482`: 修复在替代Python实现中 :mod:`glob` 极不可能发生的资源泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:14350
msgid ""
":issue:`44466`: The :mod:`faulthandler` module now detects if a fatal error "
"occurs during a garbage collector collection. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44466`: :mod:`faulthandler` 模块现在能检测到在垃圾回收器收集期间是否发生致命错误。由Victor "
"Stinner提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14353
msgid ""
":issue:`44471`: A :exc:`TypeError` is now raised instead of an "
":exc:`AttributeError` in :meth:`contextlib.ExitStack.enter_context` and "
":meth:`contextlib.AsyncExitStack.enter_async_context` for objects which do "
"not support the :term:`context manager` or :term:`asynchronous context "
"manager` protocols correspondingly."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44471`: 在 :meth:`contextlib.ExitStack.enter_context` 和 "
":meth:`contextlib.AsyncExitStack.enter_async_context` 中，对于不支持相应 "
":term:`context manager` 或 :term:`asynchronous context manager` 协议的对象，现在会引发 "
":exc:`TypeError` 而不是 :exc:`AttributeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:14359
msgid ""
":issue:`44404`: :mod:`tkinter`'s ``after()`` method now supports callables "
"without the ``__name__`` attribute."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44404`: :mod:`tkinter` 的 ``after()`` 方法现在支持没有 ``__name__`` 属性的可调用对象。"

#: ../NEWS:14362
msgid ""
":issue:`41546`: Make :mod:`pprint` (like the builtin ``print``) not attempt "
"to write to ``stdout`` when it is ``None``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`41546`: 使 :mod:`pprint` (像内置的 ``print`` 一样) 当 ``stdout`` 为 ``None`` "
"时不尝试写入。"

#: ../NEWS:14365
msgid ""
":issue:`44458`: ``BUFFER_BLOCK_SIZE`` is now declared static, to avoid "
"linking collisions when bz2, lmza or zlib are statically linked."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44458`: ``BUFFER_BLOCK_SIZE`` "
"现在被声明为静态的，以避免在bz2、lmza或zlib被静态链接时发生链接冲突。"

#: ../NEWS:14368
msgid ""
":issue:`44464`: Remove exception for flake8 in deprecated importlib.metadata"
" interfaces. Sync with importlib_metadata 4.6."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44464`: 在弃用的importlib.metadata接口中移除对flake8的异常。与importlib_metadata "
"4.6同步。"

#: ../NEWS:14371
msgid ""
":issue:`44446`: Take into account that ``lineno`` might be ``None`` in "
":class:`traceback.FrameSummary`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44446`: 在 :class:`traceback.FrameSummary` 中考虑 ``lineno`` 可能为 "
"``None`` 的情况。"

#: ../NEWS:14374
msgid ""
":issue:`44439`: Fix in :meth:`bz2.BZ2File.write` / "
":meth:`lzma.LZMAFile.write` methods, when the input data is an object that "
"supports the buffer protocol, the file length may be wrong."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44439`: 修复 :meth:`bz2.BZ2File.write` / :meth:`lzma.LZMAFile.write` "
"方法，当输入数据是支持缓冲协议的对象时，文件长度可能错误的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:14378
msgid ""
":issue:`44434`: _thread.start_new_thread() no longer calls "
"PyThread_exit_thread() explicitly at the thread exit, the call was "
"redundant. On Linux with the glibc, pthread_exit() aborts the whole process "
"if dlopen() fails to open libgcc_s.so file (ex: EMFILE error). Patch by "
"Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44434`: _thread.start_new_thread() 不再在线程退出时显式调用 "
"PyThread_exit_thread()，该调用是多余的。在 Linux 上使用 glibc 时，如果 dlopen() 无法打开 "
"libgcc_s.so 文件（例如：EMFILE 错误），pthread_exit() 会中止整个进程。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14384
msgid ""
":issue:`42972`: The _thread.RLock type now fully implement the GC protocol: "
"add a traverse function and the :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_GC` flag. Patch by"
" Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`42972`: _thread.RLock 类型现在完全实现了 GC 协议：添加了一个遍历函数和 "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_GC` 标志。由 Victor Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14388
msgid ""
":issue:`44422`: The :func:`threading.enumerate` function now uses a "
"reentrant lock to prevent a hang on reentrant call. Patch by Victor Stinner."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44422`: :func:`threading.enumerate` 函数现在使用可重入锁以防止在可重入调用上挂起。由 Victor "
"Stinner 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14391
msgid ""
":issue:`38291`: Importing typing.io or typing.re now prints a "
"``DeprecationWarning``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38291`: 导入 typing.io 或 typing.re 现在会打印一个 ``DeprecationWarning``。"

#: ../NEWS:14394
msgid ""
":issue:`37880`: argparse actions store_const and append_const each receive a"
" default value of ``None`` when the ``const`` kwarg is not provided. "
"Previously, this raised a :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`37880`: 当未提供 ``const`` 关键字参数时，argparse 的 store_const 和 append_const "
"动作各自接收一个默认值 ``None``。之前这会引发一个 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:14398
msgid ":issue:`44389`: Fix deprecation of :data:`ssl.OP_NO_TLSv1_3`"
msgstr ":issue:`44389`: 修复 :data:`ssl.OP_NO_TLSv1_3` 的弃用问题"

#: ../NEWS:14400
msgid ""
":issue:`27827`: :meth:`pathlib.PureWindowsPath.is_reserved` now identifies a"
" greater range of reserved filenames, including those with trailing spaces "
"or colons."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27827`: :meth:`pathlib.PureWindowsPath.is_reserved` "
"现在能识别更多保留文件名，包括那些带有尾部空格或冒号的文件名。"

#: ../NEWS:14404
msgid ""
":issue:`44395`: Fix :meth:`~email.message.MIMEPart.as_string` to pass "
"unixfrom properly. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44395`: 修复 :meth:`~email.message.MIMEPart.as_string` 以正确传递 "
"unixfrom。补丁由 Donghee Na 提供。"

#: ../NEWS:14407
msgid ""
":issue:`34266`: Handle exceptions from parsing the arg of :mod:`pdb`'s "
"run/restart command."
msgstr ":issue:`34266`: 处理解析 :mod:`pdb` 的 run/restart 命令参数时的异常。"

#: ../NEWS:14410
msgid ""
":issue:`44362`: Improve :mod:`ssl` module's deprecation messages, error "
"reporting, and documentation for deprecations."
msgstr ":issue:`44362`: 改进 :mod:`ssl` 模块的弃用消息、错误报告和弃用文档。"

#: ../NEWS:14413
msgid ":issue:`44342`: [Enum] Change pickling from by-value to by-name."
msgstr ":issue:`44342`: [Enum] 将 pickle 从按值改为按名称。"

#: ../NEWS:14415
msgid ""
":issue:`44356`: [Enum] Allow multiple data-type mixins if they are all the "
"same."
msgstr ":issue:`44356`: [Enum] 如果所有数据类型混合都是相同的，则允许多个数据类型混合。"

#: ../NEWS:14418
msgid ""
":issue:`44351`: Restore back :func:`parse_makefile` in "
"``distutils.sysconfig`` because it behaves differently than the similar "
"implementation in :mod:`sysconfig`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44351`: 恢复 ``distutils.sysconfig`` 中的 :func:`parse_makefile`，因为它的行为与"
" :mod:`sysconfig` 中的类似实现不同。"

#: ../NEWS:14422
msgid ""
":issue:`35800`: :class:`!smtpd.MailmanProxy` is now removed as it is "
"unusable without an external module, ``mailman``. Patch by Donghee Na."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35800`: :class:`!smtpd.MailmanProxy` 现在已被移除，因为没有外部模块 ``mailman`` "
"它就无法使用。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14425
msgid ""
":issue:`44357`: Added a function that returns cube root of the given number "
":func:`math.cbrt`"
msgstr ":issue:`44357`: 添加了一个返回给定数字的立方根的函数 :func:`math.cbrt`"

#: ../NEWS:14428
msgid ""
":issue:`44339`: Change ``math.pow(±0.0, -math.inf)`` to return ``inf`` "
"instead of raising ``ValueError``. This brings the special-case handling of "
"``math.pow`` into compliance with the IEEE 754 standard."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44339`: 将 ``math.pow(±0.0, -math.inf)`` 的返回值从抛出 ``ValueError`` 改为返回 "
"``inf``。这使得 ``math.pow`` 的特殊情况处理符合 IEEE 754 标准。"

#: ../NEWS:14432
msgid ""
":issue:`44242`: Remove missing flag check from Enum creation and move into a"
" ``verify`` decorator."
msgstr ":issue:`44242`: 从 Enum 创建中移除缺失标志检查，并将其移至 ``verify`` 装饰器中。"

#: ../NEWS:14435
msgid ""
":issue:`44246`: In ``importlib.metadata``, restore compatibility in the "
"result from ``Distribution.entry_points`` (``EntryPoints``) to honor "
"expectations in older implementations and issuing deprecation warnings for "
"these cases: A. ``EntryPoints`` objects are once again mutable, allowing   "
"for ``sort()`` and other list-based mutation operations.   Avoid deprecation"
" warnings by casting to a   mutable sequence (e.g. "
"``list(dist.entry_points).sort()``). B. ``EntryPoints`` results once again "
"allow   for access by index. To avoid deprecation warnings,   cast the "
"result to a Sequence first   (e.g. ``tuple(dist.entry_points)[0]``)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44246`: 在 ``importlib.metadata`` 中，恢复 ``Distribution.entry_points`` "
"(``EntryPoints``) 结果的兼容性，以符合旧实现的期望，并对以下情况发出弃用警告：A. ``EntryPoints`` 对象再次可变，允许"
" ``sort()`` 和其他基于列表的变异操作。通过转换为可变序列（例如 "
"``list(dist.entry_points).sort()``）避免弃用警告。B. ``EntryPoints`` "
"结果再次允许通过索引访问。为避免弃用警告，首先将结果转换为 Sequence（例如 ``tuple(dist.entry_points)[0]``）。"

#: ../NEWS:14445
msgid ""
":issue:`44246`: In importlib.metadata.entry_points, de-duplication of "
"distributions no longer requires loading the full metadata for "
"PathDistribution objects, improving entry point loading performance by ~10x."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44246`: 在 importlib.metadata.entry_points 中，去重分布不再需要为 "
"PathDistribution 对象加载完整的元数据，将入口点加载性能提高了约10倍。"

#: ../NEWS:14450
msgid ""
":issue:`43858`: Added a function that returns a copy of a dict of logging "
"levels: :func:`logging.getLevelNamesMapping`"
msgstr ""
":issue:`43858`: 添加了一个返回日志级别字典副本的函数：:func:`logging.getLevelNamesMapping`"

#: ../NEWS:14453
msgid ""
":issue:`44260`: The :class:`random.Random` constructor no longer reads "
"system entropy without need."
msgstr ":issue:`44260`: :class:`random.Random` 构造函数不再无谓地读取系统熵。"

#: ../NEWS:14456
msgid ""
":issue:`44254`: On Mac, give turtledemo button text a color that works on "
"both light or dark background.  Programmers cannot control the latter."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44254`: 在 Mac 上，为 turtledemo 按钮文本提供一种在亮或暗背景下都能工作的颜色。程序员无法控制后者。"

#: ../NEWS:14459
msgid ""
":issue:`44258`: Support PEP 515 for Fraction's initialization from string."
msgstr ":issue:`44258`: 支持从字符串初始化 Fraction 的 PEP 515。"

#: ../NEWS:14461
msgid ""
":issue:`44235`: Remove deprecated functions in the :mod:`gettext`. Patch by "
"Donghee Na."
msgstr ":issue:`44235`: 移除 :mod:`gettext` 中已弃用的函数。由 Donghee Na 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14464
msgid ""
":issue:`38693`: Prefer f-strings to ``.format`` in importlib.resources."
msgstr ":issue:`38693`: 在 importlib.resources 中优先使用 f-strings 而非 ``.format``。"

#: ../NEWS:14466
msgid ":issue:`33693`: Importlib.metadata now prefers f-strings to .format."
msgstr ":issue:`33693`: Importlib.metadata 现在优先使用 f-strings 而非 .format。"

#: ../NEWS:14468
msgid ""
":issue:`44241`: Incorporate minor tweaks from importlib_metadata 4.1: "
"SimplePath protocol, support for Metadata 2.2."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44241`: 从 importlib_metadata 4.1 中引入小调整：SimplePath 协议，支持 Metadata "
"2.2。"

#: ../NEWS:14471
msgid ""
":issue:`43216`: Remove the :func:`@asyncio.coroutine <asyncio.coroutine>` "
":term:`decorator` enabling legacy generator-based coroutines to be "
"compatible with async/await code; remove "
":class:`asyncio.coroutines.CoroWrapper` used for wrapping legacy coroutine "
"objects in the debug mode. The decorator has been deprecated since Python "
"3.8 and the removal was initially scheduled for Python 3.10. Patch by Illia "
"Volochii."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43216`: 移除 :func:`@asyncio.coroutine <asyncio.coroutine>` "
":term:`decorator`，该装饰器使得基于生成器的旧式协程能够与async/await代码兼容；移除 "
":class:`asyncio.coroutines.CoroWrapper`，该包装器用于在调试模式下包装旧式协程对象。此装饰器自Python "
"3.8起已被弃用，原计划在Python 3.10中移除。由Illia Volochii提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14479
msgid ":issue:`44210`: Make importlib.metadata._meta.PackageMetadata public."
msgstr ":issue:`44210`: 将importlib.metadata._meta.PackageMetadata公开。"

#: ../NEWS:14481
msgid ""
":issue:`43643`: Declare readers.MultiplexedPath.name as a property per the "
"spec."
msgstr ":issue:`43643`: 根据规范，将readers.MultiplexedPath.name声明为属性。"

#: ../NEWS:14484
msgid ""
":issue:`27334`: The :mod:`sqlite3` context manager now performs a rollback "
"(thus releasing the database lock) if commit failed.  Patch by Luca Citi and"
" Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`27334`: :mod:`sqlite3` 上下文管理器现在在提交失败时执行回滚（从而释放数据库锁）。补丁由Luca "
"Citi和Erlend E. Aasland提供。"

#: ../NEWS:14488
msgid ""
":issue:`4928`: Documented existing behavior on POSIX: NamedTemporaryFiles "
"are not deleted when creating process is killed with SIGKILL"
msgstr ""
":issue:`4928`: 记录了POSIX上的现有行为：当创建进程被SIGKILL杀死时，NamedTemporaryFiles不会被删除。"

#: ../NEWS:14491
msgid ""
":issue:`44154`: Optimize :class:`fractions.Fraction` pickling for large "
"components."
msgstr ":issue:`44154`: 优化 :class:`fractions.Fraction` 对大型组件的pickling操作。"

#: ../NEWS:14494
msgid ""
":issue:`33433`: For IPv4 mapped IPv6 addresses (:rfc:`4291` Section "
"2.5.5.2), the :mod:`ipaddress.IPv6Address.is_private` check is deferred to "
"the mapped IPv4 address. This solves a bug where public mapped IPv4 "
"addresses were considered private by the IPv6 check."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33433`: 对于IPv4映射的IPv6地址（:rfc:`4291` "
"第2.5.5.2节），:mod:`ipaddress.IPv6Address.is_private` "
"检查被推迟到映射的IPv4地址。这解决了一个bug，其中公共映射的IPv4地址被IPv6检查视为私有地址。"

#: ../NEWS:14499
msgid ":issue:`44150`: Add optional *weights* argument to statistics.fmean()."
msgstr ":issue:`44150`: 向statistics.fmean()添加了可选的 *weights* 参数。"

#: ../NEWS:14501
msgid ""
":issue:`44142`: :func:`ast.unparse` will now drop the redundant parentheses "
"when tuples used as assignment targets (e.g in for loops)."
msgstr ":issue:`44142`: :func:`ast.unparse` 现在将在元组用作赋值目标时（例如在for循环中）删除冗余的括号。"

#: ../NEWS:14504
msgid ""
":issue:`44145`: :mod:`hmac` computations were not releasing the GIL while "
"calling the OpenSSL ``HMAC_Update`` C API (a new feature in 3.9).  This "
"unintentionally prevented parallel computation as other :mod:`hashlib` "
"algorithms support."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44145`: :mod:`hmac` 计算在调用OpenSSL ``HMAC_Update`` C "
"API时（3.9中的新功能）没有释放GIL。这无意中阻止了并行计算，而其他 :mod:`hashlib` 算法支持并行计算。"

#: ../NEWS:14509
msgid ""
":issue:`44095`: :class:`zipfile.Path` now supports "
":attr:`zipfile.Path.stem`, :attr:`zipfile.Path.suffixes`, and "
":attr:`zipfile.Path.suffix` attributes."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44095`: :class:`zipfile.Path` 现在支持 "
":attr:`zipfile.Path.stem`、:attr:`zipfile.Path.suffixes` 和 "
":attr:`zipfile.Path.suffix` 属性。"

#: ../NEWS:14512
msgid ""
":issue:`44077`: It's now possible to receive the type of service (ToS), "
"a.k.a. differentiated services (DS), a.k.a. differentiated services code "
"point (DSCP) and explicit congestion notification (ECN) IP header fields "
"with ``socket.IP_RECVTOS``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44077`: 现在可以通过 ``socket.IP_RECVTOS`` "
"接收服务类型（ToS），也称为区分服务（DS），或区分服务代码点（DSCP）和显式拥塞通知（ECN）IP头字段。"

#: ../NEWS:14517
msgid ""
":issue:`37788`: Fix a reference leak when a Thread object is never joined."
msgstr ":issue:`37788`: 修复了一个当 Thread 对象从未被 join 时的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:14519
msgid ""
":issue:`38908`: Subclasses of ``typing.Protocol`` which only have data "
"variables declared will now raise a ``TypeError`` when checked with "
"``isinstance`` unless they are decorated with :func:`runtime_checkable`. "
"Previously, these checks passed silently. Patch provided by Yurii Karabas."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38908`: 只有数据变量声明的 ``typing.Protocol`` 子类现在在被 ``isinstance`` 检查时会抛出 "
"``TypeError``，除非它们被 :func:`runtime_checkable` 装饰。之前，这些检查会静默通过。由 Yurii "
"Karabas 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14524
msgid ""
":issue:`44098`: ``typing.ParamSpec`` will no longer be found in the "
"``__parameters__`` of most :mod:`typing` generics except in valid use "
"locations specified by :pep:`612`. This prevents incorrect usage like "
"``typing.List[P][int]``. This change means incorrect usage which may have "
"passed silently in 3.10 beta 1 and earlier will now error."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44098`: ``typing.ParamSpec`` 将不再出现在大多数 :mod:`typing` 泛型的 "
"``__parameters__`` 中，除非是在 :pep:`612` 指定的有效使用位置。这防止了像 ``typing.List[P][int]``"
" 这样的错误用法。这一变化意味着在 3.10 beta 1 及更早版本中可能静默通过的错误用法现在会报错。"

#: ../NEWS:14530
msgid ""
":issue:`44089`: Allow subclassing ``csv.Error`` in 3.10 (it was allowed in "
"3.9 and earlier but was disallowed in early versions of 3.10)."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44089`: 在 3.10 中允许继承 ``csv.Error``（在 3.9 及更早版本中是被允许的，但在 3.10 "
"的早期版本中被禁止）。"

#: ../NEWS:14533
msgid ""
":issue:`44081`: :func:`ast.unparse` now doesn't use redundant spaces to "
"separate ``lambda`` and the ``:`` if there are no parameters."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44081`: :func:`ast.unparse` 现在如果 ``lambda`` 没有参数，不会使用多余的空格来分隔 "
"``lambda`` 和 ``:``。"

#: ../NEWS:14536
msgid ""
":issue:`44061`: Fix regression in previous release when calling "
":func:`pkgutil.iter_modules` with a list of :class:`pathlib.Path` objects"
msgstr ""
":issue:`44061`: 修复了之前版本中当使用 :class:`pathlib.Path` 对象的列表调用 "
":func:`pkgutil.iter_modules` 时的回归问题。"

#: ../NEWS:14539
msgid ""
":issue:`44059`: Register the SerenityOS Browser in the :mod:`webbrowser` "
"module."
msgstr ":issue:`44059`: 在 :mod:`webbrowser` 模块中注册 SerenityOS 浏览器。"

#: ../NEWS:14542
msgid ""
":issue:`36515`: The :mod:`hashlib` module no longer does unaligned memory "
"accesses when compiled for ARM platforms."
msgstr ":issue:`36515`: 当为 ARM 平台编译时，:mod:`hashlib` 模块不再进行非对齐的内存访问。"

#: ../NEWS:14545
msgid ""
":issue:`40465`: Remove random module features deprecated in Python 3.9."
msgstr ":issue:`40465`: 移除了在 Python 3.9 中废弃的 random 模块特性。"

#: ../NEWS:14547
msgid ":issue:`44018`: random.seed() no longer mutates bytearray inputs."
msgstr ":issue:`44018`: random.seed() 不再改变 bytearray 输入。"

#: ../NEWS:14549
msgid ""
":issue:`38352`: Add ``IO``, ``BinaryIO``, ``TextIO``, ``Match``, and "
"``Pattern`` to ``typing.__all__``. Patch by Jelle Zijlstra."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38352`: 将 ``IO``, ``BinaryIO``, ``TextIO``, ``Match``, 和 ``Pattern``"
" 添加到 ``typing.__all__``。由 Jelle Zijlstra 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14552
msgid ""
":issue:`44002`: :mod:`urllib.parse` now uses :func:`functool.lru_cache` for "
"its internal URL splitting and quoting caches instead of rolling its own "
"like its the '90s."
msgstr ""
":issue:`44002`: :mod:`urllib.parse` 现在使用 :func:`functool.lru_cache` 作为其内部 "
"URL 分割和引用缓存，而不是像 90 年代那样自己实现。"

#: ../NEWS:14556
msgid ""
"The undocumented internal :mod:`urllib.parse` ``Quoted`` class API is now "
"deprecated, for removal in 3.14."
msgstr "未公开的内部模块 :mod:`urllib.parse` 的 ``Quoted`` 类 API 现已弃用，将在 3.14 版本中移除。"

#: ../NEWS:14559
msgid ""
":issue:`43972`: When :class:`http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler` sends a "
"``301 (Moved Permanently)`` for a directory path not ending with ``/``, add "
"a ``Content-Length: 0`` header. This improves the behavior for certain "
"clients."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43972`: 当 :class:`http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler` 为不以 ``/`` "
"结尾的目录路径发送 ``301 (Moved Permanently)`` 时，添加 ``Content-Length: 0`` "
"头部。这改善了某些客户端的行为。"

#: ../NEWS:14564
msgid ""
":issue:`28528`: Fix a bug in :mod:`pdb` where :meth:`~pdb.Pdb.checkline` "
"raises :exc:`AttributeError` if it is called after :meth:`~pdb.Pdb.reset`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`28528`: 修复 :mod:`pdb` 中的一个错误，其中 :meth:`~pdb.Pdb.checkline` 如果在 "
":meth:`~pdb.Pdb.reset` 之后调用会引发 :exc:`AttributeError`。"

#: ../NEWS:14567
msgid ""
":issue:`43853`: Improved string handling for :mod:`sqlite3` user-defined "
"functions and aggregates:"
msgstr ":issue:`43853`: 改进了 :mod:`sqlite3` 用户定义函数和聚合函数的字符串处理："

#: ../NEWS:14570
msgid ""
"It is now possible to pass strings with embedded null characters to UDFs"
msgstr "现在可以将含有嵌入空字符的字符串传递给 UDFs"

#: ../NEWS:14571
msgid "Conversion failures now correctly raise :exc:`MemoryError`"
msgstr "转换失败现在会正确引发 :exc:`MemoryError`"

#: ../NEWS:14575
msgid ""
":issue:`43666`: AIX: ``Lib/_aix_support.get_platform()`` may fail in an AIX "
"WPAR. The fileset bos.rte appears to have a builddate in both LPAR and WPAR "
"so this fileset is queried rather than bos.mp64. To prevent a similar "
"situation (no builddate in ODM) a value (9988) sufficient for completing a "
"build is provided. Patch by M Felt."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43666`: AIX: ``Lib/_aix_support.get_platform()`` 在 AIX WPAR "
"中可能会失败。文件集 bos.rte 似乎在 LPAR 和 WPAR 中都有 builddate，因此查询此文件集而不是 "
"bos.mp64。为了防止类似情况（ODM 中没有 builddate），提供了一个足够完成构建的值（9988）。由 M Felt 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14581
msgid ""
":issue:`43650`: Fix :exc:`MemoryError` in :func:`shutil.unpack_archive` "
"which fails inside :func:`shutil._unpack_zipfile` on large files. Patch by "
"Igor Bolshakov."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43650`: 修复 :func:`shutil.unpack_archive` 中的 :exc:`MemoryError`，该错误在 "
":func:`shutil._unpack_zipfile` 处理大文件时发生。由 Igor Bolshakov 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14585
msgid ""
":issue:`43612`: :func:`zlib.compress` now accepts a wbits parameter which "
"allows users to compress data as a raw deflate block without zlib headers "
"and trailers in one go. Previously this required instantiating a "
"``zlib.compressobj``. It also provides a faster alternative to "
"``gzip.compress`` when wbits=31 is used."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43612`: :func:`zlib.compress` 现在接受一个 wbits 参数，允许用户在不带 zlib 头部和尾部的原始 "
"deflate 块中一次性压缩数据。以前这需要实例化一个 ``zlib.compressobj``。当 wbits=31 时，它还提供了一种比 "
"``gzip.compress`` 更快的替代方案。"

#: ../NEWS:14591
msgid ""
":issue:`43392`: :func:`importlib._bootstrap._find_and_load` now implements a"
" two-step check to avoid locking when modules have been already imported and"
" are ready. This improves performance of repeated calls to "
":func:`importlib.import_module` and :func:`importlib.__import__`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43392`: :func:`importlib._bootstrap._find_and_load` "
"现在实现了一个两步检查，以避免在模块已经导入并准备就绪时锁定。这提高了重复调用 :func:`importlib.import_module` 和 "
":func:`importlib.__import__` 的性能。"

#: ../NEWS:14596
msgid ""
":issue:`43318`: Fix a bug where :mod:`pdb` does not always echo cleared "
"breakpoints."
msgstr ":issue:`43318`: 修复了一个错误，其中 :mod:`pdb` 并不总是回显清除的断点。"

#: ../NEWS:14599
msgid ""
":issue:`43234`: Prohibit passing "
"non-:class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor` executors to "
":meth:`loop.set_default_executor` following a deprecation in Python 3.8. "
"Patch by Illia Volochii."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43234`: 在Python 3.8中弃用后，禁止将非 "
":class:`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor` 执行器传递给 "
":meth:`loop.set_default_executor`。由Illia Volochii提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14604
msgid ""
":issue:`43232`: Prohibit previously deprecated potentially disruptive "
"operations on :class:`asyncio.trsock.TransportSocket`. Patch by Illia "
"Volochii."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43232`: 禁止对 :class:`asyncio.trsock.TransportSocket` "
"进行之前已弃用的可能破坏性操作。由Illia Volochii提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:14608
msgid ":issue:`30077`: Added support for Apple's aifc/sowt pseudo-compression"
msgstr ":issue:`30077`: 添加了对苹果aifc/sowt伪压缩的支持"

#: ../NEWS:14610
msgid ""
":issue:`42971`: Add definition of ``errno.EQFULL`` for platforms that define"
" this constant (such as macOS)."
msgstr ":issue:`42971`: 为定义了此常量（如macOS）的平台添加了 ``errno.EQFULL`` 的定义。"

#: ../NEWS:14613
msgid ""
":issue:`43086`: Added a new optional :code:`strict_mode` parameter to "
"*binascii.a2b_base64*. When :code:`scrict_mode` is set to :code:`True`, the "
"*a2b_base64* function will accept only valid base64 content. More details "
"about what \"valid base64 content\" is, can be found in the function's "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43086`: 为 *binascii.a2b_base64* 添加了一个新的可选参数 :code:`strict_mode`。当 "
":code:`scrict_mode` 设置为 :code:`True` 时，*a2b_base64* "
"函数将只接受有效的base64内容。关于什么是\"有效的base64内容\"的更多细节，可以在函数的文档中找到。"

#: ../NEWS:14619
msgid ""
":issue:`43024`: Improve the help signature of "
":func:`traceback.print_exception`, :func:`traceback.format_exception` and "
":func:`traceback.format_exception_only`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`43024`: 改进了 "
":func:`traceback.print_exception`、:func:`traceback.format_exception` 和 "
":func:`traceback.format_exception_only` 的帮助签名。"

#: ../NEWS:14623
