msgstr ":issue:`42686`: 启用数学函数构建 :mod:`sqlite3` 模块。由 Erlend E. Aasland 提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15052
msgid ""
":issue:`40263`: This is a follow-on bug from "
"https://bugs.python.org/issue26903. Once that is applied we run into an off-"
