"update_idletask 调用应该是无害的，可能在其他情况下也有帮助。"

#: ../NEWS:15094
msgid ""
":issue:`33962`: Move the indent space setting from the Font tab to the new "
"Windows tab. Patch by Mark Roseman and Terry Jan Reedy."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33962`: 将缩进空格设置从字体选项卡移至新的Windows选项卡。由Mark Roseman和Terry Jan "
"Reedy提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:15097
msgid ""
":issue:`40468`: Split the settings dialog General tab into Windows and "
"Shell/ED tabs. Move help sources, which extend the Help menu, to the "
"Extensions tab. Make space for new options and shorten the dialog. The "
"latter makes the dialog better fit small screens."
