msgstr ""
":issue:`43764`: 修复了某些 :mod:`dataclasses` 中 :data:`~object.__match_args__` "
"生成可能失败的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:15653
msgid ""
":issue:`43752`: Fix :mod:`sqlite3` regression for zero-sized blobs with "
