"source file encoding."
msgstr ":issue:`41058`: :func:`pdb.find_function` 现在能正确确定源文件的编码。"

#: ../NEWS:18764
msgid ""
":issue:`41056`: Invalid file descriptor values are now prevented from being "
"passed to os.fpathconf. (discovered by Coverity)"
msgstr ":issue:`41056`: 现在阻止将无效的文件描述符值传递给os.fpathconf。(由Coverity发现)"

#: ../NEWS:18767
msgid ""
":issue:`41056`: Fix a NULL pointer dereference within the ssl module during "
