msgstr ""
":issue:`41056`: 修复了ssl模块中在keylog回调中发生MemoryError时的NULL指针解引用问题。(由Coverity发现)"

#: ../NEWS:18770
msgid ""
":issue:`41056`: Fixed an instance where a MemoryError within the zoneinfo "
"module might not be reported or not reported at its source. (found by "
"Coverity)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`41056`: 修复了zoneinfo模块中MemoryError可能未被报告或未在其源头报告的情况。(由Coverity发现)"

#: ../NEWS:18774
msgid ""
":issue:`41048`: :func:`mimetypes.read_mime_types` function reads the rule "
