#: ../NEWS:18778
msgid ""
":issue:`41043`: Fixed the use of :func:`~glob.glob` in the stdlib: literal "
"part of the path is now always correctly escaped."
msgstr ":issue:`41043`: 修复了stdlib中 :func:`~glob.glob` 的使用：路径的字面部分现在总是被正确转义。"

#: ../NEWS:18781
msgid ""
":issue:`41025`: Fixed an issue preventing the C implementation of "
