msgstr ":issue:`41025`: 修复了阻止 :class:`zoneinfo.ZoneInfo` 的C实现被子类化的问题。"

#: ../NEWS:18784
msgid ""
":issue:`35018`: Add the :class:`xml.sax.handler.LexicalHandler` class that "
