msgstr ":issue:`41002`: 提高了HTTPResponse.read在给定数量下的性能。由Bruce Merry提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:18790
msgid ""
":issue:`40448`: :mod:`ensurepip` now disables the use of ``pip`` cache when "
