#: ../NEWS:18794
msgid ""
":issue:`40967`: Removed :meth:`!asyncio.Task.current_task` and "
":meth:`!asyncio.Task.all_tasks`. Patch contributed by Rémi Lapeyre."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40967`: 移除了 :meth:`!asyncio.Task.current_task` 和 "
":meth:`!asyncio.Task.all_tasks`。补丁由Rémi Lapeyre贡献。"

#: ../NEWS:18797
msgid ""
":issue:`40924`: Ensure ``importlib.resources.path`` returns an extant path "
"for the SourceFileLoader's resource reader. Avoids the regression identified"
" in master while a long-term solution is devised."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40924`: 确保 ``importlib.resources.path`` "
"为SourceFileLoader的资源阅读器返回一个存在的路径。在制定长期解决方案的同时避免了在主分支中发现的回归。"

#: ../NEWS:18801
msgid ""
":issue:`40955`: Fix a minor memory leak in :mod:`subprocess` module when "
"extra_groups was specified."
msgstr ":issue:`40955`: 修复了 :mod:`subprocess` 模块中在指定extra_groups时的一个小内存泄漏。"

#: ../NEWS:18804
msgid ""
":issue:`40855`: The standard deviation and variance functions in the "
"statistics module were ignoring their mu and xbar arguments."
msgstr ":issue:`40855`: statistics模块中的标准差和方差函数忽略了它们的mu和xbar参数。"

#: ../NEWS:18807
msgid ""
":issue:`40939`: Use the new PEG parser when generating the stdlib "
":mod:`keyword` module."
msgstr ":issue:`40939`: 在生成标准库 :mod:`keyword` 模块时使用新的PEG解析器。"

#: ../NEWS:18810
msgid ""
":issue:`23427`: Add :data:`sys.orig_argv` attribute: the list of the "
"original command line arguments passed to the Python executable."
msgstr ":issue:`23427`: 添加 :data:`sys.orig_argv` 属性：传递给Python可执行文件的原始命令行参数列表。"

#: ../NEWS:18813
msgid ""
":issue:`33689`: Ignore empty or whitespace-only lines in .pth files. This "
"matches the documentated behavior. Before, empty lines caused the site-"
"packages dir to appear multiple times in sys.path. By Ido Michael, "
"contributors Malcolm Smith and Tal Einat."
msgstr ""
":issue:`33689`: 忽略.pth文件中的空行或仅包含空白的行。这与文档中描述的行为相匹配。在此之前，空行会导致site-"
"packages目录在sys.path中多次出现。由Ido Michael贡献，贡献者包括Malcolm Smith和Tal Einat。"

#: ../NEWS:18818
msgid ""
":issue:`40884`: Added a ``defaults`` parameter to "
":class:`logging.Formatter`, to allow specifying default values for custom "
"fields. Patch by Asaf Alon and Bar Harel."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40884`: 向 :class:`logging.Formatter` 添加了一个 ``defaults`` "
"参数，允许为自定义字段指定默认值。由Asaf Alon和Bar Harel提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:18822
msgid ":issue:`40876`: Clarify error message in the :mod:`csv` module."
msgstr ":issue:`40876`: 澄清 :mod:`csv` 模块中的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:18824
msgid ""
":issue:`39791`: Refresh importlib.metadata from importlib_metadata 1.6.1."
msgstr ":issue:`39791`: 从importlib_metadata 1.6.1刷新importlib.metadata。"

#: ../NEWS:18826
msgid ""
":issue:`40807`: Stop codeop._maybe_compile, used by "
