"times."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40807`: "
"停止codeop._maybe_compile（由code.InteractiveInterpreter（和IDLE）使用）每次发出三次警告。"

#: ../NEWS:18829
msgid ""
":issue:`32604`: Fix reference leak in the :mod:`select` module when the "
