msgstr ":issue:`32604`: 修复 :mod:`select` 模块在子解释器中导入时的引用泄漏问题。"

#: ../NEWS:18832
msgid ""
":issue:`39791`: Built-in loaders (SourceFileLoader and ZipImporter) now "
