":mod:`graphlib` module to better accommodate the new tools and keep the "
"original scope of the :mod:`functools` module. Patch by Pablo Galindo"
msgstr ""
":issue:`17005`: 最初在 :mod:`functools` 模块中引入的拓扑排序功能已被移动到一个新的 :mod:`graphlib` "
"模块，以更好地适应新工具并保持 :mod:`functools` 模块的原始范围。由Pablo Galindo提供补丁"

#: ../NEWS:18845
msgid ""
":issue:`40834`: Fix truncate when sending str object "
"with_xxsubinterpreters.channel_send."
msgstr ":issue:`40834`: 修复在发送str对象时使用_xxsubinterpreters.channel_send的截断问题。"

#: ../NEWS:18848
msgid ":issue:`40755`: Add rich comparisons to collections.Counter()."
msgstr ":issue:`40755`: 向collections.Counter()添加富比较方法。"

#: ../NEWS:18850
msgid ""
":issue:`26407`: Unexpected errors in calling the ``__iter__`` method are no "
"longer masked by ``TypeError`` in :func:`csv.reader`, "
":func:`csv.writer.writerow` and :meth:`csv.writer.writerows`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`26407`: 在 :func:`csv.reader`, :func:`csv.writer.writerow` 和 "
":meth:`csv.writer.writerows` 中调用 ``__iter__`` 方法时不再因 ``TypeError`` 掩盖意外错误。"

#: ../NEWS:18854
msgid ""
":issue:`39384`: Fixed email.contentmanager to allow set_content() to set a "
"null string."
msgstr ":issue:`39384`: 修复了email.contentmanager，允许set_content()设置空字符串。"

#: ../NEWS:18857
msgid ""
":issue:`40744`: The :mod:`sqlite3` module uses SQLite API functions that "
"require SQLite v3.7.3 or higher.  This patch removes support for older "
"SQLite versions, and explicitly requires SQLite 3.7.3 both at build, compile"
" and runtime.  Patch by Sergey Fedoseev and Erlend E. Aasland."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40744`: :mod:`sqlite3` 模块使用了需要SQLite v3.7.3或更高版本的SQLite "
"API函数。此补丁移除了对旧版本SQLite的支持，并在构建、编译和运行时明确要求SQLite 3.7.3。由Sergey "
"Fedoseev和Erlend E. Aasland提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:18862
msgid ""
":issue:`40777`: Initialize PyDateTime_IsoCalendarDateType.tp_base at run-"
"time to avoid errors on some compilers."
msgstr ""
":issue:`40777`: "
"在运行时初始化PyDateTime_IsoCalendarDateType.tp_base，以避免在某些编译器上出现错误。"

#: ../NEWS:18865
msgid ""
":issue:`38488`: Update ensurepip to install pip 20.1.1 and setuptools "
"47.1.0."
msgstr ":issue:`38488`: 更新ensurepip以安装pip 20.1.1和setuptools 47.1.0。"

#: ../NEWS:18867
msgid ""
