#: ../NEWS:18893
msgid ""
":issue:`40756`: The second argument (extra) of ``LoggerAdapter.__init__`` "
"now defaults to None."
msgstr ":issue:`40756`: ``LoggerAdapter.__init__`` 的第二个参数(extra)现在默认为None。"

#: ../NEWS:18896
msgid ""
":issue:`37129`: Add a new :const:`os.RWF_APPEND` flag for "
