"失败，则跳过test_zipfile.test_add_file_after_2107()。例如在AIX 6.1上就是这种情况。"

#: ../NEWS:20917
msgid ":issue:`39489`: Remove ``COUNT_ALLOCS`` special build."
msgstr ":issue:`39489`: 移除 ``COUNT_ALLOCS`` 特殊构建。"

#: ../NEWS:20922
msgid ":issue:`39553`: Delete unused code related to SxS manifests."
msgstr ":issue:`39553`: 删除与SxS清单相关的未使用代码。"

#: ../NEWS:20924
msgid ""
":issue:`39439`: Honor the Python path when a virtualenv is active on "
"Windows."
msgstr ":issue:`39439`: 在Windows上激活virtualenv时，尊重Python路径。"

#: ../NEWS:20926
msgid ""
":issue:`39393`: Improve the error message when attempting to load a DLL with"
" unresolved dependencies."
msgstr ":issue:`39393`: 改进尝试加载具有未解决依赖项的DLL时的错误消息。"

#: ../NEWS:20929
msgid ""
":issue:`38883`: :meth:`~pathlib.Path.home` and "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.expanduser` on Windows now prefer :envvar:`USERPROFILE`"
" and no longer use :envvar:`HOME`, which is not normally set for regular "
"user accounts. This makes them again behave like :func:`os.path.expanduser`,"
" which was changed to ignore :envvar:`HOME` in 3.8, see :issue:`36264`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38883`: :meth:`~pathlib.Path.home` 和 "
":meth:`~pathlib.Path.expanduser` 在Windows上现在更倾向于使用 "
":envvar:`USERPROFILE`，不再使用 :envvar:`HOME`，因为普通用户账户通常不设置后者。这使得它们再次表现得像 "
":func:`os.path.expanduser`，后者在3.8版本中被改为忽略 :envvar:`HOME`，参见 :issue:`36264`。"

#: ../NEWS:20935
msgid ""
":issue:`39185`: The build.bat script has additional options for very-quiet "
"output (-q) and very-verbose output (-vv)"
msgstr ":issue:`39185`: build.bat脚本新增了非常安静的输出选项(-q)和非常详细的输出选项(-vv)。"

#: ../NEWS:20941
msgid ":issue:`39663`: Add tests for pyparse find_good_parse_start()."
msgstr ":issue:`39663`: 为pyparse的find_good_parse_start()添加测试。"

#: ../NEWS:20943
msgid ""
":issue:`39600`: In the font configuration window, remove duplicated font "
"names."
msgstr ":issue:`39600`: 在字体配置窗口中，移除重复的字体名称。"

#: ../NEWS:20945
msgid ""
":issue:`30780`: Add remaining configdialog tests for buttons and highlights "
"and keys tabs."
msgstr ":issue:`30780`: 为按钮、高亮和键标签页添加剩余的配置对话框测试。"

#: ../NEWS:20948
msgid ""
":issue:`39388`: IDLE Settings Cancel button now cancels pending changes"
msgstr ":issue:`39388`: IDLE设置的取消按钮现在会取消待处理的更改。"

#: ../NEWS:20950
msgid ""
":issue:`38792`: Close an IDLE shell calltip if a :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt` or"
" shell restart occurs.  Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38792`: 如果发生 :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt` 或shell重启，关闭IDLE "
"shell的调用提示。由Zackery Spytz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:20956
msgid ""
":issue:`35081`: Move the ``bytes_methods.h`` header file to the internal C "
"API as ``pycore_bytes_methods.h``: it only contains private symbols "
"(prefixed by ``_Py``), except of the ``PyDoc_STRVAR_shared()`` macro."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35081`: 将 ``bytes_methods.h`` 头文件移动到内部C API中，更名为 "
"``pycore_bytes_methods.h``：它仅包含私有符号（前缀为 ``_Py``），除了 "
"``PyDoc_STRVAR_shared()`` 宏。"

#: ../NEWS:20960
msgid ""
":issue:`35081`: Move the ``dtoa.h`` header file to the internal C API as "
"``pycore_dtoa.h``: it only contains private functions (prefixed by ``_Py``)."
" The :mod:`math` and :mod:`cmath` modules must now be compiled with the "
"``Py_BUILD_CORE`` macro defined."
msgstr ""
":issue:`35081`: 将 ``dtoa.h`` 头文件移动到内部C API中，更名为 "
"``pycore_dtoa.h``：它仅包含私有函数（前缀为 ``_Py``）。现在编译 :mod:`math` 和 :mod:`cmath` "
"模块时必须定义 ``Py_BUILD_CORE`` 宏。"

#: ../NEWS:20965
msgid ""
":issue:`39573`: Add :c:func:`Py_SET_SIZE` function to set the size of an "
"object."
msgstr ":issue:`39573`: 添加 :c:func:`Py_SET_SIZE` 函数以设置对象的大小。"

#: ../NEWS:20968
msgid ""
":issue:`39500`: :c:func:`PyUnicode_IsIdentifier` does not call "
":c:func:`Py_FatalError` anymore if the string is not ready."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39500`: :c:func:`PyUnicode_IsIdentifier` 不再在字符串未准备好时调用 "
":c:func:`Py_FatalError`。"

#: ../NEWS:20971
msgid ""
":issue:`39573`: Add :c:func:`Py_SET_TYPE` function to set the type of an "
"object."
msgstr ":issue:`39573`: 添加 :c:func:`Py_SET_TYPE` 函数以设置对象的类型。"

#: ../NEWS:20974
msgid ""
":issue:`39573`: Add a :c:func:`Py_SET_REFCNT` function to set the reference "
"counter of an object."
msgstr ":issue:`39573`: 添加 :c:func:`Py_SET_REFCNT` 函数以设置对象的引用计数器。"

#: ../NEWS:20977
msgid ""
":issue:`39542`: Convert :c:func:`PyType_HasFeature`, :c:func:`PyType_Check` "
"and :c:func:`PyType_CheckExact` macros to static inline functions."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39542`: 将 :c:func:`PyType_HasFeature`、:c:func:`PyType_Check` 和 "
":c:func:`PyType_CheckExact` 宏转换为静态内联函数。"

#: ../NEWS:20980
msgid ""
":issue:`39542`: In the limited C API, ``PyObject_INIT()`` and "
"``PyObject_INIT_VAR()`` are now defined as aliases to "
":c:func:`PyObject_Init` and :c:func:`PyObject_InitVar` to make their "
"implementation opaque. It avoids to leak implementation details in the "
"limited C API. Exclude the following functions from the limited C API: "
"``_Py_NewReference()``, ``_Py_ForgetReference()``, "
"``_PyTraceMalloc_NewReference()`` and ``_Py_GetRefTotal()``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39542`: 在受限 C API 中，``PyObject_INIT()`` 和 ``PyObject_INIT_VAR()`` "
"现在被定义为 :c:func:`PyObject_Init` 和 :c:func:`PyObject_InitVar` "
"的别名，以使它们的实现变得不透明。这避免了在受限 C API 中泄露实现细节。将以下函数从受限 C API "
"中排除：``_Py_NewReference()``、``_Py_ForgetReference()``、``_PyTraceMalloc_NewReference()``"
" 和 ``_Py_GetRefTotal()``。"

#: ../NEWS:20988
msgid ""
":issue:`39542`: Exclude trashcan mechanism from the limited C API: it "
"requires access to PyTypeObject and PyThreadState structure fields, whereas "
"these structures are opaque in the limited C API."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39542`: 将垃圾回收机制从受限 C API 中排除：它需要访问 PyTypeObject 和 PyThreadState "
"结构体字段，而这些结构在受限 C API 中是不透明的。"

#: ../NEWS:20992
msgid ""
":issue:`39511`: The :c:func:`PyThreadState_Clear` function now calls the "
":c:member:`PyThreadState.on_delete` callback. Previously, that happened in "
":c:func:`PyThreadState_Delete`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39511`: :c:func:`PyThreadState_Clear` 函数现在会调用 "
":c:member:`PyThreadState.on_delete` 回调。在此之前，这是在 "
":c:func:`PyThreadState_Delete` 中进行的。"

#: ../NEWS:20996
msgid ""
":issue:`38076`: Fix to clear the interpreter state only after clearing "
"module globals to guarantee module state access from C Extensions during "
"runtime destruction"
msgstr ":issue:`38076`: 修复了仅在清除模块全局变量后清除解释器状态的问题，以保证在运行时销毁期间从 C 扩展访问模块状态。"

#: ../NEWS:21000
msgid ""
":issue:`39245`: The Vectorcall API (PEP 590) was made public, adding the "
"functions ``PyObject_Vectorcall``, ``PyObject_VectorcallMethod``, "
"``PyVectorcall_Function``, ``PyObject_CallOneArg``, "
"``PyObject_CallMethodNoArgs``, ``PyObject_CallMethodOneArg``, "
"``PyObject_FastCallDict``, and the flag ``Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VECTORCALL``."
msgstr ""
":issue:`39245`: Vectorcall API (PEP 590) 被公开，增加了函数 "
"``PyObject_Vectorcall``、``PyObject_VectorcallMethod``、``PyVectorcall_Function``、``PyObject_CallOneArg``、``PyObject_CallMethodNoArgs``、``PyObject_CallMethodOneArg``、``PyObject_FastCallDict``，以及标志"
" ``Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_VECTORCALL``。"

