msgstr ":issue:`36045`: ``builtins.help()`` 现在为异步函数前缀 ``async``。"

#: ../NEWS:23856
msgid ""
":issue:`36084`: Add native thread ID (TID) to threading.Thread objects "
"(supported platforms: Windows, FreeBSD, Linux, macOS)"
msgstr ""
":issue:`36084`: "
"向threading.Thread对象添加原生线程ID（TID）（支持的平台：Windows、FreeBSD、Linux、macOS）"

#: ../NEWS:23859
