":issue:`36035`: Added fix for broken symlinks in combination with pathlib"
msgstr ":issue:`36035`: 添加了针对与pathlib组合使用的损坏符号链接的修复。"

#: ../NEWS:23861
msgid ""
":issue:`35983`: Added new trashcan macros to deal with a double deallocation"
" that could occur when the ``tp_dealloc`` of a subclass calls the "
"``tp_dealloc`` of a base class and that base class uses the trashcan "
