"且该基类使用trashcan机制时可能发生的双重释放问题。由Jeroen Demeyer提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23866
msgid ""
":issue:`20602`: Do not clear :data:`sys.flags` and :data:`sys.float_info` "
"during shutdown. Patch by Zackery Spytz."
msgstr ""
":issue:`20602`: 在关闭期间不清除 :data:`sys.flags` 和 :data:`sys.float_info`。由Zackery"
" Spytz提供补丁。"

#: ../NEWS:23869
msgid ""
":issue:`26826`: Expose :func:`copy_file_range` as a low level API in the "
