#: ../NEWS:23881
msgid ":issue:`37128`: Added :func:`math.perm`."
msgstr ":issue:`37128`: 添加了 :func:`math.perm`。"

#: ../NEWS:23883
msgid ""
":issue:`37120`: Add SSLContext.num_tickets to control the number of TLSv1.3 "
