msgstr ":issue:`36999`: 添加了 ``asyncio.Task.get_coro()`` 方法，以公开暴露任务的协程对象。"

#: ../NEWS:23901
msgid ""
":issue:`35246`: Make :func:`asyncio.create_subprocess_exec` accept path-like"
